{"zh": "（二十一）“苏醒人心；…使愚人有智慧；…快活人的心，…明亮人的眼目。”诗篇十九篇七至八节。", "en": "21) “Restoring the soul...making wise the simple...rejoicing the heart...enlightening the eyes” (Psa. 19:7-8).", "norm_zh": "二十一苏醒人心使愚人有智慧快活人的心明亮人的眼目诗篇十九篇七至八节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:01:49.871375+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "21 Restoring the soulmaking wise the simplerejoicing the heartenlightening the eyes Psa 1978"}
