{"zh": "产生召会—基督的身体", "en": "Producing the church—the Body of Christ", "norm_zh": "产生召会基督的身体", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:18:49.356549+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Producing the churchthe Body of Christ"}
{"zh": "我们应当告诉人以上所说，新约作神永远经纶实际之完成的三部分", "en": "We should tell people the above-mentioned three parts of the New Testament as the practical consummation of God's eternal economy", "norm_zh": "我们应当告诉人以上所说新约作神永远经纶实际之完成的三部分", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:18:49.356549+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "We should tell people the abovementioned three parts of the New Testament as the practical consummation of Gods eternal economy"}
{"zh": "壹\t旧约是神永远经纶表征的图画，新约乃是神永远经纶实际的完成；马太福音至约翰福音揭示，三一神经过过程并终极完成，成为包罗万有赐生命的灵—路二40、52，约五19，一29，三14，二十19~22：（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册，三一神的启示与行动，第三篇）", "en": "I. The Old Testament is a figurative portrait of God's eternal economy, and the New Testament is the practical fulfillment of God's eternal economy; Matthew through John reveals that the Triune God has been processed and consummated to become the all-inclusive, life-giving Spirit—Luke 2:40, 52; John 5:19; 1:29; 3:14; 20:19-22:", "norm_zh": "壹旧约是神永远经纶表征的图画新约乃是神永远经纶实际的完成马太福音至约翰福音揭示三一神经过过程并终极完成成为包罗万有赐生命的灵路二4052约五19一29三14二十1922李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册三一神的启示与行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I The Old Testament is a figurative portrait of Gods eternal economy and the New Testament is the practical fulfillment of Gods eternal economy Matthew through John reveals that the Triune God has been processed and consummated to become the allinclusive lifegiving SpiritLuke 240 52 John 519 129 314 201922"}
{"zh": "一\t借着祂的成为肉体成了神人—路二40、52，约八58。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册，三一神的启示与行动，第三篇）", "en": "A. Through His incarnation to become the God-man.—Luke 2:40, 52; John 8:58.", "norm_zh": "一借着祂的成为肉体成了神人路二4052约八58李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册三一神的启示与行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Through His incarnation to become the GodmanLuke 240 52 John 858"}
{"zh": "二\t借着祂的人性生活过神人的生活—路四42~43，约五19，四34，十七4。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册，三一神的启示与行动，第三篇）", "en": "B. Through His human living to live the God-man's life.—Luke 4:42-43; John 5:19; 4:34; 17:4.", "norm_zh": "二借着祂的人性生活过神人的生活路四4243约五19四34十七4李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册三一神的启示与行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Through His human living to live the Godmans lifeLuke 44243 John 519 434 174"}
{"zh": "三\t借着祂包罗万有的死，救赎祂失丧的受造之物，并释放祂神圣的生命—一29，三14。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册，三一神的启示与行动，第三篇）", "en": "C. Through His all-inclusive death to redeem His lost creation and to release His divine life.—John 1:29; 3:14.", "norm_zh": "三借着祂包罗万有的死救赎祂失丧的受造之物并释放祂神圣的生命一29三14李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册三一神的启示与行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Through His allinclusive death to redeem His lost creation and to release His divine lifeJohn 129 314"}
{"zh": "四\t借着祂的复活，将祂自己分赐到祂所救赎的选民里面，作他们的生命和一切—二十19~22，十一25、40~44、48~53。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册，三一神的启示与行动，第三篇）", "en": "D. Through His resurrection to dispense Himself into His redeemed chosen people as their life and everything.—John 20:19-22; 11:25, 40-44, 48-53.", "norm_zh": "四借着祂的复活将祂自己分赐到祂所救赎的选民里面作他们的生命和一切二十1922十一2540444853李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册三一神的启示与行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D Through His resurrection to dispense Himself into His redeemed chosen people as their life and everythingJohn 201922 1125 4044 4853"}
{"zh": "贰\t使徒行传揭示，包罗万有赐生命的灵，作那是神具体化身之基督的实际，扩展祂自己，为着产生神的众召会—八1、12，十三1~4：（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册，三一神的启示与行动，第三篇）", "en": "II.\tThe Book of Acts unveils the all-inclusive, life-giving Spirit spreading Himself as the reality of Christ, who is the embodiment of God, for the producing of the churches of God.—Acts 8:1, 12; 13:1-4:", "norm_zh": "贰使徒行传揭示包罗万有赐生命的灵作哪是神具体化身之基督的实际扩展祂自己为着产生神的众召会八112十三14李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册三一神的启示与行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "II The Book of Acts unveils the allinclusive lifegiving Spirit spreading Himself as the reality of Christ who is the embodiment of God for the producing of the churches of GodActs 81 12 1314"}
{"zh": "一\t使徒行传可视为新约的分界线或“背脊”；这卷书把福音书和书信（包括启示录）分开—一1~二八31。（使徒行传生命读经，第二篇）", "en": "A. Acts may be considered the dividing line, or the \"backbone,\" of the New Testament; this book divides the Gospels from the Epistles (including Revelation).—Acts 1:1-28:31.", "norm_zh": "一使徒行传可视为新约的分界线或背脊这卷书把福音书和书信包括启示录分开一1二八31使徒行传生命读经第二篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Acts may be considered the dividing line or the backbone of the New Testament this book divides the Gospels from the Epistles including RevelationActs 112831"}
{"zh": "二\t行传的主题乃是复活的基督在升天里，凭着那灵，借着门徒，为着产生众召会—神的国—的繁殖—一1~二八31：（使徒行传生命读经，第二篇）", "en": "B. The subject of Acts is the propagation of the resurrected Christ in His ascension, by the Spirit, through the disciples, for the producing of the churches—the kingdom of God.—Acts 1:1-28:31:", "norm_zh": "二行传的主提乃是复活的基督在升天里凭着哪灵借着门徒为着产生众召会神的国的繁殖一1二八31使徒行传生命读经第二篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The subject of Acts is the propagation of the resurrected Christ in His ascension by the Spirit through the disciples for the producing of the churchesthe kingdom of GodActs 112831"}
{"zh": "1\t复活基督的繁殖是由基督在祂升天里所完成的；基督在祂的升天里，得着宇宙中所有的能力和所有的权柄；带着这样的权柄和能力，这位升天者，正在执行祂宇宙、永远的繁殖—一9~11。（使徒行传生命读经，第二篇）", "en": "1. The propagation of the resurrected Christ is carried out by Christ in His ascension; in His ascension Christ has all the power and all the authority in the universe; with such authority and power, the ascended One is carrying out His universal and eternal propagation.—Acts 1:9-11.", "norm_zh": "1复活基督的繁殖是由基督在祂升天里所完成的基督在祂的升天里得着宇宙中所有的能力和所有的权柄带着这样的权柄和能力这位升天者正在执行祂宇宙永远的繁殖一911使徒行传生命读经第二篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The propagation of the resurrected Christ is carried out by Christ in His ascension in His ascension Christ has all the power and all the authority in the universe with such authority and power the ascended One is carrying out His universal and eternal propagationActs 1911"}
{"zh": "2\t复活基督的繁殖是凭着那灵，尤其是凭着经纶的灵；在使徒行传，我们看见经纶的灵如何执行基督的繁殖—二1~4。（使徒行传生命读经，第二篇）", "en": "2. The propagation of the resurrected Christ is by the Spirit, especially by the economical Spirit; in Acts we see how the economical Spirit carries out the propagation of Christ.—Acts 2:1-4.", "norm_zh": "2复活基督的繁殖是凭着哪灵尤其是凭着经纶的灵在使徒行传我们看见经纶的灵如何执行基督的繁殖二14使徒行传生命读经第二篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The propagation of the resurrected Christ is by the Spirit especially by the economical Spirit in Acts we see how the economical Spirit carries out the propagation of ChristActs 214"}
{"zh": "3\t基督的繁殖也是借着门徒；复活的基督在祂的升天里，借着祂的见证人繁殖祂自己，乃是为着产生众召会，众召会就是神的国—九31。（使徒行传生命读经，第二篇）", "en": "3. The propagation of Christ is also through the disciples; the resurrected Christ in His ascension propagates Himself through His witnesses for the producing of the churches, which are the kingdom of God.—Acts 9:31.", "norm_zh": "3基督的繁殖也是借着门徒复活的基督在祂的升天里借着祂的见证人繁殖祂自己乃是为着产生众召会众召会就是神的国九31使徒行传生命读经第二篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 The propagation of Christ is also through the disciples the resurrected Christ in His ascension propagates Himself through His witnesses for the producing of the churches which are the kingdom of GodActs 931"}
{"zh": "三\t神的国乃是由基督的繁殖所产生的生命范围；神的国就是神的扩大，而这位神的具体化身就是基督；这基督的扩大就是众召会—六7，九31。（使徒行传生命读经，第二篇）", "en": "C.\tThe kingdom of God is a sphere of life produced by the propagation of Christ; the kingdom of God is the expansion of God, and the embodiment of this God is Christ; this expansion of Christ is the churches—Acts 6:7; 9:31.", "norm_zh": "三神的国乃是由基督的繁殖所产生的生命范围神的国就是神的扩大而这位神的具体化身就是基督这基督的扩大就是众召会六7九31使徒行传生命读经第二篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The kingdom of God is a sphere of life produced by the propagation of Christ the kingdom of God is the expansion of God and the embodiment of this God is Christ this expansion of Christ is the churchesActs 67 931"}
{"zh": "叁\t罗马书至启示录揭示，包罗万有赐生命的灵借着将众召会变化成为那作神长子之基督的形像，而将众召会建造成为终极完成之三一神的生机体，作基督的身体，这要终极完成于新耶路撒冷，作终极完成之三一神永远的扩大和彰显—罗十二4~5，彼前二4~8，启二十1~2：（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册，三一神的启示与行动，第三篇）", "en": "III.\tRomans to Revelation unveil the all-inclusive life-giving Spirit building up the churches into the organism of the consummated Triune God as the Body of Christ, by transforming them into the image of Christ as the firstborn Son of God, which will consummate in the New Jerusalem as the eternal enlargement and expression of the consummated Triune God—Rom. 12:4-5; 1 Pet. 2:4-8; Rev. 20:1-2:", "norm_zh": "叁罗马书至启示录揭示包罗万有赐生命的灵借着将众召会变化成为哪作神长子之基督的形像而将众召会建造成为终极完成之三一神的生机体作基督的身体这要终极完成于新耶路撒冷作终极完成之三一神永远的扩大和彰显罗十二45彼前二48启二十12李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册三一神的启示与行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III Romans to Revelation unveil the allinclusive lifegiving Spirit building up the churches into the organism of the consummated Triune God as the Body of Christ by transforming them into the image of Christ as the firstborn Son of God which will consummate in the New Jerusalem as the eternal enlargement and expression of the consummated Triune GodRom 1245 1 Pet 248 Rev 2012"}
{"zh": "一\t神在永远里是单独的，祂有一个心愿，就是要得着基督的身体，能作祂的生机体；所以祂就有一个经纶，为着满足祂的这个心愿，以产生基督的身体—弗四12，林前十二27。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册，神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活，第五篇）", "en": "A.\tGod is alone in eternity; He has a heart's desire, which is to have the Body of Christ to be His organism; hence, He has an economy to satisfy this desire of His to produce the Body of Christ—Eph. 4:12; 1 Cor. 12:27.", "norm_zh": "一神在永远里是单独的祂有一个心愿就是要得着基督的身体能作祂的生机体所以祂就有一个经纶为着满足祂的这个心愿以产生基督的身体弗四12林前十二27李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A God is alone in eternity He has a hearts desire which is to have the Body of Christ to be His organism hence He has an economy to satisfy this desire of His to produce the Body of ChristEph 412 1 Cor 1227"}
{"zh": "二\t在四卷福音书里，只有两次题到召会，但是没有题到基督的身体；使徒行传说到众召会，但也没有题到基督的身体；基督的身体只在书信中题及—弗四12，林前十二27：（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册，三一神的启示与行动，第三篇）", "en": "B.\tIn the four Gospels the church is mentioned only twice, but the Body of Christ is not mentioned; Acts speaks of the churches, but also does not mention the Body of Christ; the Body of Christ is mentioned only in the Epistles—Eph. 4:12; 1 Cor. 12:27:", "norm_zh": "二在四卷福音书里只有两次提到召会但是没有提到基督的身体使徒行传说到众召会但也没有提到基督的身体基督的身体只在书信中提及弗四12林前十二27李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第三册三一神的启示与行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B In the four Gospels the church is mentioned only twice but the Body of Christ is not mentioned Acts speaks of the churches but also does not mention the Body of Christ the Body of Christ is mentioned only in the EpistlesEph 412 1 Cor 1227"}
{"zh": "1\t在罗马书中，保罗只有一处题到基督的身体，就是在十二章四至五节；那里说，“正如我们一个身体上有好些肢体，但肢体不都有一样的功用；我们这许多人，在基督里是一个身体，并且各个互相作肢体，也是如此”。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册，神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活，第五篇）", "en": "1.\tIn Romans, Paul mentions the Body of Christ only in one place, and that is in 12:4-5; there it says, \"For just as in one body we have many members, and all the members do not have the same function, so we who are many are one body in Christ, and individually members one of another.\"", "norm_zh": "1在罗马书中保罗只有一处提到基督的身体就是在十二章四至五节哪里说正如我们一个身体上有好些肢体但肢体不都有一样的功用我们这许多人在基督里是一个身体并且各个互相作肢体也是如此李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 In Romans Paul mentions the Body of Christ only in one place and that is in 1245 there it says For just as in one body we have many members and all the members do not have the same function so we who are many are one body in Christ and individually members one of another"}
{"zh": "2\t罗马书简短的题到基督的身体，下一卷的哥林多前书就大讲特讲基督的身体—4~5节。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册，神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活，第五篇）", "en": "2.\tWhereas Romans briefly mentions the Body of Christ, the next book, 1 Corinthians, deals with it extensively.—vv. 4-5.", "norm_zh": "2罗马书简短的提到基督的身体下一卷的哥林多前书就大讲特讲基督的身体45节李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Whereas Romans briefly mentions the Body of Christ the next book 1 Corinthians deals with it extensivelyvv 45"}
{"zh": "3\t以弗所书明显的是讲基督的身体，几乎每一章都讲到基督的身体；它不是大体的讲，乃是细讲深讲—四12：（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册，神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活，第五篇）", "en": "3.\tEphesians is obviously on the Body of Christ; almost every chapter refers to the Body of Christ; it speaks of the Body of Christ not in a general way but in a detailed and deep way—4:12:", "norm_zh": "3以弗所书明显的是讲基督的身体几乎每一章都讲到基督的身体它不是大体的讲乃是细讲深讲四12李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 Ephesians is obviously on the Body of Christ almost every chapter refers to the Body of Christ it speaks of the Body of Christ not in a general way but in a detailed and deep way412"}
{"zh": "a\t以弗所一章是讲神圣三一的分赐，就是父的分赐、子的分赐和灵的分赐，末了还有升天、超越之基督的输供；这两样的结果就产生召会；这召会就是基督的身体—22~23节：（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册，神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活，第五篇）", "en": "a.\tEphesians 1 is on the dispensing of the Divine Trinity, that is, the dispensing of the Father, of the Son, and of the Spirit, and then there is also the transmission of the ascended and transcendent Christ; these two things issue in the church; this church is the Body of Christ—vv. 22-23:", "norm_zh": "a以弗所一章是讲神圣三一的分赐就是父的分赐子的分赐和灵的分赐末了还有升天超越之基督的输供这两样的结果就产生召会这召会就是基督的身体2223节李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "a Ephesians 1 is on the dispensing of the Divine Trinity that is the dispensing of the Father of the Son and of the Spirit and then there is also the transmission of the ascended and transcendent Christ these two things issue in the church this church is the Body of Christvv 2223"}
{"zh": "（一）　基督身体里有灵的故事，有主的故事，还有父神的故事；这些调和起来就是基督的身体—林前十二13。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册，神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活，第五篇）", "en": "1)\tIn the Body of Christ there is the history of the Spirit, the history of the Lord, and the history of God the Father; these mingled together are the Body of Christ—1 Cor. 12:13.", "norm_zh": "一基督身体里有灵的故事有主的故事还有父神的故事这些调和起来就是基督的身体林前十二13李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 In the Body of Christ there is the history of the Spirit the history of the Lord and the history of God the Father these mingled together are the Body of Christ1 Cor 1213"}
{"zh": "（二）　基督的身体所以能够成为身体，乃是因为灵在里面，主在里面，并且父也在里面—弗四6。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册，神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活，第五篇）", "en": "2)\tThe Body of Christ can be the Body of Christ because the Spirit, the Lord, and the Father are in the Body—Eph. 4:6.", "norm_zh": "二基督的身体所以能够成为身体乃是因为灵在里面主在里面并且父也在里面弗四6李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The Body of Christ can be the Body of Christ because the Spirit the Lord and the Father are in the BodyEph 46"}
{"zh": "b\t以弗所书讲基督的身体，讲得最重的是第四章；四节说，一个身体和一位灵（就是那灵）；接下去说到一主，还有一位父。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册，神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活，第五篇）", "en": "b. In Ephesians the strongest emphasis on the Body of Christ is in chapter four; verse 4 speaks of one Body and one Spirit (the Spirit); it goes on to speak of one Lord and one Father.", "norm_zh": "b以弗所书讲基督的身体讲得最重的是第四章四节说一个身体和一位灵就是哪灵接下去说到一主还有一位父李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "b In Ephesians the strongest emphasis on the Body of Christ is in chapter four verse 4 speaks of one Body and one Spirit the Spirit it goes on to speak of one Lord and one Father"}
{"zh": "4\t在歌罗西书中一章里，保罗给我们看见，基督是一切受造之物的首生者，万有是借着祂并为着祂造的；祂也是召会身体的头；二章进一步给我们看见，基督的身体需要长大，而基督身体的长大是从元首基督长大的，因为这一切的供应都来自基督—19节。（李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册，神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活，第五篇）", "en": "4. In chapter one of Colossians, Paul shows us that Christ is the Firstborn of all creation, in whom all things were created; that He is the Head of the Body, the church; chapter two further shows us that the Body of Christ needs to grow, and the growth of the Body of Christ is from Christ the Head, because all this supply comes from Christ—v. 19.", "norm_zh": "4在歌罗西书中一章里保罗给我们看见基督是一切受造之物的首生者万有是借着祂并为着祂造的祂也是召会身体的头二章进一步给我们看见基督的身体需要长大而基督身体的长大是从元首基督长大的因为这一切的供应都来自基督19节李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第一册神经纶的总纲与神人该有的生活第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "4 In chapter one of Colossians Paul shows us that Christ is the Firstborn of all creation in whom all things were created that He is the Head of the Body the church chapter two further shows us that the Body of Christ needs to grow and the growth of the Body of Christ is from Christ the Head because all this supply comes from Christv 19"}
{"zh": "三\t神的经纶以基督为其中心与普及，使基督在凡事上居首位，也产生召会作基督的身体，终极完成于圣城新耶路撒冷—西一18，弗四12：（李常受文集一九九一至一九九二年第三册，在旧造里撒但的混乱以及为着新造的神圣经纶，第四篇）", "en": "C. God's economy has Christ as its centrality and universality, that Christ may have the first place in all things, and also produces the church as the Body of Christ, consummating in the holy city, the New Jerusalem—Col. 1:18; Eph. 4:12:", "norm_zh": "三神的经纶以基督为其中心与普及使基督在凡事上居首位也产生召会作基督的身体终极完成于圣城新耶路撒冷西一18弗四12李常受文集一九九一至一九九二年第三册在旧造里撒但的混乱以及为着新造的神圣经纶第四篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Gods economy has Christ as its centrality and universality that Christ may have the first place in all things and also produces the church as the Body of Christ consummating in the holy city the New JerusalemCol 118 Eph 412"}
{"zh": "1\t基督的身体乃是由祂肢体所构成的生机体—罗十二5。（李常受文集一九九一至一九九二年第三册，在旧造里撒但的混乱以及为着新造的神圣经纶，第四篇）", "en": "1. The Body of Christ is an organism constituted with His members—Rom. 12:5.", "norm_zh": "1基督的身体乃是由祂肢体所构成的生机体罗十二5李常受文集一九九一至一九九二年第三册在旧造里撒但的混乱以及为着新造的神圣经纶第四篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The Body of Christ is an organism constituted with His membersRom 125"}
{"zh": "2\t基督的身体需要用基督那追测不尽的丰富，借着神圣的分赐而得建造—弗三8~11、2。（李常受文集一九九一至一九九二年第三册，在旧造里撒但的混乱以及为着新造的神圣经纶，第四篇）", "en": "2. The Body of Christ needs to be built up with the unsearchable riches of Christ through the divine dispensing—Eph. 3:8-11, 2.", "norm_zh": "2基督的身体需要用基督哪追测不尽的丰富借着神圣的分赐而得建造弗三8112李常受文集一九九一至一九九二年第三册在旧造里撒但的混乱以及为着新造的神圣经纶第四篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The Body of Christ needs to be built up with the unsearchable riches of Christ through the divine dispensingEph 3811 2"}
{"zh": "3\t基督的身体乃是基督的丰满，就是那在万有中充满万有者的丰满，作祂的彰显—一22~23，三19：（李常受文集一九九一至一九九二年第三册，在旧造里撒但的混乱以及为着新造的神圣经纶，第四篇）", "en": "3. The Body of Christ is the fullness of Christ as the One who fills all in all to be His expression—1:22-23; 3:19:", "norm_zh": "3基督的身体乃是基督的丰满就是哪在万有中充满万有者的丰满作祂的彰显一2223三19李常受文集一九九一至一九九二年第三册在旧造里撒但的混乱以及为着新造的神圣经纶第四篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 The Body of Christ is the fullness of Christ as the One who fills all in all to be His expression12223 319"}
{"zh": "a\t神的经纶就是神的目的，乃是要把祂自己在祂神圣的三一里，分赐到祂所拣选并救赎的人里面，作他们的生命和性情，使他们能与祂一样，好作祂团体的彰显─提前一4，弗一3~23。（2015年感恩节特会，第四篇；约伯记生命读经，第九篇，第十八段*）", "en": "A.\tGod's economy is His intention to dispense Himself in His divine Trinity into His chosen and redeemed people to be their life and nature so that they may be the same as He is for His corporate expression.—1 Tim. 1:4; Eph. 1:3-23.", "norm_zh": "a神的经纶就是神的目的乃是要把祂自己在祂神圣的三一里分赐到祂所拣选并救赎的人里面作他们的生命和性情使他们能与祂一样好作祂团体的彰显提前一4弗一3232015年感恩节特会第四篇约伯记生命读经第九篇第十八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Gods economy is His intention to dispense Himself in His divine Trinity into His chosen and redeemed people to be their life and nature so that they may be the same as He is for His corporate expression1 Tim 14 Eph 1323"}
{"zh": "b\t神救赎我们为要使我们在生命和性情上成为神，使祂能得着基督的身体，终极完成于新耶路撒冷，作神的扩大和彰显，直到永远─一7，四16，启二一2。（2016年秋季长老训练，第九篇；历代志生命读经，第五篇，第七十四段*）", "en": "B.\tGod redeemed us for the purpose of making us God in life and nature so that He can have the Body of Christ, which consummates in the New Jerusalem as God's enlargement and expression for eternity.—1:7; 4:16; Rev. 21:2.", "norm_zh": "b神救赎我们为要使我们在生命和性情上成为神使祂能得着基督的身体终极完成于新耶路撒冷作神的扩大和彰显直到永远一7四16启二一22016年秋季长老训练第九篇历代志生命读经第五篇第七十四段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:20:59.719656+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B God redeemed us for the purpose of making us God in life and nature so that He can have the Body of Christ which consummates in the New Jerusalem as Gods enlargement and expression for eternity17 416 Rev 212"}
{"zh": "读经：赛三四16上，弗一17，三3，提后三16，路十22，林前二10，提后二15，太五18，诗一一九160，约八32，一4，十10", "en": "Scripture Reading: Isa. 34:16a; Eph. 1:17; 3:3; 2 Tim. 3:16; Luke 10:22; 1 Cor. 2:10; 2 Tim. 2:15; Matt. 5:18; Psa. 119:160; John 8:32; 1:4; 10:10", "norm_zh": "读经赛三四16上弗一17三3提后三16路十22林前二10提后二15太五18诗一一九160约八32一4十10", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Scripture Reading Isa 3416a Eph 117 33 2 Tim 316 Luke 1022 1 Cor 210 2 Tim 215 Matt 518 Psa 119160 John 832 14 1010"}
{"zh": "壹\t我们愿意人知道新约圣经恢复本的翻译原则；我们翻译新约圣经恢复本，不是轻易为之；我们的恢复译本，乃神圣启示的集大成—弗一17，三3，提后三16，二15：", "en": "I. We want people to know the translation principles of the New Testament Recovery Version; our translation of the New Testament Recovery Version was not undertaken lightly; our Recovery Version is the consummation of the divine revelation—Eph. 1:17; 3:3; 2 Tim. 3:16; 2:15:", "norm_zh": "壹我们愿意人知道新约圣经恢复本的翻译原则我们翻译新约圣经恢复本不是轻易为之我们的恢复译本乃神圣启示的集大成弗一17三3提后三16二15", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I We want people to know the translation principles of the New Testament Recovery Version our translation of the New Testament Recovery Version was not undertaken lightly our Recovery Version is the consummation of the divine revelationEph 117 33 2 Tim 316 215"}
{"zh": "一\t首先，我们乃是以最通用之国语和合本为参照，尽量保持其语体、节奏、和人名地名之音译的优美—歌五10，诗一四三~一四五，提后三16，赛三四16上。", "en": "A. First, we refer to the most commonly used Chinese Union Version, trying to keep its writing style, rhythm, and the beauty of its transliteration of the names of people and places—S. S. 5:10; Psa. 143—145; 2 Tim. 3:16; Isa. 34:16a.", "norm_zh": "一首先我们乃是以最通用之国语和合本为参照尽量保持其语体节奏和人名地名之音译的优美歌五10诗一四三一四五提后三16赛三四16上", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A First we refer to the most commonly used Chinese Union Version trying to keep its writing style rhythm and the beauty of its transliteration of the names of people and placesS S 510 Psa 143145 2 Tim 316 Isa 3416a"}
{"zh": "二\t其次，这本恢复译本也以所有英文权威译本，和新约希腊文字义权威解释及辞书，并所有中文白话、文言两体的译文为参考；不但为得借鉴、启发，也为避免偏见、误断—腓一10，彼前一12，提后二15：", "en": "B. Secondly, this Recovery Version also uses all authoritative English translations, authoritative interpretations, and dictionaries of the meaning of Greek words in the New Testament, and all Chinese vernacular and classical Chinese translations as references; this is not only to obtain help and inspiration but also to avoid prejudice and mistaken judgment—Phil. 1:10; 1 Pet. 1:12; 2 Tim. 2:15:", "norm_zh": "二其次这本恢复译本也以所有英文权威译本和新约希腊文字义权威解释及辞书并所有中文白话文言两体的译文为参考不但为得借鉴启发也为避免偏见误断腓一10彼前一12提后二15", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Secondly this Recovery Version also uses all authoritative English translations authoritative interpretations and dictionaries of the meaning of Greek words in the New Testament and all Chinese vernacular and classical Chinese translations as references this is not only to obtain help and inspiration but also to avoid prejudice and mistaken judgmentPhil 110 1 Pet 112 2 Tim 215"}
{"zh": "1\t所有英文中最好的新约译本约有五十种，其中最具权威的十余种，在我们翻译时，都摆在我们案前作为参考—赛三四16上。", "en": "1. There are about fifty best translations of the New Testament in English, among which more than ten are the most authoritative, and they are all placed in front of our case as a reference when we are translating.—Isa. 34:16a.", "norm_zh": "1所有英文中最好的新约译本约有五十种其中最具权威的十余种在我们翻译时都摆在我们案前作为参考赛三四16上", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 There are about fifty best translations of the New Testament in English among which more than ten are the most authoritative and they are all placed in front of our case as a reference when we are translatingIsa 3416a"}
{"zh": "2\t至于中文译本，从天主教到中国来开始，直到现在所翻译的，可用为参考的权威译本，不到十种；这些我们也都摆在工作台上，由专人研究参考—16节上。", "en": "2. As for the Chinese translations, there are less than ten authoritative translations that have been translated since the Catholic Church came to China that can be used as references; we also put these on the workbench for research and reference by special personnel.—v. 16a.", "norm_zh": "2至于中文译本从天主教到中国来开始直到现在所翻译的可用为参考的权威译本不到十种这些我们也都摆在工作台上由专人研究参考16节上", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 As for the Chinese translations there are less than ten authoritative translations that have been translated since the Catholic Church came to China that can be used as references we also put these on the workbench for research and reference by special personnelv 16a"}
{"zh": "3\t凡较佳辞句，无不尽力采集，务求圣言中的启示，能在华语中，得到差异最少，达意最准的发表—歌七6，提后二15。", "en": "3. We made every effort to adopt any better expressions, striving that the revelation in the holy Word might obtain, in the Chinese language, the most accurate expression with the fewest discrepancies—S. S. 7:6; 2 Tim. 2:15.", "norm_zh": "3凡较佳辞句无不尽力采集务求圣言中的启示能在华语中得到差异最少达意最准的发表歌七6提后二15", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 We made every effort to adopt any better expressions striving that the revelation in the holy Word might obtain in the Chinese language the most accurate expression with the fewest discrepanciesS S 76 2 Tim 215"}
{"zh": "三\t翻译圣经，除基于对圣经原文之明了外，也在于对圣言中神圣启示的认识—路十22，林前二10：", "en": "C. The translation of the Bible, besides being based on the understanding of the original text of the Bible, also lies in the understanding of the divine revelation in the holy Word—Luke 10:22; 1 Cor. 2:10:", "norm_zh": "三翻译圣经除基于对圣经原文之明了外也在于对圣言中神圣启示的认识路十22林前二10", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The translation of the Bible besides being based on the understanding of the original text of the Bible also lies in the understanding of the divine revelation in the holy WordLuke 1022 1 Cor 210"}
{"zh": "1\t历代圣徒对神圣启示的认识，也是基于他们所得之亮光，逐渐前进的—林后三14，弗三5。", "en": "1. Throughout the centuries the understanding of the divine revelation possessed by the saints has always been based upon the light they received, and this understanding has progressed steadily.—2 Cor. 3:14; Eph. 3:5.", "norm_zh": "1历代圣徒对神圣启示的认识也是基于他们所得之亮光逐渐前进的林后三14弗三5", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 Throughout the centuries the understanding of the divine revelation possessed by the saints has always been based upon the light they received and this understanding has progressed steadily2 Cor 314 Eph 35"}
{"zh": "2\t圣经恢复本所根据者，乃此类认识之集大成，加上附注，可谓二千年来，各方圣徒对神圣启示认识之结晶，希能继往又开来—林前二10，弗三9。", "en": "2. The consummation of this understanding forms the basis of the Recovery Version and its footnotes. Hence, this translation and the accompanying footnotes could be called the “crystallization” of the understanding of the divine revelation which the saints everywhere have attained to in the past two thousand years. It is our hope that the Recovery Version will carry on the heritage that it has received and will pave the way for future generations.—1 Cor. 2:10; Eph. 3:9.", "norm_zh": "2圣经恢复本所根据者乃此类认识之集大成加上附注可谓二千年来各方圣徒对神圣启示认识之结晶希能继往又开来林前二10弗三9", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The consummation of this understanding forms the basis of the Recovery Version and its footnotes Hence this translation and the accompanying footnotes could be called the crystallization of the understanding of the divine revelation which the saints everywhere have attained to in the past two thousand years It is our hope that the Recovery Version will carry on the heritage that it has received and will pave the way for future generations1 Cor 210 Eph 39"}
{"zh": "四\t鉴定圣经原文古卷，乃翻译圣经之根据；最新发现，或为时最古之古卷，并非最为准确、可靠；任何一节或一段须考量之经文，均须根据其书及其章之上下文，并须比较其相同记载之经文，而作鉴定—拉六2，诗四十7，提后二15：", "en": "D. The evaluation of the ancient manuscripts of the original text is the basis of Bible translation; the most recently discovered or the oldest manuscripts are not necessarily the most accurate and reliable; any verse or passage of Scripture under consideration must be evaluated based on the context of its book and chapter, and must be compared with parallel accounts—Ezra 6:2; Psa. 40:7; 2 Tim. 2:15:", "norm_zh": "四鉴定圣经原文古卷乃翻译圣经之根据最新发现或为时最古之古卷并非最为准确可靠任何一节或一段须考量之经文均须根据其书及其章之上下文并须比较其相同记载之经文而作鉴定拉六2诗四十7提后二15", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D The evaluation of the ancient manuscripts of the original text is the basis of Bible translation the most recently discovered or the oldest manuscripts are not necessarily the most accurate and reliable any verse or passage of Scripture under consideration must be evaluated based on the context of its book and chapter and must be compared with parallel accountsEzra 62 Psa 407 2 Tim 215"}
{"zh": "1\t由于圣经原本早已佚散不见，所以今天要得知圣经原文内容，就得倚靠这些古卷—7节，拉六2。", "en": "1. Since the original Bible has long since been lost, we must rely on these ancient manuscripts if we want to know the original text of the Bible today.—v. 7; Ezra 6:2.", "norm_zh": "1由于圣经原本早已佚散不见所以今天要得知圣经原文内容就得倚靠这些古卷7节拉六2", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 Since the original Bible has long since been lost we must rely on these ancient manuscripts if we want to know the original text of the Bible todayv 7 Ezra 62"}
{"zh": "2\t但古卷的抄写过程虽然相当严紧，仍难免有错误；历代的许多抄本，到了近代因考古学的发展，陆续出土或被发现；有心人就根据这些抄本，从事各种语言的译经工作—提后二15。", "en": "2. However, although the copying process of ancient manuscripts is quite rigorous, errors are still inevitable; many manuscripts throughout the ages have been unearthed or discovered in modern times due to the development of archaeology; based on these manuscripts, interested people are engaged in the work of Bible translation in various languages.—2 Tim. 2:15.", "norm_zh": "2但古卷的抄写过程虽然相当严紧仍难免有错误历代的许多抄本到了近代因考古学的发展陆续出土或被发现有心人就根据这些抄本从事各种语言的译经工作提后二15", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 However although the copying process of ancient manuscripts is quite rigorous errors are still inevitable many manuscripts throughout the ages have been unearthed or discovered in modern times due to the development of archaeology based on these manuscripts interested people are engaged in the work of Bible translation in various languages2 Tim 215"}
{"zh": "贰\t翻译圣经时，我们乃是逐节逐字一一研读，以期得到差异最少，达意最准的发表；以马太福音为例，与和合本相较，最少有三十一处重要的不同—15节，太五18：", "en": "II. In translating the Bible, we study word by word and verse by verse, with a view to obtaining an expression with the least difference and the most accurate meaning; taking the Gospel of Matthew as an example, there are at least 31 important differences compared with the Chinese Union Version—v. 15; Matt. 5:18:", "norm_zh": "贰翻译圣经时我们乃是逐节逐字一一研读以期得到差异最少达意最准的发表以马太福音为例与和合本相较最少有三十一处重要的不同15节太五18", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "II In translating the Bible we study word by word and verse by verse with a view to obtaining an expression with the least difference and the most accurate meaning taking the Gospel of Matthew as an example there are at least 31 important differences compared with the Chinese Union Versionv 15 Matt 518"}
{"zh": "一\t我们将“教会”一辞改译为“召会”，是因教会一辞，乃当初西教士到中国来时，领会他们是来传教，所以称信徒的聚集为教会，意即宗教的聚会—林前一1~2：", "en": "A. We changed the word \"chiao-hui\" into \"chao-hui\" because the word \" chiao-hui\" was used when Western missionaries came to China and understood that they came to preach, so they called the gathering of believers chiao-hui, which means a religious gathering.—1 Cor. 1:1-2:", "norm_zh": "一我们将教会一辞改译为召会是因教会一辞乃当初西教士到中国来时领会他们是来传教所以称信徒的聚集为教会意即宗教的聚会林前一12", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A We changed the word chiaohui into chaohui because the word chiaohui was used when Western missionaries came to China and understood that they came to preach so they called the gathering of believers chiaohui which means a religious gathering1 Cor 112"}
{"zh": "1\t“召”字意为蒙召，召会就是蒙召的聚会，那就是教会的本义—1节。", "en": "1. The word \"chao\" means to be called, and the church is a called assembly, which is the original meaning of the church.—v. 1.", "norm_zh": "1召字意为蒙召召会就是蒙召的聚会哪就是教会的本义1节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The word chao means to be called and the church is a called assembly which is the original meaning of the churchv 1"}
{"zh": "2\t教会的希腊原文是ekklesia，ek就是“出来”，kaleo是蒙召的引伸辞；因此这辞乃是蒙召出来的会众，最好译为召会—罗一6，西三15。", "en": "2. The Greek word for the church is ekklesia, ek means \"to come out,\" and kaleo is an extension of called; therefore, this word is a called-out assembly, which is better translated as the church.—Rom. 1:6; Col. 3:15.", "norm_zh": "2教会的希腊原文是ekklesiaek就是出来kaleo是蒙召的引伸辞因此这辞乃是蒙召出来的会众最好译为召会罗一6西三15", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The Greek word for the church is ekklesia ek means to come out and kaleo is an extension of called therefore this word is a calledout assembly which is better translated as the churchRom 16 Col 315"}
{"zh": "二\t马太十八章十五节说“只在你和他之间”，和合本译为“趁着只有他和你在一处的时候”：", "en": "B. Matthew 18:15 says \"between you and him alone\", which is translated in the Chinese Union Version as \"between thee and him alone\":", "norm_zh": "二马太十八章十五节说只在你和他之间和合本译为趁着只有他和你在一处的时候", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Matthew 1815 says between you and him alone which is translated in the Chinese Union Version as between thee and him alone"}
{"zh": "1\t和合本译者用“趁着”一辞，可能被领会为，恐怕这个弟兄或是死了，或者没有机会见到他了，再要认错也认不到，所以要趁着他和你同在的时候，去指责他—太十八15。", "en": "1. The Chinese Union Version translator used the word 'while', which may be understood as saying, I am afraid that this brother is either dead, or I will not have a chance to see him, and even if he admits his mistake, he will not be able to recognize it, so tell him while he is with you.—Matt. 18:15.", "norm_zh": "1和合本译者用趁着一辞可能被领会为恐怕这个弟兄或是死了或者没有机会见到他了再要认错也认不到所以要趁着他和你同在的时候去指责他太十八15", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The Chinese Union Version translator used the word while which may be understood as saying I am afraid that this brother is either dead or I will not have a chance to see him and even if he admits his mistake he will not be able to recognize it so tell him while he is with youMatt 1815"}
{"zh": "2\t但原文的意思乃是说，只在你和他之间指责他，也就是不要给第三者知道；这乃是爱心的遮护—15节，来十24。", "en": "2. However, the meaning of the original text is to accuse him between you and him alone, that is, don’t let the third party know; this is the cover of love.—v. 15; Heb. 10:24.", "norm_zh": "2但原文的意思乃是说只在你和他之间指责他也就是不要给第三者知道这乃是爱心的遮护15节来十24", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 However the meaning of the original text is to accuse him between you and him alone that is dont let the third party know this is the cover of lovev 15 Heb 1024"}
{"zh": "三\t马太十八章十九节说，“你们中间若有两个人在地上，在他们所求的任何事上和谐一致”；这里的“和谐一致”，和合本译为“同心合意”，是与另一辞混淆了—太十八19，罗十五6：", "en": "C. Matthew 18:19 says, \"If two of you are in harmony on earth concerning any matter for which they ask\"; the Chinese Union Version translates \"in harmony\" here as \"with one accord,\" which is confused with another term.—Matt. 18:19; Rom. 15:6:", "norm_zh": "三马太十八章十九节说你们中间若有两个人在地上在他们所求的任何事上和谐一致这里的和谐一致和合本译为同心合意是与另一辞混淆了太十八19罗十五6", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Matthew 1819 says If two of you are in harmony on earth concerning any matter for which they ask the Chinese Union Version translates in harmony here as with one accord which is confused with another termMatt 1819 Rom 156"}
{"zh": "1\t马太十八章里，这辞没有那么深入的意思，希腊原文只是一个字，意指发声的声调非常和谐，所以是同声同调，和谐一致—太十八19。", "en": "1. In Matthew 18, this term does not have such a deep meaning. The Greek word is just a word, which means that the sound of the voices is very harmonious, so it is in harmony with the same voice and sound.—Matt. 18:19.", "norm_zh": "1马太十八章里这辞没有哪么深入的意思希腊原文只是一个字意指发声的声调非常和谐所以是同声同调和谐一致太十八19", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 In Matthew 18 this term does not have such a deep meaning The Greek word is just a word which means that the sound of the voices is very harmonious so it is in harmony with the same voice and soundMatt 1819"}
{"zh": "2\t这特别是指祷告说的；我们祷告时，要同声同调，和谐一致—19节。", "en": "2. This refers especially to prayer; when we pray, we must be in unison and in harmony.—v. 19.", "norm_zh": "2这特别是指祷告说的我们祷告时要同声同调和谐一致19节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 This refers especially to prayer when we pray we must be in unison and in harmonyv 19"}
{"zh": "叁\t圣经恢复本每卷书的主题、纲目，乃以史事为根据，并以灵意为发表—林前二13，罗八5。", "en": "III. The subject and outlines of each book in the Recovery Version of the Bible are based on historical facts and express the spiritual meaning.—1 Cor. 2:13; Rom. 8:5.", "norm_zh": "叁圣经恢复本每卷书的主提纲目乃以史事为根据并以灵意为发表林前二13罗八5", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III The subject and outlines of each book in the Recovery Version of the Bible are based on historical facts and express the spiritual meaning1 Cor 213 Rom 85"}
{"zh": "肆\t圣经恢复本的注解重在真理的启示、属灵的亮光、以及生命的供应，过于历史、地理和人物的解释—诗一一九160，约八32，一4，十10。", "en": "IV. The footnotes of the Recovery Version of the Bible stress the revelation of truth, spiritual light, and the supply of life, more than historical, geographical, and personage explanations.—Psa. 119:160; John 8:32; 1:4; 10:10.", "norm_zh": "肆圣经恢复本的注解重在真理的启示属灵的亮光以及生命的供应过于历史地理和人物的解释诗一一九160约八32一4十10", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "IV The footnotes of the Recovery Version of the Bible stress the revelation of truth spiritual light and the supply of life more than historical geographical and personage explanationsPsa 119160 John 832 14 1010"}
{"zh": "伍\t圣经恢复本的串珠不仅指引到相同的辞句与史事，更根据属灵的启示，指引到有关的事物和经言—林前二13，罗十五21。", "en": "V. The cross-references of the Recovery Version of the Bible lead not only to similar words and historical facts but, based on spiritual revelation, also to related matters and verses.—1 Cor. 2:13; Rom. 15:21.", "norm_zh": "伍圣经恢复本的串珠不仅指引到相同的辞句与史事更根据属灵的启示指引到有关的事物和经言林前二13罗十五21", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "V The crossreferences of the Recovery Version of the Bible lead not only to similar words and historical facts but based on spiritual revelation also to related matters and verses1 Cor 213 Rom 1521"}
{"zh": "陆\t我们乃是谨慎且深入的研究，参考汇集各家所长之结晶；务期神圣言的启示，在我们国语的发表里，能向全球华人，表达得淋漓尽致；甚且能成为二千年来，圣徒们对新约讲解之集大成的译本—弗一17，三5：", "en": "VI. We do careful and in-depth research, refer to the crystallization of the best of all schools of thought, and look forward to the revelation in the holy Word, in order that the revelation of God's Word may be fully expressed to the Chinese people all over the world in the translation of Mandarin; it can even become the translation of the aggregate of the saints’ explanations of the New Testament in the past two thousand years.—Eph. 1:17; 3:5:", "norm_zh": "陆我们乃是谨慎且深入的研究参考汇集各家所长之结晶务期神圣言的启示在我们国语的发表里能向全球华人表达得淋漓尽致甚且能成为二千年来圣徒们对新约讲解之集大成的译本弗一17三5", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "VI We do careful and indepth research refer to the crystallization of the best of all schools of thought and look forward to the revelation in the holy Word in order that the revelation of Gods Word may be fully expressed to the Chinese people all over the world in the translation of Mandarin it can even become the translation of the aggregate of the saints explanations of the New Testament in the past two thousand yearsEph 117 35"}
{"zh": "一\t最常用的是一部多达十大册的希腊文字义研究，那是最好的巨著，乃是德国基特尔（G. Kittel）弟兄所著，专讲新约七千七百多个希腊字的意义—创三八5，出十二40，十七9。", "en": "A. The most commonly used is a ten-volume study of the meaning of Greek words, the greatest book of all, written by the German brother G. Kittel and devoted to the meaning of over 7,700 Greek words in the New Testament.—Gen. 38:5; Exo. 12:40; 17:9.", "norm_zh": "一最常用的是一部多达十大册的希腊文字义研究哪是最好的巨着乃是德国基特尔GKittel弟兄所着专讲新约七千七百多个希腊字的意义创三八5出十二40十七9", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The most commonly used is a tenvolume study of the meaning of Greek words the greatest book of all written by the German brother G Kittel and devoted to the meaning of over 7700 Greek words in the New TestamentGen 385 Exo 1240 179"}
{"zh": "二\t我们乃是把英文的权威译本，和原有中文译本，以及各种辞书和希腊文字典摆在一起，加上我们对二千年来神圣启示的承继，经过我们的参考、断定而成—赛三四16上，弗三3。", "en": "B. We put together the authoritative English translation, the original Chinese translation, and various dictionaries and Greek dictionaries, plus our inheritance of the divine revelation over the past two thousand years, through our reference and determination.—Isa. 34:16a; Eph. 3:3.", "norm_zh": "二我们乃是把英文的权威译本和原有中文译本以及各种辞书和希腊文字典摆在一起加上我们对二千年来神圣启示的承继经过我们的参考断定而成赛三四16上弗三3", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B We put together the authoritative English translation the original Chinese translation and various dictionaries and Greek dictionaries plus our inheritance of the divine revelation over the past two thousand years through our reference and determinationIsa 3416a Eph 33"}
{"zh": "研究希腊文字义", "en": "Studying the meaning of Greek words", "norm_zh": "研究希腊文字义", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Studying the meaning of Greek words"}
{"zh": "首重古卷学", "en": "The study of ancient manuscripts is the first priority", "norm_zh": "首重古卷学", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The study of ancient manuscripts is the first priority"}
{"zh": "国语和合本，乃根据和英译美国标准本源头一样的古卷抄本。中文的译经工作，源自天主教利玛窦等人来中国时，他们开始翻诗篇，和福音书。一八○七年，马礼逊（Robert Morrison）到中国布道，乃在一八二三年，借一中国人梁亚发，把圣经翻成中文。到了一八九○年，凡西教士所翻之圣经译本，达十一种之多，然皆不尽理想；于是他们在上海成立委员会，重加整顿，历经十七年之修订，于一九○七年出版了新约和合译本。同时在北平，天主教亦出版了文理译本。至一九一九年，旧约也完成修订，乃完成全部官话和合译本的翻译，即我们今日所通用之国语和合本。国语和合本的语体优美，但时至今日，发现其中有些意义与原意有出入，故有重新翻译之必要。", "en": "The Chinese Union Version is based on ancient manuscripts with the same origin as the American Standard Version. The work of Bible translation in Chinese originated when Catholic Matteo Ricci and others came to China; they began to translate the Psalms and the Gospels. In 1807, Robert Morrison went to China to preach, and in 1823, with the help of a Chinese man named Liang Yafa, he translated the Bible into Chinese. In 1890, there were eleven translations of the Bible translated by the Western missionaries, but none of them were satisfactory; so they established a committee in Shanghai to reorganize them, and after seventeen years of revision, they published the New Testament Union Version in 1907. At the same time in Beijing, the Catholic Church also published the Wen-li Union Version. The revision of the Old Testament was also completed, and the translation of the Chinese Union Version was completed until 1919, that is, the Chinese Union Version that we use today. The writing style of the Chinese Union Version is beautiful; however, today some meanings in it are found to be different from the original meaning, so it is necessary to re-translate.", "norm_zh": "国语和合本乃根据和英译美国标准本源头一样的古卷抄本中文的译经工作源自天主教利玛窦等人来中国时他们开始翻诗篇和福音书一八七年马礼逊RobertMorrison到中国布道乃在一八二三年借一中国人梁亚发把圣经翻成中文到了一八九年凡西教士所翻之圣经译本达十一种之多然皆不尽理想于是他们在上海成立委员会重加整顿历经十七年之修订于一九七年出版了新约和合译本同时在北平天主教亦出版了文理译本至一九一九年旧约也完成修订乃完成全部官话和合译本的翻译即我们今日所通用之国语和合本国语和合本的语体优美但时至今日发现其中有些意义与原意有出入故有重新翻译之必要", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The Chinese Union Version is based on ancient manuscripts with the same origin as the American Standard Version The work of Bible translation in Chinese originated when Catholic Matteo Ricci and others came to China they began to translate the Psalms and the Gospels In 1807 Robert Morrison went to China to preach and in 1823 with the help of a Chinese man named Liang Yafa he translated the Bible into Chinese In 1890 there were eleven translations of the Bible translated by the Western missionaries but none of them were satisfactory so they established a committee in Shanghai to reorganize them and after seventeen years of revision they published the New Testament Union Version in 1907 At the same time in Beijing the Catholic Church also published the Wenli Union Version The revision of the Old Testament was also completed and the translation of the Chinese Union Version was completed until 1919 that is the Chinese Union Version that we use today The writing style of the Chinese Union Version is beautiful however today some meanings in it are found to be different from the original meaning so it is necessary to retranslate"}
{"zh": "汇集各家所长之结晶", "en": "The crystallization of the best of all schools of thought", "norm_zh": "汇集各家所长之结晶", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The crystallization of the best of all schools of thought"}
{"zh": "神圣启示的集大成", "en": "The consummation of the divine revelation", "norm_zh": "神圣启示的集大成", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The consummation of the divine revelation"}
{"zh": "承先启后，进而更有所见", "en": "Inheriting the past and opening up the future, and advancing to see even more", "norm_zh": "承先启后进而更有所见", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Inheriting the past and opening up the future and advancing to see even more"}
{"zh": "翻译圣经，历代是逐渐进步的。惯例总是承先启后，后者借助于先者，进而更有所见。圣经恢复本，乃以华语中最通行的国语和合本为参照，尽力保留其语体、节奏、以及人地名音译，各面的优美；并以英语中所有权威译本，以及华语中所有寻得的其他译本为参考，不但为得借鉴、启发，也为避免偏见、误断。凡较佳辞句，无不尽力采集，务求圣言中的启示，能在华语中，得到差异最少，达意最准的发表。", "en": "Bible translation has always progressed throughout the centuries. The general rule has been to carry on the heritage and to develop further; the latter always relies on the former, and in turn sees further. The Recovery Version, taking the Mandarin Union Version, the most widespread version in the Chinese language, as its standard reference, has made every effort to preserve its style, rhythm, and transliteration of names, in all their beauty; it has also used all authoritative English versions and other available Chinese versions as references, not only for comparison and enlightenment, but also to avoid bias or misjudgment. It has adopted the best renderings wherever possible, so that the revelation in the divine Word may be expressed in Chinese with the least variation and the greatest accuracy.", "norm_zh": "翻译圣经历代是逐渐进步的惯例总是承先启后后者借助于先者进而更有所见圣经恢复本乃以华语中最通行的国语和合本为参照尽力保留其语体节奏以及人地名音译各面的优美并以英语中所有权威译本以及华语中所有寻得的其他译本为参考不但为得借鉴启发也为避免偏见误断凡较佳辞句无不尽力采集务求圣言中的启示能在华语中得到差异最少达意最准的发表", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Bible translation has always progressed throughout the centuries The general rule has been to carry on the heritage and to develop further the latter always relies on the former and in turn sees further The Recovery Version taking the Mandarin Union Version the most widespread version in the Chinese language as its standard reference has made every effort to preserve its style rhythm and transliteration of names in all their beauty it has also used all authoritative English versions and other available Chinese versions as references not only for comparison and enlightenment but also to avoid bias or misjudgment It has adopted the best renderings wherever possible so that the revelation in the divine Word may be expressed in Chinese with the least variation and the greatest accuracy"}
{"zh": "汇集各方圣徒对神圣启示的认识", "en": "Bringing together the realization of the divine revelation of the saints from all sides", "norm_zh": "汇集各方圣徒对神圣启示的认识", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Bringing together the realization of the divine revelation of the saints from all sides"}
{"zh": "翻译圣经，除基于对圣经原文之明了外，也在于对圣言中神圣启示的认识。历代圣徒对神圣启示的认识，也是基于他们所得之亮光，逐渐前进的。圣经恢复本所根据者，乃此类认识之集大成，加上附注，可谓二千年来，各方圣徒对神圣启示认识之结晶，希能继往又开来。", "en": "Bible translation is based not only on the understanding of the original text of the Bible but also on the understanding of the divine revelation in the holy Word. Throughout the centuries the understanding of the divine revelation possessed by the saints has always been based upon the light they received, and this understanding has progressed steadily. The consummation of this understanding forms the basis of the Recovery Version and its footnotes. Hence, this translation and the accompanying footnotes could be called the “crystallization” of the understanding of the divine revelation which the saints everywhere have attained to in the past two thousand years. It is our hope that the Recovery Version will carry on the heritage that it has received and will pave the way for future generations.", "norm_zh": "翻译圣经除基于对圣经原文之明了外也在于对圣言中神圣启示的认识历代圣徒对神圣启示的认识也是基于他们所得之亮光逐渐前进的圣经恢复本所根据者乃此类认识之集大成加上附注可谓二千年来各方圣徒对神圣启示认识之结晶希能继往又开来", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Bible translation is based not only on the understanding of the original text of the Bible but also on the understanding of the divine revelation in the holy Word Throughout the centuries the understanding of the divine revelation possessed by the saints has always been based upon the light they received and this understanding has progressed steadily The consummation of this understanding forms the basis of the Recovery Version and its footnotes Hence this translation and the accompanying footnotes could be called the crystallization of the understanding of the divine revelation which the saints everywhere have attained to in the past two thousand years It is our hope that the Recovery Version will carry on the heritage that it has received and will pave the way for future generations"}
{"zh": "鉴定圣经原文古卷，乃翻译圣经之根据。最新发现，或为时最古之古卷，并非最为准确、可靠。任何一节或一段须考量之经文，均须根据其书及其章之上下文，并须比较其相同记载之经文，而作鉴定。圣经恢复本之古卷鉴定，即以此为原则。", "en": "The determination of the original text of the ancient manuscripts is the basis of Bible translation. The most recently discovered manuscripts or the oldest manuscripts are not necessarily the most accurate and reliable. Any verse or section of Scripture under consideration must be determined according to the context of its book and chapter and must be compared with other passages of similar record. The determination of the ancient manuscripts for the Recovery Version has been done according to this principle.", "norm_zh": "鉴定圣经原文古卷乃翻译圣经之根据最新发现或为时最古之古卷并非最为准确可靠任何一节或一段须考量之经文均须根据其书及其章之上下文并须比较其相同记载之经文而作鉴定圣经恢复本之古卷鉴定即以此为原则", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The determination of the original text of the ancient manuscripts is the basis of Bible translation The most recently discovered manuscripts or the oldest manuscripts are not necessarily the most accurate and reliable Any verse or section of Scripture under consideration must be determined according to the context of its book and chapter and must be compared with other passages of similar record The determination of the ancient manuscripts for the Recovery Version has been done according to this principle"}
{"zh": "圣经恢复本竭尽所能，探究原文精意，用中肯、浅顺之国语表达之。凡难照原文语气表达者，均加注解释。", "en": "The Recovery Version has made every effort to investigate the precise meaning of the original text and to express it in a fitting, simple, and smooth Mandarin. Wherever it is difficult to express the flavor of the original text, explanatory footnotes have been added.", "norm_zh": "圣经恢复本竭尽所能探究原文精意用中肯浅顺之国语表达之凡难照原文语气表达者均加注解释", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The Recovery Version has made every effort to investigate the precise meaning of the original text and to express it in a fitting simple and smooth Mandarin Wherever it is difficult to express the flavor of the original text explanatory footnotes have been added"}
{"zh": "注解重在真理的启示、属灵的亮光、以及生命的供应", "en": "The footnotes stress the revelation of truth, spiritual light, and the supply of life", "norm_zh": "注解重在真理的启示属灵的亮光以及生命的供应", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The footnotes stress the revelation of truth spiritual light and the supply of life"}
{"zh": "圣经恢复本每卷书的主题、纲目，乃以史事为根据，并以灵意为发表。注解重于真理的启示、属灵的亮光、以及生命的供应，过于历史、地理和人物的解释。串珠不仅指引到相同的辞句与史事，更根据属灵的启示，指引到有关的事物和经言。（新约圣经恢复本简介）", "en": "The subject and outlines of each book in the Recovery Version are based on historical facts and express the spiritual meaning. The footnotes stress the revelation of truth, spiritual light, and the supply of life, more than the explanation of history, geography, and persons. The cross-references lead not only to other verses with similar language and facts, but also to other matters and verses related to the spiritual revelation. (Brief Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version)", "norm_zh": "圣经恢复本每卷书的主提纲目乃以史事为根据并以灵意为发表注解重于真理的启示属灵的亮光以及生命的供应过于历史地理和人物的解释串珠不仅指引到相同的辞句与史事更根据属灵的启示指引到有关的事物和经言新约圣经恢复本简介", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The subject and outlines of each book in the Recovery Version are based on historical facts and express the spiritual meaning The footnotes stress the revelation of truth spiritual light and the supply of life more than the explanation of history geography and persons The crossreferences lead not only to other verses with similar language and facts but also to other matters and verses related to the spiritual revelation Brief Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version"}
{"zh": "教会的希腊原文是ekklesia，ek就是“出来”，kaleo是蒙召的引伸辞；因此这辞乃是蒙召出来的会众，最好译为召会。除了神召会用这翻译外，一九三六年左右，在北平由德国弟兄Henry Loak所带领，翻译新旧库新约译本时，也用“召会”这辞代替教会。这次我们翻译新约圣经恢复本，也把好些俗用而不合圣经原意的字眼改掉，如先知改为申言者，当然，“教会”这字用得比“先知”更糟，意指一个宗教的会集，我们更该改掉。所以从今天起，凡我们的书籍和话语，都要改采用“召会”一辞。", "en": "The Greek word for the church is ekklesia, ek means \"to come out,\" and kaleo is an extension of called; therefore, this word is a called-out assembly, which is better translated as the church. In addition to the use of this translation by the Assemblies of God, around 1936, when the German brother Henry Loak led the translation of the New Testament translation of the \"Shin-Ju-Ku\" Version in Peiping, the term \"church\" was also used instead of \"chiao-hui\". When we translated the New Testament Recovery Version this time, we also changed some vulgar and unscriptural words, such as foretellers instead of prophets. Of course, the word 'chiao-hui' was used worse than 'foreteller', which means a religious gathering, and we should change it. Therefore, from today onwards, all our books and words will use the term \"church.\"", "norm_zh": "教会的希腊原文是ekklesiaek就是出来kaleo是蒙召的引伸辞因此这辞乃是蒙召出来的会众最好译为召会除了神召会用这翻译外一九三六年左右在北平由德国弟兄HenryLoak所带领翻译新旧库新约译本时也用召会这辞代替教会这次我们翻译新约圣经恢复本也把好些俗用而不合圣经原意的字眼改掉如先知改为申言者当然教会这字用得比先知更糟意指一个宗教的会集我们更该改掉所以从今天起凡我们的书籍和话语都要改采用召会一辞", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The Greek word for the church is ekklesia ek means to come out and kaleo is an extension of called therefore this word is a calledout assembly which is better translated as the church In addition to the use of this translation by the Assemblies of God around 1936 when the German brother Henry Loak led the translation of the New Testament translation of the ShinJuKu Version in Peiping the term church was also used instead of chiaohui When we translated the New Testament Recovery Version this time we also changed some vulgar and unscriptural words such as foretellers instead of prophets Of course the word chiaohui was used worse than foreteller which means a religious gathering and we should change it Therefore from today onwards all our books and words will use the term church"}
{"zh": "使用恢复译本带注解并生命读经的信息", "en": "Using the Recovery Version with footnotes and the Life-study messages", "norm_zh": "使用恢复译本带注解并生命读经的信息", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Using the Recovery Version with footnotes and the Lifestudy messages"}
{"zh": "要认识神新约的经纶，上好的路就是使用恢复译本带注解并生命读经的信息。不要以为我说这话是要宣传我的材料。我不过是诚实的告诉你们，被新约真理构成的上好的路是什么。", "en": "To know God's New Testament economy, the best way is to use the Recovery Version with footnotes and the Life-study messages. Do not think that in saying this, I am promoting my own material. I am only telling you honestly what the best way is to be constituted with the New Testament truth.", "norm_zh": "要认识神新约的经纶上好的路就是使用恢复译本带注解并生命读经的信息不要以为我说这话是要宣传我的材料我不过是诚实的告诉你们被新约真理构成的上好的路是什么", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:23:37.156638+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "To know Gods New Testament economy the best way is to use the Recovery Version with footnotes and the Lifestudy messages Do not think that in saying this I am promoting my own material I am only telling you honestly what the best way is to be constituted with the New Testament truth"}
{"zh": "壹\t我们愿意人知道新约圣经恢复本的翻译原则；我们翻译新约圣经恢复本，不是轻易为之；我们的恢复译本，乃神圣启示的集大成—弗一17，三3，提后三16，二15：（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "I. We want people to know the principles of translation of the New Testament Recovery Version; our translation of the New Testament Recovery Version was not done lightly; our Recovery Version is the consummation of the divine revelation—Eph. 1:17; 3:3; 2 Tim. 3:16; 2:15:", "norm_zh": "壹我们愿意人知道新约圣经恢复本的翻译原则我们翻译新约圣经恢复本不是轻易为之我们的恢复译本乃神圣启示的集大成弗一17三3提后三16二15李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I We want people to know the principles of translation of the New Testament Recovery Version our translation of the New Testament Recovery Version was not done lightly our Recovery Version is the consummation of the divine revelationEph 117 33 2 Tim 316 215"}
{"zh": "一\t首先，我们乃是以最通用之国语和合本为参照，尽量保持其语体、节奏、和人名地名之音译的优美—歌五10，诗一四三~一四五，提后三16，赛三四16上。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "A. First, we refer to the most commonly used Chinese Union Version and try to keep its writing style, rhythm, and transliteration of the names of people and places—S.S. 5:10; Psa. 143-145; 2 Tim. 3:16; Isa. 34:16a.", "norm_zh": "一首先我们乃是以最通用之国语和合本为参照尽量保持其语体节奏和人名地名之音译的优美歌五10诗一四三一四五提后三16赛三四16上李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A First we refer to the most commonly used Chinese Union Version and try to keep its writing style rhythm and transliteration of the names of people and placesSS 510 Psa 143145 2 Tim 316 Isa 3416a"}
{"zh": "二\t其次，这本恢复译本也以所有英文权威译本，和新约希腊文字义权威解释及辞书，并所有中文白话、文言两体的译文为参考；不但为得借鉴、启发，也为避免偏见、误断—腓一10，彼前一12，提后二15：（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第八篇；新约圣经恢复本简介）", "en": "B. Secondly, this Recovery Version also uses all authoritative English translations, authoritative interpretations, and dictionaries of the meaning of Greek words in the New Testament, and all Chinese vernacular and classical Chinese translations as references; not only to obtain benefit and inspiration but also to avoid prejudice and inaccurate judgments—Phil. 1:10; 1 Pet. 1:12; 2 Tim. 2:15:", "norm_zh": "二其次这本恢复译本也以所有英文权威译本和新约希腊文字义权威解释及辞书并所有中文白话文言两体的译文为参考不但为得借鉴启发也为避免偏见误断腓一10彼前一12提后二15李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第八篇新约圣经恢复本简介", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Secondly this Recovery Version also uses all authoritative English translations authoritative interpretations and dictionaries of the meaning of Greek words in the New Testament and all Chinese vernacular and classical Chinese translations as references not only to obtain benefit and inspiration but also to avoid prejudice and inaccurate judgmentsPhil 110 1 Pet 112 2 Tim 215"}
{"zh": "1\t所有英文中最好的新约译本约有五十种，其中最具权威的十余种，在我们翻译时，都摆在我们案前作为参考—赛三四16上。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "1. There are about fifty best translations of the New Testament in English, among which more than ten are the most authoritative, and they are all placed in front of our case as a reference when we are translating.—Isa. 34:16a.", "norm_zh": "1所有英文中最好的新约译本约有五十种其中最具权威的十余种在我们翻译时都摆在我们案前作为参考赛三四16上李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 There are about fifty best translations of the New Testament in English among which more than ten are the most authoritative and they are all placed in front of our case as a reference when we are translatingIsa 3416a"}
{"zh": "2\t至于中文译本，从天主教到中国来开始，直到现在所翻译的，可用为参考的权威译本，不到十种；这些我们也都摆在工作台上，由专人研究参考—16节上。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "2. As for the Chinese translations, there are less than ten authoritative translations that have been translated since the Catholic Church came to China that can be used as references. We also put these on the workbench for research and reference by special personnel.—v. 16a.", "norm_zh": "2至于中文译本从天主教到中国来开始直到现在所翻译的可用为参考的权威译本不到十种这些我们也都摆在工作台上由专人研究参考16节上李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 As for the Chinese translations there are less than ten authoritative translations that have been translated since the Catholic Church came to China that can be used as references We also put these on the workbench for research and reference by special personnelv 16a"}
{"zh": "3\t凡较佳辞句，无不尽力采集，务求圣言中的启示，能在华语中，得到差异最少，达意最准的发表—歌七6，提后二15。（新约圣经恢复本简介）", "en": "3. We spared no effort to collect every better expression, endeavoring to obtain the most accurate expression of the revelation in the holy Word with the fewest discrepancies in the Chinese language—S.S. 7:6; 2 Tim. 2:15. (Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version)", "norm_zh": "3凡较佳辞句无不尽力采集务求圣言中的启示能在华语中得到差异最少达意最准的发表歌七6提后二15新约圣经恢复本简介", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 We spared no effort to collect every better expression endeavoring to obtain the most accurate expression of the revelation in the holy Word with the fewest discrepancies in the Chinese languageSS 76 2 Tim 215 Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version"}
{"zh": "三\t翻译圣经，除基于对圣经原文之明了外，也在于对圣言中神圣启示的认识—路十22，林前二10：（新约圣经恢复本简介）", "en": "C. The translation of the Bible, besides being based on the understanding of the original text of the Bible, also depends on the understanding of the divine revelation in the holy Word—Luke 10:22; 1 Cor. 2:10: (Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version)", "norm_zh": "三翻译圣经除基于对圣经原文之明了外也在于对圣言中神圣启示的认识路十22林前二10新约圣经恢复本简介", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The translation of the Bible besides being based on the understanding of the original text of the Bible also depends on the understanding of the divine revelation in the holy WordLuke 1022 1 Cor 210 Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version"}
{"zh": "1\t历代圣徒对神圣启示的认识，也是基于他们所得之亮光，逐渐前进的—林后三14，弗三5。（新约圣经恢复本简介）", "en": "1. Throughout the centuries the understanding of the divine revelation possessed by the saints has always been based upon the light they received, and this understanding has progressed steadily.—2 Cor. 3:14; Eph. 3:5. (Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version)", "norm_zh": "1历代圣徒对神圣启示的认识也是基于他们所得之亮光逐渐前进的林后三14弗三5新约圣经恢复本简介", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 Throughout the centuries the understanding of the divine revelation possessed by the saints has always been based upon the light they received and this understanding has progressed steadily2 Cor 314 Eph 35 Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version"}
{"zh": "2\t圣经恢复本所根据者，乃此类认识之集大成，加上附注，可谓二千年来，各方圣徒对神圣启示认识之结晶，希能继往又开来—林前二10，弗三9。（新约圣经恢复本简介）", "en": "2. The consummation of this understanding forms the basis of the Recovery Version and its footnotes. Hence, the Recovery Version and the accompanying footnotes could be called the “crystallization” of the understanding of the divine revelation which the saints everywhere have attained to in the past two thousand years. It is our hope that the Recovery Version will carry on the heritage that it has received and will pave the way for future generations.—1 Cor. 2:10; Eph. 3:9. (Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version)", "norm_zh": "2圣经恢复本所根据者乃此类认识之集大成加上附注可谓二千年来各方圣徒对神圣启示认识之结晶希能继往又开来林前二10弗三9新约圣经恢复本简介", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The consummation of this understanding forms the basis of the Recovery Version and its footnotes Hence the Recovery Version and the accompanying footnotes could be called the crystallization of the understanding of the divine revelation which the saints everywhere have attained to in the past two thousand years It is our hope that the Recovery Version will carry on the heritage that it has received and will pave the way for future generations1 Cor 210 Eph 39 Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version"}
{"zh": "四\t鉴定圣经原文古卷，乃翻译圣经之根据；最新发现，或为时最古之古卷，并非最为准确、可靠；任何一节或一段须考量之经文，均须根据其书及其章之上下文，并须比较其相同记载之经文，而作鉴定—拉六2，诗四十7，提后二15：（新约圣经恢复本简介）", "en": "D. The establishing of the ancient manuscripts of the original text of the Bible is the basis of translating the Bible; the most recently discovered or the oldest manuscripts are not necessarily the most accurate and reliable; any verse or passage of Scripture under consideration must be determined based on the context of its book and chapter, and by comparing it with scriptures of the same record—Ezra 6:2; Psa. 40:7; 2 Tim. 2:15: (Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version)", "norm_zh": "四鉴定圣经原文古卷乃翻译圣经之根据最新发现或为时最古之古卷并非最为准确可靠任何一节或一段须考量之经文均须根据其书及其章之上下文并须比较其相同记载之经文而作鉴定拉六2诗四十7提后二15新约圣经恢复本简介", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D The establishing of the ancient manuscripts of the original text of the Bible is the basis of translating the Bible the most recently discovered or the oldest manuscripts are not necessarily the most accurate and reliable any verse or passage of Scripture under consideration must be determined based on the context of its book and chapter and by comparing it with scriptures of the same recordEzra 62 Psa 407 2 Tim 215 Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version"}
{"zh": "1\t由于圣经原本早已佚散不见，所以今天要得知圣经原文内容，就得倚靠这些古卷—7节，拉六2。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第八篇）", "en": "1. Since the original Bible has long since been lost, we must rely on these ancient manuscripts if we want to know the original text of the Bible today.—v. 7; Ezra 6:2.", "norm_zh": "1由于圣经原本早已佚散不见所以今天要得知圣经原文内容就得倚靠这些古卷7节拉六2李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第八篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 Since the original Bible has long since been lost we must rely on these ancient manuscripts if we want to know the original text of the Bible todayv 7 Ezra 62"}
{"zh": "2\t但古卷的抄写过程虽然相当严紧，仍难免有错误；历代的许多抄本，到了近代因考古学的发展，陆续出土或被发现；有心人就根据这些抄本，从事各种语言的译经工作—提后二15。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第八篇）", "en": "2. However, although the copying process of ancient manuscripts is quite rigorous, errors are still inevitable; many manuscripts throughout the ages have been unearthed or discovered in modern times due to the development of archaeology; based on these manuscripts, interested people are engaged in the work of Bible translation in various languages.—2 Tim. 2:15.", "norm_zh": "2但古卷的抄写过程虽然相当严紧仍难免有错误历代的许多抄本到了近代因考古学的发展陆续出土或被发现有心人就根据这些抄本从事各种语言的译经工作提后二15李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第八篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 However although the copying process of ancient manuscripts is quite rigorous errors are still inevitable many manuscripts throughout the ages have been unearthed or discovered in modern times due to the development of archaeology based on these manuscripts interested people are engaged in the work of Bible translation in various languages2 Tim 215"}
{"zh": "贰\t翻译圣经时，我们乃是逐节逐字一一研读，以期得到差异最少，达意最准的发表；以马太福音为例，与和合本相较，最少有三十一处重要的不同—15节，太五18：（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第八篇）", "en": "II. In translating the Bible, we study verse by verse and word by word, in order to obtain the expression with the least variation and the most accurate meaning; taking the Gospel of Matthew as an example, there are at least 31 important differences compared with the Chinese Union Version—v. 15; Matt. 5:18:", "norm_zh": "贰翻译圣经时我们乃是逐节逐字一一研读以期得到差异最少达意最准的发表以马太福音为例与和合本相较最少有三十一处重要的不同15节太五18李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第八篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "II In translating the Bible we study verse by verse and word by word in order to obtain the expression with the least variation and the most accurate meaning taking the Gospel of Matthew as an example there are at least 31 important differences compared with the Chinese Union Versionv 15 Matt 518"}
{"zh": "一\t我们将“教会”一辞改译为“召会”，是因教会一辞，乃当初西教士到中国来时，领会他们是来传教，所以称信徒的聚集为教会，意即宗教的聚会—林前一1~2：（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "A. We changed the word \"chiao-hui\" into \"chao-hui\" because the word \" chiao-hui\" was used when Western missionaries came to China and understood that they came to preach, so they called the gathering of believers chiao-hui, which means a religious gathering.—1 Cor. 1:1-2:", "norm_zh": "一我们将教会一辞改译为召会是因教会一辞乃当初西教士到中国来时领会他们是来传教所以称信徒的聚集为教会意即宗教的聚会林前一12李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A We changed the word chiaohui into chaohui because the word chiaohui was used when Western missionaries came to China and understood that they came to preach so they called the gathering of believers chiaohui which means a religious gathering1 Cor 112"}
{"zh": "1\t“召”字意为蒙召，召会就是蒙召的聚会，那就是教会的本义—1节。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "1. The word \"chao\" means to be called, and the church is a called assembly, which is the original meaning of the church.—v. 1.", "norm_zh": "1召字意为蒙召召会就是蒙召的聚会哪就是教会的本义1节李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The word chao means to be called and the church is a called assembly which is the original meaning of the churchv 1"}
{"zh": "2\t教会的希腊原文是ekklesia，ek就是“出来”，kaleo是蒙召的引伸辞；因此这辞乃是蒙召出来的会众，最好译为召会—罗一6，西三15。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "2. The Greek word for the church is ekklesia, ek means \"to come out,\" and kaleo is an extension of called; therefore, this word is a called-out assembly, which is better translated as the church.—Rom. 1:6; Col. 3:15.", "norm_zh": "2教会的希腊原文是ekklesiaek就是出来kaleo是蒙召的引伸辞因此这辞乃是蒙召出来的会众最好译为召会罗一6西三15李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The Greek word for the church is ekklesia ek means to come out and kaleo is an extension of called therefore this word is a calledout assembly which is better translated as the churchRom 16 Col 315"}
{"zh": "二\t马太十八章十五节说“只在你和他之间”，和合本译为“趁着只有他和你在一处的时候”：（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "B. Matthew 18:15 says \"between you and him alone\", which is translated in the Chinese Union Version as \"between thee and him alone\":", "norm_zh": "二马太十八章十五节说只在你和他之间和合本译为趁着只有他和你在一处的时候李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Matthew 1815 says between you and him alone which is translated in the Chinese Union Version as between thee and him alone"}
{"zh": "1\t和合本译者用“趁着”一辞，可能被领会为，恐怕这个弟兄或是死了，或者没有机会见到他了，再要认错也认不到，所以要趁着他和你同在的时候，去指责他—太十八15。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "1. The Chinese Union Version translator used the word 'while', which may be understood as saying, I am afraid that this brother is either dead, or I will not have a chance to see him, and even if he admits his mistake, he will not be able to recognize it, so tell him while he is with you.—Matt. 18:15.", "norm_zh": "1和合本译者用趁着一辞可能被领会为恐怕这个弟兄或是死了或者没有机会见到他了再要认错也认不到所以要趁着他和你同在的时候去指责他太十八15李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The Chinese Union Version translator used the word while which may be understood as saying I am afraid that this brother is either dead or I will not have a chance to see him and even if he admits his mistake he will not be able to recognize it so tell him while he is with youMatt 1815"}
{"zh": "2\t但原文的意思乃是说，只在你和他之间指责他，也就是不要给第三者知道；这乃是爱心的遮护—15节，来十24。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "2. However, the meaning of the original text is to accuse him between you and him alone, that is, don’t let the third party know; this is the cover of love.—v. 15; Heb. 10:24.", "norm_zh": "2但原文的意思乃是说只在你和他之间指责他也就是不要给第三者知道这乃是爱心的遮护15节来十24李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 However the meaning of the original text is to accuse him between you and him alone that is dont let the third party know this is the cover of lovev 15 Heb 1024"}
{"zh": "三\t马太十八章十九节说，“你们中间若有两个人在地上，在他们所求的任何事上和谐一致”；这里的“和谐一致”，和合本译为“同心合意”，是与另一辞混淆了—太十八19，罗十五6：（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "C. Matthew 18:19 says, 'If two of you are in harmony on earth concerning any matter for which they ask'; the Chinese Union Version translates \"in harmony\" here as \"with one accord,\" which is confused with another term.—Matt. 18:19; Rom. 15:6:", "norm_zh": "三马太十八章十九节说你们中间若有两个人在地上在他们所求的任何事上和谐一致这里的和谐一致和合本译为同心合意是与另一辞混淆了太十八19罗十五6李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Matthew 1819 says If two of you are in harmony on earth concerning any matter for which they ask the Chinese Union Version translates in harmony here as with one accord which is confused with another termMatt 1819 Rom 156"}
{"zh": "1\t马太十八章里，这辞没有那么深入的意思，希腊原文只是一个字，意指发声的声调非常和谐，所以是同声同调，和谐一致—太十八19。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "1. In Matthew 18, this term does not have such a deep meaning. The Greek word is just a word, which means that the sound of the voices is very harmonious, so it is in harmony with the same voice and sound.—Matt. 18:19.", "norm_zh": "1马太十八章里这辞没有哪么深入的意思希腊原文只是一个字意指发声的声调非常和谐所以是同声同调和谐一致太十八19李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 In Matthew 18 this term does not have such a deep meaning The Greek word is just a word which means that the sound of the voices is very harmonious so it is in harmony with the same voice and soundMatt 1819"}
{"zh": "2\t这特别是指祷告说的；我们祷告时，要同声同调，和谐一致—19节。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第六篇）", "en": "2. This refers especially to prayer; when we pray, we must be in unison and in harmony.—v. 19.", "norm_zh": "2这特别是指祷告说的我们祷告时要同声同调和谐一致19节李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 This refers especially to prayer when we pray we must be in unison and in harmonyv 19"}
{"zh": "叁\t圣经恢复本每卷书的主题、纲目，乃以史事为根据，并以灵意为发表—林前二13，罗八5。（新约圣经恢复本简介）", "en": "III. The subject and outlines of each book of the Recovery Version of the Bible are based on historical facts and expressed in spiritual meaning—1 Cor. 2:13; Rom. 8:5. (Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version)", "norm_zh": "叁圣经恢复本每卷书的主提纲目乃以史事为根据并以灵意为发表林前二13罗八5新约圣经恢复本简介", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III The subject and outlines of each book of the Recovery Version of the Bible are based on historical facts and expressed in spiritual meaning1 Cor 213 Rom 85 Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version"}
{"zh": "肆\t圣经恢复本的注解重在真理的启示、属灵的亮光、以及生命的供应，过于历史、地理和人物的解释—诗一一九160，约八32，一4，十10。（新约圣经恢复本简介）", "en": "IV. The footnotes of the Recovery Version of the Bible stress the revelation of truth, spiritual light, and the life supply, more than explanations of history, geography, and persons—Psa. 119:160; John 8:32; 1:4; 10:10. (Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version)", "norm_zh": "肆圣经恢复本的注解重在真理的启示属灵的亮光以及生命的供应过于历史地理和人物的解释诗一一九160约八32一4十10新约圣经恢复本简介", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "IV The footnotes of the Recovery Version of the Bible stress the revelation of truth spiritual light and the life supply more than explanations of history geography and personsPsa 119160 John 832 14 1010 Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version"}
{"zh": "伍\t圣经恢复本的串珠不仅指引到相同的辞句与史事，更根据属灵的启示，指引到有关的事物和经言—林前二13，罗十五21。（新约圣经恢复本简介）", "en": "V. The cross-references of the Recovery Version of the Bible lead not only to similar words and historical facts, but, based on spiritual revelation, to related matters and portions of the Word—1 Cor. 2:13; Rom. 15:21. (Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version)", "norm_zh": "伍圣经恢复本的串珠不仅指引到相同的辞句与史事更根据属灵的启示指引到有关的事物和经言林前二13罗十五21新约圣经恢复本简介", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "V The crossreferences of the Recovery Version of the Bible lead not only to similar words and historical facts but based on spiritual revelation to related matters and portions of the Word1 Cor 213 Rom 1521 Introduction to the New Testament Recovery Version"}
{"zh": "陆\t我们乃是谨慎且深入的研究，参考汇集各家所长之结晶；务期神圣言的启示，在我们国语的发表里，能向全球华人，表达得淋漓尽致；甚且能成为二千年来，圣徒们对新约讲解之集大成的译本—弗一17，三5：（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第八篇）", "en": "VI. We do careful and in-depth research, refer to the crystallization of the best of all schools of thought, and look forward to the revelation in the holy Word, in order that the revelation of God's Word may be fully expressed to the Chinese people all over the world in the translation of Mandarin; it can even become the translation of the aggregate of the saints’ explanations of the New Testament in the past two thousand years.—Eph. 1:17; 3:5:", "norm_zh": "陆我们乃是谨慎且深入的研究参考汇集各家所长之结晶务期神圣言的启示在我们国语的发表里能向全球华人表达得淋漓尽致甚且能成为二千年来圣徒们对新约讲解之集大成的译本弗一17三5李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第八篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "VI We do careful and indepth research refer to the crystallization of the best of all schools of thought and look forward to the revelation in the holy Word in order that the revelation of Gods Word may be fully expressed to the Chinese people all over the world in the translation of Mandarin it can even become the translation of the aggregate of the saints explanations of the New Testament in the past two thousand yearsEph 117 35"}
{"zh": "一\t最常用的是一部多达十大册的希腊文字义研究，那是最好的巨著，乃是德国基特尔（G. Kittel）弟兄所著，专讲新约七千七百多个希腊字的意义—创三八5，出十二40，十七9。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第八篇）", "en": "A. The most commonly used is a ten-volume study of the meaning of Greek words, the greatest book of all, written by the German brother G. Kittel and devoted to the meaning of over 7,700 Greek words in the New Testament.—Gen. 38:5; Exo. 12:40; 17:9.", "norm_zh": "一最常用的是一部多达十大册的希腊文字义研究哪是最好的巨着乃是德国基特尔GKittel弟兄所着专讲新约七千七百多个希腊字的意义创三八5出十二40十七9李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第八篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The most commonly used is a tenvolume study of the meaning of Greek words the greatest book of all written by the German brother G Kittel and devoted to the meaning of over 7700 Greek words in the New TestamentGen 385 Exo 1240 179"}
{"zh": "二\t我们乃是把英文的权威译本，和原有中文译本，以及各种辞书和希腊文字典摆在一起，加上我们对二千年来神圣启示的承继，经过我们的参考、断定而成—赛三四16上，弗三3。（李常受文集一九八六年第二册，主恢复中划时代的带领，第一册—新路实行的异象与具体步骤，第八篇）", "en": "B. We put together the authoritative English translation, the original Chinese translation, and various dictionaries and Greek dictionaries, plus our inheritance of the divine revelation over the past two thousand years, through our reference and determination.—Isa. 34:16a; Eph. 3:3.", "norm_zh": "二我们乃是把英文的权威译本和原有中文译本以及各种辞书和希腊文字典摆在一起加上我们对二千年来神圣启示的承继经过我们的参考断定而成赛三四16上弗三3李常受文集一九八六年第二册主恢复中划时代的带领第一册新路实行的异象与具体步骤第八篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:26:26.129941+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B We put together the authoritative English translation the original Chinese translation and various dictionaries and Greek dictionaries plus our inheritance of the divine revelation over the past two thousand years through our reference and determinationIsa 3416a Eph 33"}
{"zh": "读经：约一1，约壹一1，诗一一九130、9，耶十五16，太四4，伯二三12，来五14", "en": "Scripture Reading: John 1:1; 1 John 1:1; Psa. 119:130, 9; Jer. 15:16; Matt. 4:4; Job 23:12; Heb. 5:14", "norm_zh": "读经约一1约壹一1诗一一九1309耶十五16太四4伯二三12来五14", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Scripture Reading John 11 1 John 11 Psa 119130 9 Jer 1516 Matt 44 Job 2312 Heb 514"}
{"zh": "壹\t新约圣经恢复本注解和生命读经信息里所传达的真理，是已过二十个世纪圣徒对圣言领会的精华，是召会从圣经这部圣言所得着之启示的累积—约一1，约壹一1：", "en": "I. The truths conveyed in the footnotes of the New Testament Recovery Version and the Life-study messages are the cream of the saints, understanding of the holy Word in the past twenty centuries. They are the accumulation of the revelation that the church has received from the Bible as the holy Word.—John 1:1; 1 John 1:1:", "norm_zh": "壹新约圣经恢复本注解和生命读经信息里所传达的真理是已过二十个世纪圣徒对圣言领会的精华是召会从圣经这部圣言所得着之启示的累积约一1约壹一1", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I The truths conveyed in the footnotes of the New Testament Recovery Version and the Lifestudy messages are the cream of the saints understanding of the holy Word in the past twenty centuries They are the accumulation of the revelation that the church has received from the Bible as the holy WordJohn 11 1 John 11"}
{"zh": "一\t注解和生命读经的写法虽简单，所陈明的点却深奥，并且内容非常丰富、滋养人且光照人—诗一一九130、9。", "en": "A. The style of writing used in composing the footnotes and the Life-studies is simple, yet the points presented are profound, and the contents are very rich, nourishing, and enlightening.—Psa. 119:130, 9.", "norm_zh": "一注解和生命读经的写法虽简单所陈明的点却深奥并且内容非常丰富滋养人且光照人诗一一九1309", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The style of writing used in composing the footnotes and the Lifestudies is simple yet the points presented are profound and the contents are very rich nourishing and enlighteningPsa 119130 9"}
{"zh": "二\t生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解不能视为对圣经完备的解说，但人读完圣经任何一卷书的注解和相关的信息之后，必然会开始认识那卷书—130、9节。", "en": "B. The Life-study messages and the footnotes in the New Testament Recovery Version cannot be considered a full exposition of the Bible, but after reading the footnotes and the messages on any particular book of the Bible, a person will surely begin to understand that book.—vv. 130, 9.", "norm_zh": "二生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解不能视为对圣经完备的解说但人读完圣经任何一卷书的注解和相关的信息之后必然会开始认识哪卷书1309节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The Lifestudy messages and the footnotes in the New Testament Recovery Version cannot be considered a full exposition of the Bible but after reading the footnotes and the messages on any particular book of the Bible a person will surely begin to understand that bookvv 130 9"}
{"zh": "三\t不但如此，撰写注解和生命读经的目的，是用简短、精练的方式解决圣经中许多难解的问题；这些特点使得注解和生命读经非常有价值—130、9节。", "en": "C. Furthermore, the footnotes and the Life-studies were written with the purpose of solving many of the puzzling questions in the Bible in a brief and succinct way; these characteristics make the footnotes and the Life-studies very valuable.—vv. 130, 9.", "norm_zh": "三不但如此撰写注解和生命读经的目的是用简短精练的方式解决圣经中许多难解的问提这些特点使得注解和生命读经非常有价值1309节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Furthermore the footnotes and the Lifestudies were written with the purpose of solving many of the puzzling questions in the Bible in a brief and succinct way these characteristics make the footnotes and the Lifestudies very valuablevv 130 9"}
{"zh": "贰\t我们的负担是使真理便于主所有的儿女取得；今天在主的儿女当中有极大的饥渴—耶十五16，太四4，伯二三12，来五14：", "en": "II. Our burden is to make the truth available to all the Lord's children; there is a great hunger among the Lord's children today.—Jer. 15:16; Matt. 4:4; Job 23:12; Heb. 5:14:", "norm_zh": "贰我们的负担是使真理便于主所有的儿女取得今天在主的儿女当中有极大的饥渴耶十五16太四4伯二三12来五14", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "II Our burden is to make the truth available to all the Lords children there is a great hunger among the Lords children todayJer 1516 Matt 44 Job 2312 Heb 514"}
{"zh": "一\t天主教和更正教里的基督徒作者所出版有用的属灵书籍，仅止于二十世纪的前二十五年—诗一一九130、9。", "en": "A. Christian writers in the Catholic and Protestant churches produced useful spiritual books only until the first quarter of the twentieth century.—Psa. 119:130, 9.", "norm_zh": "一天主教和更正教里的基督徒作者所出版有用的属灵书籍仅止于二十世纪的前二十五年诗一一九1309", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Christian writers in the Catholic and Protestant churches produced useful spiritual books only until the first quarter of the twentieth centuryPsa 119130 9"}
{"zh": "二\t在十九世纪，有好些属灵的基督徒作者在英国兴起，他们出了许多属灵书籍；但二次大战后，从大约一九四五年至今，几乎没有任何循着生命、亮光、和真理这些路线上有价值的属灵书籍出版—约六63。", "en": "B. In the nineteenth century a number of spiritual Christian writers were raised up in the United Kingdom, and they produced many spiritual books; but after the Second World War, from about 1945 until the present time, almost no spiritual book of value along the lines of life, light, and truth has been published.—John 6:63.", "norm_zh": "二在十九世纪有好些属灵的基督徒作者在英国兴起他们出了许多属灵书籍但二次大战后从大约一九四五年至今几乎没有任何循着生命亮光和真理这些路线上有价值的属灵书籍出版约六63", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B In the nineteenth century a number of spiritual Christian writers were raised up in the United Kingdom and they produced many spiritual books but after the Second World War from about 1945 until the present time almost no spiritual book of value along the lines of life light and truth has been publishedJohn 663"}
{"zh": "三\t已过出版有用的书籍，主要属于字典和字义研究这类；这些书籍很好、有用，却很有限；因此，主的儿女当中有饥荒的情形—彼前二2，林前三1、2，来五12~14。", "en": "C. The useful books that have been published are mainly in the category of dictionaries and word studies; these are good and useful but in a limited way; thus, there is a situation of famine among the Lord's children.—1 Pet. 2:2; 1 Cor. 3:1, 2; Heb. 5:12-14.", "norm_zh": "三已过出版有用的书籍主要属于字典和字义研究这类这些书籍很好有用却很有限因此主的儿女当中有饥荒的情形彼前二2林前三12来五1214", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The useful books that have been published are mainly in the category of dictionaries and word studies these are good and useful but in a limited way thus there is a situation of famine among the Lords children1 Pet 22 1 Cor 31 2 Heb 51214"}
{"zh": "四\t我们打算制作精装新约生命读经，赠送许多神学院、图书馆、和基督徒团体的领头人。", "en": "D. Our intention is to produce hardbound volumes of the New Testament Life-studies and give them as gifts to many seminaries, libraries, and church leaders.", "norm_zh": "四我们打算制作精装新约生命读经赠送许多神学院图书馆和基督徒团体的领头人", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D Our intention is to produce hardbound volumes of the New Testament Lifestudies and give them as gifts to many seminaries libraries and church leaders"}
{"zh": "叁\t今天在世界各处，主都在行动，并且有许多饥饿寻求主的人；他们若尝到我们书刊中真正的食物，就会知道那正是他们所要的—彼后一19，诗一一九105，箴六23：", "en": "III. Today, all over the world, the Lord is on the move, and there are many hungry seekers of the Lord; if they taste the real food in our publications, they will know that this is exactly what they want.—2 Pet. 1:19; Psa. 119:105; Prov. 6:23:", "norm_zh": "叁今天在世界各处主都在行动并且有许多饥饿寻求主的人他们若尝到我们书刊中真正的食物就会知道哪正是他们所要的彼后一19诗一一九105箴六23", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III Today all over the world the Lord is on the move and there are many hungry seekers of the Lord if they taste the real food in our publications they will know that this is exactly what they want2 Pet 119 Psa 119105 Prov 623"}
{"zh": "一\t因此，我们急切需要将我们的英文书刊翻译成其他语文，推广给主的儿女—诗一一九45、94。", "en": "A. Thus, there is an urgent need for us to translate our English publications into other languages and spread them to the Lord's children.—Psa. 119:45, 94.", "norm_zh": "一因此我们急切需要将我们的英文书刊翻译成其他语文推广给主的儿女诗一一九4594", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Thus there is an urgent need for us to translate our English publications into other languages and spread them to the Lords childrenPsa 11945 94"}
{"zh": "二\t我信有许多人正等着收到我们的书刊—47~48、97、113、119节。", "en": "B. I believe that there are many who are waiting to receive our publications.—vv. 47-48, 97, 113, 119.", "norm_zh": "二我信有许多人正等着收到我们的书刊474897113119节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B I believe that there are many who are waiting to receive our publicationsvv 4748 97 113 119"}
{"zh": "注解和生命读经非常有价值", "en": "The footnotes and the Life-studies are very valuable.", "norm_zh": "注解和生命读经非常有价值", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The footnotes and the Lifestudies are very valuable"}
{"zh": "今天在主的儿女当中有极大的饥渴", "en": "There is a great hunger among the Lord's children today.", "norm_zh": "今天在主的儿女当中有极大的饥渴", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "There is a great hunger among the Lords children today"}
{"zh": "他们若尝到我们书刊中真正的食物，就会知道那正是他们所要的", "en": "When they taste the real food in our publications, they will recognize it.", "norm_zh": "他们若尝到我们书刊中真正的食物就会知道哪正是他们所要的", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:27:41.771300+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "When they taste the real food in our publications they will recognize it"}
{"zh": "壹\t新约圣经恢复本注解和生命读经信息里所传达的真理，是已过二十个世纪圣徒对圣言领会的精华，是召会从圣经这部圣言所得着之启示的累积—约一1，约壹一1：（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "I. The truths conveyed in the footnotes of the New Testament Recovery Version and the Life-study messages are the cream of the saints, understanding of the holy Word in the past twenty centuries. They are the accumulation of the revelation that the church has received from the Bible as the holy Word.—John 1:1; 1 John 1:1:", "norm_zh": "壹新约圣经恢复本注解和生命读经信息里所传达的真理是已过二十个世纪圣徒对圣言领会的精华是召会从圣经这部圣言所得着之启示的累积约一1约壹一1李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I The truths conveyed in the footnotes of the New Testament Recovery Version and the Lifestudy messages are the cream of the saints understanding of the holy Word in the past twenty centuries They are the accumulation of the revelation that the church has received from the Bible as the holy WordJohn 11 1 John 11"}
{"zh": "一\t注解和生命读经的写法虽简单，所陈明的点却深奥，并且内容非常丰富、滋养人且光照人—诗一一九130、9。（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "A. The style of writing used in composing the footnotes and the Life-studies is simple, yet the points presented are profound, and the contents are very rich, nourishing, and enlightening.—Psa. 119:130, 9.", "norm_zh": "一注解和生命读经的写法虽简单所陈明的点却深奥并且内容非常丰富滋养人且光照人诗一一九1309李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The style of writing used in composing the footnotes and the Lifestudies is simple yet the points presented are profound and the contents are very rich nourishing and enlighteningPsa 119130 9"}
{"zh": "二\t生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解不能视为对圣经完备的解说，但人读完圣经任何一卷书的注解和相关的信息之后，必然会开始认识那卷书—130、9节。（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "B. The Life-study messages and the footnotes in the New Testament Recovery Version cannot be considered a full exposition of the Bible, but after reading the footnotes and the messages on any particular book of the Bible, a person will surely begin to understand that book.—vv. 130, 9.", "norm_zh": "二生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解不能视为对圣经完备的解说但人读完圣经任何一卷书的注解和相关的信息之后必然会开始认识哪卷书1309节李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The Lifestudy messages and the footnotes in the New Testament Recovery Version cannot be considered a full exposition of the Bible but after reading the footnotes and the messages on any particular book of the Bible a person will surely begin to understand that bookvv 130 9"}
{"zh": "三\t不但如此，撰写注解和生命读经的目的，是用简短、精练的方式解决圣经中许多难解的问题；这些特点使得注解和生命读经非常有价值—130、9节。（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "C. Furthermore, the footnotes and the Life-studies were written with the purpose of solving many of the puzzling questions in the Bible in a brief and succinct way; these characteristics make the footnotes and the Life-studies very valuable.—vv. 130, 9.", "norm_zh": "三不但如此撰写注解和生命读经的目的是用简短精练的方式解决圣经中许多难解的问提这些特点使得注解和生命读经非常有价值1309节李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Furthermore the footnotes and the Lifestudies were written with the purpose of solving many of the puzzling questions in the Bible in a brief and succinct way these characteristics make the footnotes and the Lifestudies very valuablevv 130 9"}
{"zh": "贰\t我们的负担是使真理便于主所有的儿女取得；今天在主的儿女当中有极大的饥渴—耶十五16，太四4，伯二三12，来五14：（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "II. Our burden is to make the truth available to all the Lord's children; there is a great hunger among the Lord's children today.—Jer. 15:16; Matt. 4:4; Job 23:12; Heb. 5:14:", "norm_zh": "贰我们的负担是使真理便于主所有的儿女取得今天在主的儿女当中有极大的饥渴耶十五16太四4伯二三12来五14李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "II Our burden is to make the truth available to all the Lords children there is a great hunger among the Lords children todayJer 1516 Matt 44 Job 2312 Heb 514"}
{"zh": "一\t天主教和更正教里的基督徒作者所出版有用的属灵书籍，仅止于二十世纪的前二十五年—诗一一九130、9。（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "A. Christian writers in the Catholic and Protestant churches produced useful spiritual books only until the first quarter of the twentieth century.—Psa. 119:130, 9.", "norm_zh": "一天主教和更正教里的基督徒作者所出版有用的属灵书籍仅止于二十世纪的前二十五年诗一一九1309李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Christian writers in the Catholic and Protestant churches produced useful spiritual books only until the first quarter of the twentieth centuryPsa 119130 9"}
{"zh": "二\t在十九世纪，有好些属灵的基督徒作者在英国兴起，他们出了许多属灵书籍；但二次大战后，从大约一九四五年至今，几乎没有任何循着生命、亮光、和真理这些路线上有价值的属灵书籍出版—约六63。（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "B. In the nineteenth century a number of spiritual Christian writers were raised up in the United Kingdom, and they produced many spiritual books; but after the Second World War, from about 1945 until the present time, almost no spiritual book of value along the lines of life, light, and truth has been published.—John 6:63.", "norm_zh": "二在十九世纪有好些属灵的基督徒作者在英国兴起他们出了许多属灵书籍但二次大战后从大约一九四五年至今几乎没有任何循着生命亮光和真理这些路线上有价值的属灵书籍出版约六63李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B In the nineteenth century a number of spiritual Christian writers were raised up in the United Kingdom and they produced many spiritual books but after the Second World War from about 1945 until the present time almost no spiritual book of value along the lines of life light and truth has been publishedJohn 663"}
{"zh": "三\t已过出版有用的书籍，主要属于字典和字义研究这类；这些书籍很好、有用，却很有限；因此，主的儿女当中有饥荒的情形—彼前二2，林前三1、2，来五12~14。（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "C. The useful books that have been published are mainly in the category of dictionaries and word studies; these are good and useful but in a limited way; thus, there is a situation of famine among the Lord's children.—1 Pet. 2:2; 1 Cor. 3:1, 2; Heb. 5:12-14.", "norm_zh": "三已过出版有用的书籍主要属于字典和字义研究这类这些书籍很好有用却很有限因此主的儿女当中有饥荒的情形彼前二2林前三12来五1214李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The useful books that have been published are mainly in the category of dictionaries and word studies these are good and useful but in a limited way thus there is a situation of famine among the Lords children1 Pet 22 1 Cor 31 2 Heb 51214"}
{"zh": "四\t我们打算制作精装新约生命读经，赠送许多神学院、图书馆、和基督徒团体的领头人。（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "D. Our intention is to produce hardbound volumes of the New Testament Life-studies and give them as gifts to many seminaries, libraries, and church leaders.", "norm_zh": "四我们打算制作精装新约生命读经赠送许多神学院图书馆和基督徒团体的领头人李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D Our intention is to produce hardbound volumes of the New Testament Lifestudies and give them as gifts to many seminaries libraries and church leaders"}
{"zh": "叁\t今天在世界各处，主都在行动，并且有许多饥饿寻求主的人；他们若尝到我们书刊中真正的食物，就会知道那正是他们所要的—彼后一19，诗一一九105，箴六23：（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "III. Today the Lord is moving in every part of the world, and there are many seeking ones who are hungry; when they taste the real food in our publications, they will recognize it.—2 Pet. 1:19; Psa. 119:105; Prov. 6:23:", "norm_zh": "叁今天在世界各处主都在行动并且有许多饥饿寻求主的人他们若尝到我们书刊中真正的食物就会知道哪正是他们所要的彼后一19诗一一九105箴六23李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III Today the Lord is moving in every part of the world and there are many seeking ones who are hungry when they taste the real food in our publications they will recognize it2 Pet 119 Psa 119105 Prov 623"}
{"zh": "一\t因此，我们急切需要将我们的英文书刊翻译成其他语文，推广给主的儿女—诗一一九45、94。（李常受文集一九八四年第一册，对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话）", "en": "A. Thus, there is an urgent need for us to translate our English publications into other languages and spread them to the Lord's children.—Psa. 119:45, 94.", "norm_zh": "一因此我们急切需要将我们的英文书刊翻译成其他语文推广给主的儿女诗一一九4594李常受文集一九八四年第一册对生命读经信息和新约圣经恢复本注解推荐的话", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:28:28.651330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Thus there is an urgent need for us to translate our English publications into other languages and spread them to the Lords childrenPsa 11945 94"}
