{"zh": "光就是神的同在", "en": "Light is the presence of God", "norm_zh": "光就是神的同在", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:43:56.144386+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Light is the presence of God"}
{"zh": "一\t光是神的照耀，神的彰显；当神得着彰显的时候，那个彰显的性质就是光—5节，约八12，赛六3：（2016年夏训，第八篇；约翰一书生命读经，第九篇，第三段**）", "en": "A. Light is God’s shining, God’s expression; when God is expressed, the nature of that expression is light—v. 5; John 8:12; Isa. 6:3:", "norm_zh": "一光是神的照耀神的彰显当神得着彰显的时候哪个彰显的性质就是光5节约八12赛六32016年夏训第八篇约翰一书生命读经第九篇第三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Light is Gods shining Gods expression when God is expressed the nature of that expression is lightv 5 John 812 Isa 63"}
{"zh": "1\t在神圣的光中行，就是在神圣的光中生活、行动、行事并为人；这光就是神自己—约八12，约壹一7。（2015年夏训，第三篇；新约总论，第三百九十二篇，第十三段*）", "en": "1. To walk in the divine light is to live, move, act, and have our being in the divine light, which is God Himself—John 8:12; 1 John 1:7.", "norm_zh": "1在神圣的光中行就是在神圣的光中生活行动行事并为人这光就是神自己约八12约壹一72015年夏训第三篇新约总论第三百九十二篇第十三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 To walk in the divine light is to live move act and have our being in the divine light which is God HimselfJohn 812 1 John 17"}
{"zh": "2\t神圣的光照耀时，神圣的事物对我们就成为实际的—12节，弗四21，约十四6。（2015年夏训，第三篇；约翰一书生命读经，第九篇，第三段**）", "en": "2. When the divine light shines, divine things become real to us.—v. 12; Eph. 4:21; John 14:6.", "norm_zh": "2神圣的光照耀时神圣的事物对我们就成为实际的12节弗四21约十四62015年夏训第三篇约翰一书生命读经第九篇第三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 When the divine light shines divine things become real to usv 12 Eph 421 John 146"}
{"zh": "一\t光，是从神来的，不是从人来的—10节，创一3。（2015年夏训，第三篇；倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册，中心的信息，附篇：着迷与神的光，第五十三段）", "en": "A. Light comes from God alone, not from man—v. 10; Gen. 1:3.", "norm_zh": "一光是从神来的不是从人来的10节创一32015年夏训第三篇倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册中心的信息附篇着迷与神的光第五十三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Light comes from God alone not from manv 10 Gen 13"}
{"zh": "二\t属灵的黑暗，不是人的火所能除去的，这火绝不会带进真正属灵的光；我们自己所点的火，永远不是属灵之光的源头—赛五十11，利十1~2：（2015年夏训，第三篇；倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册，中心的信息，附篇：着迷与神的光，第五十三段**）", "en": "B. Spiritual darkness cannot be removed by human fire, which never brings in genuine spiritual light; our own fire cannot be the source of spiritual light—Isa. 50:11; Lev. 10:1-2:", "norm_zh": "二属灵的黑暗不是人的火所能除去的这火绝不会带进真正属灵的光我们自己所点的火永远不是属灵之光的源头赛五十11利十122015年夏训第三篇倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册中心的信息附篇着迷与神的光第五十三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Spiritual darkness cannot be removed by human fire which never brings in genuine spiritual light our own fire cannot be the source of spiritual lightIsa 5011 Lev 1012"}
{"zh": "1\t基督徒不能借着自己的火来走属灵的道路；他应当倚靠耶和华的名，仗赖自己的神—1~2节，赛五十10，约八12。（2015年夏训，第三篇；倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册，中心的信息，附篇：着迷与神的光，第五十四段*）", "en": "1. A Christian cannot advance in the spiritual pathway by his own fire; he should trust in the name of Jehovah and rely on his God.—vv. 1-2; Isa. 50:10; John 8:12.", "norm_zh": "1基督徒不能借着自己的火来走属灵的道路他应当倚靠耶和华的名仗赖自己的神12节赛五十10约八122015年夏训第三篇倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册中心的信息附篇着迷与神的光第五十四段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 A Christian cannot advance in the spiritual pathway by his own fire he should trust in the name of Jehovah and rely on his Godvv 12 Isa 5010 John 812"}
{"zh": "2\t属灵的光，不是从我们的感觉和思想来的—利十1~2，约壹一7。（2015年夏训，第三篇；倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册，中心的信息，附篇：着迷与神的光，第五十四段）", "en": "2. Spiritual light does not come from our own feelings or thoughts.—Lev. 10:1-2; 1 John 1:7.", "norm_zh": "2属灵的光不是从我们的感觉和思想来的利十12约壹一72015年夏训第三篇倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册中心的信息附篇着迷与神的光第五十四段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Spiritual light does not come from our own feelings or thoughtsLev 1012 1 John 17"}
{"zh": "3\t人越往自己里面找光，就越没有光，因为光不在那里—5节，约八12。（2015年夏训，第三篇；倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册，中心的信息，附篇：着迷与神的光，第五十四段）", "en": "3. The more a person searches inwardly for light, the more he will not find light, because light is not there.—v. 5; John 8:12.", "norm_zh": "3人越往自己里面找光就越没有光因为光不在哪里5节约八122015年夏训第三篇倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册中心的信息附篇着迷与神的光第五十四段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 The more a person searches inwardly for light the more he will not find light because light is not therev 5 John 812"}
{"zh": "一\t我们在神的光中才能看见光，并看见事情的真相—9节：（2015年夏训，第三篇；倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册，中心的信息，附篇：着迷与神的光，第五十五段）", "en": "A. Through God’s light we see light and the true condition of things:—v. 9:", "norm_zh": "一我们在神的光中才能看见光并看见事情的真相9节2015年夏训第三篇倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册中心的信息附篇着迷与神的光第五十五段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Through Gods light we see light and the true condition of thingsv 9"}
{"zh": "1\t诗篇三十六篇九节里的第一个光是指光照的光，第二个光是指事情的真相。（2015年夏训，第三篇；倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册，中心的信息，附篇：着迷与神的光，第五十五段*）", "en": "1. The first light in Psalm 36:9 is the enlightening light, and the second light denotes the true nature of things.", "norm_zh": "1诗篇三十六篇九节里的第一个光是指光照的光第二个光是指事情的真相2015年夏训第三篇倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册中心的信息附篇着迷与神的光第五十五段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The first light in Psalm 369 is the enlightening light and the second light denotes the true nature of things"}
{"zh": "二\t在神的光中才能看见神所看见的，这就是在神的光中得见光—诗三六9，约八12。（2015年夏训，第三篇；倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册，中心的信息，附篇：着迷与神的光，第五十七段）", "en": "B.\tWhen we are in God's light, we see what God sees; this is seeing light in God's light.B. When we are in God's light, we see what God sees; this is seeing light in God's light.—Psa. 36:9; John 8:12.", "norm_zh": "二在神的光中才能看见神所看见的这就是在神的光中得见光诗三六9约八122015年夏训第三篇倪柝声文集第二辑第十六册中心的信息附篇着迷与神的光第五十七段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B When we are in Gods light we see what God sees this is seeing light in Gods lightB When we are in Gods light we see what God sees this is seeing light in Gods lightPsa 369 John 812"}
{"zh": "伍\t神是光，这光凝聚在神的话中；因此，神的话乃是神这神圣之光的具体化—约壹一5，诗一一九105、130：（2015年夏训，第三篇；出埃及记生命读经，第六十篇，第九段**）", "en": "V. God is light, and this light is consolidated in the Word; therefore, the Word of God is the embodiment of God as the divine light—1 John 1:5; Psa. 119:105, 130:", "norm_zh": "伍神是光这光凝聚在神的话中因此神的话乃是神这神圣之光的具体化约壹一5诗一一九1051302015年夏训第三篇出埃及记生命读经第六十篇第九段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "V God is light and this light is consolidated in the Word therefore the Word of God is the embodiment of God as the divine light1 John 15 Psa 119105 130"}
{"zh": "一\t神的话是神圣之光的“凝聚”，所以每当我们来到神的话前，我们应当觉得我们是在光的气氛中—三六9，一一九105。（2015年夏训，第三篇；出埃及记生命读经，第五十九篇，第三十一段**）", "en": "A.\tThe Word is the consolidation of the divine light, so whenever we come to the Word, we should sense that we are in an atmosphere of light.—Psa. 36:9; 119:105.", "norm_zh": "一神的话是神圣之光的凝聚所以每当我们来到神的话前我们应当觉得我们是在光的气氛中三六9一一九1052015年夏训第三篇出埃及记生命读经第五十九篇第三十一段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The Word is the consolidation of the divine light so whenever we come to the Word we should sense that we are in an atmosphere of lightPsa 369 119105"}
{"zh": "二\t我们若以正确的态度来到神的话前，我们就会在光中，并在光之下，而不仅是接受光而已—约壹一6~7。（2015年夏训，第三篇；出埃及记生命读经，第五十九篇，第三十段**）", "en": "B.\tIf we come to the Word with a proper attitude, we will be in the light and under the light and not merely receive light.—1 John 1:6-7.", "norm_zh": "二我们若以正确的态度来到神的话前我们就会在光中并在光之下而不仅是接受光而已约壹一672015年夏训第三篇出埃及记生命读经第五十九篇第三十段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B If we come to the Word with a proper attitude we will be in the light and under the light and not merely receive light1 John 167"}
{"zh": "陆\t在爱神之寻求者的经历里，神的话就是光的范围—诗三六9，一一九130：（2015年夏训，第三篇***）", "en": "VI.\tIn the experience of God's loving seekers, the Word of God is a realm of light:—Psa. 36:9; 119:130:", "norm_zh": "陆在爱神之寻求者的经历里神的话就是光的范围诗三六9一一九1302015年夏训第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "VI In the experience of Gods loving seekers the Word of God is a realm of lightPsa 369 119130"}
{"zh": "一\t因着神的话乃是光的范围，神的话一解开，就发出亮光—130节。（2015年夏训，第三篇；出埃及记生命读经，第六十篇，第九段**）", "en": "A.\tBecause the Word is a realm of light, the opening of God's words gives light.—v. 130.", "norm_zh": "一因着神的话乃是光的范围神的话一解开就发出亮光130节2015年夏训第三篇出埃及记生命读经第六十篇第九段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Because the Word is a realm of light the opening of Gods words gives lightv 130"}
{"zh": "2\t光的果子与三一神有关—太十九17，罗五21，约十四17：（2015年夏训，第三篇；以弗所书生命读经，第五十篇，第二十八段）", "en": "2.\tThe fruit of the light is related to the Triune God:—Matt. 19:17; Rom. 5:21; John 14:17:", "norm_zh": "2光的果子与三一神有关太十九17罗五21约十四172015年夏训第三篇以弗所书生命读经第五十篇第二十八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The fruit of the light is related to the Triune GodMatt 1917 Rom 521 John 1417"}
{"zh": "2\t国度乃是主耶稣照耀在我们身上，国度也是主耶稣借着照耀在我们身上而有的扩展—彼前二9，太四23，出十九6。（2015年夏训，第三篇；李常受文集一九七二年第二册，国度，第二章，第二十段**）", "en": "2.\tThe kingdom is the Lord Jesus shining over us, and the kingdom is the spreading of the Lord Jesus by shining over us.—1 Pet. 2:9; Matt. 4:23; Exo. 19:6.", "norm_zh": "2国度乃是主耶稣照耀在我们身上国度也是主耶稣借着照耀在我们身上而有的扩展彼前二9太四23出十九62015年夏训第三篇李常受文集一九七二年第二册国度第二章第二十段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The kingdom is the Lord Jesus shining over us and the kingdom is the spreading of the Lord Jesus by shining over us1 Pet 29 Matt 423 Exo 196"}
{"zh": "柒\t神的话在我们的经历中对我们是不是光的范围，乃在于我们来到神话语前的态度和光景—诗一一九105，约壹一5~7：（2015年夏训，第三篇；出埃及记生命读经，第五十九篇，第三十二段**）", "en": "VII.\tWhether or not the Word is a realm of light to us in our experience depends on our attitude and condition in coming to the Word:—Psa. 119:105; 1 John 1:5-7:", "norm_zh": "柒神的话在我们的经历中对我们是不是光的范围乃在于我们来到神话语前的态度和光景诗一一九105约壹一572015年夏训第三篇出埃及记生命读经第五十九篇第三十二段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "VII Whether or not the Word is a realm of light to us in our experience depends on our attitude and condition in coming to the WordPsa 119105 1 John 157"}
{"zh": "二\t我们全人的各部分应当敞开，接受主的光照—箴二十27，诗六七1。（2015年夏训，第三篇；李常受文集一九七八年第二册，生命信息卷一，第二章，第二十三段**）", "en": "B.\tAll the chambers of our being should be open to receive the Lord's shining.—Prov. 20:27; Psa. 67:1.", "norm_zh": "二我们全人的各部分应当敞开接受主的光照箴二十27诗六七12015年夏训第三篇李常受文集一九七八年第二册生命信息卷一第二章第二十三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B All the chambers of our being should be open to receive the Lords shiningProv 2027 Psa 671"}
{"zh": "三\t我们需要对付我们的心，而向主有一个正确的心—路八13~15，耶二九13，西三23：（2015年夏训，第三篇；新约总论，第四百零一篇，第二十四段**）", "en": "C.\tWe need to deal with our heart and have a proper heart toward the Lord.—Luke 8:13-15; Jer. 29:13; Col. 3:23:", "norm_zh": "三我们需要对付我们的心而向主有一个正确的心路八1315耶二九13西三232015年夏训第三篇新约总论第四百零一篇第二十四段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C We need to deal with our heart and have a proper heart toward the LordLuke 81315 Jer 2913 Col 323"}
{"zh": "2\t惟独神是光，惟独神是光的源头，也惟独在神的光中，我们才能见光—诗三六9，约壹一5，约八12。（2015年夏训，第三篇；倪柝声文集第二辑第二十一册，特会、信息、及谈话记录（卷一），第二篇，第八段**）", "en": "2.\tOnly God is light, only God is the source of light, and only in the light of God can we see light.—Psa. 36:9; 1 John 1:5; John 8:12.", "norm_zh": "2惟独神是光惟独神是光的源头也惟独在神的光中我们才能见光诗三六9约壹一5约八122015年夏训第三篇倪柝声文集第二辑第二十一册特会信息及谈话记录卷一第二篇第八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Only God is light only God is the source of light and only in the light of God can we see lightPsa 369 1 John 15 John 812"}
{"zh": "1\t在神的经纶中并在神的召会里，只有一个窗，一个启示，和一个异象—徒九4~5，二六19，创六16，弗四3~4。（2015年夏训，第三篇；创世记生命读经，第三十篇，第二十四段*）", "en": "1.\tIn God's economy and in God's church there is only one window, one revelation, and one vision.—Acts 9:4-5; 26:19; Gen. 6:16; Eph. 4:3-4.", "norm_zh": "1在神的经纶中并在神的召会里只有一个窗一个启示和一个异象徒九45二六19创六16弗四342015年夏训第三篇创世记生命读经第三十篇第二十四段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 In Gods economy and in Gods church there is only one window one revelation and one visionActs 945 2619 Gen 616 Eph 434"}
{"zh": "2\t我们必须照着这时代的异象事奉神，而这异象乃是借着这时代的职事而有的—徒二六19。（2015年夏训，第三篇；李常受文集一九八六年第二册，时代的异象，第一篇，第二十三段**）", "en": "2.\tWe need to serve God according to the vision of the age, which comes through the ministry of the age.—Acts 26:19.", "norm_zh": "2我们必须照着这时代的异象事奉神而这异象乃是借着这时代的职事而有的徒二六192015年夏训第三篇李常受文集一九八六年第二册时代的异象第一篇第二十三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:45:12.726079+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 We need to serve God according to the vision of the age which comes through the ministry of the ageActs 2619"}
{"zh": "读经：诗一一九25、50、57上，58上，103、105、107、130上，135上，154，一2~3，约一4，西二7上，提后三16上，西一12，林后四6，三18", "en": "Scripture Reading: Psa. 119:25, 50, 57a, 58a, 103, 105, 107, 130a, 135a, 154; 1:2-3; John 1:4; Col. 2:7a; 2 Tim. 3:16a; Col. 1:12; 2 Cor. 4:6; 3:18", "norm_zh": "读经诗一一九255057上58上103105107130上135上154一23约一4西二7上提后三16上西一12林后四6三18", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Scripture Reading Psa 11925 50 57a 58a 103 105 107 130a 135a 154 123 John 14 Col 27a 2 Tim 316a Col 112 2 Cor 46 318"}
{"zh": "a\t生命出于光；光是生命的关键—约八12，一4。", "en": "a.\\tLife comes from light; light is the key to life.—John 8:12; 1:4.", "norm_zh": "a生命出于光光是生命的关键约八12一4", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "atLife comes from light light is the key to lifeJohn 812 14"}
{"zh": "b\t在神那一面，先有生命，然后有光；在我们这一面，先有光，然后有生命—诗三六9，约一1、4~5，八12，林后四6，徒二六13。", "en": "b.\\tOn God's side, there is first life and then light; on our side, there is first light and then life.—Psa. 36:9; John 1:1, 4-5; 8:12; 2 Cor. 4:6; Acts 26:13.", "norm_zh": "b在神哪一面先有生命然后有光在我们这一面先有光然后有生命诗三六9约一145八12林后四6徒二六13", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "btOn Gods side there is first life and then light on our side there is first light and then lifePsa 369 John 11 45 812 2 Cor 46 Acts 2613"}
{"zh": "5\t光照耀到哪里，生命就供应到哪里—约一4，八12，林后四6，三18。", "en": "5.\\tWhere the light shines, there the life supply goes.—John 1:4; 8:12; 2 Cor. 4:6; 3:18.", "norm_zh": "5光照耀到哪里生命就供应到哪里约一4八12林后四6三18", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "5tWhere the light shines there the life supply goesJohn 14 812 2 Cor 46 318"}
{"zh": "6\t神变化我们的路是借着光照；光照耀到哪里，生命就供应到哪里，使我们变化—18节，四6。", "en": "6.\\tGod's way of transforming us is through enlightening; wherever the light shines, life is supplied to that place for our transformation.—v. 18; 4:6.", "norm_zh": "6神变化我们的路是借着光照光照耀到哪里生命就供应到哪里使我们变化18节四6", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "6tGods way of transforming us is through enlightening wherever the light shines life is supplied to that place for our transformationv 18 46"}
{"zh": "1\t虽然有光是好的，但光必须更深地透入，直到成为生命—约一4，八12，十二36，林后三18。", "en": "1.\\tAlthough it is good to have light, the light must penetrate deeper until it becomes life.—John 1:4; 8:12; 12:36; 2 Cor. 3:18.", "norm_zh": "1虽然有光是好的但光必须更深地透入直到成为生命约一4八12十二36林后三18", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1tAlthough it is good to have light the light must penetrate deeper until it becomes lifeJohn 14 812 1236 2 Cor 318"}
{"zh": "2\t当光更深入达到我们的灵里，光就成了生命，我们便得着生命的供应—玛四2，林后三18。", "en": "2.\\tWhen light goes deeper, reaching into our spirit, it becomes life, and we receive the life supply.—Mal. 4:2; 2 Cor. 3:18.", "norm_zh": "2当光更深入达到我们的灵里光就成了生命我们便得着生命的供应玛四2林后三18", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2tWhen light goes deeper reaching into our spirit it becomes life and we receive the life supplyMal 42 2 Cor 318"}
{"zh": "一\t爱神的寻求者所经历的福，乃是被神的话浇灌—2~3节：", "en": "A.\\tGod's loving seekers experience the blessing of being watered by the Word:—vv. 2-3:", "norm_zh": "一爱神的寻求者所经历的福乃是被神的话浇灌23节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "AtGods loving seekers experience the blessing of being watered by the Wordvv 23"}
{"zh": "二\t爱神的寻求者所经历的福，乃是借着神的话吸取神—西二7上，耶十五16，约一1，西二19：", "en": "B.\\tGod's loving seekers experience the blessing of absorbing God through the Word.—Col. 2:7a; Jer. 15:16; John 1:1; Col. 2:19:", "norm_zh": "二爱神的寻求者所经历的福乃是借着神的话吸取神西二7上耶十五16约一1西二19", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "BtGods loving seekers experience the blessing of absorbing God through the WordCol 27a Jer 1516 John 11 Col 219"}
{"zh": "2\t我们若接触主，并且花时间用许多祷告读主的话，就会将神吸取到我们里面，作为使我们长大的元素—三16，约六63下，西二19。", "en": "2.\\tIf we contact the Lord and spend time in the Word with much prayer, we will absorb God into us to be the element that causes us to grow.—Col. 3:16; John 6:63b; Col. 2:19.", "norm_zh": "2我们若接触主并且花时间用许多祷告读主的话就会将神吸取到我们里面作为使我们长大的元素三16约六63下西二19", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2tIf we contact the Lord and spend time in the Word with much prayer we will absorb God into us to be the element that causes us to growCol 316 John 663b Col 219"}
{"zh": "二\t说圣经都是神的呼出，就是说圣经是那是灵之神的气，呼出—提后三16上，约二十22：", "en": "B.\\tTo say that all Scripture is God-breathed is to say that the Bible is the breath, the breathing out, of God, who is Spirit.—2 Tim. 3:16a; John 20:22:", "norm_zh": "二说圣经都是神的呼出就是说圣经是哪是灵之神的气呼出提后三16上约二十22", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "BtTo say that all Scripture is Godbreathed is to say that the Bible is the breath the breathing out of God who is Spirit2 Tim 316a John 2022"}
{"zh": "1\t因着圣经就是神的呼出，圣经就有神的成分—提后三16上，约五39。", "en": "1\tBecause the Bible is the breathing out of God, the Bible has the element of God.1\\tBecause the Bible is the breathing out of God, the Bible has the element of God.—2 Tim. 3:16a; John 5:39.", "norm_zh": "1因着圣经就是神的呼出圣经就有神的成分提后三16上约五39", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 Because the Bible is the breathing out of God the Bible has the element of God1tBecause the Bible is the breathing out of God the Bible has the element of God2 Tim 316a John 539"}
{"zh": "2\t圣经不仅是神的呼出，并且是神把祂的自己呼到祂的话里—提后三16上，约一1、14，五39，六63下。", "en": "2\tThe Bible is not only the breathing out of God but is God Himself breathed into His Word.2\\tThe Bible is not only the breathing out of God but is God Himself breathed into His Word.—2 Tim. 3:16a; John 1:1, 14; 5:39; 6:63b.", "norm_zh": "2圣经不仅是神的呼出并且是神把祂的自己呼到祂的话里提后三16上约一114五39六63下", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The Bible is not only the breathing out of God but is God Himself breathed into His Word2tThe Bible is not only the breathing out of God but is God Himself breathed into His Word2 Tim 316a John 11 14 539 663b"}
{"zh": "三\t神已经在祂的话里把自己呼出来，使我们能借着祂的话吸入祂，将祂吸入—耶十五16，诗一一九57，罗十13：", "en": "C.\tGod has breathed Himself out in the Word so that we can inhale Him, breathe Him in, through the Word:C.\\tGod has breathed Himself out in the Word so that we can inhale Him, breathe Him in, through the Word:—Jer. 15:16; Psa. 119:57; Rom. 10:13:", "norm_zh": "三神已经在祂的话里把自己呼出来使我们能借着祂的话吸入祂将祂吸入耶十五16诗一一九57罗十13", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C God has breathed Himself out in the Word so that we can inhale Him breathe Him in through the WordCtGod has breathed Himself out in the Word so that we can inhale Him breathe Him in through the WordJer 1516 Psa 11957 Rom 1013"}
{"zh": "1\t神在圣经里已将祂自己呼出，因此我们读圣经，应当是接受神的气—约二十22，提后三16上，约二十22。", "en": "1\tGod has breathed Himself out in the Scriptures, and thus our reading of the Scriptures should be the receiving of God's breath.1\\tGod has breathed Himself out in the Scriptures, and thus our reading of the Scriptures should be the receiving of God's breath.—John 20:22; 2 Tim. 3:16a; John 20:22.", "norm_zh": "1神在圣经里已将祂自己呼出因此我们读圣经应当是接受神的气约二十22提后三16上约二十22", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 God has breathed Himself out in the Scriptures and thus our reading of the Scriptures should be the receiving of Gods breath1tGod has breathed Himself out in the Scriptures and thus our reading of the Scriptures should be the receiving of Gods breathJohn 2022 2 Tim 316a John 2022"}
{"zh": "2\t神将祂自己呼出时，乃是呼出祂自己；我们借着神的话接触神时，就是吸入神—提后三16上，耶十五16。", "en": "2\tWhen God breathes Himself out, He exhales Himself, and when we contact God through the Word, we inhale God.2\\tWhen God breathes Himself out, He exhales Himself, and when we contact God through the Word, we inhale God.—2 Tim. 3:16a; Jer. 15:16.", "norm_zh": "2神将祂自己呼出时乃是呼出祂自己我们借着神的话接触神时就是吸入神提后三16上耶十五16", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 When God breathes Himself out He exhales Himself and when we contact God through the Word we inhale God2tWhen God breathes Himself out He exhales Himself and when we contact God through the Word we inhale God2 Tim 316a Jer 1516"}
{"zh": "二\t当我们有神作我们的业分，我们就有神自己作我们的一切—诗七三26，一一九57，十六5，赛十二2。", "en": "B.\tWhen we have God as our portion, we have God Himself as everything to us.B.\\tWhen we have God as our portion, we have God Himself as everything to us.—Psa. 73:26; 119:57; 16:5; Isa. 12:2.", "norm_zh": "二当我们有神作我们的业分我们就有神自己作我们的一切诗七三26一一九57十六5赛十二2", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B When we have God as our portion we have God Himself as everything to usBtWhen we have God as our portion we have God Himself as everything to usPsa 7326 11957 165 Isa 122"}
{"zh": "三\t我们越以正确的方式来到圣经跟前，这本书的著者—神自己，就越成为我们的业分—诗七三26，十六5，约五39~40。", "en": "C.\tThe more we come to the Bible in the proper way, the more the Author of this book—God Himself—becomes our portion.C.\\tThe more we come to the Bible in the proper way, the more the Author of this book—God Himself—becomes our portion.—Psa. 73:26; 16:5; John 5:39-40.", "norm_zh": "三我们越以正确的方式来到圣经跟前这本书的着者神自己就越成为我们的业分诗七三26十六5约五3940", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The more we come to the Bible in the proper way the more the Author of this bookGod Himselfbecomes our portionCtThe more we come to the Bible in the proper way the more the Author of this bookGod Himselfbecomes our portionPsa 7326 165 John 53940"}
{"zh": "四\t神能作我们的业分，因为在神的话里、凭神的话且借神的话，祂对我们是真实、现时、实际、可享受且便利的—诗一一九103，三四8。", "en": "D.\tGod can be our portion because in the Word, by the Word, and through the Word He is real, present, practical, enjoyable, and available to us.D.\\tGod can be our portion because in the Word, by the Word, and through the Word He is real, present, practical, enjoyable, and available to us.—Psa. 119:103; 34:8.", "norm_zh": "四神能作我们的业分因为在神的话里凭神的话且借神的话祂对我们是真实现时实际可享受且便利的诗一一九103三四8", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D God can be our portion because in the Word by the Word and through the Word He is real present practical enjoyable and available to usDtGod can be our portion because in the Word by the Word and through the Word He is real present practical enjoyable and available to usPsa 119103 348"}
{"zh": "二\t在民数记六章二十五至二十六节的祝福里，提到面和脸：", "en": "B.\tIn the blessing in Numbers 6:25-26, we have both the face and the countenance:", "norm_zh": "二在民数记六章二十五至二十六节的祝福里提到面和脸", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B In the blessing in Numbers 62526 we have both the face and the countenance"}
{"zh": "1\t面指一个人的同在，脸指那人的表情—诗二十四6，民六25，林后三18。", "en": "1\tThe face denotes the presence of a person, and the countenance denotes the expression of the person.1\\tThe face denotes the presence of a person, and the countenance denotes the expression of the person.—Psa. 24:6; Num. 6:25; 2 Cor. 3:18.", "norm_zh": "1面指一个人的同在脸指哪人的表情诗二十四6民六25林后三18", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The face denotes the presence of a person and the countenance denotes the expression of the person1tThe face denotes the presence of a person and the countenance denotes the expression of the personPsa 246 Num 625 2 Cor 318"}
{"zh": "2\t当经过过程并终极完成的三一神，借着祂话语的功用分赐到我们里面时，我们就有神的面，也有祂的脸—十三14，四6。", "en": "2\tWhen the processed and consummated Triune God is dispensed into us through the function of the Word, we have the face of God and also His countenance.2\\tWhen the processed and consummated Triune God is dispensed into us through the function of the Word, we have the face of God and also His countenance.—2 Cor. 13:14; 4:6.", "norm_zh": "2当经过过程并终极完成的三一神借着祂话语的功用分赐到我们里面时我们就有神的面也有祂的脸十三14四6", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 When the processed and consummated Triune God is dispensed into us through the function of the Word we have the face of God and also His countenance2tWhen the processed and consummated Triune God is dispensed into us through the function of the Word we have the face of God and also His countenance2 Cor 1314 46"}
{"zh": "三\t我们若忠心地借着话接触主，就会经历祂面的光照—6节，三16、18：", "en": "C.\tIf we are faithful in contacting the Lord through the Word, we will experience the shining of His face.C.\\tIf we are faithful in contacting the Lord through the Word, we will experience the shining of His face.—v. 6; 3:16, 18:", "norm_zh": "三我们若忠心地借着话接触主就会经历祂面的光照6节三1618", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C If we are faithful in contacting the Lord through the Word we will experience the shining of His faceCtIf we are faithful in contacting the Lord through the Word we will experience the shining of His facev 6 316 18"}
