{"zh": "神要成为我们的分，祂也必须是非常实际的、实时的、可享受的、便利的", "en": "In order for God to be our portion, He must also be very practical, present, enjoyable, and available.", "norm_zh": "神要成为我们的分祂也必须是非常实际的实时的可享受的便利的", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T03:46:36.603333+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "In order for God to be our portion He must also be very practical present enjoyable and available"}
