{"zh": "12\t羔羊神—启七10，二一9、22，二二1下，3。", "en": "12. The Lamb-God—Rev. 7:10; 21:9, 22; 22:1b, 3.", "norm_zh": "12羔羊神启七10二一922二二1下3", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "12 The LambGodRev 710 219 22 221b 3"}
{"zh": "伍\t基督在升天里，在祂天上的职事里服事我们，是借着将祂自己作为新约禧年的实际分赐到我们里面，给我们享受—来八2，路四18~22：", "en": "V.\tIn His heavenly ministry in ascension, Christ is serving us by dispensing Himself as the reality of the New Testament jubilee into us for our enjoyment.—Heb. 8:2; Luke 4:18-22:", "norm_zh": "伍基督在升天里在祂天上的职事里服事我们是借着将祂自己作为新约禧年的实际分赐到我们里面给我们享受来八2路四1822", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "V In His heavenly ministry in ascension Christ is serving us by dispensing Himself as the reality of the New Testament jubilee into us for our enjoymentHeb 82 Luke 41822"}
{"zh": "二\t基督在升天里，在祂天上的职事里作为赐生命的灵服事我们，乃是借着将祂自己分赐到我们里面，给我们经历并享受—约壹四13~15，约十六13。", "en": "B. In His heavenly ministry in ascension, Christ as the life-giving Spirit is serving us by dispensing Himself into us for our experience and enjoyment—1 John 4:13-15; John 16:13.", "norm_zh": "二基督在升天里在祂天上的职事里作为赐生命的灵服事我们乃是借着将祂自己分赐到我们里面给我们经历并享受约壹四1315约十六13", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B In His heavenly ministry in ascension Christ as the lifegiving Spirit is serving us by dispensing Himself into us for our experience and enjoyment1 John 41315 John 1613"}
{"zh": "一\t祂顾惜并喂养众召会，以照顾众召会—启一13，参出三十7：", "en": "A.\tHe is cherishing and nourishing the churches to care for them:—Rev. 1:13; cf. Exo. 30:7:", "norm_zh": "一祂顾惜并喂养众召会以照顾众召会启一13参出三十7", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A He is cherishing and nourishing the churches to care for themRev 113 cf Exo 307"}
{"zh": "二\t正如旧约里的大祭司在肩上和心上担负以色列十二支派的名字，基督作我们的大祭司，也将我们担在祂的肩上（祂的力量），并带在祂的心上（祂的爱）—出二八9~10、12、21、29，启一13。", "en": "B.\tJust as the high priest in the Old Testament bore the names of the twelve tribes of Israel on his shoulders and on his heart, Christ as our High Priest is bearing us on His shoulders (His strength) and holding us on His heart (His love).—Exo. 28:9-10, 12, 21, 29; Rev. 1:13.", "norm_zh": "二正如旧约里的大祭司在肩上和心上担负以色列十二支派的名字基督作我们的大祭司也将我们担在祂的肩上祂的力量并带在祂的心上祂的爱出二八910122129启一13", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Just as the high priest in the Old Testament bore the names of the twelve tribes of Israel on his shoulders and on his heart Christ as our High Priest is bearing us on His shoulders His strength and holding us on His heart His loveExo 28910 12 21 29 Rev 113"}
{"zh": "三\t至终，作大祭司的基督顾到神的需要和权益—13节，来二17，七26。", "en": "C.\tUltimately, Christ as the High Priest is caring for God's need and interests:—v. 13; Heb. 2:17; 7:26.", "norm_zh": "三至终作大祭司的基督顾到神的需要和权益13节来二17七26", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Ultimately Christ as the High Priest is caring for Gods need and interestsv 13 Heb 217 726"}
{"zh": "柒\t基督在祂升天里，在祂天上的职事里，作为赐生命的灵，用三一神的丰富变化我们，使我们成为“华轿”，就是基督行动的器皿，基督的乘具，基督的“车”，为着基督在祂身体里的行动，并基督为着祂身体的行动—歌三9~10，参林后二12~17：", "en": "VII.\tIn His heavenly ministry in ascension, Christ as the life-giving Spirit is transforming us with the riches of the Triune God so that we may become a \"palanquin,\" the moving vessel of Christ, the carriage of Christ, the \"car\" of Christ, for the move of Christ in and for the Body of Christ—S. S. 3:9-10; cf. 2 Cor. 2:12-17:—S. S. 3:9-10; cf. 2 Cor. 2:12-17:", "norm_zh": "柒基督在祂升天里在祂天上的职事里作为赐生命的灵用三一神的丰富变化我们使我们成为华轿就是基督行动的器皿基督的乘具基督的车为着基督在祂身体里的行动并基督为着祂身体的行动歌三910参林后二1217", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "VII In His heavenly ministry in ascension Christ as the lifegiving Spirit is transforming us with the riches of the Triune God so that we may become a palanquin the moving vessel of Christ the carriage of Christ the car of Christ for the move of Christ in and for the Body of ChristS S 3910 cf 2 Cor 21217S S 3910 cf 2 Cor 21217"}
{"zh": "一\t基督我们的所罗门王，将我们作成为着祂自己的华轿；我们的责任就是将我们的爱献给祂，并甘心将我们自己献给祂—约二一15~17，诗一一○3。", "en": "A.\tIt is Christ as our King Solomon who makes us a palanquin for Himself; our responsibility is simply to offer our love to Him and offer ourselves willingly to Him.—John 21:15-17; Psa. 110:3.", "norm_zh": "一基督我们的所罗门王将我们作成为着祂自己的华轿我们的责任就是将我们的爱献给祂并甘心将我们自己献给祂约二一1517诗一一3", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A It is Christ as our King Solomon who makes us a palanquin for Himself our responsibility is simply to offer our love to Him and offer ourselves willingly to HimJohn 211517 Psa 1103"}
{"zh": "二\t借着我们以个人、情深、私下、属灵的方式爱主，我们天然的所是就被拆毁，我们也凭基督救赎的死（银作的轿柱）、神的神圣性情（金作的轿底）和基督作赐生命的灵在我们里面施行管治的王权（紫色的坐垫），而被重修—参罗八28~29，林后四16~18。", "en": "B.\tThrough our loving the Lord in a personal, affectionate, private, and spiritual way, our natural being is torn down, and we are remodeled with Christ's redeeming death (its posts made of silver), God's divine nature (its base of gold), and Christ's kingship as the life-giving Spirit ruling within us (its seat of purple).—cf. Rom. 8:28-29; 2 Cor. 4:16-18.", "norm_zh": "二借着我们以个人情深私下属灵的方式爱主我们天然的所是就被拆毁我们也凭基督救赎的死银作的轿柱神的神圣性情金作的轿底和基督作赐生命的灵在我们里面施行管治的王权紫色的坐垫而被重修参罗八2829林后四1618", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Through our loving the Lord in a personal affectionate private and spiritual way our natural being is torn down and we are remodeled with Christs redeeming death its posts made of silver Gods divine nature its base of gold and Christs kingship as the lifegiving Spirit ruling within us its seat of purplecf Rom 82829 2 Cor 41618"}
