{"zh": "服事我们", "en": "Serving us", "norm_zh": "服事我们", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Serving us"}
{"zh": "马可福音十章四十五节：“因为人子来，并不是要受人的服事，乃是要服事人，并且要舍命，作多人的赎价”。", "en": "Mark 10:45: \"For even the Son of Man did not come to be served, but to serve and to give His life as a ransom for many.\"", "norm_zh": "马可福音十章四十五节因为人子来并不是要受人的服事乃是要服事人并且要舍命作多人的赎价", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Mark 1045 For even the Son of Man did not come to be served but to serve and to give His life as a ransom for many"}
{"zh": "路加福音二十二章二十六至二十七节：“但你们不可这样；你们里头为大的，倒要像年幼的；为首领的，倒要像服事人的。是谁为大？是坐席的呢，是服事人的呢？不是坐席的大么？然而我在你们中间，如同服事人的”。", "en": "Luke 22:26-27: \"But you shall not be so; but let the greatest among you become as the youngest, and the leader as the one who serves. For who is greater, the one who reclines at table or the one who serves? Is it not the one who reclines at table? But I am in your midst as one who serves.\"", "norm_zh": "路加福音二十二章二十六至二十七节但你们不可这样你们里头为大的倒要像年幼的为首领的倒要像服事人的是谁为大是坐席的呢是服事人的呢不是坐席的大么然而我在你们中间如同服事人的", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Luke 222627 But you shall not be so but let the greatest among you become as the youngest and the leader as the one who serves For who is greater the one who reclines at table or the one who serves Is it not the one who reclines at table But I am in your midst as one who serves"}
{"zh": "路加福音十二章三十七节：“主人来了，看见仆人儆醒，那仆人就有福了；我实在告诉你们，主人必叫他们坐席，自己束上带，进前伺候他们”。", "en": "Luke 12:37: \"Blessed are those slaves whom the master, when he comes, will find watching. Truly I say to you that he will gird himself and have them recline at table, and will come to them and serve them.\"", "norm_zh": "路加福音十二章三十七节主人来了看见仆人儆醒哪仆人就有福了我实在告诉你们主人必叫他们坐席自己束上带进前伺候他们", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Luke 1237 Blessed are those slaves whom the master when he comes will find watching Truly I say to you that he will gird himself and have them recline at table and will come to them and serve them"}
{"zh": "祂是大祭司，治理神的家", "en": "He is the great Priest over the house of God", "norm_zh": "祂是大祭司治理神的家", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "He is the great Priest over the house of God"}
{"zh": "主在祂的第五封书信里，告诉在撒狄的召会，他们是死的，衰微的。祂应许得胜者，他们要穿白衣（启三5）。白衣表征生活行动不受死亡玷污。得胜者在今世生活的方式，要成为他们在来世的赏赐。我们必须是活的，使我们能得着白衣。主告诉在非拉铁非的召会，要持守他们所有的（11）。凡在主的恢复中得胜而持守他们所有的人，要被建造到新耶路撒冷—神的殿—里作柱子（12）。在第七封书信里，主劝在老底嘉的召会要买金子、白衣和眼药，好救他们免于不冷不热的堕落光景（18）。祂应许要与那些给祂开门的人一同坐席（20）。我们可以看见，这乃是基督在祂神性里的喂养，是由祂的爱并带着祂的爱所运行的", "en": "In His fifth epistle the Lord told the church in Sardis that they were dead and dying. He promised the overcomers that they would be clothed in white garments (Rev. 3:5). White garments signify a walk and living unstained by death. The way the overcomers live in this age will become their reward in the coming age. We must be living so that we can receive the white garments. The Lord told the church in Philadelphia to hold fast to what they already had (v. 11). Those who overcome to hold fast what they have in the Lord's recovery will be built into the New Jerusalem, the temple of God, as a pillar (v. 12). In the seventh epistle, the Lord counseled the church in Laodicea to buy gold, white garments, and eyesalve to be saved from their degradation in lukewarmness (v. 18). He promised to dine with the ones who would open the door to Him (v. 20). We can see that this is the nourishing of Christ in His divinity exercised by and with His love.", "norm_zh": "主在祂的第五封书信里告诉在撒狄的召会他们是死的衰微的祂应许得胜者他们要穿白衣启三5白衣表征生活行动不受死亡玷污得胜者在今世生活的方式要成为他们在来世的赏赐我们必须是活的使我们能得着白衣主告诉在非拉铁非的召会要持守他们所有的11凡在主的恢复中得胜而持守他们所有的人要被建造到新耶路撒冷神的殿里作柱子12在第七封书信里主劝在老底嘉的召会要买金子白衣和眼药好救他们免于不冷不热的堕落光景18祂应许要与哪些给祂开门的人一同坐席20我们可以看见这乃是基督在祂神性里的喂养是由祂的爱并带着祂的爱所运行的", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "In His fifth epistle the Lord told the church in Sardis that they were dead and dying He promised the overcomers that they would be clothed in white garments Rev 35 White garments signify a walk and living unstained by death The way the overcomers live in this age will become their reward in the coming age We must be living so that we can receive the white garments The Lord told the church in Philadelphia to hold fast to what they already had v 11 Those who overcome to hold fast what they have in the Lords recovery will be built into the New Jerusalem the temple of God as a pillar v 12 In the seventh epistle the Lord counseled the church in Laodicea to buy gold white garments and eyesalve to be saved from their degradation in lukewarmness v 18 He promised to dine with the ones who would open the door to Him v 20 We can see that this is the nourishing of Christ in His divinity exercised by and with His love"}
{"zh": "基督是我们尊大的大祭司", "en": "Christ is our great High Priest", "norm_zh": "基督是我们尊大的大祭司", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Christ is our great High Priest"}
{"zh": "“所罗门王用利巴嫩木，为自己制造一乘华轿。轿柱是用银作的，轿底是用金作的，坐垫是紫色的，其中所铺的乃耶路撒冷众女儿的爱情”（三9~10）寻求者如今是盛装基督的容器，在祂的行动中负载着祂。华轿是庄严、高贵的车，是一种器皿，容纳着所负载的人。如今她是基督行动的器皿。基督盛装在她里面而行动。当她盛装基督时，基督就在她里面与她一同行动。阿利路亚！这是基督的华轿。", "en": "\"King Solomon made himself a palanquin / Of the wood of Lebanon. / Its posts he made of silver, / Its bottom, of gold; / Its seat, of purple; / Its midst was inlaid with love / From the daughters of Jerusalem\" (3:9-10) The seeker is now a vessel containing Christ, carrying Him in His move. A palanquin is a majestic, noble carriage, a kind of vessel containing the one who is carried. Now she is the vessel of Christ's move. Christ is contained in her and moves. When she contains Christ, Christ moves in her and with her. Hallelujah! This is Christ's palanquin.", "norm_zh": "所罗门王用利巴嫩木为自己制造一乘华轿轿柱是用银作的轿底是用金作的坐垫是紫色的其中所铺的乃耶路撒冷众女儿的爱情三910寻求者如今是盛装基督的容器在祂的行动中负载着祂华轿是庄严高贵的车是一种器皿容纳着所负载的人如今她是基督行动的器皿基督盛装在她里面而行动当她盛装基督时基督就在她里面与她一同行动阿利路亚这是基督的华轿", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:40:08.838924+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "King Solomon made himself a palanquin Of the wood of Lebanon Its posts he made of silver Its bottom of gold Its seat of purple Its midst was inlaid with love From the daughters of Jerusalem 3910 The seeker is now a vessel containing Christ carrying Him in His move A palanquin is a majestic noble carriage a kind of vessel containing the one who is carried Now she is the vessel of Christs move Christ is contained in her and moves When she contains Christ Christ moves in her and with her Hallelujah This is Christs palanquin"}
{"zh": "贰\t基督的升天乃是神将祂高举─徒二33~36，五31，来二9，腓二9，弗一22，太二八18：（2017年春季长老训练，第四篇；使徒行传生命读经，第十篇，第二十六段*）", "en": "II.\tChrist's ascension was God's exaltation of Him—Acts 2:33-36; 5:31; Heb. 2:9; Phil. 2:9; Eph. 1:22; Matt. 28:18:", "norm_zh": "贰基督的升天乃是神将祂高举徒二3336五31来二9腓二9弗一22太二八182017年春季长老训练第四篇使徒行传生命读经第十篇第二十六段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "II Christs ascension was Gods exaltation of HimActs 23336 531 Heb 29 Phil 29 Eph 122 Matt 2818"}
{"zh": "一\t主被立为主，作万有的主，是要得着万有；祂被立为基督，作神的受膏者，是要完成神的使命─徒二36，十36，来一9。（2017年春季长老训练，第四篇；使徒行传生命读经，第十篇，第三十三段*）", "en": "A.\tThe Lord was made Lord, the Lord of all to possess all, and He was made Christ, God's Anointed, to carry out God's commission—Acts 2:36; 10:36; Heb. 1:9.", "norm_zh": "一主被立为主作万有的主是要得着万有祂被立为基督作神的受膏者是要完成神的使命徒二36十36来一92017年春季长老训练第四篇使徒行传生命读经第十篇第三十三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The Lord was made Lord the Lord of all to possess all and He was made Christ Gods Anointed to carry out Gods commissionActs 236 1036 Heb 19"}
{"zh": "二\t神将基督高举“在自己的右边，作元首，作救主”─徒五31，太二八18。（2017年春季长老训练，第四篇；李常受文集一九七三至一九七四年第二册，新约圣经中奇妙的基督，第九章，第九段*）", "en": "B.\tGod exalted Christ \"to His right hand as Leader and Savior\"—Acts 5:31; Matt. 28:18.", "norm_zh": "二神将基督高举在自己的右边作元首作救主徒五31太二八182017年春季长老训练第四篇李常受文集一九七三至一九七四年第二册新约圣经中奇妙的基督第九章第九段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B God exalted Christ to His right hand as Leader and SaviorActs 531 Matt 2818"}
{"zh": "叁\t基督在祂的升天里超越阴间（拘留死人的地方）、地（堕落之人行动反对神的地方）、空中（撒但和他黑暗权势行事抵挡神的地方）和诸天（撒但能去的地方）─弗一20~21，四8~10，来四14，七26。（2008年夏训，第十二篇；李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第二册，过照着圣经中神圣启示高峰之生活实行的路，第一章，第三十三段）", "en": "III.\tChrist in His ascension transcended Hades (where the dead are being held), the earth (where fallen men are moving against God), the air (where Satan and his power of darkness are acting against God), and all the heavens (which Satan can reach)—Eph. 1:20-21; 4:8-10; Heb. 4:14; 7:26.", "norm_zh": "叁基督在祂的升天里超越阴间拘留死人的地方地堕落之人行动反对神的地方空中撒但和他黑暗权势行事抵挡神的地方和诸天撒但能去的地方弗一2021四810来四14七262008年夏训第十二篇李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第二册过照着圣经中神圣启示高峰之生活实行的路第一章第三十三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III Christ in His ascension transcended Hades where the dead are being held the earth where fallen men are moving against God the air where Satan and his power of darkness are acting against God and all the heavens which Satan can reachEph 12021 4810 Heb 414 726"}
{"zh": "肆\t从升天和超越的基督向着召会有一种输供；祂超越的输供包括了三一神一切丰富的分赐─弗一19~23、3~14，三20：（2008年夏训，第十二篇路加福音生命读经，第七十八篇，第四段*；李常受文集一九九三年第二册，经过过程的神圣三一之分赐与超越基督之输供的结果，第四章，第九十一段*）", "en": "IV. There is a transmission from the ascended and transcending Christ to the church; His transcending transmission includes all the rich dispensing of the Triune God—Eph. 1:19-23, 3-14; 3:20:", "norm_zh": "肆从升天和超越的基督向着召会有一种输供祂超越的输供包括了三一神一切丰富的分赐弗一1923314三202008年夏训第十二篇路加福音生命读经第七十八篇第四段李常受文集一九九三年第二册经过过程的神圣三一之分赐与超越基督之输供的结果第四章第九十一段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "IV There is a transmission from the ascended and transcending Christ to the church His transcending transmission includes all the rich dispensing of the Triune GodEph 11923 314 320"}
{"zh": "一\t这样包罗一切的输供，不仅将我们带到与成为肉体并钉十字架之基督的联结里，也将我们带到与复活并超越之基督的联结里；在与这位超越之基督的联结里，我们超过了一切消极的事物，并且远远超越它们─一3~14、21~23，二6。（2008年夏训，第十二篇；李常受文集一九九三年第二册，经过过程的神圣三一之分赐与超越基督之输供的结果，第四篇，第九十二段）", "en": "A.\tSuch an all-inclusive transmission brings us into union not only with the incarnated, crucified Christ but also with the resurrected, transcending Christ; in union with this transcending Christ, we have surpassed all the negative things and transcended above them all—1:3-14, 21-23; 2:6.", "norm_zh": "一这样包罗一切的输供不仅将我们带到与成为肉体并钉十字架之基督的联结里也将我们带到与复活并超越之基督的联结里在与这位超越之基督的联结里我们超过了一切消极的事物并且远远超越它们一3142123二62008年夏训第十二篇李常受文集一九九三年第二册经过过程的神圣三一之分赐与超越基督之输供的结果第四篇第九十二段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Such an allinclusive transmission brings us into union not only with the incarnated crucified Christ but also with the resurrected transcending Christ in union with this transcending Christ we have surpassed all the negative things and transcended above them all1314 2123 26"}
{"zh": "二\t超越之基督的输供，是将三一神在基督里所成就、所达到并所得着的，灌注到召会，就是基督的身体里，使万有在基督里归一于一个元首之下─一10、19、22~23，三10、21。（2008年夏训，第十二篇；李常受文集一九九三年第二册，经过过程的神圣三一之分赐与超越基督之输供的结果，第五篇，第七段**）", "en": "B.\tThe transmitting of the transcending Christ is to transfuse into the church, the Body of Christ, what the Triune God has accomplished, attained, and obtained for the heading up of all things in Christ—1:10, 19, 22-23; 3:10, 21.", "norm_zh": "二超越之基督的输供是将三一神在基督里所成就所达到并所得着的灌注到召会就是基督的身体里使万有在基督里归一于一个元首之下一10192223三10212008年夏训第十二篇李常受文集一九九三年第二册经过过程的神圣三一之分赐与超越基督之输供的结果第五篇第七段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The transmitting of the transcending Christ is to transfuse into the church the Body of Christ what the Triune God has accomplished attained and obtained for the heading up of all things in Christ110 19 2223 310 21"}
{"zh": "三\t超越之基督的输供，也将我们带到基督在祂十二种身分的属天职事里，这些身分是祂在祂的升天里所达到的并得着的，作为耶稣基督之灵全备的供应─腓一19，来八1~2：（2008年夏训，第十二篇；李常受文集一九九三年第二册，经过过程的神圣三一之分赐与超越基督之输供的结果，第四篇，第九十三段**）", "en": "C.\tThe transcending Christ's transmission also brings us into Christ's heavenly ministry in His twelve statuses, which He has attained and obtained in His ascension, as the bountiful supply of the Spirit of Jesus Christ—Phil. 1:19; Heb. 8:1-2:", "norm_zh": "三超越之基督的输供也将我们带到基督在祂十二种身分的属天职事里这些身分是祂在祂的升天里所达到的并得着的作为耶稣基督之灵全备的供应腓一19来八122008年夏训第十二篇李常受文集一九九三年第二册经过过程的神圣三一之分赐与超越基督之输供的结果第四篇第九十三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The transcending Christs transmission also brings us into Christs heavenly ministry in His twelve statuses which He has attained and obtained in His ascension as the bountiful supply of the Spirit of Jesus ChristPhil 119 Heb 812"}
