{"zh": "12\t羔羊神—启七10，二一9、22，二二1下，3。（2008年夏训，第十二篇；李常受文集一九九三年第二册，经过过程的神圣三一之分赐与超越基督之输供的结果，第四篇，第七十九段）", "en": "12. The Lamb-God—Rev. 7:10; 21:9, 22; 22:1b, 3.", "norm_zh": "12羔羊神启七10二一922二二1下32008年夏训第十二篇李常受文集一九九三年第二册经过过程的神圣三一之分赐与超越基督之输供的结果第四篇第七十九段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "12 The LambGodRev 710 219 22 221b 3"}
{"zh": "伍\t基督在升天里，在祂天上的职事里服事我们，是借着将祂自己作为新约禧年的实际分赐到我们里面，给我们享受─来八2，路四18~22：（2008年夏训，第十二篇***）", "en": "V.\tIn His heavenly ministry in ascension, Christ is serving us by dispensing Himself as the reality of the New Testament jubilee into us for our enjoyment—Heb. 8:2; Luke 4:18-22:", "norm_zh": "伍基督在升天里在祂天上的职事里服事我们是借着将祂自己作为新约禧年的实际分赐到我们里面给我们享受来八2路四18222008年夏训第十二篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "V In His heavenly ministry in ascension Christ is serving us by dispensing Himself as the reality of the New Testament jubilee into us for our enjoymentHeb 82 Luke 41822"}
{"zh": "一\t基督从前服事我们，现在仍是服事我们，将来还要服事我们─可十45，路二二26~27，十二37，参九54~56，十九10。（2008年夏训，第十二篇；倪柝声文集第一辑第十七册，讲经记录（卷一），主的服事，第三段），主的服事，第三段）", "en": "A.\tChrist served us in the past, still serves us in the present, and is going to serve us in the future—Mark 10:45; Luke 22:26-27; 12:37; cf. 9:54-56; 19:10 (The Service of the Lord, pt. 3).", "norm_zh": "一基督从前服事我们现在仍是服事我们将来还要服事我们可十45路二二2627十二37参九5456十九102008年夏训第十二篇倪柝声文集第一辑第十七册讲经记录卷一主的服事第三段主的服事第三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Christ served us in the past still serves us in the present and is going to serve us in the futureMark 1045 Luke 222627 1237 cf 95456 1910 The Service of the Lord pt 3"}
{"zh": "二\t基督在升天里，在祂天上的职事里作为赐生命的灵服事我们，乃是借着将祂自己分赐到我们里面，给我们经历并享受—约壹四13~15，约十六13。（2008年夏训，第十二篇***）", "en": "B. In His heavenly ministry in ascension, Christ as the life-giving Spirit is serving us by dispensing Himself into us for our experience and enjoyment—1 John 4:13-15; John 16:13.", "norm_zh": "二基督在升天里在祂天上的职事里作为赐生命的灵服事我们乃是借着将祂自己分赐到我们里面给我们经历并享受约壹四1315约十六132008年夏训第十二篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B In His heavenly ministry in ascension Christ as the lifegiving Spirit is serving us by dispensing Himself into us for our experience and enjoyment1 John 41315 John 1613"}
{"zh": "一\t祂顾惜并喂养众召会，以照顾众召会—启一13，参三十7：（2008年夏训，第十二篇；李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第五册，活力排，第十一篇，第二十四段**）", "en": "B.\tHe is cherishing and nourishing the churches to care for them:—Rev. 1:13; cf. Exo. 30:7:", "norm_zh": "一祂顾惜并喂养众召会以照顾众召会启一13参三十72008年夏训第十二篇李常受文集一九九四至一九九七年第五册活力排第十一篇第二十四段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B He is cherishing and nourishing the churches to care for themRev 113 cf Exo 307"}
{"zh": "二\t正如旧约里的大祭司在肩上和心上担负以色列十二支派的名字，基督作我们的大祭司，也将我们担在祂的肩上（祂的力量），并带在祂的心上（祂的爱）─出二八9~10、12、21、29，启一13。（2008年夏训，第十二篇；路加福音生命读经，第七十九篇，第二十二段*）", "en": "B.\tJust as the high priest in the Old Testament bore the names of the twelve tribes of Israel on his shoulders and on his heart, Christ as our High Priest is bearing us on His shoulders (His strength) and holding us on His heart (His love).—Exo. 28:9-10, 12, 21, 29; Rev. 1:13.", "norm_zh": "二正如旧约里的大祭司在肩上和心上担负以色列十二支派的名字基督作我们的大祭司也将我们担在祂的肩上祂的力量并带在祂的心上祂的爱出二八910122129启一132008年夏训第十二篇路加福音生命读经第七十九篇第二十二段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Just as the high priest in the Old Testament bore the names of the twelve tribes of Israel on his shoulders and on his heart Christ as our High Priest is bearing us on His shoulders His strength and holding us on His heart His loveExo 28910 12 21 29 Rev 113"}
{"zh": "三\t至终，作大祭司的基督顾到神的需要和权益—13节，来二17，七26。（2017年春季长老训练，第五篇***）", "en": "C.\tUltimately, Christ as the High Priest is caring for God's need and interests:—v. 13; Heb. 2:17; 7:26.", "norm_zh": "三至终作大祭司的基督顾到神的需要和权益13节来二17七262017年春季长老训练第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Ultimately Christ as the High Priest is caring for Gods need and interestsv 13 Heb 217 726"}
{"zh": "柒\t基督在祂升天里，在祂天上的职事里，作为赐生命的灵，用三一神的丰富变化我们，使我们成为“华轿”，就是基督行动的器皿，基督的乘具，基督的“车”，为着基督在祂身体里的行动，并基督为着祂身体的行动─歌三9~10，参林后二12~17：（2008年夏训，第十二篇***）", "en": "VII.\tIn His heavenly ministry in ascension, Christ as the life-giving Spirit is transforming us with the riches of the Triune God so that we may become a \"palanquin,\" the moving vessel of Christ, the carriage of Christ, the \"car\" of Christ, for the move of Christ in and for the Body of Christ—S. S. 3:9-10; cf. 2 Cor. 2:12-17:", "norm_zh": "柒基督在祂升天里在祂天上的职事里作为赐生命的灵用三一神的丰富变化我们使我们成为华轿就是基督行动的器皿基督的乘具基督的车为着基督在祂身体里的行动并基督为着祂身体的行动歌三910参林后二12172008年夏训第十二篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "VII In His heavenly ministry in ascension Christ as the lifegiving Spirit is transforming us with the riches of the Triune God so that we may become a palanquin the moving vessel of Christ the carriage of Christ the car of Christ for the move of Christ in and for the Body of ChristS S 3910 cf 2 Cor 21217"}
{"zh": "一\t基督我们的所罗门王，将我们作成为着祂自己的华轿；我们的责任就是将我们的爱献给祂，并甘心将我们自己献给祂─约二一15~17，诗一一○3。（2008年夏训，第十二篇；李常受文集一九七二年第一册，雅歌中所描绘的生命与建造，第六章，第二十段**）", "en": "A.\tIt is Christ as our King Solomon who makes us a palanquin for Himself; our responsibility is simply to offer our love to Him and offer ourselves willingly to Him.—John 21:15-17; Psa. 110:3.", "norm_zh": "一基督我们的所罗门王将我们作成为着祂自己的华轿我们的责任就是将我们的爱献给祂并甘心将我们自己献给祂约二一1517诗一一32008年夏训第十二篇李常受文集一九七二年第一册雅歌中所描绘的生命与建造第六章第二十段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A It is Christ as our King Solomon who makes us a palanquin for Himself our responsibility is simply to offer our love to Him and offer ourselves willingly to HimJohn 211517 Psa 1103"}
{"zh": "二\t借着我们以个人、情深、私下、属灵的方式爱主，我们天然的所是就被拆毁，我们也凭基督救赎的死（银作的轿柱）、神的神圣性情（金作的轿底）和基督作赐生命的灵在我们里面施行管治的王权（紫色的坐垫），而被重修─参罗八28~29，林后四16~18。（2008年夏训，第十二篇；雅歌书生命读经，第四篇，第十五段**）", "en": "B.\tThrough our loving the Lord in a personal, affectionate, private, and spiritual way, our natural being is torn down, and we are remodeled with Christ's redeeming death (its posts made of silver), God's divine nature (its base of gold), and Christ's kingship as the life-giving Spirit ruling within us (its seat of purple).—cf. Rom. 8:28-29; 2 Cor. 4:16-18.", "norm_zh": "二借着我们以个人情深私下属灵的方式爱主我们天然的所是就被拆毁我们也凭基督救赎的死银作的轿柱神的神圣性情金作的轿底和基督作赐生命的灵在我们里面施行管治的王权紫色的坐垫而被重修参罗八2829林后四16182008年夏训第十二篇雅歌书生命读经第四篇第十五段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:41:33.373512+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Through our loving the Lord in a personal affectionate private and spiritual way our natural being is torn down and we are remodeled with Christs redeeming death its posts made of silver Gods divine nature its base of gold and Christs kingship as the lifegiving Spirit ruling within us its seat of purplecf Rom 82829 2 Cor 41618"}
{"zh": "读经：启六1~17，八1~2、6，十一14~18，十五5~8，十六1，二十11~15，二一~二二", "en": "Scripture Reading: Rev. 6:1-17; 8:1-2, 6; 11:14-18; 15:5-8; 16:1; 20:11-15; 21—22", "norm_zh": "读经启六117八126十一1418十五58十六1二十1115二一二二", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Scripture Reading Rev 6117 812 6 111418 1558 161 201115 2122"}
{"zh": "壹\t七印、七号、七碗是从基督升天时到将来无终的永远—启六1~17，八1~2、61，十一14~18，十五5~8，十六1。", "en": "I. The seven seals, the seven trumpets, and the seven bowls being from the time of Christ's ascension to eternity in the future without ending—Rev. 6:1-17; 8:1-2, 6; 11:14-18; 15:5-8; 16:1.", "norm_zh": "壹七印七号七碗是从基督升天时到将来无终的永远启六117八1261十一1418十五58十六1", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I The seven seals the seven trumpets and the seven bowls being from the time of Christs ascension to eternity in the future without endingRev 6117 812 6 111418 1558 161"}
{"zh": "贰\t七印乃是神经纶的奥秘—六1~17，八1~2：", "en": "II. The seven seals are the mystery of God's economy—6:1-17; 8:1-2:", "norm_zh": "贰七印乃是神经纶的奥秘六117八12", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "II The seven seals are the mystery of Gods economy6117 812"}
{"zh": "一\t头四印是四匹马的历程：福音的传扬、战争、饥荒和死亡；这四匹马的历程乃是现今召会时代里世界的历程—六1~8，太二四6~8、14。", "en": "A. The first four seals are the course of the four horses: gospel preaching, war, famine, and death; the course of these four horses is the course of the world in the present age of the church—6:1-8; Matt. 24:6-8, 14.", "norm_zh": "一头四印是四匹马的历程福音的传扬战争饥荒和死亡这四匹马的历程乃是现今召会时代里世界的历程六18太二四6814", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The first four seals are the course of the four horses gospel preaching war famine and death the course of these four horses is the course of the world in the present age of the church618 Matt 2468 14"}
{"zh": "二\t第五印是殉道圣徒求伸冤的呼喊—启二13，六9~11。", "en": "B. The fifth seal is the cry of the martyred saints for vengeance—Rev. 2:13; 6:9-11.", "norm_zh": "二第五印是殉道圣徒求伸冤的呼喊启二13六911", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The fifth seal is the cry of the martyred saints for vengeanceRev 213 6911"}
{"zh": "三\t得胜者的被提是第五印和第六印之间的插入—二7，十二5，十四1。", "en": "C. The rapture of the overcomers is an insertion between the fifth and sixth seals—2:7; 12:5; 14:1.", "norm_zh": "三得胜者的被提是第五印和第六印之间的插入二7十二5十四1", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The rapture of the overcomers is an insertion between the fifth and sixth seals27 125 141"}
{"zh": "四\t按照圣经，可以将得胜者分为五类—腓三11，启二7，十四4，路二一36，太二四40：", "en": "D. According to the Bible, we can classify the overcomers into five categories—Phil. 3:11; Rev. 2:7; 14:4; Luke 21:36; Matt. 24:40:", "norm_zh": "四按照圣经可以将得胜者分为五类腓三11启二7十四4路二一36太二四40", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D According to the Bible we can classify the overcomers into five categoriesPhil 311 Rev 27 144 Luke 2136 Matt 2440"}
{"zh": "1\t第一是男孩子，由复活的殉道者所组成，他们要有分于“杰出的复活”，“更美的复活”—启十二5，腓三11，来十一35。", "en": "1. First, there is the man-child, composed of the resurrected martyrs who should participate in \"the extra resurrection,\" \"the better resurrection\"—Rev. 12:5; Phil. 3:11; Heb. 11:35.", "norm_zh": "1第一是男孩子由复活的殉道者所组成他们要有分于杰出的复活更美的复活启十二5腓三11来十一35", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 First there is the manchild composed of the resurrected martyrs who should participate in the extra resurrection the better resurrectionRev 125 Phil 311 Heb 1135"}
{"zh": "2\t第二类的得胜者是初熟的果子—启十四1、4。", "en": "2. The second category of overcomers is the firstfruit—Rev. 14:1, 4.", "norm_zh": "2第二类的得胜者是初熟的果子启十四14", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The second category of overcomers is the firstfruitRev 141 4"}
{"zh": "3\t第三类是非拉铁非的得胜者—二7~8。", "en": "3. The third category is the Philadelphia overcomers—2:7-8.", "norm_zh": "3第三类是非拉铁非的得胜者二78", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 The third category is the Philadelphia overcomers278"}
{"zh": "4\t儆醒祈求的得胜者是第四类—路二一36。", "en": "4. The watchful and beseeching overcomers are the fourth category—Luke 21:36.", "norm_zh": "4儆醒祈求的得胜者是第四类路二一36", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "4 The watchful and beseeching overcomers are the fourth categoryLuke 2136"}
{"zh": "5\t第五类是两个圣徒中儆醒的一个—太二四40~42。", "en": "5.\tThe fifth category is the watchful one of the two saints—Matt. 24:40-42.", "norm_zh": "5第五类是两个圣徒中儆醒的一个太二四4042", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "5 The fifth category is the watchful one of the two saintsMatt 244042"}
{"zh": "五\t得胜者被提之后，敌基督要毁弃他与以色列所立的一七之约，并且大灾难要开始，历时三年半—四十二个月—一千二百六十天—但九24~27，太二四21：", "en": "E.\tAfter the rapture of the overcomers, Antichrist will break his one-week covenant with Israel, and the great tribulation will begin and last for three and a half years—forty-two months—one thousand two hundred and sixty days—Dan. 9:24-27; Matt. 24:21:", "norm_zh": "五得胜者被提之后敌基督要毁弃他与以色列所立的一七之约并且大灾难要开始历时三年半四十二个月一千二百六十天但九2427太二四21", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E After the rapture of the overcomers Antichrist will break his oneweek covenant with Israel and the great tribulation will begin and last for three and a half yearsfortytwo monthsone thousand two hundred and sixty daysDan 92427 Matt 2421"}
{"zh": "1\t第一，撒但要从天上被摔在地上，就大大发怒，使地和海有祸了，并要逼迫仍存留在地上神的子民，且要与守神诫命的犹太人和持守耶稣见证的信徒争战—启十二7、12。", "en": "1.\tFirst, Satan will be cast from heaven to the earth to cause, with great rage, woes to the earth and the sea and to persecute God's people, those who still remain on the earth, and he will war with the Jews, who keep the commandments of God, and the believers, who have the testimony of Jesus—Rev. 12:7, 12.", "norm_zh": "1第一撒但要从天上被摔在地上就大大发怒使地和海有祸了并要逼迫仍存留在地上神的子民且要与守神诫命的犹太人和持守耶稣见证的信徒争战启十二712", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 First Satan will be cast from heaven to the earth to cause with great rage woes to the earth and the sea and to persecute Gods people those who still remain on the earth and he will war with the Jews who keep the commandments of God and the believers who have the testimony of JesusRev 127 12"}
{"zh": "2\t第二，从无底坑土来的敌基督，要高抬自己超过一切称为神，或受人敬拜者，坐在神的殿里，展示自己，说他就是神—十七8，帖后二4，但九27下，太二四15。", "en": "2.\tSecond, Antichrist, who will come up out of the abyss, will exalt himself above all that is called God or an object of worship, seating himself in the temple of God, setting himself forth, saying that he is God—Rev. 17:8; 2 Thes. 2:4; Dan. 9:27b; Matt. 24:15.", "norm_zh": "2第二从无底坑土来的敌基督要高抬自己超过一切称为神或受人敬拜者坐在神的殿里展示自己说他就是神十七8帖后二4但九27下太二四15", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Second Antichrist who will come up out of the abyss will exalt himself above all that is called God or an object of worship seating himself in the temple of God setting himself forth saying that he is GodRev 178 2 Thes 24 Dan 927b Matt 2415"}
{"zh": "3\t第三，所有住在地上的，都要拜撒但（那龙），又拜敌基督（那兽）和他的像；那些不拜他和他像的，都要被杀害—启十三3~4、8、15。", "en": "3.\tThird, all those dwelling on the earth will worship Satan (the dragon) and worship Antichrist (the beast) and his image; those who would not worship him and his image will be slain—Rev. 13:3-4, 8, 15.", "norm_zh": "3第三所有住在地上的都要拜撒但哪龙又拜敌基督哪兽和他的像哪些不拜他和他像的都要被杀害启十三34815", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 Third all those dwelling on the earth will worship Satan the dragon and worship Antichrist the beast and his image those who would not worship him and his image will be slainRev 1334 8 15"}
{"zh": "4\t第四，敌基督要与圣徒争战，并胜过他们，又要随意而行四十二个月—7节，但七21。", "en": "4.\tFourth, Antichrist will war with the saints, overcome them, and act as he wills for forty-two months—v. 7; Dan. 7:21.", "norm_zh": "4第四敌基督要与圣徒争战并胜过他们又要随意而行四十二个月7节但七21", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "4 Fourth Antichrist will war with the saints overcome them and act as he wills for fortytwo monthsv 7 Dan 721"}
{"zh": "5\t第五，假申言者（另一兽）要行大奇事迷惑人，叫人给敌基督作个像，并拜那像—启十三11~15，十六13，十九20。", "en": "5.\tFifth, the false prophet (another beast) will do great signs to deceive people to make an image for Antichrist and worship it—Rev. 13:11-15; 16:13; 19:20.", "norm_zh": "5第五假申言者另一兽要行大奇事迷惑人叫人给敌基督作个像并拜哪像启十三1115十六13十九20", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "5 Fifth the false prophet another beast will do great signs to deceive people to make an image for Antichrist and worship itRev 131115 1613 1920"}
{"zh": "6\t第六，除了属撒但的三一—撒但、敌基督、和假申言者所造成的一切破坏之外，神要在怒中用超自然的灾难、杀戮、毒疮、黑暗，就是第六印、头六号和第七号之七碗中的灾祸，向地上的人施行审判—六12~17，路二一11。", "en": "6.\tSixth, in addition to all the devastations caused by the satanic trinity—Satan, Antichrist, and the false prophet—God will mete out His judgment in His wrath to men on the earth with supernatural calamities, killings, a malignant sore, and darkness, as woes in the sixth seal, the first six trumpets, and the seven bowls of the seventh trumpet.—Rev. 6:12-17; Luke 21:11.", "norm_zh": "6第六除了属撒但的三一撒但敌基督和假申言者所造成的一切破坏之外神要在怒中用超自然的灾难杀戮毒疮黑暗就是第六印头六号和第七号之七碗中的灾祸向地上的人施行审判六1217路二一11", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "6 Sixth in addition to all the devastations caused by the satanic trinitySatan Antichrist and the false prophetGod will mete out His judgment in His wrath to men on the earth with supernatural calamities killings a malignant sore and darkness as woes in the sixth seal the first six trumpets and the seven bowls of the seventh trumpetRev 61217 Luke 2111"}
{"zh": "六\t第六印是天地震动—启六12~17，太二四21：", "en": "F.\tThe sixth seal is the shaking of the earth and heaven—Rev. 6:12-17; Matt. 24:21:", "norm_zh": "六第六印是天地震动启六1217太二四21", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "F The sixth seal is the shaking of the earth and heavenRev 61217 Matt 2421"}
{"zh": "1\t这是超自然灾难的起头，破坏居人之地，以及天与天象，就是神开始答应第五印中殉道者的呼喊—路二一11，启六9~11。", "en": "1.\tIt is the beginning of the supernatural calamities to damage the inhabitable earth and heaven with its hosts, as the beginning of God's answer to the martyrs' cry in the fifth seal—Luke 21:11; Rev. 6:9-11.", "norm_zh": "1这是超自然灾难的起头破坏居人之地以及天与天象就是神开始答应第五印中殉道者的呼喊路二一11启六911", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 It is the beginning of the supernatural calamities to damage the inhabitable earth and heaven with its hosts as the beginning of Gods answer to the martyrs cry in the fifth sealLuke 2111 Rev 6911"}
{"zh": "2\t第六印也是三年半大灾难，就是那将要临到整个居人之地试炼之时候的引进；这也是对住在地上之人的警告—太二四21，但十二7，启三10，六15~17，十一2，十三5。", "en": "2. The sixth seal is also the initiation of the great tribulation of three and a half years, the hour of trial to come on the whole inhabited earth; it is also a warning to the inhabitants on the earth—Matt. 24:21; Dan. 12:7; Rev. 3:10; 6:15-17; 11:2; 13:5.", "norm_zh": "2第六印也是三年半大灾难就是哪将要临到整个居人之地试炼之时候的引进这也是对住在地上之人的警告太二四21但十二7启三10六1517十一2十三5", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The sixth seal is also the initiation of the great tribulation of three and a half years the hour of trial to come on the whole inhabited earth it is also a warning to the inhabitants on the earthMatt 2421 Dan 127 Rev 310 61517 112 135"}
{"zh": "七\t第六印之后，第七印就来了；第七印带进了七号—八1~2、6。", "en": "G. After the sixth seal comes the seventh seal; the seventh seal brings in the seven trumpets—8:1-2, 6.", "norm_zh": "七第六印之后第七印就来了第七印带进了七号八126", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "G After the sixth seal comes the seventh seal the seventh seal brings in the seven trumpets812 6"}
{"zh": "叁\t七号是第七印的内容—6节，十一14~18：", "en": "III. The seven trumpets are the contents of the seventh seal—v. 6; 11:14-18:", "norm_zh": "叁七号是第七印的内容6节十一1418", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III The seven trumpets are the contents of the seventh sealv 6 111418"}
{"zh": "一\t头四号将是加强的超自然灾难，破坏一切为着人生活之自然供备的源头—八7~8、10、12。", "en": "A. The first four trumpets will be the intensified supernatural calamities to damage all the sources of natural provisions for men's living—8:7-8, 10, 12.", "norm_zh": "一头四号将是加强的超自然灾难破坏一切为着人生活之自然供备的源头八781012", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The first four trumpets will be the intensified supernatural calamities to damage all the sources of natural provisions for mens living878 10 12"}
{"zh": "二\t第五号，就是第一样灾祸，是神对人的审判，借着撒但与敌基督合作而使人受痛苦；在吹第五号之后，撒但如同星从天落到地上，将蝗虫从无底坑里释放出来，用好像蝎子的刺伤人，叫人受痛苦五个月—九1~5、7~10。", "en": "B. The fifth trumpet, which is the first woe, is God's judgment on men to torment men by Satan collaborating with Antichrist; after the sounding of the fifth trumpet, Satan as a star will fall out of heaven to the earth to release \"locusts\" from the abyss (the bottomless pit) to torment men by stinging as scorpions for five months—9:1-5, 7-10.", "norm_zh": "二第五号就是第一样灾祸是神对人的审判借着撒但与敌基督合作而使人受痛苦在吹第五号之后撒但如同星从天落到地上将蝗虫从无底坑里释放出来用好像蝎子的刺伤人叫人受痛苦五个月九15710", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The fifth trumpet which is the first woe is Gods judgment on men to torment men by Satan collaborating with Antichrist after the sounding of the fifth trumpet Satan as a star will fall out of heaven to the earth to release locusts from the abyss the bottomless pit to torment men by stinging as scorpions for five months915 710"}
{"zh": "三\t第六号，就是第二样灾祸，是神对人进一步的审判，借着二万万马军，杀了人类的三分之一—12~21节，参十六12。", "en": "C. The sixth trumpet, which is the second woe, is God's further judgment on men by two hundred million cavalry troops killing the third part of men—vv. 12-21; cf. 16:12.", "norm_zh": "三第六号就是第二样灾祸是神对人进一步的审判借着二万万马军杀了人类的三分之一1221节参十六12", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The sixth trumpet which is the second woe is Gods further judgment on men by two hundred million cavalry troops killing the third part of menvv 1221 cf 1612"}
{"zh": "四\t在第六号以后，第七号之前，另外有一段关于圣徒被提与基督再来的插入；基督是在诸天之上与被提到宝座的得胜者在一起—十1，创九8~17。", "en": "D. After the sixth trumpet and before the seventh trumpet is another insertion related to the rapture of the saints and the second coming of Christ; Christ is in the heavens with the overcomers raptured to the throne—10:1; Gen. 9:8-17.", "norm_zh": "四在第六号以后第七号之前另外有一段关于圣徒被提与基督再来的插入基督是在诸天之上与被提到宝座的得胜者在一起十1创九817", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D After the sixth trumpet and before the seventh trumpet is another insertion related to the rapture of the saints and the second coming of Christ Christ is in the heavens with the overcomers raptured to the throne101 Gen 9817"}
{"zh": "五\t在第七号的日子，乃是神奥秘的完成—启十7，十一14~18：", "en": "E. In the days of the seventh trumpet will be the finishing of the mystery of God—Rev. 10:7; 11:14-18:", "norm_zh": "五在第七号的日子乃是神奥秘的完成启十7十一1418", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E In the days of the seventh trumpet will be the finishing of the mystery of GodRev 107 111418"}
{"zh": "1\t在第七号吹响时，就有神和基督永远的国；那时，世上的国要成为神和基督的国，祂要作王，直到永永远远—15节，但二44。", "en": "1. At the trumpeting of the seventh trumpet will be the eternal kingdom of God and of Christ; at that time the kingdom of the world will become the kingdom of God and of Christ, and He shall reign forever and ever—v. 15; Dan. 2:44.", "norm_zh": "1在第七号吹响时就有神和基督永远的国哪时世上的国要成为神和基督的国祂要作王直到永永远远15节但二44", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 At the trumpeting of the seventh trumpet will be the eternal kingdom of God and of Christ at that time the kingdom of the world will become the kingdom of God and of Christ and He shall reign forever and everv 15 Dan 244"}
{"zh": "2\t第七号的吹响也包含对死人的审判—启十一18，二十6，约五29。", "en": "2. The trumpeting of the seventh trumpet also comprises the judgment of the dead—Rev. 11:18; 20:6; John 5:29.", "norm_zh": "2第七号的吹响也包含对死人的审判启十一18二十6约五29", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The trumpeting of the seventh trumpet also comprises the judgment of the deadRev 1118 206 John 529"}
{"zh": "六\t这就带我们到大体圣徒被提，以及两个见证人被提的插入—太十三30，启十一3~12：", "en": "F. This brings us to the insertions of the rapture of the majority of the saints and the rapture of the two witnesses.—Matt. 13:30; Rev. 11:3-12:", "norm_zh": "六这就带我们到大体圣徒被提以及两个见证人被提的插入太十三30启十一312", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "F This brings us to the insertions of the rapture of the majority of the saints and the rapture of the two witnessesMatt 1330 Rev 11312"}
{"zh": "1\t大体圣徒要被提到云里，到空中主的仓里，就是基督的巴路西亚（同在）那时所在之处—太十三30，帖前四17：", "en": "1. The majority of the saints will be raptured to the Lord's barn in the air within the clouds, where Christ's parousia (presence) will then be—Matt. 13:30; 1 Thes. 4:17:", "norm_zh": "1大体圣徒要被提到云里到空中主的仓里就是基督的巴路西亚同在哪时所在之处太十三30帖前四17", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The majority of the saints will be raptured to the Lords barn in the air within the clouds where Christs parousia presence will then beMatt 1330 1 Thes 417"}
{"zh": "a\t大体圣徒不是被提到宇宙的顶点，到三层天里的锡安山上，乃是被提到空中—太十三30。", "en": "a. The majority of the saints will be raptured not to the peak of the universe, to Zion in the third heavens, but to the air—Matt. 13:30.", "norm_zh": "a大体圣徒不是被提到宇宙的顶点到三层天里的锡安山上乃是被提到空中太十三30", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "a The majority of the saints will be raptured not to the peak of the universe to Zion in the third heavens but to the airMatt 1330"}
{"zh": "b\t敌基督显出后，在末次号筒，就是在第七号之时，在大灾难末了，这世代的终结时，大体的圣徒（如同庄稼）要被提—39节，帖后二1、3下~4，启十四9~12。", "en": "b. The rapture of the majority of the saints as the harvest will be at the consummation of this age, after the manifestation of Antichrist, at the end of the great tribulation, at the last trumpet, that is, the seventh trumpet—v. 39; 2 Thes. 2:1, 3b-4; Rev. 14:9-12.", "norm_zh": "b敌基督显出后在末次号筒就是在第七号之时在大灾难末了这世代的终结时大体的圣徒如同庄稼要被提39节帖后二13下4启十四912", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "b The rapture of the majority of the saints as the harvest will be at the consummation of this age after the manifestation of Antichrist at the end of the great tribulation at the last trumpet that is the seventh trumpetv 39 2 Thes 21 3b4 Rev 14912"}
{"zh": "c\t这个被提包括复活的圣徒，他们要在“眨眼之间”复活，也包括还存留的圣徒—太二五1~12，启十五2，十六15，二十4~6，帖前四16，林前十五51~52。", "en": "c. This rapture will comprise the resurrected saints who will be resurrected \"in the twinkling of an eye,\" and also the remaining saints—Matt. 25:1-12; Rev. 15:2; 16:15; 20:4-6; 1 Thes. 4:16; 1 Cor. 15:51-52.", "norm_zh": "c这个被提包括复活的圣徒他们要在眨眼之间复活也包括还存留的圣徒太二五112启十五2十六15二十46帖前四16林前十五5152", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "c This rapture will comprise the resurrected saints who will be resurrected in the twinkling of an eye and also the remaining saintsMatt 25112 Rev 152 1615 2046 1 Thes 416 1 Cor 155152"}
{"zh": "d\t大体还存留的圣徒，要在得胜者被提后留下来，经过三年半的大灾难，他们要在旷野神为他们所预备的地方蒙保守三年半—启十二6、14。", "en": "d. The majority of the remaining saints, who will be left after the rapture of the overcomers to pass through the three and a half years of the great tribulation, will be preserved in a place prepared by God for them in the wilderness for those three and a half years—Rev. 12:6, 14.", "norm_zh": "d大体还存留的圣徒要在得胜者被提后留下来经过三年半的大灾难他们要在旷野神为他们所预备的地方蒙保守三年半启十二614", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "d The majority of the remaining saints who will be left after the rapture of the overcomers to pass through the three and a half years of the great tribulation will be preserved in a place prepared by God for them in the wilderness for those three and a half yearsRev 126 14"}
{"zh": "e\t凡在大灾难期间在基督里得救，并持守耶稣见证的人，都包括在还存留的圣徒之中，主在启示录十六章十五节提醒他们祂要再来—17节。", "en": "e. Those who will be saved in Christ and have the testimony of Jesus during the great tribulation will all be included among the remaining saints, whom the Lord will remind of His coming in Revelation 16:15—v. 17.", "norm_zh": "e凡在大灾难期间在基督里得救并持守耶稣见证的人都包括在还存留的圣徒之中主在启示录十六章十五节提醒他们祂要再来17节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "e Those who will be saved in Christ and have the testimony of Jesus during the great tribulation will all be included among the remaining saints whom the Lord will remind of His coming in Revelation 1615v 17"}
{"zh": "2\t两个见证人—摩西和以利亚的被提—十一3~12：", "en": "2. The rapture of the two witnesses—Moses and Elijah—11:3-12:", "norm_zh": "2两个见证人摩西和以利亚的被提十一312", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The rapture of the two witnessesMoses and Elijah11312"}
{"zh": "a\t摩西代表律法，以利亚代表申言者，二人都为神作见证—路十六16。", "en": "a. Moses represents the law and Elijah represents the prophets, both testifying for God—Luke 16:16.", "norm_zh": "a摩西代表律法以利亚代表申言者二人都为神作见证路十六16", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "a Moses represents the law and Elijah represents the prophets both testifying for GodLuke 1616"}
{"zh": "b\t他们作完见证时，敌基督必与他们争战，把他们杀了—启十一7。", "en": "b. When they will have completed their testimony, Antichrist will war with them and kill them—Rev. 11:7.", "norm_zh": "b他们作完见证时敌基督必与他们争战把他们杀了启十一7", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "b When they will have completed their testimony Antichrist will war with them and kill themRev 117"}
{"zh": "c\t过了这三天半，在他们尽职一千二百六十天的最后一天，也就是在大灾难的最后一天，他们要复活，在云中被提—11~12节。", "en": "c. After the three and a half days, they will resurrect and be raptured in the cloud on the last day of their ministry of one thousand two hundred and sixty days, that is, on the last day of the great tribulation—vv. 11-12.", "norm_zh": "c过了这三天半在他们尽职一千二百六十天的最后一天也就是在大灾难的最后一天他们要复活在云中被提1112节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "c After the three and a half days they will resurrect and be raptured in the cloud on the last day of their ministry of one thousand two hundred and sixty days that is on the last day of the great tribulationvv 1112"}
{"zh": "肆\t七碗乃是第三样灾祸，是大灾难的末后灾害—14、18节上，十五5~8：", "en": "IV. The seven bowls will be the third woe, the last plagues of the great tribulation—vv. 14, 18a; 15:5-8:", "norm_zh": "肆七碗乃是第三样灾祸是大灾难的末后灾害1418节上十五58", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "IV The seven bowls will be the third woe the last plagues of the great tribulationvv 14 18a 1558"}
{"zh": "一\t头四碗是终极的超自然灾害，彻底的毁坏人在宇宙中的住处—十六2~4、8。", "en": "A. The first four bowls are the consummating supernatural calamities to utterly damage men's habitation in the universe—16:2-4, 8.", "norm_zh": "一头四碗是终极的超自然灾害彻底的毁坏人在宇宙中的住处十六248", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The first four bowls are the consummating supernatural calamities to utterly damage mens habitation in the universe1624 8"}
{"zh": "二\t第五碗是神对敌基督之国的终极审判，要施行于敌基督的座位上，便他的国变为黑暗，属他的人由于疼痛，就咬自己的舌头，又由于所生的疮就亵渎神—10~11节。", "en": "B. The fifth bowl will be God's ultimate judgment on the kingdom of Antichrist executed on his throne, causing his kingdom to become darkened and his people to gnaw their tongues for pain and blaspheme God for their sores—vv. 10-11.", "norm_zh": "二第五碗是神对敌基督之国的终极审判要施行于敌基督的座位上便他的国变为黑暗属他的人由于疼痛就咬自己的舌头又由于所生的疮就亵渎神1011节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The fifth bowl will be Gods ultimate judgment on the kingdom of Antichrist executed on his throne causing his kingdom to become darkened and his people to gnaw their tongues for pain and blaspheme God for their soresvv 1011"}
{"zh": "三\t第六碗是对伯拉大河的破坏，使河水干了，要给那来自日出之地的众王预备道路，在哈米吉顿争战—12、16节。", "en": "C. The sixth bowl will be the damage on the great river Euphrates, causing it to dry up for the preparation of the way for the kings from the rising of the sun for the war at Armageddon—vv. 12, 16.", "norm_zh": "三第六碗是对伯拉大河的破坏使河水干了要给哪来自日出之地的众王预备道路在哈米吉顿争战1216节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The sixth bowl will be the damage on the great river Euphrates causing it to dry up for the preparation of the way for the kings from the rising of the sun for the war at Armageddonvv 12 16"}
{"zh": "三\t在第六碗和第七碗之间，插入哈米吉顿战争的预备—13、15、16节。", "en": "C. Between the sixth and seventh bowls is the insertion of the preparation for the war at Armageddon—vv. 13, 15, 16.", "norm_zh": "三在第六碗和第七碗之间插入哈米吉顿战争的预备131516节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Between the sixth and seventh bowls is the insertion of the preparation for the war at Armageddonvv 13 15 16"}
{"zh": "四\t第七碗将是大灾难结束的灾害：有最大的地震和大雹子；那地震是全宇宙最后一次的地震，也是最大的一次—17~21节。", "en": "D. The seventh bowl will be the concluding plague of the great tribulation: the greatest earthquake and the great hail; that earthquake will be the last earthquake in the whole universe and the biggest one—vv. 17-21.", "norm_zh": "四第七碗将是大灾难结束的灾害有最大的地震和大雹子哪地震是全宇宙最后一次的地震也是最大的一次1721节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D The seventh bowl will be the concluding plague of the great tribulation the greatest earthquake and the great hail that earthquake will be the last earthquake in the whole universe and the biggest onevv 1721"}
{"zh": "五\t在七碗之后，得胜者经过基督审判台的审判，要得着赏赐—林后五10，启十一18下。", "en": "E. After the seven bowls is the giving of the reward to the overcomers, judged at the judgment seat of Christ—2 Cor. 5:10; Rev. 11:18b.", "norm_zh": "五在七碗之后得胜者经过基督审判台的审判要得着赏赐林后五10启十一18下", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E After the seven bowls is the giving of the reward to the overcomers judged at the judgment seat of Christ2 Cor 510 Rev 1118b"}
{"zh": "六\t在审判台、施行赏赐、以及基督与得胜者的婚娶之后，基督要与祂的新妇从空中来到地上，在哈米吉顿的战争中与敌基督争战，并击败他—太二四27~28，启十六14、16：", "en": "F. After the judgment seat, the giving of the reward, and the marriage of Christ and His overcomers, He will come with His bride from the air to the earth to fight against and defeat Antichrist at the war of Armageddon—Matt. 24:27-28; Rev. 16:14, 16:", "norm_zh": "六在审判台施行赏赐以及基督与得胜者的婚娶之后基督要与祂的新妇从空中来到地上在哈米吉顿的战争中与敌基督争战并击败他太二四2728启十六1416", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "F After the judgment seat the giving of the reward and the marriage of Christ and His overcomers He will come with His bride from the air to the earth to fight against and defeat Antichrist at the war of ArmageddonMatt 242728 Rev 1614 16"}
{"zh": "1\t在哈米吉顿，基督要在那些在地上作恶的人身上，踹神烈怒的大酒醡—十四19~20。", "en": "1. At Armageddon Christ will tread the great winepress of the fury of God on the evildoers of the earth—Rev. 14:19-20.", "norm_zh": "1在哈米吉顿基督要在哪些在地上作恶的人身上踹神烈怒的大酒醡十四1920", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 At Armageddon Christ will tread the great winepress of the fury of God on the evildoers of the earthRev 141920"}
{"zh": "2\t基督和祂的新妇—得胜者—要与敌基督、十王、并他们的众军争战，且要在一个小时之内胜过他们，败坏那些败坏地者—十一18下，十七12~14。", "en": "2\tChrist with His bride—the overcomers—will fight Antichrist, the ten kings, and their armies and overcome them within one hour to destroy the destroyers of the earth—Rev. 11:18b; 17:12-14.", "norm_zh": "2基督和祂的新妇得胜者要与敌基督十王并他们的众军争战且要在一个小时之内胜过他们败坏哪些败坏地者十一18下十七1214", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Christ with His bridethe overcomerswill fight Antichrist the ten kings and their armies and overcome them within one hour to destroy the destroyers of the earthRev 1118b 171214"}
{"zh": "3\t基督要将敌基督和他的假申言者活活的扔在火湖里，他们所跟从的魔鬼撒但，也要被扔在其中，永远受火的痛苦—十九19~20，二十10。", "en": "3\tChrist will cast Antichrist and his false prophet alive into the lake of fire, into which the devil, Satan, whom they follow, will be cast also, to suffer the eternal torment by fire—Rev. 19:19-20; 20:10.", "norm_zh": "3基督要将敌基督和他的假申言者活活的扔在火湖里他们所跟从的魔鬼撒但也要被扔在其中永远受火的痛苦十九1920二十10", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 Christ will cast Antichrist and his false prophet alive into the lake of fire into which the devil Satan whom they follow will be cast also to suffer the eternal torment by fireRev 191920 2010"}
{"zh": "4\t那时以色列全家要向主悔改，并蒙祂拯救—亚十二10~14。", "en": "4\tAt that time the whole house of Israel will repent to the Lord and be saved by Him—Zech. 12:10-14.", "norm_zh": "4哪时以色列全家要向主悔改并蒙祂拯救亚十二1014", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "4 At that time the whole house of Israel will repent to the Lord and be saved by HimZech 121014"}
{"zh": "七\t祂要毁灭宗教、奥秘的巴比伦，以及政治、物质的巴比伦—启十七~十八：", "en": "G.\tHe Will Destroy the Religious and Mystical Babylon and the Political and Physical Babylon—Rev. 17—18:", "norm_zh": "七祂要毁灭宗教奥秘的巴比伦以及政治物质的巴比伦启十七十八", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "G He Will Destroy the Religious and Mystical Babylon and the Political and Physical BabylonRev 1718"}
{"zh": "1\t神首先要在大灾难开始时，借着敌基督毁了与以色列所立的约，并开始逼迫一切的宗教，而毁灭宗教、奥秘的巴比伦，就是背道的罗马教—但八11，九27，帖后二3~4。", "en": "1\tGod first will destroy the religious and mystical Babylon, that is, the apostate Roman Church, by Antichrist at the beginning of the great tribulation when he will break the covenant with Israel and begin to persecute all religions—Dan. 8:11; 9:27; 2 Thes. 2:3-4.", "norm_zh": "1神首先要在大灾难开始时借着敌基督毁了与以色列所立的约并开始逼迫一切的宗教而毁灭宗教奥秘的巴比伦就是背道的罗马教但八11九27帖后二34", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 God first will destroy the religious and mystical Babylon that is the apostate Roman Church by Antichrist at the beginning of the great tribulation when he will break the covenant with Israel and begin to persecute all religionsDan 811 927 2 Thes 234"}
{"zh": "2\t在大灾难末了时，就是在第七碗中哈米吉顿的战争之后，神也要毁灭政治、物质的巴比伦，就是罗马城—启十六19。", "en": "2\tAt the end of the great tribulation, right after the war at Armageddon in the seventh bowl, God will also destroy the political and physical Babylon, that is, the city of Rome—Rev. 16:19.", "norm_zh": "2在大灾难末了时就是在第七碗中哈米吉顿的战争之后神也要毁灭政治物质的巴比伦就是罗马城启十六19", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 At the end of the great tribulation right after the war at Armageddon in the seventh bowl God will also destroy the political and physical Babylon that is the city of RomeRev 1619"}
{"zh": "伍\t在白色大宝座前要有永远的审判，审判历代以来一切死了的不信者；在那审判之后，就有新天新地作神永远之国的范围，有新耶路撒冷为神永远之国的中心；这是第七印和第七号的终结，而第七印和第七号要持续到永远—二十11~15，二一~二二。", "en": "V.\tThere will be the eternal judgment at the great white throne to judge all the dead unbelievers throughout all the centuries; after that judgment, there will be the new heaven and new earth as the realm of the eternal kingdom of God with the New Jerusalem as the center of the eternal kingdom of God; this is the conclusion of the seventh seal and of the seventh trumpet which will last forever—Rev. 20:11-15; 21-22.", "norm_zh": "伍在白色大宝座前要有永远的审判审判历代以来一切死了的不信者在哪审判之后就有新天新地作神永远之国的范围有新耶路撒冷为神永远之国的中心这是第七印和第七号的终结而第七印和第七号要持续到永远二十1115二一二二", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "V There will be the eternal judgment at the great white throne to judge all the dead unbelievers throughout all the centuries after that judgment there will be the new heaven and new earth as the realm of the eternal kingdom of God with the New Jerusalem as the center of the eternal kingdom of God this is the conclusion of the seventh seal and of the seventh trumpet which will last foreverRev 201115 2122"}
{"zh": "七印乃是神经纶的奥秘（启六1~17，八1~2。）头四印是四匹马的历程：福音的传扬、战争、饥荒和死亡（启六1~8，太二四6~8、14。）这四匹马的历程乃是现今召会时代里世界的历程。紧接基督升天之后，福音、战争、饥荒、和死亡这四件事，便像四个骑马的骑在四匹马上，开始奔跑，一直持续到这世代的末了。从第一世纪开始，经过了这二十个世纪，福音不断的广传。福音是带头的。同时战争也不断在人类中间进行。战争总是造成饥荒，饥荒便带来死亡。这四印开始于基督的升天，并要持续到第六印里超自然的灾难。（启六12~17。）", "en": "The seven seals are the mystery of God's economy (Rev. 6:1-17; 8:1-2). The first four seals are the course of the four horses: gospel preaching, war, famine, and death (Rev. 6:1-8; Matt. 24:6-8, 14). The course of these four horses is the course of the world in the present age of the church. Immediately after Christ's ascension, these four things—the gospel, war, famine, and death—began to run like riders on four horses and will continue until the end of this age. Beginning with the first century, the gospel has been spreading throughout all these twenty centuries. The gospel takes the lead. War among the human race has also been proceeding simultaneously. War has always caused famine, and famine has issued in death. These four seals began from the ascension of Christ and will continue to the supernatural calamities in the sixth seal (Rev. 6:12-17).", "norm_zh": "七印乃是神经纶的奥秘启六117八12头四印是四匹马的历程福音的传扬战争饥荒和死亡启六18太二四6814这四匹马的历程乃是现今召会时代里世界的历程紧接基督升天之后福音战争饥荒和死亡这四件事便像四个骑马的骑在四匹马上开始奔跑一直持续到这世代的末了从第一世纪开始经过了这二十个世纪福音不断的广传福音是带头的同时战争也不断在人类中间进行战争总是造成饥荒饥荒便带来死亡这四印开始于基督的升天并要持续到第六印里超自然的灾难启六1217", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The seven seals are the mystery of Gods economy Rev 6117 812 The first four seals are the course of the four horses gospel preaching war famine and death Rev 618 Matt 2468 14 The course of these four horses is the course of the world in the present age of the church Immediately after Christs ascension these four thingsthe gospel war famine and deathbegan to run like riders on four horses and will continue until the end of this age Beginning with the first century the gospel has been spreading throughout all these twenty centuries The gospel takes the lead War among the human race has also been proceeding simultaneously War has always caused famine and famine has issued in death These four seals began from the ascension of Christ and will continue to the supernatural calamities in the sixth seal Rev 61217"}
{"zh": "得胜者分为五类", "en": "The overcomers being divided into five categories", "norm_zh": "得胜者分为五类", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The overcomers being divided into five categories"}
{"zh": "按照圣经，我们可以将得胜者分为五类。第一是男孩子，由复活的殉道者所组成，他们要有分于“杰出的复活”，“更美的复活”（启十二5，腓三11，来十一35。）第二类的得胜者是初熟的果子（启十四1、4。）第三类是非拉铁非的得胜者（启二7~8。）儆醒祈求的得胜者是第四类（路二一36。）最后，第五类是两个圣徒中儆醒的一个。（太二四40~42。）", "en": "According to the Bible, we can classify the overcomers into five categories. First, there is the man-child, composed of the resurrected martyrs who should participate in \"the extra resurrection,\" \"the better resurrection\" (Rev. 12:5; Phil. 3:11; Heb. 11:35). The second category of overcomers is the firstfruit (Rev. 14:1, 4). The third category is the Philadelphia overcomers (Rev. 2:7-8). The watchful and beseeching overcomers are the fourth category (Luke 21:36). Finally, the fifth category is the watchful one of the two saints (Matt. 24:40-42).", "norm_zh": "按照圣经我们可以将得胜者分为五类第一是男孩子由复活的殉道者所组成他们要有分于杰出的复活更美的复活启十二5腓三11来十一35第二类的得胜者是初熟的果子启十四14第三类是非拉铁非的得胜者启二78儆醒祈求的得胜者是第四类路二一36最后第五类是两个圣徒中儆醒的一个太二四4042", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "According to the Bible we can classify the overcomers into five categories First there is the manchild composed of the resurrected martyrs who should participate in the extra resurrection the better resurrection Rev 125 Phil 311 Heb 1135 The second category of overcomers is the firstfruit Rev 141 4 The third category is the Philadelphia overcomers Rev 278 The watchful and beseeching overcomers are the fourth category Luke 2136 Finally the fifth category is the watchful one of the two saints Matt 244042"}
{"zh": "祸患、超自然的灾难、灾害、灾祸要发生", "en": "evils, supernatural calamities, plagues, and woes will take place", "norm_zh": "祸患超自然的灾难灾害灾祸要发生", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "evils supernatural calamities plagues and woes will take place"}
{"zh": "以上五类得胜者要在揭开第六印之前被提。得胜者被提之后，在但以理九章二十四至二十七节所启示的七十个七的末七（部七年）之半，敌基督要毁弃他与以色列所立的一七（部七年）之约，并且大灾难（太二四21）要开始，历时三年半—四十二个月—一千二百六十天；在这段期间，以下的祸患、超自然的灾难、灾害、灾祸要发生。第一，撒但要从天上被摔在地上，就大大发怒，使地和海有祸了，并要逼迫仍存留在地上神的子民，且要与守神诫命的犹太人和持守耶稣见证的信徒争战（启十二7、12下~13、17。）第二，从无底坑土来的敌基督，（启十七8，）要高抬自己超过一切称为神，或受人敬拜者，坐在神的殿里，展示自己，说他就是神（帖后二4，但九27下，太二四 15。）第三，所有住在地上的，都要拜撒但（那龙），又拜敌基督（那兽）和他的像；那些不拜他和他像的，都要被杀害（启十三3~4、8、15。）有些基督徒必定要被杀害，因为在启示录十五章，这些被杀害的人要复活并被提。他们成了站在玻璃海上的人（启十五2~4。）启示录二十章四节也题到在大灾难中这些不肯拜兽和兽像的殉道者。第四，敌基督要与圣徒争战，并胜过他们，又要随意而行四十二个月（启十三7、5。）在那段期间内，有一位天使要向住在地上的人传永远的福音，吩咐他们应当敬畏神，并要敬拜祂，也就是说，不可拜敌基督和他的像，因为祂施行审判的时候已经到了（启十四6~7、9~11。）因着这福音，在万民中有一些人不拜敌基督或他的像。按照马太二十五章他们反而要善待神的子民，主的弟兄们。当主来到地上时，祂要将他们看作是“绵羊”，并且使他们在千年国中作地上的百姓。第五，假申言者（另一兽）要行大奇事迷惑人，叫人给敌基督作个像，并拜那像（启十三11~15，十六13，十九20。）第六，除了属撒但的三一—撒但、敌基督、和假申言者—所造成的一切破坏之外，神要在怒中用超自然的灾难、杀戮、毒疮、黑暗，就是第六印、头六号和第七号之七碗中的灾祸，向地上的人施行审判。现在我们来到第六印的揭开。", "en": "The above five categories of overcomers will be raptured before the opening of the sixth seal. After the rapture of the overcomers, in the midst of the last week (seven years) of the seventy weeks revealed in Daniel 9:24-27, Antichrist will break his one-week (seven years) covenant with Israel, and the great tribulation (Matt. 24:21) will begin and last for three and a half years—forty-two months—one thousand two hundred and sixty days, in which period of time the following evils, supernatural calamities, plagues, and woes will take place. First, Satan will be cast from heaven to the earth to cause, with great rage, woes to the earth and the sea and to persecute God's people, those who still remain on the earth, and he will war with the Jews, who keep the commandments of God, and the believers, who have the testimony of Jesus (Rev. 12:7, 12b-13, 17). Second, Antichrist, who will come up out of the abyss (Rev. 17:8), will exalt himself above all that is called God or an object of worship, seating himself in the temple of God and proclaiming that he is God (2 Thes. 2:4; Dan. 9:27b; Matt. 24:15). Third, all those dwelling on the earth will worship Satan (the dragon) and worship Antichrist (the beast) and his image; those who would not worship him and his image will be slain (Rev. 13:3-4, 8, 15). Some Christians surely will be slain because in Revelation 15, these slain ones will be resurrected and raptured. They become the ones standing on the glassy sea (Rev. 15:2-4). Revelation 20:4 also mentions these martyrs in the great tribulation who would not worship the beast and his image. Fourth, Antichrist will war with the saints, overcome them, and act as he wills for forty-two months (Rev. 13:7, 5). During that time, an angel will announce an eternal gospel to those settled on the earth, charging them to fear God and worship Him, that is, not to worship Antichrist and his image, because the hour of His judgment has come (Rev. 14:6-7, 9-11). Because of this gospel, some among the nations will not worship the Antichrist or his image. Instead, according to Matthew 25, they will treat God's people, the Lord's brothers, kindly. When the Lord comes to earth, He will consider them as \"sheep\" and make them the people on the earth in the millennium. Fifth, the false prophet (another beast) will do great signs to deceive people to make an image for Antichrist and worship it (Rev. 13:11-15; 16:13; 19:20). Sixth, in addition to all the devastations caused by the satanic trinity—Satan, Antichrist, and the false prophet—God will mete out His judgment in His wrath to men on the earth with supernatural calamities, killings, a malignant sore, and darkness, as woes in the sixth seal, the first six trumpets, and the seven bowls of the seventh trumpet. Now we come to the opening of the sixth seal.", "norm_zh": "以上五类得胜者要在揭开第六印之前被提得胜者被提之后在但以理九章二十四至二十七节所启示的七十个七的末七部七年之半敌基督要毁弃他与以色列所立的一七部七年之约并且大灾难太二四21要开始历时三年半四十二个月一千二百六十天在这段期间以下的祸患超自然的灾难灾害灾祸要发生第一撒但要从天上被摔在地上就大大发怒使地和海有祸了并要逼迫仍存留在地上神的子民且要与守神诫命的犹太人和持守耶稣见证的信徒争战启十二712下1317第二从无底坑土来的敌基督启十七8要高抬自己超过一切称为神或受人敬拜者坐在神的殿里展示自己说他就是神帖后二4但九27下太二四15第三所有住在地上的都要拜撒但哪龙又拜敌基督哪兽和他的像哪些不拜他和他像的都要被杀害启十三34815有些基督徒必定要被杀害因为在启示录十五章这些被杀害的人要复活并被提他们成了站在玻璃海上的人启十五24启示录二十章四节也提到在大灾难中这些不肯拜兽和兽像的殉道者第四敌基督要与圣徒争战并胜过他们又要随意而行四十二个月启十三75在哪段期间内有一位天使要向住在地上的人传永远的福音吩咐他们应当敬畏神并要敬拜祂也就是说不可拜敌基督和他的像因为祂施行审判的时候已经到了启十四67911因着这福音在万民中有一些人不拜敌基督或他的像按照马太二十五章他们反而要善待神的子民主的弟兄们当主来到地上时祂要将他们看作是绵羊并且使他们在千年国中作地上的百姓第五假申言者另一兽要行大奇事迷惑人叫人给敌基督作个像并拜哪像启十三1115十六13十九20第六除了属撒但的三一撒但敌基督和假申言者所造成的一切破坏之外神要在怒中用超自然的灾难杀戮毒疮黑暗就是第六印头六号和第七号之七碗中的灾祸向地上的人施行审判现在我们来到第六印的揭开", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The above five categories of overcomers will be raptured before the opening of the sixth seal After the rapture of the overcomers in the midst of the last week seven years of the seventy weeks revealed in Daniel 92427 Antichrist will break his oneweek seven years covenant with Israel and the great tribulation Matt 2421 will begin and last for three and a half yearsfortytwo monthsone thousand two hundred and sixty days in which period of time the following evils supernatural calamities plagues and woes will take place First Satan will be cast from heaven to the earth to cause with great rage woes to the earth and the sea and to persecute Gods people those who still remain on the earth and he will war with the Jews who keep the commandments of God and the believers who have the testimony of Jesus Rev 127 12b13 17 Second Antichrist who will come up out of the abyss Rev 178 will exalt himself above all that is called God or an object of worship seating himself in the temple of God and proclaiming that he is God 2 Thes 24 Dan 927b Matt 2415 Third all those dwelling on the earth will worship Satan the dragon and worship Antichrist the beast and his image those who would not worship him and his image will be slain Rev 1334 8 15 Some Christians surely will be slain because in Revelation 15 these slain ones will be resurrected and raptured They become the ones standing on the glassy sea Rev 1524 Revelation 204 also mentions these martyrs in the great tribulation who would not worship the beast and his image Fourth Antichrist will war with the saints overcome them and act as he wills for fortytwo months Rev 137 5 During that time an angel will announce an eternal gospel to those settled on the earth charging them to fear God and worship Him that is not to worship Antichrist and his image because the hour of His judgment has come Rev 1467 911 Because of this gospel some among the nations will not worship the Antichrist or his image Instead according to Matthew 25 they will treat Gods people the Lords brothers kindly When the Lord comes to earth He will consider them as sheep and make them the people on the earth in the millennium Fifth the false prophet another beast will do great signs to deceive people to make an image for Antichrist and worship it Rev 131115 1613 1920 Sixth in addition to all the devastations caused by the satanic trinitySatan Antichrist and the false prophetGod will mete out His judgment in His wrath to men on the earth with supernatural calamities killings a malignant sore and darkness as woes in the sixth seal the first six trumpets and the seven bowls of the seventh trumpet Now we come to the opening of the sixth seal"}
{"zh": "七号是第七印的内容（启八61，十一14~18。）头四号将是加强的超自然灾难，破坏一切为着人生活之自然供备的源头。我们在地上生活的一切供备都是神所预备的，但这一切都要因着头四号而受破坏。第一号是神对地的审判：有雹子与火搀着血丢在地上；地约三分之一、树约三分之一、和一切的青草，都被烧了。", "en": "The seven trumpets are the contents of the seventh seal (Rev. 8:6-9:21; 11:14-18). The first four trumpets will be the intensified supernatural calamities to damage all the sources of natural provisions for men's living. All the provisions for us to live on earth were prepared by God, but all these will be damaged with the first four trumpets. The first trumpet will be God's judgment on the earth: hail and fire mingled with blood will be cast to the earth; about a third of the earth, about a third of the trees, and all the green grass will be burnt (Rev. 8:7).", "norm_zh": "七号是第七印的内容启八61十一1418头四号将是加强的超自然灾难破坏一切为着人生活之自然供备的源头我们在地上生活的一切供备都是神所预备的但这一切都要因着头四号而受破坏第一号是神对地的审判有雹子与火搀着血丢在地上地约三分之一树约三分之一和一切的青草都被烧了", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The seven trumpets are the contents of the seventh seal Rev 86921 111418 The first four trumpets will be the intensified supernatural calamities to damage all the sources of natural provisions for mens living All the provisions for us to live on earth were prepared by God but all these will be damaged with the first four trumpets The first trumpet will be Gods judgment on the earth hail and fire mingled with blood will be cast to the earth about a third of the earth about a third of the trees and all the green grass will be burnt Rev 87"}
{"zh": "（启八7。）第二号是神对海的审判：有火烧着的大山扔在海中，海约三分之一变成血，海中的活物死了三分之一，船隻也坏了三分之一（启八8~9。）第三号是神对江河的审判：有名叫茵陈的大星，好像烧着的火把，从天上落下来，落在江河约三分之一，和泉水的泉上，众水的三分之一变为茵陈，许多人因苦水而死了（启八10~11。）第四号是神对日、月、星辰的审判：日、月、星辰约三分之一都被击打，这三光（日、月、星辰）约三分之一黑暗了，白昼与黑夜有三分之一不出现（启八12。）三分之一的白昼要成为黑暗，月亮和星辰在黑夜有三分之一不发亮。这是神的审判，破坏为着人生活之自然供备的源头。", "en": "(Rev. 8:7). The second trumpet will be God's judgment on the sea: a great mountain burning with fire will be cast into the sea; about a third of the sea will become blood, the third part of the living creatures in the sea will die, and the third part of the ships will be destroyed (Rev. 8:8-9). The third trumpet will be God's judgment on the rivers: a great star, called Wormwood, will fall out of heaven, burning like a torch, and will fall upon about a third of the rivers and upon the springs of waters; the third part of the waters will become wormwood, and many men will die from the bitter waters (Rev. 8:10-11). The fourth trumpet will be God's judgment on the sun, moon, and stars: about a third of the sun, of the moon, and of the stars will be smitten; about a third of the three lights (the sun, moon, and stars) will be darkened, the day and night not appearing for the third part of them (Rev. 8:12). The third part of the day will be dark. The moon and the stars will not shine for the third part of the night. This is God's judgment to damage the sources of the natural provisions for men's living.", "norm_zh": "启八7第二号是神对海的审判有火烧着的大山扔在海中海约三分之一变成血海中的活物死了三分之一船只也坏了三分之一启八89第三号是神对江河的审判有名叫茵陈的大星好像烧着的火把从天上落下来落在江河约三分之一和泉水的泉上众水的三分之一变为茵陈许多人因苦水而死了启八1011第四号是神对日月星辰的审判日月星辰约三分之一都被击打这三光日月星辰约三分之一黑暗了白昼与黑夜有三分之一不出现启八12三分之一的白昼要成为黑暗月亮和星辰在黑夜有三分之一不发亮这是神的审判破坏为着人生活之自然供备的源头", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Rev 87 The second trumpet will be Gods judgment on the sea a great mountain burning with fire will be cast into the sea about a third of the sea will become blood the third part of the living creatures in the sea will die and the third part of the ships will be destroyed Rev 889 The third trumpet will be Gods judgment on the rivers a great star called Wormwood will fall out of heaven burning like a torch and will fall upon about a third of the rivers and upon the springs of waters the third part of the waters will become wormwood and many men will die from the bitter waters Rev 81011 The fourth trumpet will be Gods judgment on the sun moon and stars about a third of the sun of the moon and of the stars will be smitten about a third of the three lights the sun moon and stars will be darkened the day and night not appearing for the third part of them Rev 812 The third part of the day will be dark The moon and the stars will not shine for the third part of the night This is Gods judgment to damage the sources of the natural provisions for mens living"}
{"zh": "第五号，就是第一样灾祸，是神对人的审判", "en": "The fifth trumpet, which is the first woe, is God's judgment on men", "norm_zh": "第五号就是第一样灾祸是神对人的审判", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The fifth trumpet which is the first woe is Gods judgment on men"}
{"zh": "第六号，就是第二样灾祸，是神对人进一步的审判", "en": "The sixth trumpet, which is the second woe, is God's further judgment on men", "norm_zh": "第六号就是第二样灾祸是神对人进一步的审判", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The sixth trumpet which is the second woe is Gods further judgment on men"}
{"zh": "第六号，就是第二样灾祸，是神对人进一步的审判，借着二万万马军，杀了人类的三分之一（启九12~21。）在吹了这号之后，捆绑在伯拉大河的四个使者要被释放，在十三个月一天又一小时之内，借着二万万马军杀害人类约三分之一（启九14~15。）马军要用马的口中所出的人、烟与硫磺，并用像蛇的马尾杀人（启九17~19。）其余末被这些灾害所杀的人，仍旧不肯悔改自己的拜偶像、凶杀、邪术、淫乱和偷窃（启九20~21。）第五号和第六号要持续一年半以上。在第六号以后，第七号之前，另外有一段关于圣徒被提与基督再来的插入。这一段的插入是说到基督从天降临空中。", "en": "The sixth trumpet, which is the second woe, is God's further judgment on men by two hundred million cavalry troops killing about a third of men (Rev. 9:12-21). After this trumpet is sounded, the four angels who are bound at the great river Euphrates are loosed to kill about a third of men within thirteen months and one day and one hour by two hundred million cavalry troops (Rev. 9:14-15). The cavalry troops will kill men by fire, smoke, and sulphur proceeding out of the mouth of their horses and by the tails of their horses, which are like the tails of serpents (Rev. 9:17-19). The rest of the men who have not been killed by these plagues will not repent of their idolatry, murders, witchcrafts, fornication, and thefts (Rev. 9:20-21). The fifth trumpet and the sixth trumpet will last for more than one and a half years. After the sixth trumpet and before the seventh trumpet is another insertion related to the rapture of the saints and the second coming of Christ. This insertion is concerning Christ's coming down out of heaven to the air.", "norm_zh": "第六号就是第二样灾祸是神对人进一步的审判借着二万万马军杀了人类的三分之一启九1221在吹了这号之后捆绑在伯拉大河的四个使者要被释放在十三个月一天又一小时之内借着二万万马军杀害人类约三分之一启九1415马军要用马的口中所出的人烟与硫磺并用像蛇的马尾杀人启九1719其余末被这些灾害所杀的人仍旧不肯悔改自己的拜偶像凶杀邪术淫乱和偷窃启九2021第五号和第六号要持续一年半以上在第六号以后第七号之前另外有一段关于圣徒被提与基督再来的插入这一段的插入是说到基督从天降临空中", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The sixth trumpet which is the second woe is Gods further judgment on men by two hundred million cavalry troops killing about a third of men Rev 91221 After this trumpet is sounded the four angels who are bound at the great river Euphrates are loosed to kill about a third of men within thirteen months and one day and one hour by two hundred million cavalry troops Rev 91415 The cavalry troops will kill men by fire smoke and sulphur proceeding out of the mouth of their horses and by the tails of their horses which are like the tails of serpents Rev 91719 The rest of the men who have not been killed by these plagues will not repent of their idolatry murders witchcrafts fornication and thefts Rev 92021 The fifth trumpet and the sixth trumpet will last for more than one and a half years After the sixth trumpet and before the seventh trumpet is another insertion related to the rapture of the saints and the second coming of Christ This insertion is concerning Christs coming down out of heaven to the air"}
{"zh": "基督从天降临空中", "en": "Christ's coming down out of heaven to the air", "norm_zh": "基督从天降临空中", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Christs coming down out of heaven to the air"}
{"zh": "两个见证人—摩西和以利亚的被提", "en": "The rapture of the two witnesses—Moses and Elijah", "norm_zh": "两个见证人摩西和以利亚的被提", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The rapture of the two witnessesMoses and Elijah"}
{"zh": "在大灾难末了，也有两个见证人—摩西和以利亚—的被提（启十一3~12。）他们在启示录十一章五至六节所作的，正像摩西和以利亚的作为（出七17、19，九14，十一1，王下一10~12，王上十七1。）摩西和以利亚曾在变化山上显现在主面前，（太十七1~3，）摩西代表律法，以利亚代表申言者，（路十六16，）二人都为神作见证。在撒迦利亚四章三节、十一至十四节，他们是两棵橄榄树，两个油的儿子（启十一4。）他们要说预言一千二百六十天，那时圣城耶路撒冷要被敌基督践踏四十二个月（启十一3、2。）他们作完见证时，敌基督必与他们争战，把他们杀了（启十一7。）他们的尸首要倒在那大城（耶路撒冷）的街道上三天半（启十一8~9。）过了这三天半，在他们尽职一千二百六十天的最后一天，也就是在大灾难的最后一天，他们要复活，在云中被提（启十一11~12。）我们既看过了大体圣徒的被提，以及两个见证人的被提，我们现在来看七碗，就是第七号的消极内容。", "en": "At the end of the great tribulation, there will be also the rapture of the two witnesses—Moses and Elijah (Rev. 11:3-12). What they will do in Revelation 11:5-6 is just like the deeds of Moses and Elijah (Exo. 7:17, 19; 9:14; 11:1; 2 Kings 1:10-12; 1 Kings 17:1), who appeared before the Lord on the mount of transfiguration (Matt. 17:1-3). Moses, representing the law, and Elijah, representing the prophets (Luke 16:16), both testify for God. They are the two olive trees, the two sons of oil (Rev. 11:4) in Zechariah 4:3 and 11-14. They will prophesy a thousand two hundred and sixty days, when the holy city, Jerusalem, will be trampled by Antichrist for forty-two months (Rev. 11:3, 2). When they will have completed their testimony, Antichrist will war with them and kill them (Rev. 11:7). Their corpses will be on the street of the great city (Jerusalem) for three and a half days (Rev. 11:8-9). After the three and a half days, they will resurrect and be raptured in the cloud on the last day of their ministry of one thousand two hundred and sixty days, that is, on the last day of the great tribulation (Rev. 11:11-12). Since we have seen the insertions of the rapture of the majority of the saints and of the two witnesses, we come to the seven bowls, which are the negative contents of the seventh trumpet.", "norm_zh": "在大灾难末了也有两个见证人摩西和以利亚的被提启十一312他们在启示录十一章五至六节所作的正像摩西和以利亚的作为出七1719九14十一1王下一1012王上十七1摩西和以利亚曾在变化山上显现在主面前太十七13摩西代表律法以利亚代表申言者路十六16二人都为神作见证在撒迦利亚四章三节十一至十四节他们是两棵橄榄树两个油的儿子启十一4他们要说预言一千二百六十天哪时圣城耶路撒冷要被敌基督践踏四十二个月启十一32他们作完见证时敌基督必与他们争战把他们杀了启十一7他们的尸首要倒在哪大城耶路撒冷的街道上三天半启十一89过了这三天半在他们尽职一千二百六十天的最后一天也就是在大灾难的最后一天他们要复活在云中被提启十一1112我们既看过了大体圣徒的被提以及两个见证人的被提我们现在来看七碗就是第七号的消极内容", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "At the end of the great tribulation there will be also the rapture of the two witnessesMoses and Elijah Rev 11312 What they will do in Revelation 1156 is just like the deeds of Moses and Elijah Exo 717 19 914 111 2 Kings 11012 1 Kings 171 who appeared before the Lord on the mount of transfiguration Matt 1713 Moses representing the law and Elijah representing the prophets Luke 1616 both testify for God They are the two olive trees the two sons of oil Rev 114 in Zechariah 43 and 1114 They will prophesy a thousand two hundred and sixty days when the holy city Jerusalem will be trampled by Antichrist for fortytwo months Rev 113 2 When they will have completed their testimony Antichrist will war with them and kill them Rev 117 Their corpses will be on the street of the great city Jerusalem for three and a half days Rev 1189 After the three and a half days they will resurrect and be raptured in the cloud on the last day of their ministry of one thousand two hundred and sixty days that is on the last day of the great tribulation Rev 111112 Since we have seen the insertions of the rapture of the majority of the saints and of the two witnesses we come to the seven bowls which are the negative contents of the seventh trumpet"}
{"zh": "七碗乃是第三样灾祸，是大灾难的末后灾害", "en": "The seven bowls will be the third woe, the last plagues of the great tribulation", "norm_zh": "七碗乃是第三样灾祸是大灾难的末后灾害", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The seven bowls will be the third woe the last plagues of the great tribulation"}
{"zh": "头四碗是终极的超自然灾害", "en": "The first four bowls are the consummating supernatural calamities", "norm_zh": "头四碗是终极的超自然灾害", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The first four bowls are the consummating supernatural calamities"}
{"zh": "头四碗是终极的超自然灾害，彻底的毁坏人在宇宙中的住处（启十六2~9。）第一碗是神对地更进一步的审判，使又恶又毒的疮，生在拜敌基督的人身上（启十六1~2。）第二碗是神对海更进一步的审判，使海变成血，并使海中所有的生物都死了（启十六3。）第三碗是神对江河与水泉更进一步的审判，使其变成血，叫人喝这血（启十六4~7。）第四碗是神对日头更进一步的审判，使其用火烤人，人被烤就亵渎神的名。（启十六8~9。）", "en": "The first four bowls are the consummating supernatural calamities to utterly damage men's habitation in the universe (Rev. 16:2-9). The first bowl will be God's further judgment on the earth, causing an evil and malignant sore upon the worshippers of Antichrist (Rev. 16:1-2). The second bowl will be God's further judgment on the sea, causing the sea to become blood and every living soul in the sea to die (Rev. 16:3). The third bowl will be God's further judgment on the rivers and springs, causing them to become blood that men have to drink (Rev. 16:4-7). The fourth bowl will be God's further judgment on the sun causing it to burn men with fire, and men being burned to blaspheme the name of God (Rev. 16:8-9).", "norm_zh": "头四碗是终极的超自然灾害彻底的毁坏人在宇宙中的住处启十六29第一碗是神对地更进一步的审判使又恶又毒的疮生在拜敌基督的人身上启十六12第二碗是神对海更进一步的审判使海变成血并使海中所有的生物都死了启十六3第三碗是神对江河与水泉更进一步的审判使其变成血叫人喝这血启十六47第四碗是神对日头更进一步的审判使其用火烤人人被烤就亵渎神的名启十六89", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The first four bowls are the consummating supernatural calamities to utterly damage mens habitation in the universe Rev 1629 The first bowl will be Gods further judgment on the earth causing an evil and malignant sore upon the worshippers of Antichrist Rev 1612 The second bowl will be Gods further judgment on the sea causing the sea to become blood and every living soul in the sea to die Rev 163 The third bowl will be Gods further judgment on the rivers and springs causing them to become blood that men have to drink Rev 1647 The fourth bowl will be Gods further judgment on the sun causing it to burn men with fire and men being burned to blaspheme the name of God Rev 1689"}
{"zh": "第五碗是神对敌基督之国的终极审判", "en": "The fifth bowl will be God's ultimate judgment on the kingdom of Antichrist", "norm_zh": "第五碗是神对敌基督之国的终极审判", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The fifth bowl will be Gods ultimate judgment on the kingdom of Antichrist"}
{"zh": "第五碗是神对敌基督之国的终极审判，要施行于敌基督的座位上，便他的国变为黑暗，属他的人由于疼痛，就咬自己的舌头，又由于所生的疮就亵渎神。（启十六10~11。）", "en": "The fifth bowl will be God's ultimate judgment on the kingdom of Antichrist executed on his throne, causing his kingdom to become darkened and his people to gnaw their tongues for pain and blaspheme God for their sores (Rev. 16:10-11).", "norm_zh": "第五碗是神对敌基督之国的终极审判要施行于敌基督的座位上便他的国变为黑暗属他的人由于疼痛就咬自己的舌头又由于所生的疮就亵渎神启十六1011", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The fifth bowl will be Gods ultimate judgment on the kingdom of Antichrist executed on his throne causing his kingdom to become darkened and his people to gnaw their tongues for pain and blaspheme God for their sores Rev 161011"}
{"zh": "第六碗是对伯拉大河的破坏", "en": "The sixth bowl will be the damage on the great river Euphrates", "norm_zh": "第六碗是对伯拉大河的破坏", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The sixth bowl will be the damage on the great river Euphrates"}
{"zh": "第六碗是对伯拉大河的破坏，使河水干了，要给那来自日出之地的众王预备道路，在哈米吉顿争战（启十六12、16。）在第六碗和第七碗之间，插入哈米吉顿战争的预备。", "en": "The sixth bowl will be the damage on the great river Euphrates, causing it to dry up for the preparation of the way for the kings from the rising of the sun for the war at Armageddon (Rev. 16:12 with v. 16). Between the sixth and seventh bowls is the insertion of the preparation for the war at Armageddon.", "norm_zh": "第六碗是对伯拉大河的破坏使河水干了要给哪来自日出之地的众王预备道路在哈米吉顿争战启十六1216在第六碗和第七碗之间插入哈米吉顿战争的预备", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The sixth bowl will be the damage on the great river Euphrates causing it to dry up for the preparation of the way for the kings from the rising of the sun for the war at Armageddon Rev 1612 with v 16 Between the sixth and seventh bowls is the insertion of the preparation for the war at Armageddon"}
{"zh": "哈米吉顿战争的预备", "en": "The preparation for the war at Armageddon", "norm_zh": "哈米吉顿战争的预备", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The preparation for the war at Armageddon"}
{"zh": "大灾难结束的灾害", "en": "The concluding plague of the great tribulation", "norm_zh": "大灾难结束的灾害", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The concluding plague of the great tribulation"}
{"zh": "第七碗将是大灾难结束的灾害：有最大的地震和大雹子（启十六17~21。）那地震是全宇宙最后一次的地震，也是最大的一次。地震要使那大城—耶路撒冷—裂为三段，列国的城也都要倒塌（启十六19上。）大巴比伦（物质的罗马城）要被毁灭（启十六19下。）各海岛都逃避了，众山也不见了（启十六20。）大雹子（每个约重一他连得—约一百磅）击打人，人就亵渎神。（启十六21。）", "en": "The seventh bowl will be the concluding plague of the great tribulation: the greatest earthquake and the great hail (Rev. 16:17-21). That earthquake will be the last earthquake in the whole universe and the biggest one. The earthquake will divide the great city—Jerusalem—into three parts and the cities of the nations will fall (Rev. 16:19a). Babylon the great (the material city of Rome) will be destroyed (Rev. 16:19b). Every island will flee and mountains will disappear (Rev. 16:20). The great hail (each weighing about one talent—approximately one hundred pounds) will smite men, and men will blaspheme God (Rev. 16:21).", "norm_zh": "第七碗将是大灾难结束的灾害有最大的地震和大雹子启十六1721哪地震是全宇宙最后一次的地震也是最大的一次地震要使哪大城耶路撒冷裂为三段列国的城也都要倒塌启十六19上大巴比伦物质的罗马城要被毁灭启十六19下各海岛都逃避了众山也不见了启十六20大雹子每个约重一他连得约一百磅击打人人就亵渎神启十六21", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The seventh bowl will be the concluding plague of the great tribulation the greatest earthquake and the great hail Rev 161721 That earthquake will be the last earthquake in the whole universe and the biggest one The earthquake will divide the great cityJerusaleminto three parts and the cities of the nations will fall Rev 1619a Babylon the great the material city of Rome will be destroyed Rev 1619b Every island will flee and mountains will disappear Rev 1620 The great hail each weighing about one talentapproximately one hundred pounds will smite men and men will blaspheme God Rev 1621"}
{"zh": "白色大宝座前的永远审判，以及新天新地作神永远之国的范围", "en": "The Eternal Judgment at the Great White Throne, and the New Heaven and New Earth as the Realm of the Eternal Kingdom of God", "norm_zh": "白色大宝座前的永远审判以及新天新地作神永远之国的范围", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The Eternal Judgment at the Great White Throne and the New Heaven and New Earth as the Realm of the Eternal Kingdom of God"}
{"zh": "儆醒，预备好我们自己", "en": "Be on the alert and get ourselves prepared", "norm_zh": "儆醒预备好我们自己", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:44:41.462730+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Be on the alert and get ourselves prepared"}
{"zh": "壹\t七印、七号、七碗是从基督升天时到将来无终的永远—启六1~17，八1~2、61，十一14~18，十五5~8，十六1。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "I. The seven seals, the seven trumpets, and the seven bowls are from the time of Christ's ascension to eternity in the future without ending—Rev. 6:1-17; 8:1-2, 6; 11:14-18; 15:5-8; 16:1.", "norm_zh": "壹七印七号七碗是从基督升天时到将来无终的永远启六117八1261十一1418十五58十六1李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I The seven seals the seven trumpets and the seven bowls are from the time of Christs ascension to eternity in the future without endingRev 6117 812 6 111418 1558 161"}
{"zh": "贰\t七印乃是神经纶的奥秘—六1~17，八1~2：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "II. The seven seals are the mystery of God's economy—6:1-17; 8:1-2:", "norm_zh": "贰七印乃是神经纶的奥秘六117八12李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "II The seven seals are the mystery of Gods economy6117 812"}
{"zh": "一\t头四印是四匹马的历程：福音的传扬、战争、饥荒和死亡；这四匹马的历程乃是现今召会时代里世界的历程—六1~8，太二四6~8、14。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "A. The first four seals are the course of the four horses: gospel preaching, war, famine, and death; the course of these four horses is the course of the world in the present age of the church—6:1-8; Matt. 24:6-8, 14.", "norm_zh": "一头四印是四匹马的历程福音的传扬战争饥荒和死亡这四匹马的历程乃是现今召会时代里世界的历程六18太二四6814李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The first four seals are the course of the four horses gospel preaching war famine and death the course of these four horses is the course of the world in the present age of the church618 Matt 2468 14"}
{"zh": "二\t第五印是殉道圣徒求伸冤的呼喊—启二13，六9~11。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "B. The fifth seal is the cry of the martyred saints for vengeance—Rev. 2:13; 6:9-11.", "norm_zh": "二第五印是殉道圣徒求伸冤的呼喊启二13六911李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The fifth seal is the cry of the martyred saints for vengeanceRev 213 6911"}
{"zh": "三\t得胜者的被提是第五印和第六印之间的插入—二7，十二5，十四1。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "C. The rapture of the overcomers is an insertion between the fifth and sixth seals—2:7; 12:5; 14:1.", "norm_zh": "三得胜者的被提是第五印和第六印之间的插入二7十二5十四1李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The rapture of the overcomers is an insertion between the fifth and sixth seals27 125 141"}
{"zh": "四\t按照圣经，可以将得胜者分为五类—腓三11，启二7，十四4，路二一36，太二四40：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "D. According to the Bible, we can classify the overcomers into five categories—Phil. 3:11; Rev. 2:7; 14:4; Luke 21:36; Matt. 24:40:", "norm_zh": "四按照圣经可以将得胜者分为五类腓三11启二7十四4路二一36太二四40李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D According to the Bible we can classify the overcomers into five categoriesPhil 311 Rev 27 144 Luke 2136 Matt 2440"}
{"zh": "1\t第一是男孩子，由复活的殉道者所组成，他们要有分于“杰出的复活”，“更美的复活”—启十二5，腓三11，来十一35。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "1. First, there is the man-child, composed of the resurrected martyrs who should participate in \"the extra resurrection,\" \"the better resurrection\"—Rev. 12:5; Phil. 3:11; Heb. 11:35.", "norm_zh": "1第一是男孩子由复活的殉道者所组成他们要有分于杰出的复活更美的复活启十二5腓三11来十一35李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 First there is the manchild composed of the resurrected martyrs who should participate in the extra resurrection the better resurrectionRev 125 Phil 311 Heb 1135"}
{"zh": "2\t第二类的得胜者是初熟的果子—启十四1、4。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "2. The second category of overcomers is the firstfruit—Rev. 14:1, 4.", "norm_zh": "2第二类的得胜者是初熟的果子启十四14李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The second category of overcomers is the firstfruitRev 141 4"}
{"zh": "3\t第三类是非拉铁非的得胜者—二7~8。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "3. The third category is the Philadelphia overcomers—2:7-8.", "norm_zh": "3第三类是非拉铁非的得胜者二78李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 The third category is the Philadelphia overcomers278"}
{"zh": "4\t儆醒祈求的得胜者是第四类—路二一36。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "4. The watchful and beseeching overcomers are the fourth category—Luke 21:36.", "norm_zh": "4儆醒祈求的得胜者是第四类路二一36李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "4 The watchful and beseeching overcomers are the fourth categoryLuke 2136"}
{"zh": "5\t第五类是两个圣徒中儆醒的一个—太二四40~42。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "5.\tThe fifth category is the watchful one of the two saints—Matt. 24:40-42.", "norm_zh": "5第五类是两个圣徒中儆醒的一个太二四4042李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "5 The fifth category is the watchful one of the two saintsMatt 244042"}
{"zh": "五\t得胜者被提之后，敌基督要毁弃他与以色列所立的一七之约，并且大灾难要开始，历时三年半—四十二个月—一千二百六十天—但九24~27，太二四21：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "E.\tAfter the rapture of the overcomers, Antichrist will break his one-week covenant with Israel, and the great tribulation will begin and last for three and a half years—forty-two months—one thousand two hundred and sixty days—Dan. 9:24-27; Matt. 24:21:", "norm_zh": "五得胜者被提之后敌基督要毁弃他与以色列所立的一七之约并且大灾难要开始历时三年半四十二个月一千二百六十天但九2427太二四21李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E After the rapture of the overcomers Antichrist will break his oneweek covenant with Israel and the great tribulation will begin and last for three and a half yearsfortytwo monthsone thousand two hundred and sixty daysDan 92427 Matt 2421"}
{"zh": "1\t第一，撒但要从天上被摔在地上，就大大发怒，使地和海有祸了，并要逼迫仍存留在地上神的子民，且要与守神诫命的犹太人和持守耶稣见证的信徒争战—启十二7、12。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "1.\tFirst, Satan will be cast from heaven to the earth to cause, with great rage, woes to the earth and the sea and to persecute God's people, those who still remain on the earth, and he will war with the Jews, who keep the commandments of God, and the believers, who have the testimony of Jesus—Rev. 12:7, 12.", "norm_zh": "1第一撒但要从天上被摔在地上就大大发怒使地和海有祸了并要逼迫仍存留在地上神的子民且要与守神诫命的犹太人和持守耶稣见证的信徒争战启十二712李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 First Satan will be cast from heaven to the earth to cause with great rage woes to the earth and the sea and to persecute Gods people those who still remain on the earth and he will war with the Jews who keep the commandments of God and the believers who have the testimony of JesusRev 127 12"}
{"zh": "2\t第二，从无底坑土来的敌基督，要高抬自己超过一切称为神，或受人敬拜者，坐在神的殿里，展示自己，说他就是神—十七8，帖后二4，但九27下，太二四15。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "2.\tSecond, Antichrist, who will come out of the abyss, will exalt himself above all that is called God or an object of worship, sitting in the temple of God, setting himself forth, saying that he is God—17:8; 2 Thes. 2:4; Dan. 9:27b; Matt. 24:15.", "norm_zh": "2第二从无底坑土来的敌基督要高抬自己超过一切称为神或受人敬拜者坐在神的殿里展示自己说他就是神十七8帖后二4但九27下太二四15李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Second Antichrist who will come out of the abyss will exalt himself above all that is called God or an object of worship sitting in the temple of God setting himself forth saying that he is God178 2 Thes 24 Dan 927b Matt 2415"}
{"zh": "3\t第三，所有住在地上的，都要拜撒但（那龙），又拜敌基督（那兽）和他的像；那些不拜他和他像的，都要被杀害—启十三3~4、8、15。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "3.\tThird, all those dwelling on the earth will worship Satan (the dragon) and worship Antichrist (the beast) and his image; those who would not worship him and his image will be slain—Rev. 13:3-4, 8, 15.", "norm_zh": "3第三所有住在地上的都要拜撒但哪龙又拜敌基督哪兽和他的像哪些不拜他和他像的都要被杀害启十三34815李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 Third all those dwelling on the earth will worship Satan the dragon and worship Antichrist the beast and his image those who would not worship him and his image will be slainRev 1334 8 15"}
{"zh": "4\t第四，敌基督要与圣徒争战，并胜过他们，又要随意而行四十二个月—7节，但七21。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "4.\tFourth, Antichrist will war with the saints, overcome them, and act as he wills for forty-two months—v. 7; Dan. 7:21.", "norm_zh": "4第四敌基督要与圣徒争战并胜过他们又要随意而行四十二个月7节但七21李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "4 Fourth Antichrist will war with the saints overcome them and act as he wills for fortytwo monthsv 7 Dan 721"}
{"zh": "5\t第五，假申言者（另一兽）要行大奇事迷惑人，叫人给敌基督作个像，并拜那像—启十三11~15，十六13，十九20。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "5.\tFifth, the false prophet (another beast) will do great signs to deceive people to make an image for Antichrist and worship it—Rev. 13:11-15; 16:13; 19:20.", "norm_zh": "5第五假申言者另一兽要行大奇事迷惑人叫人给敌基督作个像并拜哪像启十三1115十六13十九20李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "5 Fifth the false prophet another beast will do great signs to deceive people to make an image for Antichrist and worship itRev 131115 1613 1920"}
{"zh": "6\t第六，除了属撒但的三一—撒但、敌基督、和假申言者所造成的一切破坏之外，神要在怒中用超自然的灾难、杀戮、毒疮、黑暗，就是第六印、头六号和第七号之七碗中的灾祸，向地上的人施行审判—六12~17，路二一11。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "6.\tSixth, in addition to all the devastations caused by the satanic trinity—Satan, Antichrist, and the false prophet—God will mete out His judgment in His wrath to men on the earth with supernatural calamities, killings, a malignant sore, and darkness, as woes in the sixth seal, the first six trumpets, and the seven bowls of the seventh trumpet—6:12-17; Luke 21:11.", "norm_zh": "6第六除了属撒但的三一撒但敌基督和假申言者所造成的一切破坏之外神要在怒中用超自然的灾难杀戮毒疮黑暗就是第六印头六号和第七号之七碗中的灾祸向地上的人施行审判六1217路二一11李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "6 Sixth in addition to all the devastations caused by the satanic trinitySatan Antichrist and the false prophetGod will mete out His judgment in His wrath to men on the earth with supernatural calamities killings a malignant sore and darkness as woes in the sixth seal the first six trumpets and the seven bowls of the seventh trumpet61217 Luke 2111"}
{"zh": "六\t第六印是天地震动—启六12~17，太二四21：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "F.\tThe sixth seal is the shaking of the earth and heaven—Rev. 6:12-17; Matt. 24:21:", "norm_zh": "六第六印是天地震动启六1217太二四21李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "F The sixth seal is the shaking of the earth and heavenRev 61217 Matt 2421"}
{"zh": "1\t这是超自然灾难的起头，破坏居人之地，以及天与天象，就是神开始答应第五印中殉道者的呼喊—路二一11，启六9~11。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "1.\tIt is the beginning of the supernatural calamities to damage the inhabitable earth and heaven with its hosts, as the beginning of God's answer to the martyrs' cry in the fifth seal—Luke 21:11; Rev. 6:9-11.", "norm_zh": "1这是超自然灾难的起头破坏居人之地以及天与天象就是神开始答应第五印中殉道者的呼喊路二一11启六911李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 It is the beginning of the supernatural calamities to damage the inhabitable earth and heaven with its hosts as the beginning of Gods answer to the martyrs cry in the fifth sealLuke 2111 Rev 6911"}
{"zh": "2\t第六印也是三年半大灾难，就是那将要临到整个居人之地试炼之时候的引进；这也是对住在地上之人的警告—太二四21，但十二7，启三10，六15~17，十一2，十三5。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "2. The sixth seal is also the initiation of the great tribulation of three and a half years, the hour of trial to come on the whole inhabited earth; it is also a warning to the inhabitants on the earth—Matt. 24:21; Dan. 12:7; Rev. 3:10; 6:15-17; 11:2; 13:5.", "norm_zh": "2第六印也是三年半大灾难就是哪将要临到整个居人之地试炼之时候的引进这也是对住在地上之人的警告太二四21但十二7启三10六1517十一2十三5李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The sixth seal is also the initiation of the great tribulation of three and a half years the hour of trial to come on the whole inhabited earth it is also a warning to the inhabitants on the earthMatt 2421 Dan 127 Rev 310 61517 112 135"}
{"zh": "七\t第六印之后，第七印就来了；第七印带进了七号—八1~2、6。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "G. After the sixth seal comes the seventh seal, which is the ushering in of the seven trumpets—8:1-2, 6.", "norm_zh": "七第六印之后第七印就来了第七印带进了七号八126李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "G After the sixth seal comes the seventh seal which is the ushering in of the seven trumpets812 6"}
{"zh": "叁\t七号是第七印的内容—6节，十一14~18：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "III. The seven trumpets are the contents of the seventh seal—v. 6; 11:14-18:", "norm_zh": "叁七号是第七印的内容6节十一1418李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III The seven trumpets are the contents of the seventh sealv 6 111418"}
{"zh": "一\t头四号将是加强的超自然灾难，破坏一切为着人生活之自然供备的源头—八7~8、10、12。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "A. The first four trumpets will be the intensified supernatural calamities to damage all the sources of natural provisions for men's living—8:7-8, 10, 12.", "norm_zh": "一头四号将是加强的超自然灾难破坏一切为着人生活之自然供备的源头八781012李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The first four trumpets will be the intensified supernatural calamities to damage all the sources of natural provisions for mens living878 10 12"}
{"zh": "二\t第五号，就是第一样灾祸，是神对人的审判，借着撒但与敌基督合作而使人受痛苦；在吹第五号之后，撒但如同星从天落到地上，将蝗虫从无底坑里释放出来，用好像蝎子的刺伤人，叫人受痛苦五个月—九1~5、7~10。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "B. The fifth trumpet, which is the first woe, is God's judgment on men to torment men by Satan collaborating with Antichrist; after the sounding of the fifth trumpet, Satan as a star will fall out of heaven to the earth to release \"locusts\" from the abyss (the bottomless pit) to torment men by stinging as scorpions for five months—9:1-5, 7-10.", "norm_zh": "二第五号就是第一样灾祸是神对人的审判借着撒但与敌基督合作而使人受痛苦在吹第五号之后撒但如同星从天落到地上将蝗虫从无底坑里释放出来用好像蝎子的刺伤人叫人受痛苦五个月九15710李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The fifth trumpet which is the first woe is Gods judgment on men to torment men by Satan collaborating with Antichrist after the sounding of the fifth trumpet Satan as a star will fall out of heaven to the earth to release locusts from the abyss the bottomless pit to torment men by stinging as scorpions for five months915 710"}
{"zh": "三\t第六号，就是第二样灾祸，是神对人进一步的审判，借着二万万马军，杀了人类的三分之一—12~21节，参十六12。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "C. The sixth trumpet, which is the second woe, is God's further judgment on men by two hundred million cavalry troops killing the third part of men—vv. 12-21; cf. 16:12.", "norm_zh": "三第六号就是第二样灾祸是神对人进一步的审判借着二万万马军杀了人类的三分之一1221节参十六12李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The sixth trumpet which is the second woe is Gods further judgment on men by two hundred million cavalry troops killing the third part of menvv 1221 cf 1612"}
{"zh": "四\t在第六号以后，第七号之前，另外有一段关于圣徒被提与基督再来的插入；基督是在诸天之上与被提到宝座的得胜者在一起—十1，创九8~17。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "D. After the sixth trumpet and before the seventh trumpet is another insertion related to the rapture of the saints and the second coming of Christ; Christ is in the heavens with the overcomers raptured to the throne—10:1; Gen. 9:8-17.", "norm_zh": "四在第六号以后第七号之前另外有一段关于圣徒被提与基督再来的插入基督是在诸天之上与被提到宝座的得胜者在一起十1创九817李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D After the sixth trumpet and before the seventh trumpet is another insertion related to the rapture of the saints and the second coming of Christ Christ is in the heavens with the overcomers raptured to the throne101 Gen 9817"}
{"zh": "五\t在第七号的日子，乃是神奥秘的完成—启十7，十一14~18：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "E. In the days of the seventh trumpet will be the finishing of the mystery of God—Rev. 10:7; 11:14-18:", "norm_zh": "五在第七号的日子乃是神奥秘的完成启十7十一1418李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E In the days of the seventh trumpet will be the finishing of the mystery of GodRev 107 111418"}
{"zh": "1\t在第七号吹响时，就有神和基督永远的国；那时，世上的国要成为神和基督的国，祂要作王，直到永永远远—15节，但二44。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "1. At the trumpeting of the seventh trumpet will be the eternal kingdom of God and of Christ; it will be at that time that the kingdom of the world will become the kingdom of God and of Christ, and He shall reign forever and ever—v. 15; Dan. 2:44.", "norm_zh": "1在第七号吹响时就有神和基督永远的国哪时世上的国要成为神和基督的国祂要作王直到永永远远15节但二44李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 At the trumpeting of the seventh trumpet will be the eternal kingdom of God and of Christ it will be at that time that the kingdom of the world will become the kingdom of God and of Christ and He shall reign forever and everv 15 Dan 244"}
{"zh": "2\t第七号的吹响也包含对死人的审判—启十一18，二十6，约五29。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "2. The trumpeting of the seventh trumpet also comprises the judgment of the dead—Rev. 11:18; 20:6; John 5:29.", "norm_zh": "2第七号的吹响也包含对死人的审判启十一18二十6约五29李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The trumpeting of the seventh trumpet also comprises the judgment of the deadRev 1118 206 John 529"}
{"zh": "六\t这就带我们到大体圣徒被提，以及两个见证人被提的插入—太十三30，启十一3~12：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "F. This brings us to the insertions of the rapture of the majority of the saints and the rapture of the two witnesses.—Matt. 13:30; Rev. 11:3-12:", "norm_zh": "六这就带我们到大体圣徒被提以及两个见证人被提的插入太十三30启十一312李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "F This brings us to the insertions of the rapture of the majority of the saints and the rapture of the two witnessesMatt 1330 Rev 11312"}
{"zh": "1\t大体圣徒要被提到云里，到空中主的仓里，就是基督的巴路西亚（同在）那时所在之处—太十三30，帖前四17：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "1. The majority of the saints will be raptured to the Lord's barn in the air within the clouds, where Christ's parousia (presence) will then be.—Matt. 13:30; 1 Thess. 4:17:", "norm_zh": "1大体圣徒要被提到云里到空中主的仓里就是基督的巴路西亚同在哪时所在之处太十三30帖前四17李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The majority of the saints will be raptured to the Lords barn in the air within the clouds where Christs parousia presence will then beMatt 1330 1 Thess 417"}
{"zh": "a\t大体圣徒不是被提到宇宙的顶点，到三层天里的锡安山上，乃是被提到空中—太十三30。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "a. The majority of the saints will be raptured not to the peak of the universe, to Zion in the third heavens, but to the air.—Matt. 13:30.", "norm_zh": "a大体圣徒不是被提到宇宙的顶点到三层天里的锡安山上乃是被提到空中太十三30李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "a The majority of the saints will be raptured not to the peak of the universe to Zion in the third heavens but to the airMatt 1330"}
{"zh": "b\t敌基督显出后，在末次号筒，就是在第七号之时，在大灾难末了，这世代的终结时，大体的圣徒（如同庄稼）要被提—39节，帖后二1、3下~4，启十四9~12。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "b. The rapture of the majority of the saints as the harvest will be at the consummation of this age, after the manifestation of Antichrist, at the end of the great tribulation, at the last trumpet, that is, the seventh trumpet.—v. 39; 2 Thess. 2:1, 3b-4; Rev. 14:9-12.", "norm_zh": "b敌基督显出后在末次号筒就是在第七号之时在大灾难末了这世代的终结时大体的圣徒如同庄稼要被提39节帖后二13下4启十四912李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "b The rapture of the majority of the saints as the harvest will be at the consummation of this age after the manifestation of Antichrist at the end of the great tribulation at the last trumpet that is the seventh trumpetv 39 2 Thess 21 3b4 Rev 14912"}
{"zh": "c\t这个被提包括复活的圣徒，他们要在“眨眼之间”复活，也包括还存留的圣徒—太二五1~12，启十五2，十六15，二十4~6，帖前四16，林前十五51~52。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "c. This rapture will comprise the resurrected saints who will be resurrected \"in the twinkling of an eye\", and also the remaining saints.—Matt. 25:1-12; Rev. 15:2; 16:15; 20:4-6; 1 Thess. 4:16; 1 Cor. 15:51-52.", "norm_zh": "c这个被提包括复活的圣徒他们要在眨眼之间复活也包括还存留的圣徒太二五112启十五2十六15二十46帖前四16林前十五5152李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "c This rapture will comprise the resurrected saints who will be resurrected in the twinkling of an eye and also the remaining saintsMatt 25112 Rev 152 1615 2046 1 Thess 416 1 Cor 155152"}
{"zh": "d\t大体还存留的圣徒，要在得胜者被提后留下来，经过三年半的大灾难，他们要在旷野神为他们所预备的地方蒙保守三年半—启十二6、14。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "d. The majority of the remaining saints, who will be left after the rapture of the overcomers to pass through the three and a half years of the great tribulation, will be preserved in a place prepared by God for them in the wilderness for those three and a half years.—Rev. 12:6, 14.", "norm_zh": "d大体还存留的圣徒要在得胜者被提后留下来经过三年半的大灾难他们要在旷野神为他们所预备的地方蒙保守三年半启十二614李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "d The majority of the remaining saints who will be left after the rapture of the overcomers to pass through the three and a half years of the great tribulation will be preserved in a place prepared by God for them in the wilderness for those three and a half yearsRev 126 14"}
{"zh": "e\t凡在大灾难期间在基督里得救，并持守耶稣见证的人，都包括在还存留的圣徒之中，主在启示录十六章十五节提醒他们祂要再来—17节。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "e. Those who will be saved in Christ and have the testimony of Jesus during the great tribulation will all be included among the remaining saints, whom the Lord will remind of His coming in Revelation 16:15.—v. 17.", "norm_zh": "e凡在大灾难期间在基督里得救并持守耶稣见证的人都包括在还存留的圣徒之中主在启示录十六章十五节提醒他们祂要再来17节李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "e Those who will be saved in Christ and have the testimony of Jesus during the great tribulation will all be included among the remaining saints whom the Lord will remind of His coming in Revelation 1615v 17"}
{"zh": "2\t两个见证人—摩西和以利亚的被提—十一3~12：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "2. The rapture of the two witnesses—Moses and Elijah—Rev. 11:3-12:", "norm_zh": "2两个见证人摩西和以利亚的被提十一312李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The rapture of the two witnessesMoses and ElijahRev 11312"}
{"zh": "a\t摩西代表律法，以利亚代表申言者，二人都为神作见证—路十六16。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "a. Moses, representing the law, and Elijah, representing the prophets, both testify for God.—Luke 16:16.", "norm_zh": "a摩西代表律法以利亚代表申言者二人都为神作见证路十六16李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "a Moses representing the law and Elijah representing the prophets both testify for GodLuke 1616"}
{"zh": "b\t他们作完见证时，敌基督必与他们争战，把他们杀了—启十一7。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "b. When they will have completed their testimony, Antichrist will war with them and kill them.—Rev. 11:7.", "norm_zh": "b他们作完见证时敌基督必与他们争战把他们杀了启十一7李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "b When they will have completed their testimony Antichrist will war with them and kill themRev 117"}
{"zh": "c\t过了这三天半，在他们尽职一千二百六十天的最后一天，也就是在大灾难的最后一天，他们要复活，在云中被提—11~12节。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "c. After the three and a half days, they will resurrect and be raptured in the cloud on the last day of their ministry of one thousand two hundred and sixty days, that is, on the last day of the great tribulation—vv. 11-12.", "norm_zh": "c过了这三天半在他们尽职一千二百六十天的最后一天也就是在大灾难的最后一天他们要复活在云中被提1112节李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "c After the three and a half days they will resurrect and be raptured in the cloud on the last day of their ministry of one thousand two hundred and sixty days that is on the last day of the great tribulationvv 1112"}
{"zh": "肆\t七碗乃是第三样灾祸，是大灾难的末后灾害—14、18节上，十五5~8：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "IV. The seven bowls will be the third woe, the last plagues of the great tribulation—vv. 14, 18a; 15:5-8:", "norm_zh": "肆七碗乃是第三样灾祸是大灾难的末后灾害1418节上十五58李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "IV The seven bowls will be the third woe the last plagues of the great tribulationvv 14 18a 1558"}
{"zh": "一\t头四碗是终极的超自然灾害，彻底的毁坏人在宇宙中的住处—十六2~4、8。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "A. The first four bowls are the consummating supernatural calamities to utterly damage men's habitation in the universe—16:2-4, 8.", "norm_zh": "一头四碗是终极的超自然灾害彻底的毁坏人在宇宙中的住处十六248李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The first four bowls are the consummating supernatural calamities to utterly damage mens habitation in the universe1624 8"}
{"zh": "二\t第五碗是神对敌基督之国的终极审判，要施行于敌基督的座位上，便他的国变为黑暗，属他的人由于疼痛，就咬自己的舌头，又由于所生的疮就亵渎神—10~11节。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "B. The fifth bowl will be God's ultimate judgment on the kingdom of Antichrist executed on his throne, causing his kingdom to become darkened and his people to gnaw their tongues for pain and blaspheme God for their sores—vv. 10-11.", "norm_zh": "二第五碗是神对敌基督之国的终极审判要施行于敌基督的座位上便他的国变为黑暗属他的人由于疼痛就咬自己的舌头又由于所生的疮就亵渎神1011节李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The fifth bowl will be Gods ultimate judgment on the kingdom of Antichrist executed on his throne causing his kingdom to become darkened and his people to gnaw their tongues for pain and blaspheme God for their soresvv 1011"}
{"zh": "三\t第六碗是对伯拉大河的破坏，使河水干了，要给那来自日出之地的众王预备道路，在哈米吉顿争战—12、16节。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "C. The sixth bowl will be the damage on the great river Euphrates, causing it to dry up for the preparation of the way for the kings from the rising of the sun for the war at Armageddon—vv. 12, 16.", "norm_zh": "三第六碗是对伯拉大河的破坏使河水干了要给哪来自日出之地的众王预备道路在哈米吉顿争战1216节李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The sixth bowl will be the damage on the great river Euphrates causing it to dry up for the preparation of the way for the kings from the rising of the sun for the war at Armageddonvv 12 16"}
{"zh": "三\t在第六碗和第七碗之间，插入哈米吉顿战争的预备—13、15、16节。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "C. Between the sixth and seventh bowls is the insertion of the preparation for the war at Armageddon—vv. 13, 15, 16.", "norm_zh": "三在第六碗和第七碗之间插入哈米吉顿战争的预备131516节李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Between the sixth and seventh bowls is the insertion of the preparation for the war at Armageddonvv 13 15 16"}
{"zh": "四\t第七碗将是大灾难结束的灾害：有最大的地震和大雹子；那地震是全宇宙最后一次的地震，也是最大的一次—17~21节。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "D. The seventh bowl will be the concluding plague of the great tribulation: the greatest earthquake and the great hail; that earthquake will be the last earthquake in the whole universe and the biggest one—vv. 17-21.", "norm_zh": "四第七碗将是大灾难结束的灾害有最大的地震和大雹子哪地震是全宇宙最后一次的地震也是最大的一次1721节李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D The seventh bowl will be the concluding plague of the great tribulation the greatest earthquake and the great hail that earthquake will be the last earthquake in the whole universe and the biggest onevv 1721"}
{"zh": "五\t在七碗之后，得胜者经过基督审判台的审判，要得着赏赐—林后五10，启十一18下。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "E. After the seven bowls is the giving of the reward to the overcomers, judged at the judgment seat of Christ—2 Cor. 5:10; Rev. 11:18b.", "norm_zh": "五在七碗之后得胜者经过基督审判台的审判要得着赏赐林后五10启十一18下李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E After the seven bowls is the giving of the reward to the overcomers judged at the judgment seat of Christ2 Cor 510 Rev 1118b"}
{"zh": "六\t在审判台、施行赏赐、以及基督与得胜者的婚娶之后，基督要与祂的新妇从空中来到地上，在哈米吉顿的战争中与敌基督争战，并击败他—太二四27~28，启十六14、16：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "F. After the judgment seat, the giving of the reward, and the marriage of Christ and His overcomers, He will come with His bride from the air to the earth to fight against and defeat Antichrist at the war of Armageddon—Matt. 24:27-28; Rev. 16:14, 16:", "norm_zh": "六在审判台施行赏赐以及基督与得胜者的婚娶之后基督要与祂的新妇从空中来到地上在哈米吉顿的战争中与敌基督争战并击败他太二四2728启十六1416李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "F After the judgment seat the giving of the reward and the marriage of Christ and His overcomers He will come with His bride from the air to the earth to fight against and defeat Antichrist at the war of ArmageddonMatt 242728 Rev 1614 16"}
{"zh": "1\t在哈米吉顿，基督要在那些在地上作恶的人身上，踹神烈怒的大酒醡—十四19~20。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "1. At Armageddon Christ will tread the great winepress of the fury of God on the evildoers of the earth—14:19-20.", "norm_zh": "1在哈米吉顿基督要在哪些在地上作恶的人身上踹神烈怒的大酒醡十四1920李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 At Armageddon Christ will tread the great winepress of the fury of God on the evildoers of the earth141920"}
{"zh": "2\t基督和祂的新妇—得胜者—要与敌基督、十王、并他们的众军争战，且要在一个小时之内胜过他们，败坏那些败坏地者—十一18下，十七12~14。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "2. Christ with His bride—the overcomers—will fight Antichrist, the ten kings, and their armies and overcome them within one hour to destroy the destroyers of the earth—Rev. 11:18b; 17:12-14.", "norm_zh": "2基督和祂的新妇得胜者要与敌基督十王并他们的众军争战且要在一个小时之内胜过他们败坏哪些败坏地者十一18下十七1214李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Christ with His bridethe overcomerswill fight Antichrist the ten kings and their armies and overcome them within one hour to destroy the destroyers of the earthRev 1118b 171214"}
{"zh": "3\t基督要将敌基督和他的假申言者活活的扔在火湖里，他们所跟从的魔鬼撒但，也要被扔在其中，永远受火的痛苦—十九19~20，二十10。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "3. Christ will cast Antichrist and his false prophet alive into the lake of fire, into which the devil, Satan, whom they follow, will be cast also, to suffer the eternal torment by fire—Rev. 19:19-20; 20:10.", "norm_zh": "3基督要将敌基督和他的假申言者活活的扔在火湖里他们所跟从的魔鬼撒但也要被扔在其中永远受火的痛苦十九1920二十10李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 Christ will cast Antichrist and his false prophet alive into the lake of fire into which the devil Satan whom they follow will be cast also to suffer the eternal torment by fireRev 191920 2010"}
{"zh": "4\t那时以色列全家要向主悔改，并蒙祂拯救—亚十二10~14。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "4. At that time the whole house of Israel will repent to the Lord and be saved by Him—Zech. 12:10-14.", "norm_zh": "4哪时以色列全家要向主悔改并蒙祂拯救亚十二1014李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "4 At that time the whole house of Israel will repent to the Lord and be saved by HimZech 121014"}
{"zh": "七\t祂要毁灭宗教、奥秘的巴比伦，以及政治、物质的巴比伦—启十七~十八：（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "G. He will destroy religious, mystical Babylon and political, physical Babylon—Rev. 17—18:", "norm_zh": "七祂要毁灭宗教奥秘的巴比伦以及政治物质的巴比伦启十七十八李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "G He will destroy religious mystical Babylon and political physical BabylonRev 1718"}
{"zh": "1\t神首先要在大灾难开始时，借着敌基督毁了与以色列所立的约，并开始逼迫一切的宗教，而毁灭宗教、奥秘的巴比伦，就是背道的罗马教—但八11，九27，帖后二3~4。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "1. God first will destroy the religious and mystical Babylon, that is, the apostate Roman Church, by Antichrist at the beginning of the great tribulation when he will break the covenant with Israel and begin to persecute all religions—Dan. 8:11; 9:27; 2 Thes. 2:3-4.", "norm_zh": "1神首先要在大灾难开始时借着敌基督毁了与以色列所立的约并开始逼迫一切的宗教而毁灭宗教奥秘的巴比伦就是背道的罗马教但八11九27帖后二34李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 God first will destroy the religious and mystical Babylon that is the apostate Roman Church by Antichrist at the beginning of the great tribulation when he will break the covenant with Israel and begin to persecute all religionsDan 811 927 2 Thes 234"}
{"zh": "2\t在大灾难末了时，就是在第七碗中哈米吉顿的战争之后，神也要毁灭政治、物质的巴比伦，就是罗马城—启十六19。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "2. At the end of the great tribulation, right after the war at Armageddon in the seventh bowl, God will also destroy the political and physical Babylon, that is, the city of Rome—Rev. 16:19.", "norm_zh": "2在大灾难末了时就是在第七碗中哈米吉顿的战争之后神也要毁灭政治物质的巴比伦就是罗马城启十六19李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 At the end of the great tribulation right after the war at Armageddon in the seventh bowl God will also destroy the political and physical Babylon that is the city of RomeRev 1619"}
{"zh": "伍\t在白色大宝座前要有永远的审判，审判历代以来一切死了的不信者；在那审判之后，就有新天新地作神永远之国的范围，有新耶路撒冷为神永远之国的中心；这是第七印和第七号的终结，而第七印和第七号要持续到永远—二十11~15，二一~二二。（李常受文集一九九〇年第一册，使徒的教训，第九篇）", "en": "V. There will be the eternal judgment at the great white throne to judge all the dead unbelievers throughout all the centuries; after that judgment, there will be the new heaven and new earth as the realm of the eternal kingdom of God with the New Jerusalem as the center of the eternal kingdom of God; this is the conclusion of the seventh seal and of the seventh trumpet which will last forever—Rev. 20:11-15; 21—22.", "norm_zh": "伍在白色大宝座前要有永远的审判审判历代以来一切死了的不信者在哪审判之后就有新天新地作神永远之国的范围有新耶路撒冷为神永远之国的中心这是第七印和第七号的终结而第七印和第七号要持续到永远二十1115二一二二李常受文集一九九〇年第一册使徒的教训第九篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:48:15.672532+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "V There will be the eternal judgment at the great white throne to judge all the dead unbelievers throughout all the centuries after that judgment there will be the new heaven and new earth as the realm of the eternal kingdom of God with the New Jerusalem as the center of the eternal kingdom of God this is the conclusion of the seventh seal and of the seventh trumpet which will last foreverRev 201115 2122"}
{"zh": "读经：启十四1~5、14~16，十五2~4，十二5、7~10，十六15，帖前四15~18", "en": "Scripture Reading: Rev. 14:1-5, 14-16; 15:2-4; 12:5, 7-10; 16:15; 1 Thes. 4:15-18", "norm_zh": "读经启十四151416十五24十二5710十六15帖前四1518", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Scripture Reading Rev 1415 1416 1524 125 710 1615 1 Thes 41518"}
{"zh": "壹\t被提主要的还不是为着我们的享受，乃是为着神的享受；我们需要被提到天上，但不是为我们的快乐，乃是为完成神的定旨—启十二5、7~10，十四1、4下：", "en": "I.\tThe rapture is not mainly for our enjoyment but for God's enjoyment; we need to be raptured to heaven, not for our happiness but for the fulfillment of God's purpose.—Rev. 12:5, 7-10; 14:1, 4b:", "norm_zh": "壹被提主要的还不是为着我们的享受乃是为着神的享受我们需要被提到天上但不是为我们的快乐乃是为完成神的定旨启十二5710十四14下", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I The rapture is not mainly for our enjoyment but for Gods enjoyment we need to be raptured to heaven not for our happiness but for the fulfillment of Gods purposeRev 125 710 141 4b"}
{"zh": "2\t一部分农作物—初熟的果子—成熟在先，就先收成；其余部分的农作物—庄稼—成熟较晚，就后收成—启十四3~5，十五2~3。", "en": "2\tPart of the crop—the firstfruits—ripens earlier and is reaped earlier; the rest of the crop—the harvest—ripens later and is reaped later.—Rev. 14:3-5; 15:2-3.", "norm_zh": "2一部分农作物初熟的果子成熟在先就先收成其余部分的农作物庄稼成熟较晚就后收成启十四35十五23", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Part of the cropthe firstfruitsripens earlier and is reaped earlier the rest of the cropthe harvestripens later and is reaped laterRev 1435 1523"}
{"zh": "3\t根据启示录十四章，有两种的被提，就是初熟果子的被提和庄稼的被提—十四4下，14~15。", "en": "3\tAccording to Revelation 14 there are two kinds of rapture—the rapture of the firstfruits and the rapture of the harvest.—vv. 4b, 14-15.", "norm_zh": "3根据启示录十四章有两种的被提就是初熟果子的被提和庄稼的被提十四4下1415", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 According to Revelation 14 there are two kinds of rapturethe rapture of the firstfruits and the rapture of the harvestvv 4b 1415"}
{"zh": "一\t初熟的果子要被提到天上的锡安山，到第三层天神的居所那里，得在神与基督面前—1、4节下。", "en": "A.\tThe firstfruits will be caught up to the heavenly Mount Zion, to the place of God's dwelling in the third heaven, in order to be in the presence of God and Christ.—vv. 1, 4b.", "norm_zh": "一初熟的果子要被提到天上的锡安山到第三层天神的居所哪里得在神与基督面前14节下", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The firstfruits will be caught up to the heavenly Mount Zion to the place of Gods dwelling in the third heaven in order to be in the presence of God and Christvv 1 4b"}
{"zh": "1\t初熟的果子满足了父神和救赎主羔羊的饥饿—出二三19上，利二三10。", "en": "1\tThe firstfruits satisfy the hunger of God the Father and the Lamb, the Redeemer.—Exo. 23:19a; Lev. 23:10.", "norm_zh": "1初熟的果子满足了父神和救赎主羔羊的饥饿出二三19上利二三10", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The firstfruits satisfy the hunger of God the Father and the Lamb the RedeemerExo 2319a Lev 2310"}
{"zh": "2\t男孩子是为着争战，对付仇敌，而初熟的果子乃是为着叫神和羔羊得满足—出二三19。", "en": "2\tWhereas the man-child is for fighting to deal with the enemy, the firstfruits are for the satisfaction of God and the Lamb.—Exo. 23:19.", "norm_zh": "2男孩子是为着争战对付仇敌而初熟的果子乃是为着叫神和羔羊得满足出二三19", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Whereas the manchild is for fighting to deal with the enemy the firstfruits are for the satisfaction of God and the LambExo 2319"}
{"zh": "四\t初熟的果子额上都写着羔羊和祂父的名，这表明他们与羔羊和父是一，属于羔羊和父—启十四1下，4~5。", "en": "D.\tThe firstfruits have the name of the Lamb and of His Father written on their foreheads; this is the designation of their being one with the Lamb and with the Father and of their belonging to Them.—Rev. 14:1b, 4-5.", "norm_zh": "四初熟的果子额上都写着羔羊和祂父的名这表明他们与羔羊和父是一属于羔羊和父启十四1下45", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D The firstfruits have the name of the Lamb and of His Father written on their foreheads this is the designation of their being one with the Lamb and with the Father and of their belonging to ThemRev 141b 45"}
{"zh": "五\t十四万四千初熟的果子，乃是那些为着完成神永远定旨的信徒—1、3~5节：", "en": "E.\tThe one hundred forty-four thousand firstfruits are believers who are for the accomplishment of God's eternal purpose.—vv. 1, 3-5:", "norm_zh": "五十四万四千初熟的果子乃是哪些为着完成神永远定旨的信徒135节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E The one hundred fortyfour thousand firstfruits are believers who are for the accomplishment of Gods eternal purposevv 1 35"}
{"zh": "1\t十二这数字表征神性与人性的调和；这调和是为着神经纶的完整—二一12。", "en": "1\tThe number twelve signifies the mingling of divinity with humanity; this mingling is for the completion of God's economy.—Rev. 21:12.", "norm_zh": "1十二这数字表征神性与人性的调和这调和是为着神经纶的完整二一12", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The number twelve signifies the mingling of divinity with humanity this mingling is for the completion of Gods economyRev 2112"}
{"zh": "2\t十二乘十二的意思是完整中的完整，这是神为完成祂经纶之行政的完整—十四1。", "en": "2\tTwelve multiplied by twelve means completion of completions, the completion in God's administration for the fulfillment of His economy.—14:1.", "norm_zh": "2十二乘十二的意思是完整中的完整这是神为完成祂经纶之行政的完整十四1", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Twelve multiplied by twelve means completion of completions the completion in Gods administration for the fulfillment of His economy141"}
{"zh": "一\t初熟的果子要在大灾难前被提到诸天之上的宝座那里，而庄稼要在大灾难的末了，就是在吹末次号筒时，被提到空中（仓房）—帖前四16~17，林前十五2，启十7，太十三30，三12。", "en": "A. Whereas the firstfruits are taken to the throne in the heavens before the great tribulation, the harvest is taken to the air (the barn) toward the end of the tribulation, that is, at the last trumpet—1 Thes. 4:16-17; 1 Cor. 15:52; Rev. 10:7; Matt. 13:30; 3:12.", "norm_zh": "一初熟的果子要在大灾难前被提到诸天之上的宝座哪里而庄稼要在大灾难的末了就是在吹末次号筒时被提到空中仓房帖前四1617林前十五2启十7太十三30三12", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Whereas the firstfruits are taken to the throne in the heavens before the great tribulation the harvest is taken to the air the barn toward the end of the tribulation that is at the last trumpet1 Thes 41617 1 Cor 1552 Rev 107 Matt 1330 312"}
{"zh": "二\t所有包括在庄稼被提里的，都必须经过大灾难—二四21，启三10：", "en": "B.\tAll those included in the rapture of the harvest must pass through the greater part of the great tribulation.—Matt. 24:21; Rev. 3:10:", "norm_zh": "二所有包括在庄稼被提里的都必须经过大灾难二四21启三10", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B All those included in the rapture of the harvest must pass through the greater part of the great tribulationMatt 2421 Rev 310"}
{"zh": "2\t大灾难在一面说，就是猛烈的阳光，要使所有在灾难前未预备好的信徒成熟—启十四15，太十三39下。", "en": "2.\tIn a sense, the great tribulation will be the strong sunshine which will ripen all the believers who were not ready before the tribulation.—Rev. 14:15; Matt. 13:39b.", "norm_zh": "2大灾难在一面说就是猛烈的阳光要使所有在灾难前未预备好的信徒成熟启十四15太十三39下", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 In a sense the great tribulation will be the strong sunshine which will ripen all the believers who were not ready before the tribulationRev 1415 Matt 1339b"}
{"zh": "三\t我们今日若不撇弃世界，向基督而活，基督要把我们留在地上，经过大灾难—十六26，林后五14~15：", "en": "C.\tIf today we do not give up the world and live to Christ, Christ will leave us on earth to pass through the great tribulation.—Matt. 16:26; 2 Cor. 5:14-15:", "norm_zh": "三我们今日若不撇弃世界向基督而活基督要把我们留在地上经过大灾难十六26林后五1415", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C If today we do not give up the world and live to Christ Christ will leave us on earth to pass through the great tribulationMatt 1626 2 Cor 51415"}
{"zh": "一\t他们虽然被敌基督所杀，在神看来，他们却是得胜的—2~4节。", "en": "A.\tAlthough they are slain by Antichrist, in the eyes of God they are victorious.—vv. 2-4.", "norm_zh": "一他们虽然被敌基督所杀在神看来他们却是得胜的24节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Although they are slain by Antichrist in the eyes of God they are victoriousvv 24"}
{"zh": "二\t晚期的得胜者唱摩西的歌和羔羊的歌—3节上，五9：", "en": "B.\tThe late overcomers sing the song of Moses and of the Lamb.—v. 3a; Rev. 5:9:", "norm_zh": "二晚期的得胜者唱摩西的歌和羔羊的歌3节上五9", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The late overcomers sing the song of Moses and of the Lambv 3a Rev 59"}
{"zh": "2\t羔羊的歌指出，神的子民在仇敌面前所经历之基督的救赎—启十五3~4。", "en": "2.\tThe song of the Lamb indicates Christ's redemption experienced by God's people in the presence of their enemy.—Rev. 15:3-4.", "norm_zh": "2羔羊的歌指出神的子民在仇敌面前所经历之基督的救赎启十五34", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The song of the Lamb indicates Christs redemption experienced by Gods people in the presence of their enemyRev 1534"}
{"zh": "三\t晚期的得胜者赞美神的作为和道路，也就是赞美祂的行动和祂的法则—3~4节。", "en": "C.\tThe late overcomers praise God for His works and His ways, that is, for His acts and His principles.—vv. 3-4.", "norm_zh": "三晚期的得胜者赞美神的作为和道路也就是赞美祂的行动和祂的法则34节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The late overcomers praise God for His works and His ways that is for His acts and His principlesvv 34"}
{"zh": "为完成神的定旨，以满足神的需要", "en": "To fulfill God's purpose to satisfy God's need", "norm_zh": "为完成神的定旨以满足神的需要", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "To fulfill Gods purpose to satisfy Gods need"}
{"zh": "许多基督徒对被提这件事，有着浅薄的观念，以为被提的目的，只是给他们一段快乐的时光，把他们带到一个快乐的地方。被提不只是为着我们，更是为着神的经纶和神的战略。神的仇敌如今还在天上。虽然他已受了审判，判决也宣告了，但在已过的十九个世纪里，神还没有得着一班人，可以在仇敌身上执行祂的判决。神的仇敌撒但，已经被主耶稣在十字架上审判了。（约十二31，十六11。）接着，需要得胜的信徒完成这审判，执行这判决。得胜的信徒和撒但争战，实际上就是执行主对撒但的审判。至终，借着他们的争战，撒但要从天上被摔下去。（启十二9。）谁能到天上去执行神的审判，命令那已被定罪、审判、判决的仇敌离开天上？天使作不到，他们不够资格。因为他们是天使，撒但以前也在他们中间，与他们有同等地位，所以他们没有地位作这事。神需要一个人来完成这工作，人子耶稣就是这人的头。祂是男孩子的头，也是所有得胜者的先锋。神需要这样的人来执行祂对撒但的判决。神为着这个人等待好久了，虽然至今还未得着，但总有一天祂会得着。", "en": "Many Christians have a poor concept of the rapture, thinking that rapture is merely for the purpose of giving them a happy time, of taking them to a pleasant place. The rapture is not only for us; it is for God's economy and for God's strategy. God's enemy is still in the heavens. This enemy has been judged and his sentence has been pronounced, but during the past nineteen centuries God has not had those who could execute His sentence upon the enemy. Satan, the enemy of God, was judged by the Lord Jesus on the cross (John 12:31; 16:11). Following that, there is the need of the overcoming believers to carry out that judgment, to execute that sentence. The fighting waged by the overcoming believers against Satan is actually the execution of the Lord's judgment upon him. Eventually, through their fighting, he will be cast out of heaven (Rev. 12:9). Who will go to heaven to execute God's judgment and command the condemned, judged, and sentenced enemy to depart? The angels will not do this, for they are not qualified. The angels lack the position to do this because, being angels, they are on the same level as Satan who formerly was among them. God needs a man to accomplish this. This man has a Head—the man Jesus. He is the Head of the man-child, the Pioneer of all the overcomers. God needs such a man to execute His sentence upon Satan. God has been waiting a long time for this man. Although God does not have him yet, one day He will have him.", "norm_zh": "许多基督徒对被提这件事有着浅薄的观念以为被提的目的只是给他们一段快乐的时光把他们带到一个快乐的地方被提不只是为着我们更是为着神的经纶和神的战略神的仇敌如今还在天上虽然他已受了审判判决也宣告了但在已过的十九个世纪里神还没有得着一班人可以在仇敌身上执行祂的判决神的仇敌撒但已经被主耶稣在十字架上审判了约十二31十六11接着需要得胜的信徒完成这审判执行这判决得胜的信徒和撒但争战实际上就是执行主对撒但的审判至终借着他们的争战撒但要从天上被摔下去启十二9谁能到天上去执行神的审判命令哪已被定罪审判判决的仇敌离开天上天使作不到他们不够资格因为他们是天使撒但以前也在他们中间与他们有同等地位所以他们没有地位作这事神需要一个人来完成这工作人子耶稣就是这人的头祂是男孩子的头也是所有得胜者的先锋神需要这样的人来执行祂对撒但的判决神为着这个人等待好久了虽然至今还未得着但总有一天祂会得着", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Many Christians have a poor concept of the rapture thinking that rapture is merely for the purpose of giving them a happy time of taking them to a pleasant place The rapture is not only for us it is for Gods economy and for Gods strategy Gods enemy is still in the heavens This enemy has been judged and his sentence has been pronounced but during the past nineteen centuries God has not had those who could execute His sentence upon the enemy Satan the enemy of God was judged by the Lord Jesus on the cross John 1231 1611 Following that there is the need of the overcoming believers to carry out that judgment to execute that sentence The fighting waged by the overcoming believers against Satan is actually the execution of the Lords judgment upon him Eventually through their fighting he will be cast out of heaven Rev 129 Who will go to heaven to execute Gods judgment and command the condemned judged and sentenced enemy to depart The angels will not do this for they are not qualified The angels lack the position to do this because being angels they are on the same level as Satan who formerly was among them God needs a man to accomplish this This man has a Headthe man Jesus He is the Head of the manchild the Pioneer of all the overcomers God needs such a man to execute His sentence upon Satan God has been waiting a long time for this man Although God does not have him yet one day He will have him"}
{"zh": "得胜者的被提和大体信徒的被提", "en": "The rapture of the overcomers and the rapture of the majority of the believers", "norm_zh": "得胜者的被提和大体信徒的被提", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The rapture of the overcomers and the rapture of the majority of the believers"}
{"zh": "启示录十四章十五节和十六节说，“又有一位天使从殿中出来，向那坐在云上的大声喊着说，伸出你的镰刀来收割，因为收割的时候到了，地上的庄稼已经熟了。那坐在云上的，把镰刀扔在地上，地上的庄稼就被收割了”。……农作物的收割是在于农作物的成熟。那些成熟较早的，就是初熟的果子；大部分成熟较晚的，便是庄稼。主耶稣在马太十三章三十九节指出，庄稼要在这世代的终结时被收割。……到这世代的终结，神的田地就要收割了。在这收割的时刻来到之前，初熟的果子要先成熟而被提。", "en": "Revelation 14:15 and 16 say, \"And another angel came out of the temple, crying with a loud voice to Him who sat on the cloud, Send forth Your sickle and reap, for the hour to reap has come because the harvest of the earth is ripe. And He who sat on the cloud thrust His sickle upon the earth, and the earth was reaped.\" ... The reaping of the crops depends on the maturity of the crops. Those that ripen earlier are the firstfruits; the majority that ripen later are the harvest. The Lord Jesus pointed out in Matthew 13:39 that the harvest will be reaped at the consummation of the age. ... At the consummation of this age, God's field will be reaped. Before this hour of reaping comes, the firstfruits will mature first and be raptured.", "norm_zh": "启示录十四章十五节和十六节说又有一位天使从殿中出来向哪坐在云上的大声喊着说伸出你的镰刀来收割因为收割的时候到了地上的庄稼已经熟了哪坐在云上的把镰刀扔在地上地上的庄稼就被收割了农作物的收割是在于农作物的成熟哪些成熟较早的就是初熟的果子大部分成熟较晚的便是庄稼主耶稣在马太十三章三十九节指出庄稼要在这世代的终结时被收割到这世代的终结神的田地就要收割了在这收割的时刻来到之前初熟的果子要先成熟而被提", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Revelation 1415 and 16 say And another angel came out of the temple crying with a loud voice to Him who sat on the cloud Send forth Your sickle and reap for the hour to reap has come because the harvest of the earth is ripe And He who sat on the cloud thrust His sickle upon the earth and the earth was reaped The reaping of the crops depends on the maturity of the crops Those that ripen earlier are the firstfruits the majority that ripen later are the harvest The Lord Jesus pointed out in Matthew 1339 that the harvest will be reaped at the consummation of the age At the consummation of this age Gods field will be reaped Before this hour of reaping comes the firstfruits will mature first and be raptured"}
{"zh": "初熟果子的被提和庄稼的被提", "en": "The rapture of the firstfruits and the rapture of the harvest", "norm_zh": "初熟果子的被提和庄稼的被提", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The rapture of the firstfruits and the rapture of the harvest"}
{"zh": "作初熟的果子归与神和羔羊", "en": "As firstfruits to God and to the Lamb", "norm_zh": "作初熟的果子归与神和羔羊", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "As firstfruits to God and to the Lamb"}
{"zh": "要给神这个享受，就必须成熟", "en": "For us to give God this enjoyment, we need to be matured.", "norm_zh": "要给神这个享受就必须成熟", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "For us to give God this enjoyment we need to be matured"}
{"zh": "收割者基督坐着白云回来所收割", "en": "To be reaped by Christ as the Reaper at His coming back sitting on a white cloud", "norm_zh": "收割者基督坐着白云回来所收割", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "To be reaped by Christ as the Reaper at His coming back sitting on a white cloud"}
{"zh": "为什么要将庄稼留下来经过大灾难？因为青嫩、末熟的庄稼，需要猛烈的阳光照晒，才会成熟。大灾难在一方面说，就像猛烈的日头，要使所有在灾难前未预备好的圣徒成熟。简单的说，你今日若不撇弃世界，为基督而活，基督要把你留在地上，经过大灾难。到了那个时候，你必然会放下世界，而且认识到最好的生活，就是为基督而活。所有神的儿女都当这样，否则永远不能成熟。你若不信，等着瞧好了。可能你认为世界太可爱，放下世界太可惜了，那么主就会说，“既然你这么爱世界，我且把你留下，让你看看世界是否真的那么可爱！”然后，主要震动世界。最后你要说，“主阿，我悔改！”然而，到那个时候悔改，可能迟了一点。不要等大灾难来到了才悔改，现在就悔改！每一个真基督徒迟早都要悔改。我有把握说，有一天每一个得救的人都要看见，世界不但不可爱，更是有毒；你越爱世界，就越要中毒。世界是与神为仇的，我们都必须摒弃它。主迟早要使你知道，祂是何等恨恶这个世界。那一天要来到，我们都要成熟。你不要说，“我不在乎成熟不成熟，只要我得救了，一切就都没有问题！”你今天可以硬着心硬着颈项和我争辩，但那一天来到，你就知道你需要成熟。我劝你不要等到收割的日子。靠着祂的恩，今日就进前来，作初熟果子的一部分。（启示录生命读经，第三篇）", "en": "Why will the harvest be left to pass through the great tribulation? Because green, unripened fields need strong sunshine to ripen. In a sense, the great tribulation will be the strong sunshine which will ripen all the saints who were not ready before the tribulation. Simply speaking, if you do not abandon the world and live for Christ today, Christ will leave you on the earth to pass through the great tribulation. At that time, you will surely put down the world and realize that the best life is to live for Christ. All of God's children must be like this, otherwise they will never mature. If you do not believe it, just wait and see. Perhaps you think the world is too lovely and it is too a pity to put down the world; then the Lord will say, \"Since you love the world so much, I will leave you here to let you see if the world is really that lovely!\" Then, the Lord will shake the world. Finally you will say, \"Lord, I repent!\" However, to repent at that time may be a little too late. Do not wait until the great tribulation comes to repent; repent now! Every real Christian will repent sooner or later. I am confident to say that one day every saved person will see that the world is not only unlovely but also poisonous; the more you love the world, the more you will be poisoned. The world is at enmity with God, and we must all abandon it. Sooner or later the Lord will let you know how much He hates this world. That day will come, and we all must mature. Do not say, \"I do not care whether I mature or not; as long as I am saved, everything is fine!\" Today you can harden your heart and stiffen your neck to argue with me, but when that day comes, you will know that you need to mature. I advise you not to wait until the day of harvest. By His grace, come forward today to be a part of the firstfruits.", "norm_zh": "为什么要将庄稼留下来经过大灾难因为青嫩末熟的庄稼需要猛烈的阳光照晒才会成熟大灾难在一方面说就像猛烈的日头要使所有在灾难前未预备好的圣徒成熟简单的说你今日若不撇弃世界为基督而活基督要把你留在地上经过大灾难到了哪个时候你必然会放下世界而且认识到最好的生活就是为基督而活所有神的儿女都当这样否则永远不能成熟你若不信等着瞧好了可能你认为世界太可爱放下世界太可惜了哪么主就会说既然你这么爱世界我且把你留下让你看看世界是否真的哪么可爱然后主要震动世界最后你要说主阿我悔改然而到哪个时候悔改可能迟了一点不要等大灾难来到了才悔改现在就悔改每一个真基督徒迟早都要悔改我有把握说有一天每一个得救的人都要看见世界不但不可爱更是有毒你越爱世界就越要中毒世界是与神为仇的我们都必须摒弃它主迟早要使你知道祂是何等恨恶这个世界哪一天要来到我们都要成熟你不要说我不在乎成熟不成熟只要我得救了一切就都没有问提你今天可以硬着心硬着颈项和我争辩但哪一天来到你就知道你需要成熟我劝你不要等到收割的日子靠着祂的恩今日就进前来作初熟果子的一部分启示录生命读经第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Why will the harvest be left to pass through the great tribulation Because green unripened fields need strong sunshine to ripen In a sense the great tribulation will be the strong sunshine which will ripen all the saints who were not ready before the tribulation Simply speaking if you do not abandon the world and live for Christ today Christ will leave you on the earth to pass through the great tribulation At that time you will surely put down the world and realize that the best life is to live for Christ All of Gods children must be like this otherwise they will never mature If you do not believe it just wait and see Perhaps you think the world is too lovely and it is too a pity to put down the world then the Lord will say Since you love the world so much I will leave you here to let you see if the world is really that lovely Then the Lord will shake the world Finally you will say Lord I repent However to repent at that time may be a little too late Do not wait until the great tribulation comes to repent repent now Every real Christian will repent sooner or later I am confident to say that one day every saved person will see that the world is not only unlovely but also poisonous the more you love the world the more you will be poisoned The world is at enmity with God and we must all abandon it Sooner or later the Lord will let you know how much He hates this world That day will come and we all must mature Do not say I do not care whether I mature or not as long as I am saved everything is fine Today you can harden your heart and stiffen your neck to argue with me but when that day comes you will know that you need to mature I advise you not to wait until the day of harvest By His grace come forward today to be a part of the firstfruits"}
{"zh": "晚期的得胜者要拿着神的琴；他们不再用地上的乐器。神要为他们准备这些琴，使他们可以赞美祂。三节说，晚期的得胜者“唱着神奴仆摩西的歌、和羔羊的歌”。", "en": "The late overcomers will have harps of God. They will not have any earthly musical instruments. God will prepare these harps for them that they might praise Him. Verse 3 says that the late overcomers \"sing the song of Moses, the slave of God, and the song of the Lamb.\"", "norm_zh": "晚期的得胜者要拿着神的琴他们不再用地上的乐器神要为他们准备这些琴使他们可以赞美祂三节说晚期的得胜者唱着神奴仆摩西的歌和羔羊的歌", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The late overcomers will have harps of God They will not have any earthly musical instruments God will prepare these harps for them that they might praise Him Verse 3 says that the late overcomers sing the song of Moses the slave of God and the song of the Lamb"}
{"zh": "摩西的歌记在出埃及十五章一至十八节，赞美神借着红海审判的水，施行得胜的拯救，胜过了法老的军队。当时摩西和以色列人在红海边唱这歌。现在这些晚期的得胜者，在玻璃海上再唱这歌，指明他们胜过了敌基督的权势，敌基督乃是神所要用玻璃海的火审判的。（启十九20。）摩西的歌指出神在祂百姓的仇敌身上得胜的审判，在消极方面为着神的审判赞美神；而羔羊的歌指出神的子民在仇敌面前所经历基督的救赎，在积极方面为着基督的救赎赞美神。晚期的得胜者得以站在玻璃海上，是因着神审判了仇敌，且因着基督救赎了祂的百姓。当这些晚期的得胜者赞美神的时候，他们要向全宇宙宣告，他们是在神对祂仇敌的审判之上，并且有分于基督的救赎。他们所经历的这两件事，就成了两种歌。", "en": "The song of Moses recorded in Exodus 15:1-19 praises God for victory over the forces of Pharaoh by His triumphant deliverance through the judging waters of the Red Sea. Moses and the children of Israel sang that song on the shore of the Red Sea. Now these late overcomers sing this song again on the glassy sea, indicating that they are victorious over the power of Antichrist, who is judged by God with the fire of the glassy sea (Rev. 19:20). The song of Moses indicates God's triumphant judgment over the enemy of His people, whereas the song of the Lamb indicates Christ's redemption experienced by God's people in the presence of their enemy. Thus, the song of Moses praises God for His judgment negatively, and the song of the Lamb praises Him for Christ's redemption positively. The late overcomers are positioned to stand on the glassy sea because of God's judgment over the enemy and because of Christ's redemption of His people. In their praises to God, the late overcomers will declare to the whole universe that they are above God's judgment on His enemies and that they have participated in the redemption of Christ. Their experience of these two things will become two kinds of songs.", "norm_zh": "摩西的歌记在出埃及十五章一至十八节赞美神借着红海审判的水施行得胜的拯救胜过了法老的军队当时摩西和以色列人在红海边唱这歌现在这些晚期的得胜者在玻璃海上再唱这歌指明他们胜过了敌基督的权势敌基督乃是神所要用玻璃海的火审判的启十九20摩西的歌指出神在祂百姓的仇敌身上得胜的审判在消极方面为着神的审判赞美神而羔羊的歌指出神的子民在仇敌面前所经历基督的救赎在积极方面为着基督的救赎赞美神晚期的得胜者得以站在玻璃海上是因着神审判了仇敌且因着基督救赎了祂的百姓当这些晚期的得胜者赞美神的时候他们要向全宇宙宣告他们是在神对祂仇敌的审判之上并且有分于基督的救赎他们所经历的这两件事就成了两种歌", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:50:12.207454+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The song of Moses recorded in Exodus 15119 praises God for victory over the forces of Pharaoh by His triumphant deliverance through the judging waters of the Red Sea Moses and the children of Israel sang that song on the shore of the Red Sea Now these late overcomers sing this song again on the glassy sea indicating that they are victorious over the power of Antichrist who is judged by God with the fire of the glassy sea Rev 1920 The song of Moses indicates Gods triumphant judgment over the enemy of His people whereas the song of the Lamb indicates Christs redemption experienced by Gods people in the presence of their enemy Thus the song of Moses praises God for His judgment negatively and the song of the Lamb praises Him for Christs redemption positively The late overcomers are positioned to stand on the glassy sea because of Gods judgment over the enemy and because of Christs redemption of His people In their praises to God the late overcomers will declare to the whole universe that they are above Gods judgment on His enemies and that they have participated in the redemption of Christ Their experience of these two things will become two kinds of songs"}
{"zh": "壹\t被提主要的还不是为着我们的享受，乃是为着神的享受；我们需要被提到天上，但不是为我们的快乐，乃是为完成神的定旨—启十二5、7~10，十四1、4下：（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第三篇，第二十三段*；第三十八篇，第十三段*）", "en": "I.\tThe rapture is not mainly for our enjoyment but for God's enjoyment; we need to be raptured to heaven, not for our happiness but for the fulfillment of God's purpose.—Rev. 12:5, 7-10; 14:1, 4b:", "norm_zh": "壹被提主要的还不是为着我们的享受乃是为着神的享受我们需要被提到天上但不是为我们的快乐乃是为完成神的定旨启十二5710十四14下1999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第三篇第二十三段第三十八篇第十三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I The rapture is not mainly for our enjoyment but for Gods enjoyment we need to be raptured to heaven not for our happiness but for the fulfillment of Gods purposeRev 125 710 141 4b"}
{"zh": "2\t一部分农作物—初熟的果子—成熟在先，就先收成；其余部分的农作物—庄稼—成熟较晚，就后收成—启十四3~5，十五2~3。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第四十八篇，第四段**）", "en": "2.\tPart of the crop—the firstfruits—ripens earlier and is reaped earlier; the rest of the crop—the harvest—ripens later and is reaped later.—Rev. 14:3-5; 15:2-3.", "norm_zh": "2一部分农作物初熟的果子成熟在先就先收成其余部分的农作物庄稼成熟较晚就后收成启十四35十五231999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第四十八篇第四段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Part of the cropthe firstfruitsripens earlier and is reaped earlier the rest of the cropthe harvestripens later and is reaped laterRev 1435 1523"}
{"zh": "3\t根据启示录十四章，有两种的被提，就是初熟果子的被提和庄稼的被提—十四4下，14~15。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第三十篇，第三十五段*）", "en": "3.\tAccording to Revelation 14 there are two kinds of rapture—the rapture of the firstfruits and the rapture of the harvest.—14:4b, 14-15.", "norm_zh": "3根据启示录十四章有两种的被提就是初熟果子的被提和庄稼的被提十四4下14151999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第三十篇第三十五段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 According to Revelation 14 there are two kinds of rapturethe rapture of the firstfruits and the rapture of the harvest144b 1415"}
{"zh": "一\t初熟的果子要被提到天上的锡安山，到第三层天神的居所那里，得在神与基督面前—1、4节下。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；新约总论，第一百一十三篇，第二十八段*）", "en": "A.\tThe firstfruits will be caught up to the heavenly Mount Zion, to the place of God's dwelling in the third heaven, in order to be in the presence of God and Christ.—vv. 1, 4b.", "norm_zh": "一初熟的果子要被提到天上的锡安山到第三层天神的居所哪里得在神与基督面前14节下1999年冬训第十五篇新约总论第一百一十三篇第二十八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The firstfruits will be caught up to the heavenly Mount Zion to the place of Gods dwelling in the third heaven in order to be in the presence of God and Christvv 1 4b"}
{"zh": "1\t初熟的果子满足了父神和救赎主羔羊的饥饿—出二三19上，利二三10。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第四十六篇，第三十七段）", "en": "1.\tThe firstfruits satisfy the hunger of God the Father and the Lamb, the Redeemer.—Exo. 23:19a; Lev. 23:10.", "norm_zh": "1初熟的果子满足了父神和救赎主羔羊的饥饿出二三19上利二三101999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第四十六篇第三十七段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The firstfruits satisfy the hunger of God the Father and the Lamb the RedeemerExo 2319a Lev 2310"}
{"zh": "2\t男孩子是为着争战，对付仇敌，而初熟的果子乃是为着叫神和羔羊得满足—出二三19。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第四十六篇，第三十一段*）", "en": "2.\tWhereas the man-child is for fighting to deal with the enemy, the firstfruits are for the satisfaction of God and the Lamb.—Exo. 23:19.", "norm_zh": "2男孩子是为着争战对付仇敌而初熟的果子乃是为着叫神和羔羊得满足出二三191999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第四十六篇第三十一段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Whereas the manchild is for fighting to deal with the enemy the firstfruits are for the satisfaction of God and the LambExo 2319"}
{"zh": "四\t初熟的果子额上都写着羔羊和祂父的名，这表明他们与羔羊和父是一，属于羔羊和父—启十四1下，4~5。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；新约总论，第一百一十三篇，第三十九段*）", "en": "D.\tThe firstfruits have the name of the Lamb and of His Father written on their foreheads; this is the designation of their being one with the Lamb and with the Father and of their belonging to Them.—Rev. 14:1b, 4-5.", "norm_zh": "四初熟的果子额上都写着羔羊和祂父的名这表明他们与羔羊和父是一属于羔羊和父启十四1下451999年冬训第十五篇新约总论第一百一十三篇第三十九段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D The firstfruits have the name of the Lamb and of His Father written on their foreheads this is the designation of their being one with the Lamb and with the Father and of their belonging to ThemRev 141b 45"}
{"zh": "五\t十四万四千初熟的果子，乃是那些为着完成神永远定旨的信徒—1、3~5节：（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第四十六篇，第十二段*）", "en": "E.\tThe one hundred forty-four thousand firstfruits are believers who are for the accomplishment of God's eternal purpose.—vv. 1, 3-5:", "norm_zh": "五十四万四千初熟的果子乃是哪些为着完成神永远定旨的信徒135节1999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第四十六篇第十二段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E The one hundred fortyfour thousand firstfruits are believers who are for the accomplishment of Gods eternal purposevv 1 35"}
{"zh": "1\t十二这数字表征神性与人性的调和；这调和是为着神经纶的完整—二一12。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；李常受文集一九六九年第二册，圣经中关于生命的重要启示，第四章，第十段*；新约总论，第四百零二十二篇，第十三段）", "en": "1.\tThe number twelve signifies the mingling of divinity with humanity; this mingling is for the completion of God's economy.—21:12.", "norm_zh": "1十二这数字表征神性与人性的调和这调和是为着神经纶的完整二一121999年冬训第十五篇李常受文集一九六九年第二册圣经中关于生命的重要启示第四章第十段新约总论第四百零二十二篇第十三段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The number twelve signifies the mingling of divinity with humanity this mingling is for the completion of Gods economy2112"}
{"zh": "2\t十二乘十二的意思是完整中的完整，这是神为完成祂经纶之行政的完整—十四1。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第四十六篇，第十二段*）", "en": "2.\tTwelve multiplied by twelve means completion of completions, the completion in God's administration for the fulfillment of His economy.—14:1.", "norm_zh": "2十二乘十二的意思是完整中的完整这是神为完成祂经纶之行政的完整十四11999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第四十六篇第十二段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Twelve multiplied by twelve means completion of completions the completion in Gods administration for the fulfillment of His economy141"}
{"zh": "一\t初熟的果子要在大灾难前被提到诸天之上的宝座那里，而庄稼要在大灾难的末了，就是在吹末次号筒时，被提到空中（仓房）—帖前四16~17，林前十五2，启十7，太十三30，三12。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；新约总论，第七十八篇，第十五段**）", "en": "A. Whereas the firstfruits are taken to the throne in the heavens before the great tribulation, the harvest is taken to the air (the barn) toward the end of the tribulation, that is, at the last trumpet.—1 Thes. 4:16-17; 1 Cor. 15:2; Rev. 10:7; Matt. 13:30; 3:12.", "norm_zh": "一初熟的果子要在大灾难前被提到诸天之上的宝座哪里而庄稼要在大灾难的末了就是在吹末次号筒时被提到空中仓房帖前四1617林前十五2启十7太十三30三121999年冬训第十五篇新约总论第七十八篇第十五段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Whereas the firstfruits are taken to the throne in the heavens before the great tribulation the harvest is taken to the air the barn toward the end of the tribulation that is at the last trumpet1 Thes 41617 1 Cor 152 Rev 107 Matt 1330 312"}
{"zh": "二\t所有包括在庄稼被提里的，都必须经过大灾难—二四21，启三10：（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第四十八篇，第八段*）", "en": "B.\tAll those included in the rapture of the harvest must pass through the greater part of the great tribulation.—Matt. 24:21; Rev. 3:10:", "norm_zh": "二所有包括在庄稼被提里的都必须经过大灾难二四21启三101999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第四十八篇第八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B All those included in the rapture of the harvest must pass through the greater part of the great tribulationMatt 2421 Rev 310"}
{"zh": "2\t大灾难在一面说，就是猛烈的阳光，要使所有在灾难前未预备好的信徒成熟—启十四15，太十三39下。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第三篇，第二十五段*）", "en": "2\tIn a sense, the great tribulation will be the strong sunshine which will ripen all the believers who were not ready before the tribulation.—Rev. 14:15; Matt. 13:39b.", "norm_zh": "2大灾难在一面说就是猛烈的阳光要使所有在灾难前未预备好的信徒成熟启十四15太十三39下1999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第三篇第二十五段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 In a sense the great tribulation will be the strong sunshine which will ripen all the believers who were not ready before the tribulationRev 1415 Matt 1339b"}
{"zh": "三\t我们今日若不撇弃世界，向基督而活，基督要把我们留在地上，经过大灾难—十六26，林后五14~15：（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第三篇，第二十五段*）", "en": "C.\tIf today we do not give up the world and live to Christ, Christ will leave us on earth to pass through the great tribulation.—Matt. 16:26; 2 Cor. 5:14-15:", "norm_zh": "三我们今日若不撇弃世界向基督而活基督要把我们留在地上经过大灾难十六26林后五14151999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第三篇第二十五段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C If today we do not give up the world and live to Christ Christ will leave us on earth to pass through the great tribulationMatt 1626 2 Cor 51415"}
{"zh": "一\t他们虽然被敌基督所杀，在神看来，他们却是得胜的—2~4节。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第四十九篇，第五段*）", "en": "A.\tAlthough they are slain by Antichrist, in the eyes of God they are victorious.—vv. 2-4.", "norm_zh": "一他们虽然被敌基督所杀在神看来他们却是得胜的24节1999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第四十九篇第五段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Although they are slain by Antichrist in the eyes of God they are victoriousvv 24"}
{"zh": "二\t晚期的得胜者唱摩西的歌和羔羊的歌—3节上，五9：（1999年冬训，第十五篇；李常受文集一九八〇年第二册，约翰的修补职事，第十六章，第五十段**）", "en": "B.\tThe late overcomers sing the song of Moses and of the Lamb.—v. 3a; 5:9:", "norm_zh": "二晚期的得胜者唱摩西的歌和羔羊的歌3节上五91999年冬训第十五篇李常受文集一九八〇年第二册约翰的修补职事第十六章第五十段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The late overcomers sing the song of Moses and of the Lambv 3a 59"}
{"zh": "2\t羔羊的歌指出，神的子民在仇敌面前所经历之基督的救赎—启十五3~4。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第四十九篇，第十八段*）", "en": "2\tThe song of the Lamb indicates Christ's redemption experienced by God's people in the presence of their enemy.—Rev. 15:3-4.", "norm_zh": "2羔羊的歌指出神的子民在仇敌面前所经历之基督的救赎启十五341999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第四十九篇第十八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The song of the Lamb indicates Christs redemption experienced by Gods people in the presence of their enemyRev 1534"}
{"zh": "三\t晚期的得胜者赞美神的作为和道路，也就是赞美祂的行动和祂的法则—2~4节。（1999年冬训，第十五篇；启示录生命读经，第四十九篇，第二十段**）", "en": "C.\tThe late overcomers praise God for His works and His ways, that is, for His acts and His principles.—vv. 2-4.", "norm_zh": "三晚期的得胜者赞美神的作为和道路也就是赞美祂的行动和祂的法则24节1999年冬训第十五篇启示录生命读经第四十九篇第二十段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:52:12.173329+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The late overcomers praise God for His works and His ways that is for His acts and His principlesvv 24"}
{"zh": "读经：帖前一10，二19，三13，四15~18，五23，帖后二1~12，但九24~27，二28，启十二1~5，十四1~5，十九7~9、13~16，但十19，太二四42~44，二五13，启十九7，二二20", "en": "Scripture Reading: 1 Thes. 1:10; 2:19; 3:13; 4:15-18; 5:23; 2 Thes. 2:1-12; Dan. 9:24-27; 2:28; Rev. 12:1-5; 14:1-5; 19:7-9, 13-16; Dan. 10:19; Matt. 24:42-44; 25:13; Rev. 19:7; 22:20", "norm_zh": "读经帖前一10二19三13四1518五23帖后二112但九2427二28启十二15十四15十九791316但十19太二四4244二五13启十九7二二20", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Scripture Reading 1 Thes 110 219 313 41518 523 2 Thes 2112 Dan 92427 228 Rev 1215 1415 1979 1316 Dan 1019 Matt 244244 2513 Rev 197 2220"}
{"zh": "壹\t给帖撒罗尼迦人的两封书信是在主来临的光中写成的；主的来临（希腊文，parousia，巴路西亚）就是主的同在—帖前四15，太二四3，帖后二19：", "en": "I.\tThe two Epistles to the Thessalonians were written in the light of the Lord's coming; the Lord's coming (Gk. parousia) is His presence:—1 Thes. 4:15; Matt. 24:3; 2 Thes. 2:19:", "norm_zh": "壹给帖撒罗尼迦人的两封书信是在主来临的光中写成的主的来临希腊文parousia巴路西亚就是主的同在帖前四15太二四3帖后二19", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I The two Epistles to the Thessalonians were written in the light of the Lords coming the Lords coming Gk parousia is His presence1 Thes 415 Matt 243 2 Thes 219"}
{"zh": "一\t帖撒罗尼迦前书每章都结束于主的来临；这说明著者保罗是生活工作在主的来临前，以此为吸引、鼓励、目标并警惕—一10，二19，三13，四15~18，五23。", "en": "A. Every chapter of 1 Thessalonians ends with the coming of the Lord; this shows that the writer, Paul, lived and worked with the Lord's coming before him, taking it as an attraction, an incentive, a goal, and a warning—1 Thes. 1:10; 2:19; 3:13; 4:15-18; 5:23.", "norm_zh": "一帖撒罗尼迦前书每章都结束于主的来临这说明着者保罗是生活工作在主的来临前以此为吸引鼓励目标并警惕一10二19三13四1518五23", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Every chapter of 1 Thessalonians ends with the coming of the Lord this shows that the writer Paul lived and worked with the Lords coming before him taking it as an attraction an incentive a goal and a warning1 Thes 110 219 313 41518 523"}
{"zh": "二\t在三年半（就是但以理九章二十七节里末七的后半）之大灾难的末了，大体的信徒，包括死了又复活以及活着的，都要被提到基督在空中的同在（巴路西亚）里；帖前四章十六至十七节说到这种被提，这与启示录十四章十四至十六节的收割庄稼相符。", "en": "B.\tAt the end of the three and a half years of the great tribulation, the second half of the last week in Daniel 9:27, the majority of the believers, both the dead (who will be resurrected) and the living, will be raptured into Christ's presence (parousia) in the air; 1 Thessalonians 4:16-17 speaks of this rapture, which corresponds to the reaping of the harvest in Revelation 14:14-16.", "norm_zh": "二在三年半就是但以理九章二十七节里末七的后半之大灾难的末了大体的信徒包括死了又复活以及活着的都要被提到基督在空中的同在巴路西亚里帖前四章十六至十七节说到这种被提这与启示录十四章十四至十六节的收割庄稼相符", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B At the end of the three and a half years of the great tribulation the second half of the last week in Daniel 927 the majority of the believers both the dead who will be resurrected and the living will be raptured into Christs presence parousia in the air 1 Thessalonians 41617 speaks of this rapture which corresponds to the reaping of the harvest in Revelation 141416"}
{"zh": "一\t首先，七个七（四十九年）的截定，是从出令重新修建耶路撒冷，到重建完成—尼二1~8，但九25。", "en": "A.\tFirst, seven weeks (forty-nine years) were apportioned from the issuing of the decree to restore and rebuild Jerusalem to the completion of the rebuilding.—Neh. 2:1-8; Dan. 9:25.", "norm_zh": "一首先七个七四十九年的截定是从出令重新修建耶路撒冷到重建完成尼二18但九25", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A First seven weeks fortynine years were apportioned from the issuing of the decree to restore and rebuild Jerusalem to the completion of the rebuildingNeh 218 Dan 925"}
{"zh": "二\t第二，六十二个七（四百三十四年）的截定，是从耶路撒冷重建完成，到弥赛亚被剪除（钉十字架）—25~26节。", "en": "B.\tSecond, sixty-two weeks (434 years) were apportioned from the completion of the rebuilding of Jerusalem to the cutting off (crucifixion) of the Messiah.—vv. 25-26.", "norm_zh": "二第二六十二个七四百三十四年的截定是从耶路撒冷重建完成到弥赛亚被剪除钉十字架2526节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Second sixtytwo weeks 434 years were apportioned from the completion of the rebuilding of Jerusalem to the cutting off crucifixion of the Messiahvv 2526"}
{"zh": "三\t第三，末七的七年，将是敌基督与以色列人坚定盟约之时；这七年之半他要毁约，使以色列对神的祭祀和供献止息，并逼迫敬畏神的人；这将是持续三年半之大灾难的开始—27节，启十三：", "en": "C. Third, the last week of seven years will be for Antichrist to make a firm covenant with the people of Israel; in the middle of those seven years he will break the covenant, terminate Israel's sacrifices and oblations to God, and persecute those who fear God; this will be the beginning of the great tribulation, which will last for three and a half years.—v. 27; Rev. 13:", "norm_zh": "三第三末七的七年将是敌基督与以色列人坚定盟约之时这七年之半他要毁约使以色列对神的祭祀和供献止息并逼迫敬畏神的人这将是持续三年半之大灾难的开始27节启十三", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Third the last week of seven years will be for Antichrist to make a firm covenant with the people of Israel in the middle of those seven years he will break the covenant terminate Israels sacrifices and oblations to God and persecute those who fear God this will be the beginning of the great tribulation which will last for three and a half yearsv 27 Rev 13"}
{"zh": "2\t在大灾难开始时，敌基督的像要被当作偶像立在殿中，并且他要坐在神的殿中，高举自己超过一切受人敬拜的对象；这意思是圣殿必须在大灾难开始之前重建—15、21节，启十三14~15，帖后二3~4，但十一36~37。", "en": "2. At the beginning of the great tribulation, Antichrist's image will be set up in the temple as an idol and he will sit in the temple of God, exalting himself above every object of worship; this means that the temple must be rebuilt before the great tribulation begins—vv. 15, 21; Rev. 13:14-15; 2 Thes. 2:3-4; Dan. 11:36-37.", "norm_zh": "2在大灾难开始时敌基督的像要被当作偶像立在殿中并且他要坐在神的殿中高举自己超过一切受人敬拜的对象这意思是圣殿必须在大灾难开始之前重建1521节启十三1415帖后二34但十一3637", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 At the beginning of the great tribulation Antichrists image will be set up in the temple as an idol and he will sit in the temple of God exalting himself above every object of worship this means that the temple must be rebuilt before the great tribulation beginsvv 15 21 Rev 131415 2 Thes 234 Dan 113637"}
{"zh": "1\t在这时代中，基督秘密的、奥秘的在新造里建造召会，作祂的身体和新妇—太十六18，弗五25~32。", "en": "1.\tDuring this age Christ is secretly and mysteriously building up the church in the new creation to be His Body and His bride.—Matt. 16:18; Eph. 5:25-32.", "norm_zh": "1在这时代中基督秘密的奥秘的在新造里建造召会作祂的身体和新妇太十六18弗五2532", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 During this age Christ is secretly and mysteriously building up the church in the new creation to be His Body and His brideMatt 1618 Eph 52532"}
{"zh": "一\t每一次神要有时代的行动，就是转移时代的行动，祂都必须得着祂时代的器皿；我们必须是在末后日子对神有时代价值的人，以转移时代─启十二5~11，一20，但十二3，九23，十11、19。", "en": "A.\tEvery time God wants to make a dispensational move, an age-turning move, He must obtain His dispensational instrument; we must be those who have dispensational value to God in the last days to turn the age.—Rev. 12:5-11; 1:20; Dan. 12:3; 9:23; 10:11, 19.", "norm_zh": "一每一次神要有时代的行动就是转移时代的行动祂都必须得着祂时代的器皿我们必须是在末后日子对神有时代价值的人以转移时代启十二511一20但十二3九23十1119", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Every time God wants to make a dispensational move an ageturning move He must obtain His dispensational instrument we must be those who have dispensational value to God in the last days to turn the ageRev 12511 120 Dan 123 923 1011 19"}
{"zh": "二\t神永远经纶的目标，就是神圣历史在人类历史中的目标，乃是要得着团体的基督，就是基督与祂的得胜者如同砸人的石头，作祂时代的器皿，以结束这时代，并且成为一座大山，就是神的国─二28、31~45，珥三11，启十二1~2、5，十四1~5，十九7~21。", "en": "B.\tThe goal of God's eternal economy, the goal of the divine history within human history, is to have the corporate Christ, Christ with His overcomers, as the crushing stone to be His dispensational instrument to end this age and become a great mountain, the kingdom of God.—Dan. 2:28, 31-45; Joel 3:11; Rev. 12:1-2, 5; 14:1-5; 19:7-21.", "norm_zh": "二神永远经纶的目标就是神圣历史在人类历史中的目标乃是要得着团体的基督就是基督与祂的得胜者如同砸人的石头作祂时代的器皿以结束这时代并且成为一座大山就是神的国二283145珥三11启十二125十四15十九721", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The goal of Gods eternal economy the goal of the divine history within human history is to have the corporate Christ Christ with His overcomers as the crushing stone to be His dispensational instrument to end this age and become a great mountain the kingdom of GodDan 228 3145 Joel 311 Rev 1212 5 1415 19721"}
{"zh": "三\t简单的说，恢复就是得胜；在主的恢复里，就是在主的得胜里，预备作祂得胜的新妇，使祂得以回来─二7，三21，十九7~9。", "en": "C.\tSimply speaking, the recovery is to overcome; to be in the Lord's recovery is to be in the Lord's overcoming, being prepared to be His overcoming bride for His return.—Rev. 2:7; 3:21; 19:7-9.", "norm_zh": "三简单的说恢复就是得胜在主的恢复里就是在主的得胜里预备作祂得胜的新妇使祂得以回来二7三21十九79", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Simply speaking the recovery is to overcome to be in the Lords recovery is to be in the Lords overcoming being prepared to be His overcoming bride for His returnRev 27 321 1979"}
{"zh": "伍\t主要像贼一样，隐密的临到那些爱祂的人，把他们当作宝贝偷去，带到祂诸天之上的同在里；因此，我们必须儆醒并预备自己成为祂的新妇—但十19，太二四42~44，二五13，启十九7，二二20：", "en": "V. The Lord will come secretly as a thief to those who love Him and will steal them away as His treasures to bring them into His presence in the heavens; hence, we must watch and make ourselves ready to be His bride—Dan. 10:19; Matt. 24:42-44; 25:13; Rev. 19:7; 22:20:", "norm_zh": "伍主要像贼一样隐密的临到哪些爱祂的人把他们当作宝贝偷去带到祂诸天之上的同在里因此我们必须儆醒并预备自己成为祂的新妇但十19太二四4244二五13启十九7二二20", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "V The Lord will come secretly as a thief to those who love Him and will steal them away as His treasures to bring them into His presence in the heavens hence we must watch and make ourselves ready to be His brideDan 1019 Matt 244244 2513 Rev 197 2220"}
{"zh": "五\t我们必须为着我们的祷告生活儆醒、警觉，与内住、圣别的灵合作，过喜乐、祷告并谢恩的生活；这样的生活对神是荣耀，对神的仇敌是羞辱—太二五13，帖前五16~18。", "en": "E.\tWe must be watchful, on the alert, for our prayer life, cooperating with the indwelling, sanctifying Spirit to live a rejoicing, praying, and thanking life as a glory to God and a shame to His enemy.—Matt. 25:13; 1 Thes. 5:16-18.", "norm_zh": "五我们必须为着我们的祷告生活儆醒警觉与内住圣别的灵合作过喜乐祷告并谢恩的生活这样的生活对神是荣耀对神的仇敌是羞辱太二五13帖前五1618", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E We must be watchful on the alert for our prayer life cooperating with the indwelling sanctifying Spirit to live a rejoicing praying and thanking life as a glory to God and a shame to His enemyMatt 2513 1 Thes 51618"}
{"zh": "基督的再来乃是与祂的信徒同在", "en": "Christ's coming will be His presence with His believers.", "norm_zh": "基督的再来乃是与祂的信徒同在", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Christs coming will be His presence with His believers"}
{"zh": "……【帖撒罗尼迦前书四章】十五节的“来临”，希腊文是parousia，巴路西亚，与马太二十四章三节者同字。基督的再来乃是与祂的信徒同在。这同在（巴路西亚）要开始于得胜者被提到宝座那里，延续到主来到空中（启十1），结束于主来到地上。在主的巴路西亚期间，会有大体的信徒被提到空中（帖前四15~17）、基督的审判台（林后五10）、以及羔羊的婚娶（启十九7~9）。", "en": "...the Greek word for \"coming\" in [1 Thessalonians 4] verse 15 is parousia, the same word as used in Matthew 24:3. Christ's coming will be His presence with His believers. This parousia will begin from the time the overcomers are raptured to the throne, continue with His coming to the air (Rev. 10:1), and end with His coming to the earth. Within His parousia, there will be the rapture of the majority of the believers to the air (1 Thes. 4:15-17), the judgment seat of Christ (2 Cor. 5:10), and the marriage of the Lamb (Rev. 19:7-9).", "norm_zh": "帖撒罗尼迦前书四章十五节的来临希腊文是parousia巴路西亚与马太二十四章三节者同字基督的再来乃是与祂的信徒同在这同在巴路西亚要开始于得胜者被提到宝座哪里延续到主来到空中启十1结束于主来到地上在主的巴路西亚期间会有大体的信徒被提到空中帖前四1517基督的审判台林后五10以及羔羊的婚娶启十九79", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "the Greek word for coming in 1 Thessalonians 4 verse 15 is parousia the same word as used in Matthew 243 Christs coming will be His presence with His believers This parousia will begin from the time the overcomers are raptured to the throne continue with His coming to the air Rev 101 and end with His coming to the earth Within His parousia there will be the rapture of the majority of the believers to the air 1 Thes 41517 the judgment seat of Christ 2 Cor 510 and the marriage of the Lamb Rev 1979"}
{"zh": "保罗是生活工作在主的再来跟前，以此为吸引、鼓励、目标并警惕", "en": "Paul lived and worked with the Lord's coming before him, taking it as an attraction, an incentive, a goal, and a warning", "norm_zh": "保罗是生活工作在主的再来跟前以此为吸引鼓励目标并警惕", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Paul lived and worked with the Lords coming before him taking it as an attraction an incentive a goal and a warning"}
{"zh": "【帖撒罗尼迦前书】每章都以主的再来为结束，这说明著者保罗是生活工作在主的再来跟前，以此为吸引、鼓励、目标并警惕。他不仅自己这样作，也以此勉励所带领的信徒。（圣经恢复本，帖前五23注7）。", "en": "Every chapter of [1 Thessalonians] ends with the coming of the Lord. This shows that the writer, Paul, lived and worked with the Lord's coming before him, taking it as an attraction, an incentive, a goal, and a warning. He not only did this himself but also encouraged the believers under his care to do the same.", "norm_zh": "帖撒罗尼迦前书每章都以主的再来为结束这说明着者保罗是生活工作在主的再来跟前以此为吸引鼓励目标并警惕他不仅自己这样作也以此勉励所带领的信徒圣经恢复本帖前五23注7", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Every chapter of 1 Thessalonians ends with the coming of the Lord This shows that the writer Paul lived and worked with the Lords coming before him taking it as an attraction an incentive a goal and a warning He not only did this himself but also encouraged the believers under his care to do the same"}
{"zh": "我们的盼望是要来的主，祂是我们永远的定命", "en": "Our hope is the coming Lord, who is our destiny forever.", "norm_zh": "我们的盼望是要来的主祂是我们永远的定命", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T04:55:27.090921+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Our hope is the coming Lord who is our destiny forever"}
