{"zh": "四\t祂在人性生活里，乃是神的儿子，在圣灵和神圣能力的膏抹之下，有神的同在—徒十38，可一1：", "en": "D. In His human living, He was the Son of God, under the anointing of the Holy Spirit and divine power, with the presence of God—Acts 10:38; Mark 1:1:", "norm_zh": "四祂在人性生活里乃是神的儿子在圣灵和神圣能力的膏抹之下有神的同在徒十38可一1", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D In His human living He was the Son of God under the anointing of the Holy Spirit and divine power with the presence of GodActs 1038 Mark 11"}
{"zh": "1\t祂所行的善事，展示祂那被神的属性所浸透的美德，为要在圣灵的膏抹下表明三一神—六53~56。", "en": "1. The good things He did were a display of His virtues saturated with God's attributes to declare the Triune God under the anointing of the Holy Spirit.—6:53-56.", "norm_zh": "1祂所行的善事展示祂哪被神的属性所浸透的美德为要在圣灵的膏抹下表明三一神六5356", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The good things He did were a display of His virtues saturated with Gods attributes to declare the Triune God under the anointing of the Holy Spirit65356"}
{"zh": "2\t祂在神圣能力的膏抹之下，行了许多神迹，给人看见神的能力—一24~26。", "en": "2. He did many miracles under the anointing of the divine power to show people the power of God.—1:24-26.", "norm_zh": "2祂在神圣能力的膏抹之下行了许多神迹给人看见神的能力一2426", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 He did many miracles under the anointing of the divine power to show people the power of God12426"}
