{"zh": "贰\t神在人性生活的各阶段里，显现于肉体—赛五三2，路二7、40、42：", "en": "II. God was manifested in the flesh in the stages of human life.—Isa. 53:2; Luke 2:7, 40, 42:", "norm_zh": "贰神在人性生活的各阶段里显现于肉体赛五三2路二74042", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "II God was manifested in the flesh in the stages of human lifeIsa 532 Luke 27 40 42"}
{"zh": "一\t当祂成为人时，祂在耶和华面前生长如嫩芽，像根出于干地—赛五三2~3。", "en": "A. When He became a man, He was growing before Jehovah as a tender plant and as a root out of dry ground.—Isa. 53:2-3.", "norm_zh": "一当祂成为人时祂在耶和华面前生长如嫩芽像根出于干地赛五三23", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A When He became a man He was growing before Jehovah as a tender plant and as a root out of dry groundIsa 5323"}
{"zh": "二\t神显现于肉体，先是在婴孩时期；天使告诉牧羊人说，“你们要看见一个婴孩，包着布，卧在马槽里，那就是给你们的记号了”—路二7、12。", "en": "B. God was manifested in the flesh in babyhood; the angel told the shepherds, \"This will be the sign to you: you will find a baby wrapped in swaddling clothes and lying in a manger.\"—Luke 2:7, 12.", "norm_zh": "二神显现于肉体先是在婴孩时期天使告诉牧羊人说你们要看见一个婴孩包着布卧在马槽里哪就是给你们的记号了路二712", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B God was manifested in the flesh in babyhood the angel told the shepherds This will be the sign to you you will find a baby wrapped in swaddling clothes and lying in a mangerLuke 27 12"}
{"zh": "三\t祂在孩童时期，在智慧和身量，在神的恩，并神与人对祂的喜爱上，都不断增长；祂也在十二岁的时候，关心神的事—40、52、42、46~47、49节。", "en": "C. In His boyhood He grew in wisdom and stature, in the grace of God, and in favor with God and men; and at twelve years of age He was also concerned about God's business.—vv. 40, 52, 42, 46-47, 49.", "norm_zh": "三祂在孩童时期在智慧和身量在神的恩并神与人对祂的喜爱上都不断增长祂也在十二岁的时候关心神的事405242464749节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C In His boyhood He grew in wisdom and stature in the grace of God and in favor with God and men and at twelve years of age He was also concerned about Gods businessvv 40 52 42 4647 49"}
{"zh": "四\t祂在三十岁长大成人时，开始尽职事奉神—三23与注1：", "en": "D. In His maturity as a man at the age of thirty, He began His ministry for God.—3:23 and note 1:", "norm_zh": "四祂在三十岁长大成人时开始尽职事奉神三23与注1", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D In His maturity as a man at the age of thirty He began His ministry for God323 and note 1"}
{"zh": "1\t从祂成为神的执事起，祂也是忧患之子，遭人藐视、厌弃并逼迫—赛五三3，太十三55~57，路四28~30，太二六4、16。", "en": "1. From the time that He became a minister of God, He also became a man of sorrows, suffering the despising, rejection, and persecution of man.—Isa. 53:3; Matt. 13:55-57; Luke 4:28-30; Matt. 26:4, 16.", "norm_zh": "1从祂成为神的执事起祂也是忧患之子遭人藐视厌弃并逼迫赛五三3太十三5557路四2830太二六416", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 From the time that He became a minister of God He also became a man of sorrows suffering the despising rejection and persecution of manIsa 533 Matt 135557 Luke 42830 Matt 264 16"}
{"zh": "2\t祂到了三十岁后，受魔鬼试诱；这试诱乃是在神的灵引导之下；在那试诱里，祂击败魔鬼，并且有天使服事—四1、11。", "en": "2. After He became thirty years old, He was tempted by the devil, and this temptation was under the leading of the Spirit of God; in that temptation He defeated the devil and was ministered to by the angels.—4:1, 11.", "norm_zh": "2祂到了三十岁后受魔鬼试诱这试诱乃是在神的灵引导之下在哪试诱里祂击败魔鬼并且有天使服事四111", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 After He became thirty years old He was tempted by the devil and this temptation was under the leading of the Spirit of God in that temptation He defeated the devil and was ministered to by the angels41 11"}
{"zh": "叁\t基督借着成为肉体，成了在地上生活的人；就着在人性生活里的基督，祂的生活和祂的工作并没有什么区别；祂的生活就是祂的工作，祂的工作就是祂的生活—约六57上，可一14~45：", "en": "III. Christ, through incarnation, became a man living on the earth; with Christ in His human living, there was no difference between life and work; His life was His work, and His work was His life.—John 6:57a; Mark 1:14-45:", "norm_zh": "叁基督借着成为肉体成了在地上生活的人就着在人性生活里的基督祂的生活和祂的工作并没有什么区别祂的生活就是祂的工作祂的工作就是祂的生活约六57上可一1445", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III Christ through incarnation became a man living on the earth with Christ in His human living there was no difference between life and work His life was His work and His work was His lifeJohn 657a Mark 11445"}
{"zh": "一\t基督在祂的人性生活里显为人的样子，甚至奴仆的形状—腓二7~8：", "en": "A.\tIn His human living Christ was found in fashion as a man, even in the form of a slave—Phil. 2:7-8:", "norm_zh": "一基督在祂的人性生活里显为人的样子甚至奴仆的形状腓二78", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A In His human living Christ was found in fashion as a man even in the form of a slavePhil 278"}
{"zh": "1\t基督在人性生活里建立人的样子，并取了奴仆的形状，祂这工作乃是祂职事的根基和背景—路四14~19。", "en": "1. Christ’s work in His human living to build up the fashion of a man and to take on the form of a slave was the foundation and background of His ministry.—Luke 4:14-19.", "norm_zh": "1基督在人性生活里建立人的样子并取了奴仆的形状祂这工作乃是祂职事的根基和背景路四1419", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 Christs work in His human living to build up the fashion of a man and to take on the form of a slave was the foundation and background of His ministryLuke 41419"}
{"zh": "2\t我们这些渴望事奉主的人需要有一种工作，不是凭着作为，乃是凭着生活以建立一种工作，作他们将来事奉主的扎实立场和坚固背景—徒十六1~3上，提后四5、11下，西四17。", "en": "2. We who aspire to serve the Lord need to have a work, not by doing but by living, to build up a work that will be the solid ground and strong background for their coming service to the Lord.—Acts 16:1-3a; 2 Tim. 4:5, 11b; Col. 4:17.", "norm_zh": "2我们这些渴望事奉主的人需要有一种工作不是凭着作为乃是凭着生活以建立一种工作作他们将来事奉主的扎实立场和坚固背景徒十六13上提后四511下西四17", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 We who aspire to serve the Lord need to have a work not by doing but by living to build up a work that will be the solid ground and strong background for their coming service to the LordActs 1613a 2 Tim 45 11b Col 417"}
{"zh": "二\t马可六章三节告诉我们，基督是一个卑微家庭的木匠；在这样的工作里，基督显为人的样子，不是崇高的，乃是卑微、细致、忍耐的。", "en": "B. Mark 6:3 tells us that Christ was a carpenter in a lowly home; in such a work Christ was found in fashion as a man, not in loftiness but in lowliness, fineness, and patience.", "norm_zh": "二马可六章三节告诉我们基督是一个卑微家庭的木匠在这样的工作里基督显为人的样子不是崇高的乃是卑微细致忍耐的", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Mark 63 tells us that Christ was a carpenter in a lowly home in such a work Christ was found in fashion as a man not in loftiness but in lowliness fineness and patience"}
{"zh": "三\t基督在为人生活里之工作的另一面是表明神；按约翰一章一至十八节，基督是借着话、生命、光、恩典和实际，将神表明出来—1、14、4~5、16、17节：", "en": "C. Another aspect of Christ’s work in His human living was to declare God; according to John 1:1-18, Christ declared God by the Word, life, light, grace, and reality.—vv. 1, 14, 4-5, 16, 17:", "norm_zh": "三基督在为人生活里之工作的另一面是表明神按约翰一章一至十八节基督是借着话生命光恩典和实际将神表明出来114451617节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Another aspect of Christs work in His human living was to declare God according to John 1118 Christ declared God by the Word life light grace and realityvv 1 14 45 16 17"}
{"zh": "四\t基督在人性生活里的工作也包括祂彰显父—约十四9，七17~18，十七4上：", "en": "D. Christ’s work in His human living also includes His expressing the Father—John 14:9; 7:17-18; 17:4a:", "norm_zh": "四基督在人性生活里的工作也包括祂彰显父约十四9七1718十七4上", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D Christs work in His human living also includes His expressing the FatherJohn 149 71718 174a"}
{"zh": "1\t按约翰福音，子基督在父的名里来，在父的名里行事，行父的旨意，说父的话，并寻求父的荣耀；祂与父是一—五43，十25，六38，三34上，十四24，七16~17，十二47~50，七18，十30。", "en": "1. According to the Gospel of John, Christ the Son came in the Father’s name, worked in the Father’s name, did the Father’s will, spoke the Father’s word, and sought the Father’s glory; He was one with the Father.—5:43; 10:25; 6:38; 3:34a; 14:24; 7:16-17; 12:47-50; 7:18; 10:30.", "norm_zh": "1按约翰福音子基督在父的名里来在父的名里行事行父的旨意说父的话并寻求父的荣耀祂与父是一五43十25六38三34上十四24七1617十二4750七18十30", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 According to the Gospel of John Christ the Son came in the Fathers name worked in the Fathers name did the Fathers will spoke the Fathers word and sought the Fathers glory He was one with the Father543 1025 638 334a 1424 71617 124750 718 1030"}
{"zh": "2\t祂为着自己没有工作，没有旨意，没有话语，没有荣耀，也没有野心；基督是这样的一个人，单单彰显父；祂没有彰显自己；祂是子，然而祂彰显父—五43，十25，三34上，十四24，七16~18，十二47~50。", "en": "2. He had no work, no will, no word, no glory, and no ambition for Himself; as such a one, Christ expressed only the Father; He did not express Himself; He was the Son, yet He expressed the Father.—5:43; 10:25; 3:34a; 14:24; 7:16-18; 12:47-50.", "norm_zh": "2祂为着自己没有工作没有旨意没有话语没有荣耀也没有野心基督是这样的一个人单单彰显父祂没有彰显自己祂是子然而祂彰显父五43十25三34上十四24七1618十二4750", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 He had no work no will no word no glory and no ambition for Himself as such a one Christ expressed only the Father He did not express Himself He was the Son yet He expressed the Father543 1025 334a 1424 71618 124750"}
{"zh": "3\t因为子不是彰显自己，乃是彰显父，我们若看见子，就看见了父，父具体化身在子里，借着祂在人性生活里得着彰显—七18。", "en": "3. Because the Son expresses not Himself but the Father, if we have seen the Son, we have seen the Father, the Father being embodied in the Son to be expressed through Him in His human living.—7:18.", "norm_zh": "3因为子不是彰显自己乃是彰显父我们若看见子就看见了父父具体化身在子里借着祂在人性生活里得着彰显七18", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 Because the Son expresses not Himself but the Father if we have seen the Son we have seen the Father the Father being embodied in the Son to be expressed through Him in His human living718"}
{"zh": "我们要继续来看基督在祂人性生活里的工作。", "en": "We shall go on to see Christ’s work in His human living.", "norm_zh": "我们要继续来看基督在祂人性生活里的工作", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:18:05.264742+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "We shall go on to see Christs work in His human living"}
