{"zh": "壹\t提前三章十六节说，神显现于肉体；神显现于肉体，乃是神过人性的生活：（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "I. First Timothy 3:16 says that God was manifested in the flesh; God being manifested in the flesh is God living a human life:", "norm_zh": "壹提前三章十六节说神显现于肉体神显现于肉体乃是神过人性的生活李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I First Timothy 316 says that God was manifested in the flesh God being manifested in the flesh is God living a human life"}
{"zh": "一\t主耶稣取了奴仆的形状，成为人的样式，显为人的样子—腓二7~8。（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "A. The Lord Jesus took the form of a slave, became in the likeness of men, and was found in fashion as a man—Phil. 2:7-8.", "norm_zh": "一主耶稣取了奴仆的形状成为人的样式显为人的样子腓二78李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The Lord Jesus took the form of a slave became in the likeness of men and was found in fashion as a manPhil 278"}
{"zh": "二\t主耶稣是真实的、完全的人，是神显现于肉体，使永远、无限、看不见、荣耀、无所不能、无所不知、无所不在的神，借着必死、有限、看得见、没有荣耀，在能力、知识、同在上都受限制的人，得着彰显—8节，约七3~4：（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "B. The Lord Jesus is a real, perfect man, God manifested in the flesh to express the eternal, infinite, invisible, glorious, omnipotent, omniscient, and omnipresent God through the mortal, finite, visible, inglorious man, limited in power, knowledge, and presence—v. 8; John 7:3-4:", "norm_zh": "二主耶稣是真实的完全的人是神显现于肉体使永远无限看不见荣耀无所不能无所不知无所不在的神借着必死有限看得见没有荣耀在能力知识同在上都受限制的人得着彰显8节约七34李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The Lord Jesus is a real perfect man God manifested in the flesh to express the eternal infinite invisible glorious omnipotent omniscient and omnipresent God through the mortal finite visible inglorious man limited in power knowledge and presencev 8 John 734"}
{"zh": "1\t基督的生活乃是神性揭示于人性的生活—腓一21。（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "1. Christ's living was a life of divinity unveiled in humanity—Phil. 1:21.", "norm_zh": "1基督的生活乃是神性揭示于人性的生活腓一21李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 Christs living was a life of divinity unveiled in humanityPhil 121"}
{"zh": "2\t在基督的人性生活里，神圣属性显于人性美德—彼前二9。（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "2. In Christ's human living, the divine attributes were shown in the human virtues.—1 Pet. 2:9.", "norm_zh": "2在基督的人性生活里神圣属性显于人性美德彼前二9李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 In Christs human living the divine attributes were shown in the human virtues1 Pet 29"}
{"zh": "3\t在基督的人性生活里，神的生命与人的生命调和，同有一个生活，而没有第三个实体—利二4。（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "3. In Christ's human living, the divine life was mingled with the human life to have one kind of living without a third entity.—Lev. 2:4.", "norm_zh": "3在基督的人性生活里神的生命与人的生命调和同有一个生活而没有第三个实体利二4李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 In Christs human living the divine life was mingled with the human life to have one kind of living without a third entityLev 24"}
{"zh": "三\t基督在祂的人性生活里，乃是神显现于肉体，在怜悯、爱和恩典里，不在律法的定罪之中—约三17，提前三16：（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "C. In His human living, Christ was God manifested in the flesh in mercy, love, and grace and not in the condemnation of the law—John 3:17; 1 Tim. 3:16:", "norm_zh": "三基督在祂的人性生活里乃是神显现于肉体在怜悯爱和恩典里不在律法的定罪之中约三17提前三16李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C In His human living Christ was God manifested in the flesh in mercy love and grace and not in the condemnation of the lawJohn 317 1 Tim 316"}
{"zh": "1\t祂的人性生活，展示神所要的乃是怜悯—太九10~13。（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "1. His human living exhibited that God desires mercy.—Matt. 9:10-13.", "norm_zh": "1祂的人性生活展示神所要的乃是怜悯太九1013李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 His human living exhibited that God desires mercyMatt 91013"}
{"zh": "2\t基督在祂的人性生活里，借着祂口中所出的恩言，宣扬神悦纳人的禧年—路四19~22上。（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "2. In His human living Christ proclaimed God's acceptable year of jubilee through the words of grace proceeding out of His mouth—Luke 4:19-22a.", "norm_zh": "2基督在祂的人性生活里借着祂口中所出的恩言宣扬神悦纳人的禧年路四1922上李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 In His human living Christ proclaimed Gods acceptable year of jubilee through the words of grace proceeding out of His mouthLuke 41922a"}
{"zh": "四\t祂在人性生活里，乃是神的儿子，在圣灵和神圣能力的膏抹之下，有神的同在—徒十38，可一1：（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "D. In His human living, He was the Son of God under the anointing of the Holy Spirit and divine power, having the presence of God—Acts 10:38; Mark 1:1:", "norm_zh": "四祂在人性生活里乃是神的儿子在圣灵和神圣能力的膏抹之下有神的同在徒十38可一1李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D In His human living He was the Son of God under the anointing of the Holy Spirit and divine power having the presence of GodActs 1038 Mark 11"}
{"zh": "1\t祂所行的善事，展示祂那被神的属性所浸透的美德，为要在圣灵的膏抹下表明三一神—六53~56。（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "1. The good things He did were a display of His virtues saturated with God's attributes to declare the Triune God under the anointing of the Holy Spirit.—6:53-56.", "norm_zh": "1祂所行的善事展示祂哪被神的属性所浸透的美德为要在圣灵的膏抹下表明三一神六5356李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The good things He did were a display of His virtues saturated with Gods attributes to declare the Triune God under the anointing of the Holy Spirit65356"}
{"zh": "2\t祂在神圣能力的膏抹之下，行了许多神迹，给人看见神的能力—一24~26。（李常受文集一九九三年第一册，神在人里的行动，第三篇）", "en": "2. He did many miracles under the anointing of the divine power to show people the power of God.—Mark 1:24-26.", "norm_zh": "2祂在神圣能力的膏抹之下行了许多神迹给人看见神的能力一2426李常受文集一九九三年第一册神在人里的行动第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:19:58.936716+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 He did many miracles under the anointing of the divine power to show people the power of GodMark 12426"}
