{"zh": "神的国是重在信徒的义务和操练", "en": "The kingdom of God referring to the believers' obligation and exercise", "norm_zh": "神的国是重在信徒的义务和操练", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:48:44.168570+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The kingdom of God referring to the believers obligation and exercise"}
{"zh": "壹\t神的国就是神自己─可一15，四26、30，太六33，约三3，林前四20，路九2、60：（2017年安那翰春季全时间训练，第八篇；李常受文集一九八六年第二册，神的经纶与神圣三一输送的奥秘，第三篇，第二十九段）", "en": "I.\tThe kingdom of God is God Himself—Mark 1:15; 4:26, 30; Matt. 6:33; John 3:3; 1 Cor. 4:20; Luke 9:2, 60:", "norm_zh": "壹神的国就是神自己可一15四2630太六33约三3林前四20路九2602017年安哪翰春季全时间训练第八篇李常受文集一九八六年第二册神的经纶与神圣三一输送的奥秘第三篇第二十九段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I The kingdom of God is God HimselfMark 115 426 30 Matt 633 John 33 1 Cor 420 Luke 92 60"}
{"zh": "一\t神的国是以神为内容；神自己就是一切，作祂的国的内容─林前四20，十五28，路九2、60。（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；李常受文集一九八六年第二册，神的经纶与神圣三一输送的奥秘，第三篇，第二十九段**）", "en": "A.\tGod's kingdom has God as its content; God Himself is everything as the content of His kingdom—1 Cor. 4:20; 15:28; Luke 9:2, 60.", "norm_zh": "一神的国是以神为内容神自己就是一切作祂的国的内容林前四20十五28路九2602005年秋季长老训练第八篇李常受文集一九八六年第二册神的经纶与神圣三一输送的奥秘第三篇第二十九段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A Gods kingdom has God as its content God Himself is everything as the content of His kingdom1 Cor 420 1528 Luke 92 60"}
{"zh": "三\t实际上，神在我们身上的掌权不是外在的，乃是神圣生命本能的事─罗八2、4下，5~6节。（2017年安那翰春季全时间训练，第八篇；李常受文集一九八六年第二册，神的经纶与神圣三一输送的奥秘，第三篇，第二十六段**）", "en": "C.\tIn actuality, God's reigning over us is not an outward matter but a matter of the innate ability of the divine life—Rom. 8:2, 4b, 5-6.", "norm_zh": "三实际上神在我们身上的掌权不是外在的乃是神圣生命本能的事罗八24下56节2017年安哪翰春季全时间训练第八篇李常受文集一九八六年第二册神的经纶与神圣三一输送的奥秘第三篇第二十六段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C In actuality Gods reigning over us is not an outward matter but a matter of the innate ability of the divine lifeRom 82 4b 56"}
{"zh": "五\t神的国的性质是神圣的，因为是“神”的国—罗十四17，太五3、20，约三3、5，来十二28。（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；新约总论，第二百五十篇，第二十一段**）", "en": "E.\tThe nature of the kingdom of God is divine because it is the kingdom of God.—Rom. 14:17; Matt. 5:3, 20; John 3:3, 5; Heb. 12:28.", "norm_zh": "五神的国的性质是神圣的因为是神的国罗十四17太五320约三35来十二282005年秋季长老训练第八篇新约总论第二百五十篇第二十一段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E The nature of the kingdom of God is divine because it is the kingdom of GodRom 1417 Matt 53 20 John 33 5 Heb 1228"}
{"zh": "六\t主耶稣说，“神的国已经临近了”─可一15，太十二28，路十一20，十七21，二一31，约三3、5：（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇）", "en": "F.\tThe Lord Jesus said, \"The kingdom of God has drawn near\"—Mark 1:15; Matt. 12:28; Luke 11:20; 17:21; 21:31; John 3:3, 5:", "norm_zh": "六主耶稣说神的国已经临近了可一15太十二28路十一20十七21二一31约三352005年秋季长老训练第八篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "F The Lord Jesus said The kingdom of God has drawn nearMark 115 Matt 1228 Luke 1120 1721 2131 John 33 5"}
{"zh": "一\t神的国乃是神圣生命的范围，让这生命行动、工作、治理、管治，使生命能完成其目的─3、5节。（2017年安那翰春季全时间训练，第八篇；李常受文集一九八四年第二册，长老训练二—主恢复的异象，第四章，第六段*）", "en": "A.\tThe kingdom of God is the realm of the divine life for this life to move, to work, to rule, and to govern so that life may accomplish its purpose—vv. 3, 5.", "norm_zh": "一神的国乃是神圣生命的范围让这生命行动工作治理管治使生命能完成其目的35节2017年安哪翰春季全时间训练第八篇李常受文集一九八四年第二册长老训练二主恢复的异象第四章第六段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The kingdom of God is the realm of the divine life for this life to move to work to rule and to govern so that life may accomplish its purposevv 3 5"}
{"zh": "二\t神的国是由神的生命所构成的生机体，作为生命的范围，让祂得以治理，在其中祂以祂的生命掌权，并在神圣生命里彰显祂自己这神圣的三一—─3、5、15~16节，十五1~8、16、26。（2017年安那翰春季全时间训练，第八篇***）", "en": "B.\tThe kingdom of God is an organism constituted with God's life as the realm of life for His ruling, in which He reigns by His life and expresses Himself in the Divine Trinity in the divine life—vv. 3, 5, 15-16; 15:1-8, 16, 26.", "norm_zh": "二神的国是由神的生命所构成的生机体作为生命的范围让祂得以治理在其中祂以祂的生命掌权并在神圣生命里彰显祂自己这神圣的三一351516节十五1816262017年安哪翰春季全时间训练第八篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The kingdom of God is an organism constituted with Gods life as the realm of life for His ruling in which He reigns by His life and expresses Himself in the Divine Trinity in the divine lifevv 3 5 1516 1518 16 26"}
{"zh": "三\t神的国乃是神在基督里作生命连同其一切活动的总和─十一25，十10下，十四6、10~11。（2017年安那翰春季全时间训练，第八篇；李常受文集一九七二年第二册，国度，第三章，第十六段**）", "en": "C.\tThe kingdom of God is God in Christ being the totality of life with all its activities—11:25; 10:10b; 14:6, 10-11.", "norm_zh": "三神的国乃是神在基督里作生命连同其一切活动的总和十一25十10下十四610112017年安哪翰春季全时间训练第八篇李常受文集一九七二年第二册国度第三章第十六段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The kingdom of God is God in Christ being the totality of life with all its activities1125 1010b 146 1011"}
{"zh": "4\t我们已经生入神的国，现今那在我们灵里神圣的生命认识神的国─3、5~6节，太五3，路十七21。（2017年安那翰春季全时间训练，第八篇；李常受文集一九九三年第二册，那灵同我们的灵，第十篇，第四十段**；约翰福音生命读经，第九篇，第十八段*）", "en": "D.\tWe have been born into the kingdom of God, and now the divine life in our spirit knows the kingdom of God—vv. 3, 5-6; Matt. 5:3; Luke 17:21.", "norm_zh": "4我们已经生入神的国现今哪在我们灵里神圣的生命认识神的国356节太五3路十七212017年安哪翰春季全时间训练第八篇李常受文集一九九三年第二册哪灵同我们的灵第十篇第四十段约翰福音生命读经第九篇第十八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D We have been born into the kingdom of God and now the divine life in our spirit knows the kingdom of Godvv 3 56 Matt 53 Luke 1721"}
{"zh": "五\t国度有其实际，这实际就是神圣生命的生活─太五3、8、20，六33，七21，罗十四17，路十七21。（2017年安那翰春季全时间训练，第八篇；李常受文集一九八四年第二册，长老训练二—主恢复的异象，第四章，第二十六段*）", "en": "E.\tThe kingdom has its reality, and this reality is the living of the divine life—Matt. 5:3, 8, 20; 6:33; 7:21; Rom. 14:17; Luke 17:21.", "norm_zh": "五国度有其实际这实际就是神圣生命的生活太五3820六33七21罗十四17路十七212017年安哪翰春季全时间训练第八篇李常受文集一九八四年第二册长老训练二主恢复的异象第四章第二十六段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "E The kingdom has its reality and this reality is the living of the divine lifeMatt 53 8 20 633 721 Rom 1417 Luke 1721"}
{"zh": "叁\t神的国在生命一面乃是主耶稣作生命的种子，撒到祂的信徒里面，并发展成为一个范围，就是神的国，使神在祂神圣的生命里，能在其中掌权─十七20~21，可四3、26：（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；使徒行传生命读经，第二十二篇，第二十七段*）", "en": "III. The kingdom of God in the sense of life is the Lord Jesus as the seed of life sown into His believers and developing into a realm over which God can rule as His kingdom in His divine life—Luke 17:20-21; Mark 4:3, 26:", "norm_zh": "叁神的国在生命一面乃是主耶稣作生命的种子撒到祂的信徒里面并发展成为一个范围就是神的国使神在祂神圣的生命里能在其中掌权十七2021可四3262005年秋季长老训练第八篇使徒行传生命读经第二十二篇第二十七段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III The kingdom of God in the sense of life is the Lord Jesus as the seed of life sown into His believers and developing into a realm over which God can rule as His kingdom in His divine lifeLuke 172021 Mark 43 26"}
{"zh": "三\t基督作为神国第一粒的生命种子，将祂自己撒在相信祂的人里面，使祂能在他们里面长大并生活，且从他们里面发展出来，产生许多子粒─太十三3~8、18~23，约十二24，彼前一23。（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；真理课程，一级，第二十三课，第八十九段*）", "en": "C. Christ, as the first seed of life of the kingdom of God, sowed Himself into His believers that He might grow and live in them and be developed from within them to bring forth many grains—Matt. 13:3-8, 18-23; John 12:24; 1 Pet. 1:23.", "norm_zh": "三基督作为神国第一粒的生命种子将祂自己撒在相信祂的人里面使祂能在他们里面长大并生活且从他们里面发展出来产生许多子粒太十三381823约十二24彼前一232005年秋季长老训练第八篇真理课程一级第二十三课第八十九段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Christ as the first seed of life of the kingdom of God sowed Himself into His believers that He might grow and live in them and be developed from within them to bring forth many grainsMatt 1338 1823 John 1224 1 Pet 123"}
{"zh": "六\t国度乃是基督自己作生命的种子，撒在我们里面，在我们里面生长，在我们里面扩展，并在我们里面成熟，直到有了完满的收割─国度的实现─太十三43上，3~8、18~23节，启十四15。（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；李常受文集一九七二年第二册，国度，第四章，第二段*）", "en": "F. The kingdom is Christ Himself as the seed of life sown into us, growing in us, spreading in us, and maturing in us until there is a full harvest—the manifestation of the kingdom—Matt. 13:43a, vv. 3-8, 18-23; Rev. 14:15.", "norm_zh": "六国度乃是基督自己作生命的种子撒在我们里面在我们里面生长在我们里面扩展并在我们里面成熟直到有了完满的收割国度的实现太十三43上381823节启十四152005年秋季长老训练第八篇李常受文集一九七二年第二册国度第四章第二段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "F The kingdom is Christ Himself as the seed of life sown into us growing in us spreading in us and maturing in us until there is a full harvestthe manifestation of the kingdomMatt 1343a vv 38 1823 Rev 1415"}
{"zh": "一\t承受神的国不仅仅是进入国度，乃是得着国度为赏赐，作我们的享受─太二五14、21，十九29，约壹一2。（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；新约总论，第一百五十九篇，第三十四段*）", "en": "A. To inherit the kingdom of God is not simply to enter into the kingdom; it is to receive the kingdom as a reward for our enjoyment—Matt. 25:14, 21; 19:29; 1 John 1:2.", "norm_zh": "一承受神的国不仅仅是进入国度乃是得着国度为赏赐作我们的享受太二五1421十九29约壹一22005年秋季长老训练第八篇新约总论第一百五十九篇第三十四段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A To inherit the kingdom of God is not simply to enter into the kingdom it is to receive the kingdom as a reward for our enjoymentMatt 2514 21 1929 1 John 12"}
{"zh": "二\t承受神的国就是承受永远的生命，作我们的享受─可四26~27，约壹一2，二25，五11~13。（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；真理课程，一级，第二十三课，第九十八段*）", "en": "B. To inherit the kingdom of God is to inherit eternal life as our enjoyment—Mark 4:26-27; 1 John 1:2; 2:25; 5:11-13.", "norm_zh": "二承受神的国就是承受永远的生命作我们的享受可四2627约壹一2二25五11132005年秋季长老训练第八篇真理课程一级第二十三课第九十八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B To inherit the kingdom of God is to inherit eternal life as our enjoymentMark 42627 1 John 12 225 51113"}
{"zh": "四\t承受神的国与借着重生进入神的国不同─林前六10下，约三5，一12~13，三5、15，加五21下，弗五5下：（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；新约总论，第二百四十一篇，第二十九段*）", "en": "D. Inheriting the kingdom of God is different from entering into the kingdom of God through regeneration—1 Cor. 6:10b; John 3:5; 1:12-13; 3:5, 15; Gal. 5:21b; Eph. 5:5b:", "norm_zh": "四承受神的国与借着重生进入神的国不同林前六10下约三5一1213三515加五21下弗五5下2005年秋季长老训练第八篇新约总论第二百四十一篇第二十九段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D Inheriting the kingdom of God is different from entering into the kingdom of God through regeneration1 Cor 610b John 35 11213 35 15 Gal 521b Eph 55b"}
{"zh": "1\t当我们相信主耶稣，我们就蒙重生，得着永远的生命，并且进入国度─约一12~13，三5、15。（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；李常受文集一九八三年第三册，圣经中的基本启示，第六章，第四十二段*）", "en": "1. When we believed in the Lord Jesus, we were regenerated, received eternal life, and entered into the kingdom—John 1:12-13; 3:5, 15.", "norm_zh": "1当我们相信主耶稣我们就蒙重生得着永远的生命并且进入国度约一1213三5152005年秋季长老训练第八篇李常受文集一九八三年第三册圣经中的基本启示第六章第四十二段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 When we believed in the Lord Jesus we were regenerated received eternal life and entered into the kingdomJohn 11213 35 15"}
{"zh": "伍\t我们需要凭永远的生命活在神的国里，在今世经历并享受永远的生命，使我们在来世可以承受神的国，也就是承受对神永远生命完满的享受，作我们的赏赐─约三5，罗八2、6、10~11，十四17，林前六10下：（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；真理课程，一级，第二十三课，第九十八段**）", "en": "V. We need to live in the kingdom of God by the eternal life, experiencing and enjoying the eternal life in this age, so that we may inherit the kingdom of God in the coming age, that is, inherit the full enjoyment of God's eternal life as our reward—John 3:5; Rom. 8:2, 6, 10-11; 14:17; 1 Cor. 6:10b:", "norm_zh": "伍我们需要凭永远的生命活在神的国里在今世经历并享受永远的生命使我们在来世可以承受神的国也就是承受对神永远生命完满的享受作我们的赏赐约三5罗八261011十四17林前六10下2005年秋季长老训练第八篇真理课程一级第二十三课第九十八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "V We need to live in the kingdom of God by the eternal life experiencing and enjoying the eternal life in this age so that we may inherit the kingdom of God in the coming age that is inherit the full enjoyment of Gods eternal life as our rewardJohn 35 Rom 82 6 1011 1417 1 Cor 610b"}
{"zh": "一\t接受永远的生命而进入神的国，以及照着永远的生命活着而承受神的国，两者都是生命的事─约三3、15，太十九29。（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；真理课程，一级，第二十三课，第九十八段**）", "en": "A. To receive eternal life and enter into the kingdom of God and to live according to eternal life and inherit the kingdom of God are both a matter of life—John 3:3, 15; Matt. 19:29.", "norm_zh": "一接受永远的生命而进入神的国以及照着永远的生命活着而承受神的国两者都是生命的事约三315太十九292005年秋季长老训练第八篇真理课程一级第二十三课第九十八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A To receive eternal life and enter into the kingdom of God and to live according to eternal life and inherit the kingdom of God are both a matter of lifeJohn 33 15 Matt 1929"}
{"zh": "二\t我们应当殷勤追求让我们里面的神圣生命长大并发展，直到我们得着丰富充足的供应，以进入“我们主和救主耶稣基督永远的国”─彼后一5~11，罗八2、6、10，林前六10，太十九29。（2005年秋季长老训练，第八篇；真理课程，一级，第二十三课，第九十八段**）", "en": "B. We should be diligent to pursue the growth and development of the divine life within us until we are richly and bountifully supplied the entrance into \"the eternal kingdom of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ\"—2 Pet. 1:5-11; Rom. 8:2, 6, 10; 1 Cor. 6:10; Matt. 19:29.", "norm_zh": "二我们应当殷勤追求让我们里面的神圣生命长大并发展直到我们得着丰富充足的供应以进入我们主和救主耶稣基督永远的国彼后一511罗八2610林前六10太十九292005年秋季长老训练第八篇真理课程一级第二十三课第九十八段", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:49:46.295343+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B We should be diligent to pursue the growth and development of the divine life within us until we are richly and bountifully supplied the entrance into the eternal kingdom of our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ2 Pet 1511 Rom 82 6 10 1 Cor 610 Matt 1929"}
{"zh": "读经：但四26，太三2，十三24~43，十六18~19，二四44~二五30，二五31、34", "en": "Scripture Reading: Dan. 4:26; Matt. 3:2; 13:24-43; 16:18-19; 24:44-25:30; 25:31, 34", "norm_zh": "读经但四26太三2十三2443十六1819二四44二五30二五3134", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Scripture Reading Dan 426 Matt 32 132443 161819 24442530 2531 34"}
{"zh": "壹\t诸天的国是诸天的掌权；是神国里特殊的部分，是神在生命上特别的掌权；根据马太福音，诸天的国有实际、外表和实现三面—但四26，太三2，十六18~19。", "en": "I. The kingdom of the heavens is the ruling of the heavens; it is a particular section of the kingdom of God, which is God's particular reigning in the sense of life; according to the Gospel of Matthew, there are three aspects of the kingdom of the heavens: the reality, the outward appearance, and the manifestation.—Dan. 4:26; Matt. 3:2; 16:18-19.", "norm_zh": "壹诸天的国是诸天的掌权是神国里特殊的部分是神在生命上特别的掌权根据马太福音诸天的国有实际外表和实现三面但四26太三2十六1819", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I The kingdom of the heavens is the ruling of the heavens it is a particular section of the kingdom of God which is Gods particular reigning in the sense of life according to the Gospel of Matthew there are three aspects of the kingdom of the heavens the reality the outward appearance and the manifestationDan 426 Matt 32 161819"}
{"zh": "贰\t诸天之国的实际，乃是诸天之国属天和属灵性质上的内容，如在五至七章所启示的：", "en": "II. The reality of the kingdom of the heavens is the inward content of the kingdom of the heavens in its heavenly and spiritual nature, as revealed in chapters 5 through 7:", "norm_zh": "贰诸天之国的实际乃是诸天之国属天和属灵性质上的内容如在五至七章所启示的", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "II The reality of the kingdom of the heavens is the inward content of the kingdom of the heavens in its heavenly and spiritual nature as revealed in chapters 5 through 7"}
{"zh": "一\t马太五至七章的记载，给我们看见一种实际，就是神圣生命高标准的实际，这乃是得胜的召会生活。", "en": "A. The record of Matthew 5—7 gives us a view of a certain kind of reality, the reality of the high standard of the divine life; this is the overcoming church life.", "norm_zh": "一马太五至七章的记载给我们看见一种实际就是神圣生命高标准的实际这乃是得胜的召会生活", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The record of Matthew 57 gives us a view of a certain kind of reality the reality of the high standard of the divine life this is the overcoming church life"}
{"zh": "二\t今天的基督教里，没有多少诸天之国的实际；诸天之国的实际，今天在召会时代存于召会里面—太十三24~43。", "en": "B. There is not much of the reality of the kingdom of the heavens in today's Christianity; the reality of the kingdom of the heavens exists today within the church in the church age.—Matt. 13:24-43.", "norm_zh": "二今天的基督教里没有多少诸天之国的实际诸天之国的实际今天在召会时代存于召会里面太十三2443", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B There is not much of the reality of the kingdom of the heavens in todays Christianity the reality of the kingdom of the heavens exists today within the church in the church ageMatt 132443"}
{"zh": "三\t诸天之国的实际对寻求的信徒是操练—五4~10：", "en": "C.\tThe reality of the kingdom of the heavens is an exercise to the seeking believers.—5:4-10:", "norm_zh": "三诸天之国的实际对寻求的信徒是操练五410", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C The reality of the kingdom of the heavens is an exercise to the seeking believers5410"}
{"zh": "1\t我们人的这部分，必须是贫穷的、倒空的、卸去旧有的，这样我们才能领悟并得着诸天的国—3节。", "en": "1. We need to be poor, emptied, unloaded, in this part of our being so that we may realize and possess the kingdom of the heavens.—v. 3.", "norm_zh": "1我们人的这部分必须是贫穷的倒空的卸去旧有的这样我们才能领悟并得着诸天的国3节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 We need to be poor emptied unloaded in this part of our being so that we may realize and possess the kingdom of the heavensv 3"}
{"zh": "2\t世界的每一面都是不义的；我们若是义的，就会遭受定罪、反对并逼迫；我们若出代价寻求义，诸天的国就成为我们的—约壹五19，太五6、10。", "en": "2. Every aspect of the world is unrighteous; if we are righteous, we shall be condemned, opposed, and persecuted; if we pay a price to seek righteousness, the kingdom of the heavens becomes ours.—1 John 5:19; Matt. 5:6, 10.", "norm_zh": "2世界的每一面都是不义的我们若是义的就会遭受定罪反对并逼迫我们若出代价寻求义诸天的国就成为我们的约壹五19太五610", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Every aspect of the world is unrighteous if we are righteous we shall be condemned opposed and persecuted if we pay a price to seek righteousness the kingdom of the heavens becomes ours1 John 519 Matt 56 10"}
{"zh": "3\t“你们的义，若不超过经学家和法利赛人的义，绝不能进诸天的国”；进诸天的国，要求我们重生之后，在生活中有超凡的义，意即今天活在诸天之国的实际里，将来有分于诸天之国的实现—20节，林前一30，罗三26。", "en": "3. \"Unless your righteousness surpasses that of the scribes and Pharisees, you shall by no means enter into the kingdom of the heavens\"; to enter into the kingdom of the heavens demands surpassing righteousness in our living after regeneration, which means to live in its reality today and to participate in its manifestation in the future.—v. 20; 1 Cor. 1:30; Rom. 3:26.", "norm_zh": "3你们的义若不超过经学家和法利赛人的义绝不能进诸天的国进诸天的国要求我们重生之后在生活中有超凡的义意即今天活在诸天之国的实际里将来有分于诸天之国的实现20节林前一30罗三26", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 Unless your righteousness surpasses that of the scribes and Pharisees you shall by no means enter into the kingdom of the heavens to enter into the kingdom of the heavens demands surpassing righteousness in our living after regeneration which means to live in its reality today and to participate in its manifestation in the futurev 20 1 Cor 130 Rom 326"}
{"zh": "4\t我们要进诸天的国，需要呼求主，并实行天父的旨意；进神的国是借着神圣生命的出生，进诸天的国是借着神圣生命的生活—约三3、5，太七21，罗十13。", "en": "4. To enter into the kingdom of the heavens, we need to call on the Lord and do the will of the heavenly Father; entrance into the kingdom of God is through being born of the divine life, and entrance into the kingdom of the heavens is through the living of the divine life.—John 3:3, 5; Matt. 7:21; Rom. 10:13.", "norm_zh": "4我们要进诸天的国需要呼求主并实行天父的旨意进神的国是借着神圣生命的出生进诸天的国是借着神圣生命的生活约三35太七21罗十13", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "4 To enter into the kingdom of the heavens we need to call on the Lord and do the will of the heavenly Father entrance into the kingdom of God is through being born of the divine life and entrance into the kingdom of the heavens is through the living of the divine lifeJohn 33 5 Matt 721 Rom 1013"}
{"zh": "叁\t诸天之国的外表，乃是诸天之国名义上的外状，如在马太十三章二十四至四十三节，借着稗子、芥菜种和面酵的比喻所启示的：", "en": "III. The outward appearance of the kingdom of the heavens is the outward condition of the kingdom of the heavens in name, as revealed in Matthew 13:24-43 through the parables of the tares, the mustard seed, and the leaven:", "norm_zh": "叁诸天之国的外表乃是诸天之国名义上的外状如在马太十三章二十四至四十三节借着稗子芥菜种和面酵的比喻所启示的", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "III The outward appearance of the kingdom of the heavens is the outward condition of the kingdom of the heavens in name as revealed in Matthew 132443 through the parables of the tares the mustard seed and the leaven"}
{"zh": "一\t诸天之国的外表，就是今日的基督教国，包括罗马天主教和一切假基督徒—十三24~43：", "en": "A. The appearance of the kingdom of the heavens is today's Christendom, which includes the Roman Catholic Church and all the false Christians.—13:24-43:", "norm_zh": "一诸天之国的外表就是今日的基督教国包括罗马天主教和一切假基督徒十三2443", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The appearance of the kingdom of the heavens is todays Christendom which includes the Roman Catholic Church and all the false Christians132443"}
{"zh": "1\t稗子的比喻启示国度的建立及其假冒的成分；国度之子构成了国度；恶者之子形成了国度的外表，就是今天所谓的基督教国—24~30、36~43节。", "en": "1. The parable of the tares reveals the establishment of the kingdom and its false constituents; the sons of the kingdom constitute the kingdom, whereas the sons of the evil one have formed the outward appearance of the kingdom, which today is called Christendom.—vv. 24-30, 36-43.", "norm_zh": "1稗子的比喻启示国度的建立及其假冒的成分国度之子构成了国度恶者之子形成了国度的外表就是今天所谓的基督教国24303643节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 The parable of the tares reveals the establishment of the kingdom and its false constituents the sons of the kingdom constitute the kingdom whereas the sons of the evil one have formed the outward appearance of the kingdom which today is called Christendomvv 2430 3643"}
{"zh": "2\t芥菜种的比喻说到国度外表的畸形发展；召会是国度的具体表现，该像菜蔬一样生产食物，却成了树，作飞鸟的宿处，其性质和功用都变了；这形成了诸天之国外表的外在组织—十三31~32。", "en": "2. The parable of the mustard seed speaks of the abnormal growth of the outward appearance of the kingdom; the church, which is the embodiment of the kingdom, should be like an herb to produce food, but it became a tree, a lodge for birds, having its nature and function changed; this has formed the outward organization of the outward appearance of the kingdom of the heavens.—Matt. 13:31-32.", "norm_zh": "2芥菜种的比喻说到国度外表的畸形发展召会是国度的具体表现该像菜蔬一样生产食物却成了树作飞鸟的宿处其性质和功用都变了这形成了诸天之国外表的外在组织十三3132", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 The parable of the mustard seed speaks of the abnormal growth of the outward appearance of the kingdom the church which is the embodiment of the kingdom should be like an herb to produce food but it became a tree a lodge for birds having its nature and function changed this has formed the outward organization of the outward appearance of the kingdom of the heavensMatt 133132"}
{"zh": "3\t面酵藏在细面里的比喻说到国度外表的内在腐败；酵藏在三斗面里，象征天主教暗中使一切关于基督的教训都发了酵；这就成为诸天之国外表的腐败内容—33节，十六6、11~12，，林前五6、8，利二1，创十八6，林前五7~8。", "en": "3. The parable of the leaven hidden in the fine flour speaks of the inward corruption of the outward appearance of the kingdom; the leaven hidden in three measures of meal signifies that the Catholic Church has leavened in a hidden way all the teachings concerning Christ; this became the corrupted content of the outward appearance of the kingdom of the heavens.—v. 33; 16:6, 11-12; 1 Cor. 5:6, 8; Lev. 2:1; Gen. 18:6; 1 Cor. 5:7-8.", "norm_zh": "3面酵藏在细面里的比喻说到国度外表的内在腐败酵藏在三斗面里象征天主教暗中使一切关于基督的教训都发了酵这就成为诸天之国外表的腐败内容33节十六61112林前五68利二1创十八6林前五78", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "3 The parable of the leaven hidden in the fine flour speaks of the inward corruption of the outward appearance of the kingdom the leaven hidden in three measures of meal signifies that the Catholic Church has leavened in a hidden way all the teachings concerning Christ this became the corrupted content of the outward appearance of the kingdom of the heavensv 33 166 1112 1 Cor 56 8 Lev 21 Gen 186 1 Cor 578"}
{"zh": "二\t诸天之国的外表，在召会时代与召会一同存在；原则上，我们不允许稗子在召会生活里，我们也不允许大树及其畸形发展，或面酵及其腐败在召会里—太十三24~30、36~43。", "en": "B. The outward appearance of the kingdom of the heavens exists along with the church in the church age; as a principle, we do not allow tares in the church life, and we do not allow the big tree with its abnormal growth or the leaven with its corruption to be in the church.—Matt. 13:24-30, 36-43.", "norm_zh": "二诸天之国的外表在召会时代与召会一同存在原则上我们不允许稗子在召会生活里我们也不允许大树及其畸形发展或面酵及其腐败在召会里太十三24303643", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The outward appearance of the kingdom of the heavens exists along with the church in the church age as a principle we do not allow tares in the church life and we do not allow the big tree with its abnormal growth or the leaven with its corruption to be in the churchMatt 132430 3643"}
{"zh": "肆\t诸天的国乃是主耶稣的属天管治，属天行政—二五31、34：", "en": "IV.\tThe kingdom of the heavens is the heavenly ruling, the heavenly government, of the Lord Jesus.—Matt. 25:31, 34:", "norm_zh": "肆诸天的国乃是主耶稣的属天管治属天行政二五3134", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "IV The kingdom of the heavens is the heavenly ruling the heavenly government of the Lord JesusMatt 2531 34"}
{"zh": "一\t马太福音里的基督乃是君王救主，在我们里面建立诸天的国管治我们—五3，四17。", "en": "A.\tThe Christ in Matthew is the King-Savior who sets up the kingdom of the heavens over us and within us:—Matt. 5:3; 4:17.", "norm_zh": "一马太福音里的基督乃是君王救主在我们里面建立诸天的国管治我们五3四17", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A The Christ in Matthew is the KingSavior who sets up the kingdom of the heavens over us and within usMatt 53 417"}
{"zh": "1\t祂进入我们的灵，国度就与祂一同进来—22节。", "en": "1\tWhen He came into our spirit, the kingdom arrived with Him.—v. 22.", "norm_zh": "1祂进入我们的灵国度就与祂一同进来22节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 When He came into our spirit the kingdom arrived with Himv 22"}
{"zh": "2\t如今在我们灵里，我们有王带着国度；因此，说主与我们的灵同在，意思就是国度与我们的灵同在—22节。", "en": "2\tNow in our spirit we have the King with the kingdom; thus, to say that the Lord is with our spirit means that the kingdom is with our spirit.—v. 22.", "norm_zh": "2如今在我们灵里我们有王带着国度因此说主与我们的灵同在意思就是国度与我们的灵同在22节", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 Now in our spirit we have the King with the kingdom thus to say that the Lord is with our spirit means that the kingdom is with our spiritv 22"}
{"zh": "三\t神重生我们的目的，是要把我们带到祂属天的管治之下—约三3、5：", "en": "B.\tGod's intention in regenerating us is to bring us under His heavenly rule:—John 3:3, 5:", "norm_zh": "三神重生我们的目的是要把我们带到祂属天的管治之下约三35", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B Gods intention in regenerating us is to bring us under His heavenly ruleJohn 33 5"}
{"zh": "1\t我们已经生在君尊、属天的家庭里，我们必须有属天的操练，并受属天管治的支配—太五48。", "en": "1\tWe have been born into a royal, heavenly family, and we must be exercised in a heavenly way and be governed by a heavenly rule.—Matt. 5:48.", "norm_zh": "1我们已经生在君尊属天的家庭里我们必须有属天的操练并受属天管治的支配太五48", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 We have been born into a royal heavenly family and we must be exercised in a heavenly way and be governed by a heavenly ruleMatt 548"}
{"zh": "2\t我们若在这管治之下，我们就是得胜的，我们就在诸天之国的实际里，我们也进入诸天之国的实现里，与主一同管治并掌权—二五21、23，启二十4、6。", "en": "2\tIf we are under this ruling, we will be victorious and overcoming, we will be in the reality of the kingdom of the heavens, and we will enter into the manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens to rule and reign with the Lord.—Matt. 25:21, 23; Rev. 20:4, 6.", "norm_zh": "2我们若在这管治之下我们就是得胜的我们就在诸天之国的实际里我们也进入诸天之国的实现里与主一同管治并掌权二五2123启二十46", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2 If we are under this ruling we will be victorious and overcoming we will be in the reality of the kingdom of the heavens and we will enter into the manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens to rule and reign with the LordMatt 2521 23 Rev 204 6"}
{"zh": "伍\t诸天之国的实现，乃是诸天之国在大能里实际地来临，如在马太二十四章四十四节至二十五章三十节所启示的：", "en": "V. The manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens is the practical coming of the kingdom of the heavens in power, as revealed in Matthew 24:44—25:30:", "norm_zh": "伍诸天之国的实现乃是诸天之国在大能里实际地来临如在马太二十四章四十四节至二十五章三十节所启示的", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "V The manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens is the practical coming of the kingdom of the heavens in power as revealed in Matthew 24442530"}
{"zh": "一\t在现今的时代，国度的实际与国度的外表同时进展；然而，主耶稣回来时，国度的实际要转为国度的实现，国度的外表要被烧尽—十三40~42。", "en": "A. During the present age, the reality of the kingdom and the appearance of the kingdom progress simultaneously; however, when the Lord Jesus comes back, the reality of the kingdom will be transferred into the manifestation of the kingdom, and the appearance of the kingdom will be burned away.—Matt. 13:40-42.", "norm_zh": "一在现今的时代国度的实际与国度的外表同时进展然而主耶稣回来时国度的实际要转为国度的实现国度的外表要被烧尽十三4042", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "A During the present age the reality of the kingdom and the appearance of the kingdom progress simultaneously however when the Lord Jesus comes back the reality of the kingdom will be transferred into the manifestation of the kingdom and the appearance of the kingdom will be burned awayMatt 134042"}
{"zh": "二\t千年国的属天部分将是父的国；这将是诸天之国的实现，作得胜者的赏赐；千年国时，在国度属天部分的得胜者，要与基督一同掌权管理属地部分，就是大卫复兴的国，在那里基督为人子，大卫王室的后裔，要作以色列人的王—41、43节，撒下七13，徒十五16，启十一15。", "en": "B. The heavenly part of the millennium will be the kingdom of the Father; this will be the manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens as a reward to the overcomers; in the millennium the overcomers in the heavenly part of the kingdom will reign with Christ over the earthly part, which will be the restored kingdom of David, where Christ as the Son of Man, David’s royal descendant, will be the King over the children of Israel.—vv. 41, 43; 2 Sam. 7:13; Acts 15:16; Rev. 11:15.", "norm_zh": "二千年国的属天部分将是父的国这将是诸天之国的实现作得胜者的赏赐千年国时在国度属天部分的得胜者要与基督一同掌权管理属地部分就是大卫复兴的国在哪里基督为人子大卫王室的后裔要作以色列人的王4143节撒下七13徒十五16启十一15", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "B The heavenly part of the millennium will be the kingdom of the Father this will be the manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens as a reward to the overcomers in the millennium the overcomers in the heavenly part of the kingdom will reign with Christ over the earthly part which will be the restored kingdom of David where Christ as the Son of Man Davids royal descendant will be the King over the children of Israelvv 41 43 2 Sam 713 Acts 1516 Rev 1115"}
{"zh": "三\t惟有今天在诸天之国实际里的得胜者，将来才会有分于诸天之国的实现；诸天之国的实现将是给得胜者的赏赐，奖赏—提后四18，太十三43，二六29，弗五5，彼后一11。", "en": "C. Only the overcomers who are in the reality of the kingdom of the heavens today will have a share in the manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens in the future; the manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens will be a reward, a prize, given to the overcomers.—2 Tim. 4:18; Matt. 13:43; 26:29; Eph. 5:5; 2 Pet. 1:11.", "norm_zh": "三惟有今天在诸天之国实际里的得胜者将来才会有分于诸天之国的实现诸天之国的实现将是给得胜者的赏赐奖赏提后四18太十三43二六29弗五5彼后一11", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "C Only the overcomers who are in the reality of the kingdom of the heavens today will have a share in the manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens in the future the manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens will be a reward a prize given to the overcomers2 Tim 418 Matt 1343 2629 Eph 55 2 Pet 111"}
{"zh": "四\t诸天之国的实现将在千年国时代，存于千年国；诸天之国的实际是随着今世的召会，而诸天之国的实现将是在来世—11节，罗十四17。", "en": "D. The manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens will exist in the millennium during the age of the millennium; whereas the reality of the kingdom of the heavens is with the church in this age, the manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens will be in the coming age.—v. 11; Rom. 14:17.", "norm_zh": "四诸天之国的实现将在千年国时代存于千年国诸天之国的实际是随着今世的召会而诸天之国的实现将是在来世11节罗十四17", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T05:52:27.568330+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "D The manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens will exist in the millennium during the age of the millennium whereas the reality of the kingdom of the heavens is with the church in this age the manifestation of the kingdom of the heavens will be in the coming agev 11 Rom 1417"}
