{"zh": "约翰福音                      生命的福音—证明耶稣基督是神救主，来作生命，使神得扩增。", "en": "John: The Gospel of Life—Proving That Jesus Christ Is God the Savior, Coming That He May Be Life and That God May Have His Increase.", "norm_zh": "约翰福音生命的福音证明耶稣基督是神救主来作生命使神得扩增", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T06:23:42.375739+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "John The Gospel of LifeProving That Jesus Christ Is God the Savior Coming That He May Be Life and That God May Have His Increase"}
{"zh": "罗马书                     神的福音—将罪人作成神的儿子，构成基督的身体，显为在地方上的召会。", "en": "Romans: The Gospel of God—To Make Sinners Sons of God, to Constitute the Body of Christ, Which Is Expressed as the Local Churches.", "norm_zh": "罗马书神的福音将罪人作成神的儿子构成基督的身体显为在地方上的召会", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T06:23:42.375739+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Romans The Gospel of GodTo Make Sinners Sons of God to Constitute the Body of Christ Which Is Expressed as the Local Churches"}
