{"zh": "歌罗西书                       基督—包罗万有、在万有中居首位、作神的奥秘与化身，作召会的头与成分，作圣徒的业分、生命、成分、盼望，并作一切正面事物的实体。", "en": "Colossians: Christ—the All-inclusive One, Having the First Place in All Things, Being the Mystery and Embodiment of God, the Head and Constituent of the Church, the Saints' Portion, Life, Constituent, Hope, and the Reality of All Positive Things.", "norm_zh": "歌罗西书基督包罗万有在万有中居首位作神的奥秘与化身作召会的头与成分作圣徒的业分生命成分盼望并作一切正面事物的实体", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T06:23:42.375739+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Colossians Christthe Allinclusive One Having the First Place in All Things Being the Mystery and Embodiment of God the Head and Constituent of the Church the Saints Portion Life Constituent Hope and the Reality of All Positive Things"}
{"zh": "帖撒罗尼迦前书        为着召会生活的圣别生活—事奉活神，圣别为人，并等候主来。", "en": "1 Thessalonians        A Holy Life for the Church Life—Serving the Living God, Conducting Ourselves Holily, and Waiting for the Lord's Coming.", "norm_zh": "帖撒罗尼迦前书为着召会生活的圣别生活事奉活神圣别为人并等候主来", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T06:23:42.375739+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "1 Thessalonians A Holy Life for the Church LifeServing the Living God Conducting Ourselves Holily and Waiting for the Lords Coming"}
