{"zh": "歌罗西书 基督—包罗万有、在万有中居首位、作神的奥秘与化身，作召会的头与成分，作圣徒的业分、生命、成分、盼望，并作一切正面事物的实体。（圣经恢复本）", "en": "Colossians: Christ—the All-inclusive One, Having the First Place in All Things, as the Mystery and Embodiment of God, as the Head and Constituent of the Church, as the Portion, Life, Constituent, and Hope of the Saints, and as the Body of All Positive Things.", "norm_zh": "歌罗西书基督包罗万有在万有中居首位作神的奥秘与化身作召会的头与成分作圣徒的业分生命成分盼望并作一切正面事物的实体圣经恢复本", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T06:24:08.785901+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Colossians Christthe Allinclusive One Having the First Place in All Things as the Mystery and Embodiment of God as the Head and Constituent of the Church as the Portion Life Constituent and Hope of the Saints and as the Body of All Positive Things"}
