{"zh": "宣读本周纲要大点。", "en": "Reading the main points of the outline for this week.", "norm_zh": "宣读本周纲要大点", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Reading the main points of the outline for this week"}
{"zh": "关于神创造人并对付祂选民之目的这个重大问题的重大答案是什么？把主带回来，召会历史中最大的复兴是什么？", "en": "What is the major answer to the major question of the purpose of God's creation of man and His dealing with His elect? What is the greatest revival in church history, which will bring the Lord back?", "norm_zh": "关于神创造人并对付祂选民之目的这个重大问提的重大答案是什么把主带回来召会历史中最大的复兴是什么", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "What is the major answer to the major question of the purpose of Gods creation of man and His dealing with His elect What is the greatest revival in church history which will bring the Lord back"}
{"zh": "我们借着达到神所赐给我们之神圣启示—神永远经纶之启示—的最高峰，就能进入一个新的复兴；这是关于神创造人并对付祂选民之目的这个重大问题的重大答案。", "en": "By attaining to the high peak of the divine revelation given to us by God—the revelation of God's eternal economy—we can enter into a new revival; this is the major answer to the major question of the purpose of God's creation of man and His dealing with His elect.", "norm_zh": "我们借着达到神所赐给我们之神圣启示神永远经纶之启示的最高峰就能进入一个新的复兴这是关于神创造人并对付祂选民之目的这个重大问提的重大答案", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "By attaining to the high peak of the divine revelation given to us by Godthe revelation of Gods eternal economywe can enter into a new revival this is the major answer to the major question of the purpose of Gods creation of man and His dealing with His elect"}
{"zh": "属灵负担", "en": "The Spiritual Burden", "norm_zh": "属灵负担", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The Spiritual Burden"}
{"zh": "我们借着达到神圣启示的最高峰，借着过神人的生活，并借着有分于基督天上的职事，按着神牧养神的群羊，就能进入一个新的复兴，以结束这个世代。", "en": "By attaining to the high peak of the divine revelation, by living the life of a God-man, and by participating in Christ's heavenly ministry to shepherd the flock of God according to God, we can enter into a new revival to end this age.", "norm_zh": "我们借着达到神圣启示的最高峰借着过神人的生活并借着有分于基督天上的职事按着神牧养神的群羊就能进入一个新的复兴以结束这个世代", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "By attaining to the high peak of the divine revelation by living the life of a Godman and by participating in Christs heavenly ministry to shepherd the flock of God according to God we can enter into a new revival to end this age"}
{"zh": "“我们都该宣告，我们要过神人的生活。至终，神人将是胜利者，得胜者，作耶路撒冷里的锡安。这要带进历史上前所未见新的复兴，也要结束这个世代” 。", "en": "\"We should all declare that we want to live the life of a God-man. Eventually, the God-men will be the victors, the overcomers, the Zion within Jerusalem. This will bring in a new revival which has never been seen in history, and this will end this age.\"", "norm_zh": "我们都该宣告我们要过神人的生活至终神人将是胜利者得胜者作耶路撒冷里的锡安这要带进历史上前所未见新的复兴也要结束这个世代", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "We should all declare that we want to live the life of a Godman Eventually the Godmen will be the victors the overcomers the Zion within Jerusalem This will bring in a new revival which has never been seen in history and this will end this age"}
{"zh": "申言聚会结语参考", "en": "Reference for Concluding the Prophesying Meeting", "norm_zh": "申言聚会结语参考", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Reference for Concluding the Prophesying Meeting"}
{"zh": "真理启示", "en": "The Revelation of the Truth", "norm_zh": "真理启示", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The Revelation of the Truth"}
{"zh": "在神的选民中间，一直有复兴的渴望。", "en": "Among God's elect there has always been an aspiration to be revived.", "norm_zh": "在神的选民中间一直有复兴的渴望", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Among Gods elect there has always been an aspiration to be revived"}
{"zh": "神成为人，好使人在生命和性情上（但不在神格上）成为神，为着产生并建造基督的身体，以终极完成新耶路撒冷；这是整本圣经的要素，是圣经这“盒子”里的“钻石”，也就是神永远的经纶。", "en": "God becoming man that man might become God in life and in nature but not in the Godhead for the producing and building up of the Body of Christ to consummate the New Jerusalem is the essence of the entire Bible, the \"diamond\" in the \"box\" of the Bible, the eternal economy of God.", "norm_zh": "神成为人好使人在生命和性情上但不在神格上成为神为着产生并建造基督的身体以终极完成新耶路撒冷这是整本圣经的要素是圣经这盒子里的钻石也就是神永远的经纶", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "God becoming man that man might become God in life and in nature but not in the Godhead for the producing and building up of the Body of Christ to consummate the New Jerusalem is the essence of the entire Bible the diamond in the box of the Bible the eternal economy of God"}
{"zh": "基督的跟从者被构成为门徒，乃是借着基督在地上的人性生活，作神人的模型，就是祂在人性里否认自己而活神；照着主的模型过神人生活唯一的路，乃是把我们全人置于调和的灵，照着调和的灵行事、生活并为人。", "en": "The followers of Christ are constituted as disciples by Christ's human living on the earth as the model of a God-man, which was His denying of Himself in His humanity to live God; the only way to live the God-man life according to the Lord's model is to set our entire being on the mingled spirit and to walk, live, and have our being according to the mingled spirit.", "norm_zh": "基督的跟从者被构成为门徒乃是借着基督在地上的人性生活作神人的模型就是祂在人性里否认自己而活神照着主的模型过神人生活惟一的路乃是把我们全人置于调和的灵照着调和的灵行事生活并为人", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The followers of Christ are constituted as disciples by Christs human living on the earth as the model of a Godman which was His denying of Himself in His humanity to live God the only way to live the Godman life according to the Lords model is to set our entire being on the mingled spirit and to walk live and have our being according to the mingled spirit"}
{"zh": "实行应用", "en": "Practical Application", "norm_zh": "实行应用", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Practical Application"}
{"zh": "我们借着有分于基督天上的职事，喂养祂的小羊并牧养祂的羊，以照顾神的群羊，就是召会，结果带进基督的身体，就能进入一个新的复兴；这是把使徒的职事和基督天上的职事合并。", "en": "We can enter into a new revival by participating in Christ's heavenly ministry to feed His lambs and shepherd His sheep to take care of the flock of God, which is the church, resulting in the Body of Christ; this is the incorporation of the apostolic ministry with Christ's heavenly ministry.", "norm_zh": "我们借着有分于基督天上的职事喂养祂的小羊并牧养祂的羊以照顾神的群羊就是召会结果带进基督的身体就能进入一个新的复兴这是把使徒的职事和基督天上的职事合并", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "We can enter into a new revival by participating in Christs heavenly ministry to feed His lambs and shepherd His sheep to take care of the flock of God which is the church resulting in the Body of Christ this is the incorporation of the apostolic ministry with Christs heavenly ministry"}
{"zh": "我们必须照着主耶稣在祂尽职时的榜样牧养人，以完成神永远的经纶。", "en": "We need to shepherd people according to the pattern of the Lord Jesus in His ministry for carrying out God's eternal economy.", "norm_zh": "我们必须照着主耶稣在祂尽职时的榜样牧养人以完成神永远的经纶", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "We need to shepherd people according to the pattern of the Lord Jesus in His ministry for carrying out Gods eternal economy"}
{"zh": "我们必须照着使徒保罗的榜样牧养人；保罗牧养圣徒，就像乳养的母亲和劝勉的父亲一样，照顾神的群羊。", "en": "We need to shepherd people according to the pattern of the apostle Paul, who shepherded the saints as a nursing mother and an exhorting father in order to take care of God's flock.", "norm_zh": "我们必须照着使徒保罗的榜样牧养人保罗牧养圣徒就像乳养的母亲和劝勉的父亲一样照顾神的群羊", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "We need to shepherd people according to the pattern of the apostle Paul who shepherded the saints as a nursing mother and an exhorting father in order to take care of Gods flock"}
{"zh": "第二篇", "en": "Message Two", "norm_zh": "第二篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Message Two"}
{"zh": "借这荣耀和美德，祂已将又宝贵又极大的应许赐给我们，叫你们……借着这些应许，得有分于神的性情—彼后一4。", "en": "Through which He has granted to us precious and exceedingly great promises that through these you might... become partakers of the divine nature—2 Pet. 1:4.", "norm_zh": "借这荣耀和美德祂已将又宝贵又极大的应许赐给我们叫你们借着这些应许得有分于神的性情彼后一4", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Through which He has granted to us precious and exceedingly great promises that through these you might become partakers of the divine nature2 Pet 14"}
{"zh": "神所赐给我们神圣启示的最高峰是什么？", "en": "What is the highest peak of the divine revelation given to us by God?", "norm_zh": "神所赐给我们神圣启示的最高峰是什么", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "What is the highest peak of the divine revelation given to us by God"}
{"zh": "神所赐给我们神圣启示的最高峰，乃是神永远经纶的启示—神成为人，为要使人在生命和性情上，但不在神格上，成为神。", "en": "The highest peak of the divine revelation given to us by God is the revelation of the eternal economy of God—God becoming man that man might become God in life and in nature but not in the Godhead.", "norm_zh": "神所赐给我们神圣启示的最高峰乃是神永远经纶的启示神成为人为要使人在生命和性情上但不在神格上成为神", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The highest peak of the divine revelation given to us by God is the revelation of the eternal economy of GodGod becoming man that man might become God in life and in nature but not in the Godhead"}
{"zh": "神所赐给我们神圣启示的最高峰，乃是神永远经纶的启示─神成为人，为要使人成为神。神成为人，是借着成为肉体；人成为神，是借着重生、圣别、更新、变化、模成和得荣。", "en": "The high peak of the divine revelation given to us by God is the revelation of God's eternal economy—God became man to make man God. God became man through incarnation; man becomes God through regeneration, sanctification, renewing, transformation, conformation, and glorification.", "norm_zh": "神所赐给我们神圣启示的最高峰乃是神永远经纶的启示神成为人为要使人成为神神成为人是借着成为肉体人成为神是借着重生圣别更新变化模成和得荣", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The high peak of the divine revelation given to us by God is the revelation of Gods eternal economyGod became man to make man God God became man through incarnation man becomes God through regeneration sanctification renewing transformation conformation and glorification"}
{"zh": "唯有借着神成为人，使人成为神，才能产生基督的身体；这一点是神所赐给我们异象的高峰。神成为人，为要使人成为神，好使神产生基督的身体，就是三一神的生机体，其终极的显出乃是新耶路撒冷。", "en": "It is only by God's becoming man to make man God that the Body of Christ can be produced; this point is the high peak of the vision given to us by God. God became man to make man God that God may produce the Body of Christ, which is the organism of the Triune God, the ultimate manifestation of which is the New Jerusalem.", "norm_zh": "惟有借着神成为人使人成为神才能产生基督的身体这一点是神所赐给我们异象的高峰神成为人为要使人成为神好使神产生基督的身体就是三一神的生机体其终极的显出乃是新耶路撒冷", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "It is only by Gods becoming man to make man God that the Body of Christ can be produced this point is the high peak of the vision given to us by God God became man to make man God that God may produce the Body of Christ which is the organism of the Triune God the ultimate manifestation of which is the New Jerusalem"}
{"zh": "神圣启示的高峰—圣经这“盒子”里的“钻石”—乃是一个启示，就是神在基督里成为人，为要使人在生命和性情上（但不在神格上）成为神。", "en": "The high peak of the divine revelation—the \"diamond\" in the \"box\" of the Bible—is the revelation that in Christ God has become man in order that man might become God in life and nature but not in the Godhead.", "norm_zh": "神圣启示的高峰圣经这盒子里的钻石乃是一个启示就是神在基督里成为人为要使人在生命和性情上但不在神格上成为神", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The high peak of the divine revelationthe diamond in the box of the Bibleis the revelation that in Christ God has become man in order that man might become God in life and nature but not in the Godhead"}
{"zh": "唯有借着神成为人，使人成为神，才能产生基督的身体；这一点是神所赐给我们异象的高峰。", "en": "It is only by God's becoming man to make man God that the Body of Christ can be produced; this point is the high peak of the vision given to us by God.", "norm_zh": "惟有借着神成为人使人成为神才能产生基督的身体这一点是神所赐给我们异象的高峰", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "It is only by Gods becoming man to make man God that the Body of Christ can be produced this point is the high peak of the vision given to us by God"}
{"zh": "为要完成神的经纶，我们需要神将祂自己在基督里建造到我们里面，作我们的生命、性情和构成，使我们在生命和性情上成为神，但无分于祂的神格。", "en": "For the fulfillment of God's economy, we need God to build Himself in Christ into us as our life, our nature, and our constitution to make us God in life and nature but not in the Godhead.", "norm_zh": "为要完成神的经纶我们需要神将祂自己在基督里建造到我们里面作我们的生命性情和构成使我们在生命和性情上成为神但无分于祂的神格", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "For the fulfillment of Gods economy we need God to build Himself in Christ into us as our life our nature and our constitution to make us God in life and nature but not in the Godhead"}
{"zh": "神成为人，是借着成为肉体；人成为神，是借着重生、圣别、更新、变化、模成和得荣。", "en": "God became man through incarnation; man becomes God through regeneration, sanctification, renewing, transformation, conformation, and glorification.", "norm_zh": "神成为人是借着成为肉体人成为神是借着重生圣别更新变化模成和得荣", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "God became man through incarnation man becomes God through regeneration sanctification renewing transformation conformation and glorification"}
{"zh": "身为在基督里的信徒和神的儿女，我们不是人类，我们乃是神人类。领悟这点，会使我们改变，甚至有革命性的改变。当我们领悟我们是神人，我们会说，“主，你是第一位神人，我们是许多跟随你的神人。你过人性生活，不是凭你属人的生命，乃是凭神神圣的生命，以彰显祂。……你活在这地上，每天都在死。你是被钉死而活着。主，今天你是我的生命，是我的人位，你就是我。所以我必须死。我需要模成你的死。我必须每天被钉死而死，以过神人的生活，人性的生活，但不是凭我属人的生命，乃是凭神圣的生命，以你的生命和你的性情作我的构成，彰显你神圣的属性，这属性成了我人性的美德。”", "en": "As believers in Christ and children of God, we are not mankind — we are God-man kind. To realize this is to be changed, even revolutionized. When we realize that we are God-men, we will say, “Lord, You are the first God-man, and we are the many God-men following You. You lived a human life, not by Your human life but by God’s divine life to express Him. ... You were here on this earth dying every day. You were crucified to live. Lord, You are my life today and You are my person. You are just me. I therefore must die. I need to be conformed to Your death. I have to be crucified to die every day to live a God-man’s life, a human life yet not by my human life but by God’s divine life, with Your life and Your nature as my constitution to express You in Your divine attributes, which become my human virtues.”", "norm_zh": "身为在基督里的信徒和神的儿女我们不是人类我们乃是神人类领悟这点会使我们改变甚至有革命性的改变当我们领悟我们是神人我们会说主你是第一位神人我们是许多跟随你的神人你过人性生活不是凭你属人的生命乃是凭神神圣的生命以彰显祂你活在这地上每天都在死你是被钉死而活着主今天你是我的生命是我的人位你就是我所以我必须死我需要模成你的死我必须每天被钉死而死以过神人的生活人性的生活但不是凭我属人的生命乃是凭神圣的生命以你的生命和你的性情作我的构成彰显你神圣的属性这属性成了我人性的美德", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "As believers in Christ and children of God we are not mankind we are Godman kind To realize this is to be changed even revolutionized When we realize that we are Godmen we will say Lord You are the first Godman and we are the many Godmen following You You lived a human life not by Your human life but by Gods divine life to express Him You were here on this earth dying every day You were crucified to live Lord You are my life today and You are my person You are just me I therefore must die I need to be conformed to Your death I have to be crucified to die every day to live a Godmans life a human life yet not by my human life but by Gods divine life with Your life and Your nature as my constitution to express You in Your divine attributes which become my human virtues"}
{"zh": "第三篇", "en": "Message Three", "norm_zh": "第三篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Message Three"}
{"zh": "为着新的复兴之神人的生活", "en": "The God-man Life for a New Revival", "norm_zh": "为着新的复兴之神人的生活", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The Godman Life for a New Revival"}
{"zh": "但你们并不是这样学了基督；如果你们真是听过祂，并在祂里面，照着那在耶稣身上是实际者，受过教导—弗四20~21。", "en": "But you did not so learn Christ, if indeed you have heard Him and have been taught in Him, as the reality is in Jesus—Eph. 4:20-21.", "norm_zh": "但你们并不是这样学了基督如果你们真是听过祂并在祂里面照着哪在耶稣身上是实际者受过教导弗四2021", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "But you did not so learn Christ if indeed you have heard Him and have been taught in Him as the reality is in JesusEph 42021"}
{"zh": "什么是为着新的复兴之神人的生活？", "en": "What is the God-man life for a new revival?", "norm_zh": "什么是为着新的复兴之神人的生活", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "What is the Godman life for a new revival"}
{"zh": "神心头的愿望是要“那在耶稣身上是实际者”（弗四21），也就是记载在四卷福音书里耶稣神人生活的实际光景，能借着实际的灵重复于基督身体的许多肢体，成为基督身体的实际，就是神经纶中的最高峰，而有新的复兴。", "en": "God’s heart’s desire is that “the reality is in Jesus” (Eph. 4:21), the actual condition of the God-man life of Jesus as recorded in the four Gospels, would be duplicated by the Spirit of reality in the many members of the Body of Christ to become the reality of the Body of Christ, the highest peak of God’s economy, to have a new revival.", "norm_zh": "神心头的愿望是要哪在耶稣身上是实际者弗四21也就是记载在四卷福音书里耶稣神人生活的实际光景能借着实际的灵重复于基督身体的许多肢体成为基督身体的实际就是神经纶中的最高峰而有新的复兴", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Gods hearts desire is that the reality is in Jesus Eph 421 the actual condition of the Godman life of Jesus as recorded in the four Gospels would be duplicated by the Spirit of reality in the many members of the Body of Christ to become the reality of the Body of Christ the highest peak of Gods economy to have a new revival"}
{"zh": "唯一讨神喜悦的生活，就是重复基督在地上所过的生活；这是在基督作燔祭的经历中经历祂的生活。", "en": "The only life that is pleasing to God is the life that is a repetition of the life Christ lived on the earth; this is a life that experiences Christ in His experiences as the burnt offering.", "norm_zh": "惟一讨神喜悦的生活就是重复基督在地上所过的生活这是在基督作燔祭的经历中经历祂的生活", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The only life that is pleasing to God is the life that is a repetition of the life Christ lived on the earth this is a life that experiences Christ in His experiences as the burnt offering"}
{"zh": "我们必须让主焚烧我们，使我们成为常献的燔祭，以焚烧别人并被消减成灰，好成为新耶路撒冷，使神得着彰显。", "en": "We must allow the Lord to burn us so that we may be a continual burnt offering to burn others and be reduced to ashes to become the New Jerusalem for God's expression.", "norm_zh": "我们必须让主焚烧我们使我们成为常献的燔祭以焚烧别人并被消减成灰好成为新耶路撒冷使神得着彰显", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "We must allow the Lord to burn us so that we may be a continual burnt offering to burn others and be reduced to ashes to become the New Jerusalem for Gods expression"}
{"zh": "在完成神新约职事的事上，作为燔祭之实际的主耶稣不从自己作什么（约五19），祂不作自己的工（四34，十七4），祂不说自己的话，祂作每件事都不凭自己的意思（五30），祂不寻求自己的荣耀（七18）；祂绝不失望，因祂只以神为满足。", "en": "In accomplishing God's New Testament ministry, the Lord Jesus as the reality of the burnt offering did nothing from Himself (John 5:19), He did not do His own work (4:34, 17:4), He did not speak His own words, He did nothing of His own will (5:30), and He did not seek His own glory (7:18); He was never disappointed, because He was satisfied with God alone.", "norm_zh": "在完成神新约职事的事上作为燔祭之实际的主耶稣不从自己作什么约五19祂不作自己的工四34十七4祂不说自己的话祂作每件事都不凭自己的意思五30祂不寻求自己的荣耀七18祂绝不失望因祂只以神为满足", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "In accomplishing Gods New Testament ministry the Lord Jesus as the reality of the burnt offering did nothing from Himself John 519 He did not do His own work 434 174 He did not speak His own words He did nothing of His own will 530 and He did not seek His own glory 718 He was never disappointed because He was satisfied with God alone"}
{"zh": "借着正确的祷告而按手在作燔祭的基督身上，我们就与祂联结，祂与我们就成为一；基督活在我们里面，就在我们里面重复祂在地上所过的生活，就是燔祭的生活；在这样的联结、这样的联合里，我们一切的软弱、缺陷和过失，都由祂担负。", "en": "By laying our hands on Christ as the burnt offering through proper prayer, we are joined to Him, and He and we become one; Christ living in us repeats in us the life He lived on earth, the life of the burnt offering; in such an identification, such a union, all our weaknesses, defects, and faults are taken on by Him.", "norm_zh": "借着正确的祷告而按手在作燔祭的基督身上我们就与祂联结祂与我们就成为一基督活在我们里面就在我们里面重复祂在地上所过的生活就是燔祭的生活在这样的联结这样的联合里我们一切的软弱缺陷和过失都由祂担负", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "By laying our hands on Christ as the burnt offering through proper prayer we are joined to Him and He and we become one Christ living in us repeats in us the life He lived on earth the life of the burnt offering in such an identification such a union all our weaknesses defects and faults are taken on by Him"}
{"zh": "我们住在那是神自己的爱里面，爱“在我们便得了成全，使我们在审判的日子，可以坦然无惧；因为祂如何，我们在这世上也如何”（约壹四17）；基督作为燔祭的实际，曾在这世上活出神就是爱的生活，如今祂是我们的生命，使我们能在这世上活出同样爱的生活，与祂所是的一样。", "en": "When we abide in the love that is God Himself, love \"has been perfected with us, that we may have boldness in the day of the judgment because even as He is, so also are we in this world\" (1 John 4:17); Christ as the reality of the burnt offering lived in this world a life of God as love, and He is now our life that we may live the same life of love in this world and be the same as He is.", "norm_zh": "我们住在哪是神自己的爱里面爱在我们便得了成全使我们在审判的日子可以坦然无惧因为祂如何我们在这世上也如何约壹四17基督作为燔祭的实际曾在这世上活出神就是爱的生活如今祂是我们的生命使我们能在这世上活出同样爱的生活与祂所是的一样", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "When we abide in the love that is God Himself love has been perfected with us that we may have boldness in the day of the judgment because even as He is so also are we in this world 1 John 417 Christ as the reality of the burnt offering lived in this world a life of God as love and He is now our life that we may live the same life of love in this world and be the same as He is"}
{"zh": "当爱的律在我们里面得以发动，我们就自动并自然地成为牧人，有我们父神爱和赦免的心，并我们救主基督牧养和寻找的灵。", "en": "When the law of love is activated within us, we automatically and spontaneously will be shepherds who have the loving and forgiving heart of our Father God and the shepherding and seeking spirit of our Savior Christ.", "norm_zh": "当爱的律在我们里面得以发动我们就自动并自然地成为牧人有我们父神爱和赦免的心并我们救主基督牧养和寻找的灵", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "When the law of love is activated within us we automatically and spontaneously will be shepherds who have the loving and forgiving heart of our Father God and the shepherding and seeking spirit of our Savior Christ"}
{"zh": "第四篇", "en": "Message Four", "norm_zh": "第四篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Message Four"}
{"zh": "借着活在神的国作为神圣种类的范围里，过神人的生活", "en": "Living the God-man life by living in the kingdom of God as the realm of the divine species", "norm_zh": "借着活在神的国作为神圣种类的范围里过神人的生活", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Living the Godman life by living in the kingdom of God as the realm of the divine species"}
{"zh": "耶稣回答说，我实实在在地告诉你，人若不重生，就不能见神的国……我实实在在地告诉你，人若不是从水和灵生的，就不能进神的国—约三3、5。", "en": "Jesus answered and said, Truly, truly, I say to you, Unless one is born anew, he cannot see the kingdom of God... Truly, truly, I say to you, Unless one is born of water and the Spirit, he cannot enter into the kingdom of God—John 3:3, 5.", "norm_zh": "耶稣回答说我实实在在地告诉你人若不重生就不能见神的国我实实在在地告诉你人若不是从水和灵生的就不能进神的国约三35", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Jesus answered and said Truly truly I say to you Unless one is born anew he cannot see the kingdom of God Truly truly I say to you Unless one is born of water and the Spirit he cannot enter into the kingdom of GodJohn 33 5"}
{"zh": "作为在基督里的信徒，什么是活在神的国里？什么是活在神圣种类范围里？", "en": "As believers in Christ, what is it to live in the kingdom of God? What is it to live in the realm of the divine species?", "norm_zh": "作为在基督里的信徒什么是活在神的国里什么是活在神圣种类范围里", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "As believers in Christ what is it to live in the kingdom of God What is it to live in the realm of the divine species"}
{"zh": "神的国乃是神在基督里作神圣生命连同其一切活动的总和；神的国乃是神圣生命的范围，让这生命行动、工作、治理、管治，使生命能完成其目的。", "en": "The kingdom of God is the totality of God in Christ as the divine life with all its activities; the kingdom of God is the realm of the divine life for this life to move, to work, to rule, and to govern so that life may accomplish its purpose.", "norm_zh": "神的国乃是神在基督里作神圣生命连同其一切活动的总和神的国乃是神圣生命的范围让这生命行动工作治理管治使生命能完成其目的", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The kingdom of God is the totality of God in Christ as the divine life with all its activities the kingdom of God is the realm of the divine life for this life to move to work to rule and to govern so that life may accomplish its purpose"}
{"zh": "神的国是一个范围，不仅是神圣管治的范围，也是神圣种类的范围，在其中有一切神圣的事物；要进入神圣种类的范围，我们就必须从神而生，得着神圣的生命和神圣的性情；我们凭生命的感觉活在神的国这神圣生命的范围里；“到那日，你们就知道我在我父里面，你们在我里面，我也在你们里面”。", "en": "The kingdom of God is a realm, not only of the divine ruling but also of the divine species, in which are all divine things; to enter into the realm of the divine species, we must be born of God to obtain the divine life and the divine nature; we live in the kingdom of God, the realm of the divine life, by the sense of life; \"In that day you will know that I am in My Father, and you in Me, and I in you.\"", "norm_zh": "神的国是一个范围不仅是神圣管治的范围也是神圣种类的范围在其中有一切神圣的事物要进入神圣种类的范围我们就必须从神而生得着神圣的生命和神圣的性情我们凭生命的感觉活在神的国这神圣生命的范围里到哪日你们就知道我在我父里面你们在我里面我也在你们里面", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The kingdom of God is a realm not only of the divine ruling but also of the divine species in which are all divine things to enter into the realm of the divine species we must be born of God to obtain the divine life and the divine nature we live in the kingdom of God the realm of the divine life by the sense of life In that day you will know that I am in My Father and you in Me and I in you"}
{"zh": "作为在基督里的信徒，我们过神人的生活；作为第一个神人的繁殖与复制，我们该过与祂所过同样的生活；主的神人生活为我们的神人生活设立了模型—被钉十字架以活神，好使神在人性里得彰显；主耶稣不是活出一种努力要属灵、圣别并得胜的生活；祂乃是活出一种完全照着神新约经纶，并为着神新约经纶的生活；我们必须凭基督之灵全备的供应，否认己，模成基督的死，并显大祂。", "en": "As believers in Christ, we live a God-man life; as the reproduction and duplication of the first God-man, we should live the same kind of life that He lived; the Lord's God-man life set up a model for our God-man life—being crucified to live God so that God may be expressed in humanity; the Lord Jesus did not live a life of trying to be spiritual, holy, and victorious; He lived a life absolutely according to and for God's New Testament economy; we must deny ourselves, be conformed to the death of Christ, and magnify Him by the bountiful supply of the Spirit of Christ.", "norm_zh": "作为在基督里的信徒我们过神人的生活作为第一个神人的繁殖与复制我们该过与祂所过同样的生活主的神人生活为我们的神人生活设立了模型被钉十字架以活神好使神在人性里得彰显主耶稣不是活出一种努力要属灵圣别并得胜的生活祂乃是活出一种完全照着神新约经纶并为着神新约经纶的生活我们必须凭基督之灵全备的供应否认己模成基督的死并显大祂", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "As believers in Christ we live a Godman life as the reproduction and duplication of the first Godman we should live the same kind of life that He lived the Lords Godman life set up a model for our Godman lifebeing crucified to live God so that God may be expressed in humanity the Lord Jesus did not live a life of trying to be spiritual holy and victorious He lived a life absolutely according to and for Gods New Testament economy we must deny ourselves be conformed to the death of Christ and magnify Him by the bountiful supply of the Spirit of Christ"}
{"zh": "因着我们已经由神而生，我们就是神的种类；也就是说，我们在生命和性情上（但不在神格上）是神。", "en": "Because we have been born of God, we are of the God-kind; that is, we are God in life and nature but not in the Godhead.", "norm_zh": "因着我们已经由神而生我们就是神的种类也就是说我们在生命和性情上但不在神格上是神", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Because we have been born of God we are of the Godkind that is we are God in life and nature but not in the Godhead"}
{"zh": "神人有神圣的权利，有分于神的种类。", "en": "God-men have the divine right to participate in God's species.", "norm_zh": "神人有神圣的权利有分于神的种类", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Godmen have the divine right to participate in Gods species"}
{"zh": "作为在基督里的信徒，我们活在神的国里。", "en": "As believers in Christ, we live in the kingdom of God.", "norm_zh": "作为在基督里的信徒我们活在神的国里", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "As believers in Christ we live in the kingdom of God"}
{"zh": "作为在基督里的信徒，我们活在神的国里；我们是基督里的信徒和神的儿女，有神圣生命的实际，而且全人正被变化并模成主的形像。", "en": "As believers in Christ, we live in the kingdom of God; we are believers in Christ and children of God, having the reality of the divine life, and our whole being is being transformed and conformed to the image of the Lord.", "norm_zh": "作为在基督里的信徒我们活在神的国里我们是基督里的信徒和神的儿女有神圣生命的实际而且全人正被变化并模成主的形像", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "As believers in Christ we live in the kingdom of God we are believers in Christ and children of God having the reality of the divine life and our whole being is being transformed and conformed to the image of the Lord"}
{"zh": "神的国乃是神圣生命的范围，让这生命行动、工作、治理、管治，使生命能完成其目的；神的国是由神的生命所构成的生机体，作为让祂得以治理的生命范围，在其中祂以祂的生命掌权，并在神圣生命里彰显祂自己这神圣的三一；我们凭生命的感觉活在神的国这神圣生命的范围里。", "en": "The kingdom of God is a realm of the divine life for this life to move, work, rule, and govern so that life may accomplish its purpose; the kingdom of God is an organism constituted with God's life as the realm of life for Him to govern, in which He reigns with His life and expresses Himself, the Divine Trinity, in the divine life; we live in the kingdom of God, the realm of the divine life, by the sense of life.", "norm_zh": "神的国乃是神圣生命的范围让这生命行动工作治理管治使生命能完成其目的神的国是由神的生命所构成的生机体作为让祂得以治理的生命范围在其中祂以祂的生命掌权并在神圣生命里彰显祂自己这神圣的三一我们凭生命的感觉活在神的国这神圣生命的范围里", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The kingdom of God is a realm of the divine life for this life to move work rule and govern so that life may accomplish its purpose the kingdom of God is an organism constituted with Gods life as the realm of life for Him to govern in which He reigns with His life and expresses Himself the Divine Trinity in the divine life we live in the kingdom of God the realm of the divine life by the sense of life"}
{"zh": "作为在基督里的信徒，我们过神人的生活；作为第一个神人的繁殖与复制，我们该过与祂所过同样的生活。", "en": "As believers in Christ, we live a God-man life; as the reproduction and duplication of the first God-man, we should live the same kind of life that He lived.", "norm_zh": "作为在基督里的信徒我们过神人的生活作为第一个神人的繁殖与复制我们该过与祂所过同样的生活", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "As believers in Christ we live a Godman life as the reproduction and duplication of the first Godman we should live the same kind of life that He lived"}
{"zh": "我们必须凭基督之灵全备的供应，否认己，模成基督的死，并显大祂；过神人生活的那一位，如今乃是那灵，在我们里面并借着我们活着；我们必须弃绝修养自己和建立天然的人，单单让这一位充满我们并占有我们，好使我们个人地并团体地在祂的身体召会中，活祂并彰显祂。", "en": "We must deny ourselves, be conformed to the death of Christ, and magnify Him by the bountiful supply of the Spirit of Christ; the One who lived the God-man life is now the Spirit, living in us and through us; we must reject self-cultivation and the building up of the natural man, and simply let this One fill and occupy us, so that we may live Him and express Him individually and corporately in His Body, the church.", "norm_zh": "我们必须凭基督之灵全备的供应否认己模成基督的死并显大祂过神人生活的哪一位如今乃是哪灵在我们里面并借着我们活着我们必须弃绝修养自己和建立天然的人单单让这一位充满我们并占有我们好使我们个人地并团体地在祂的身体召会中活祂并彰显祂", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "We must deny ourselves be conformed to the death of Christ and magnify Him by the bountiful supply of the Spirit of Christ the One who lived the Godman life is now the Spirit living in us and through us we must reject selfcultivation and the building up of the natural man and simply let this One fill and occupy us so that we may live Him and express Him individually and corporately in His Body the church"}
{"zh": "第五篇", "en": "Message Five", "norm_zh": "第五篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Message Five"}
{"zh": "使徒的职事与基督天上的职事合作，牧养作神群羊的召会，为着建造基督的身体并有新的复兴", "en": "The apostolic ministry cooperates with Christ's heavenly ministry to shepherd the church of God, which is the flock of God, for the building up of the Body of Christ and to have a new revival.", "norm_zh": "使徒的职事与基督天上的职事合作牧养作神群羊的召会为着建造基督的身体并有新的复兴", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The apostolic ministry cooperates with Christs heavenly ministry to shepherd the church of God which is the flock of God for the building up of the Body of Christ and to have a new revival"}
{"zh": "……我来了，是要叫羊得生命，并且得的更丰盛。我是好牧人，好牧人为羊舍命—约十10~11。", "en": "...\"I have come that they may have life and may have it abundantly. I am the good Shepherd; the good Shepherd lays down His life for the sheep\"—John 10:10-11.", "norm_zh": "我来了是要叫羊得生命并且得的更丰盛我是好牧人好牧人为羊舍命约十1011", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "I have come that they may have life and may have it abundantly I am the good Shepherd the good Shepherd lays down His life for the sheepJohn 101011"}
{"zh": "……约翰的儿子西门，你爱我么？彼得对祂说，主啊，是的，你知道我爱你。耶稣对他说，你牧养我的羊—二一16。", "en": "...\"Simon, son of John, do you love Me? Peter said to Him, Yes, Lord, You know that I love You. Jesus said to him, Shepherd My sheep.\"—John 21:16.", "norm_zh": "约翰的儿子西门你爱我么彼得对祂说主啊是的你知道我爱你耶稣对他说你牧养我的羊二一16", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Simon son of John do you love Me Peter said to Him Yes Lord You know that I love You Jesus said to him Shepherd My sheepJohn 2116"}
{"zh": "约翰二十一章给我们的启示是什么？我们要如何能为着建造基督的身体并有新的复兴？", "en": "What is the revelation in John 21? How can we be for the building up of the Body of Christ and have a new revival?", "norm_zh": "约翰二十一章给我们的启示是什么我们要如何能为着建造基督的身体并有新的复兴", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "What is the revelation in John 21 How can we be for the building up of the Body of Christ and have a new revival"}
{"zh": "使徒职事与基督天上职事合并的主要目的和目标，乃是要建造基督的身体，终极完成新耶路撒冷，以完成神永远的经纶；基督在祂天上的职事里一直在牧养人，我们需要与祂合作牧养人；我们若接受这个交通，地上会有一个大复兴，将主带回来。", "en": "The main purpose and goal of the incorporation of the apostolic ministry with Christ's heavenly ministry are to build up the Body of Christ, consummating in the New Jerusalem, to accomplish God's eternal economy; Christ is shepherding people in His heavenly ministry, and we need to cooperate with Him to shepherd people; if we receive this fellowship, there will be a great revival on the earth to bring the Lord back.", "norm_zh": "使徒职事与基督天上职事合并的主要目的和目标乃是要建造基督的身体终极完成新耶路撒冷以完成神永远的经纶基督在祂天上的职事里一直在牧养人我们需要与祂合作牧养人我们若接受这个交通地上会有一个大复兴将主带回来", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The main purpose and goal of the incorporation of the apostolic ministry with Christs heavenly ministry are to build up the Body of Christ consummating in the New Jerusalem to accomplish Gods eternal economy Christ is shepherding people in His heavenly ministry and we need to cooperate with Him to shepherd people if we receive this fellowship there will be a great revival on the earth to bring the Lord back"}
{"zh": "金灯台生机的维持乃是基督天上的职事，在祂的人性里顾惜众召会，并在祂的神性里喂养众召会，好借着祂生机的牧养产生得胜者；借着基督奇妙的牧养，我们得以享受祂作我们的福分，从今时直到永远。", "en": "The organic maintenance of the golden lampstands is Christ's heavenly ministry to cherish the churches in His humanity and nourish them in His divinity to produce overcomers through His organic shepherding; through Christ's wonderful shepherding we are escorted into the enjoyment of Himself as our blessing now and forever.", "norm_zh": "金灯台生机的维持乃是基督天上的职事在祂的人性里顾惜众召会并在祂的神性里喂养众召会好借着祂生机的牧养产生得胜者借着基督奇妙的牧养我们得以享受祂作我们的福分从今时直到永远", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The organic maintenance of the golden lampstands is Christs heavenly ministry to cherish the churches in His humanity and nourish them in His divinity to produce overcomers through His organic shepherding through Christs wonderful shepherding we are escorted into the enjoyment of Himself as our blessing now and forever"}
{"zh": "基督住在我们里面，作我们的生命和一切，但祂也监督、察看我们内里所是的光景和情形；祂借着顾到我们里面各部分的益处，并监督我们魂（就是我们真人位）的光景，而牧养我们。", "en": "Christ indwells us to be our life and everything, but He is also overseeing, observing, the condition and situation of our inner being; He shepherds us by caring for the welfare of our inner being and by exercising His oversight over the condition of our soul, our real person.", "norm_zh": "基督住在我们里面作我们的生命和一切但祂也监督察看我们内里所是的光景和情形祂借着顾到我们里面各部分的益处并监督我们魂就是我们真人位的光景而牧养我们", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Christ indwells us to be our life and everything but He is also overseeing observing the condition and situation of our inner being He shepherds us by caring for the welfare of our inner being and by exercising His oversight over the condition of our soul our real person"}
{"zh": "基督在祂三个时期的丰满职事中，以祂自己这包罗万有的基督来喂养我们，使我们在神圣的生命中长大成熟，成为祂的得胜者，以完成祂永远的经纶；借着基督奇妙的牧养，我们得以享受祂作我们的福分，从今时直到永远。", "en": "Christ in His full ministry in three stages feeds us with Himself as the all-inclusive Christ so that we may grow and mature in the divine life to be His overcomers for the accomplishment of His eternal economy; through Christ's wonderful shepherding we are escorted into the enjoyment of Himself as our blessing now and forever.", "norm_zh": "基督在祂三个时期的丰满职事中以祂自己这包罗万有的基督来喂养我们使我们在神圣的生命中长大成熟成为祂的得胜者以完成祂永远的经纶借着基督奇妙的牧养我们得以享受祂作我们的福分从今时直到永远", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Christ in His full ministry in three stages feeds us with Himself as the allinclusive Christ so that we may grow and mature in the divine life to be His overcomers for the accomplishment of His eternal economy through Christs wonderful shepherding we are escorted into the enjoyment of Himself as our blessing now and forever"}
{"zh": "基督在祂天上的职事里一直在牧养人，我们需要与祂合作牧养人； “我们要坚定持续地祷告，并尽话语的职事”（徒六4）；这乃是与基督天上的职事合作，这职事乃是代求的职事（来七25），也是将神供应到人里面的职事（八2） 。", "en": "Christ is shepherding people in His heavenly ministry, and we need to cooperate with Him to shepherd people; \"We will continue steadfastly in prayer and in the ministry of the word\" (Acts 6:4); this is to cooperate with Christ's heavenly ministry of intercession (Heb. 7:25) and of ministering God into His people (8:2).", "norm_zh": "基督在祂天上的职事里一直在牧养人我们需要与祂合作牧养人我们要坚定持续地祷告并尽话语的职事徒六4这乃是与基督天上的职事合作这职事乃是代求的职事来七25也是将神供应到人里面的职事八2", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Christ is shepherding people in His heavenly ministry and we need to cooperate with Him to shepherd people We will continue steadfastly in prayer and in the ministry of the word Acts 64 this is to cooperate with Christs heavenly ministry of intercession Heb 725 and of ministering God into His people 82"}
{"zh": "牧养信徒，对于他们在神圣生命里的长大，是极其重要的；我们必须以牧养的路来传福音并复兴召会。我们应当祷告说，“主，我要得着复兴；从今天起，我要作一个牧人；我要去喂养人，牧养人，把人聚成一群。”", "en": "Shepherding the believers is extremely important for their growth in the divine life; we must preach the gospel and revive the church by the way of shepherding. We should pray, \"Lord, I want to be revived; from today I want to be a shepherd; I want to go to feed people, to shepherd people, and to flock people together.\"", "norm_zh": "牧养信徒对于他们在神圣生命里的长大是极其重要的我们必须以牧养的路来传福音并复兴召会我们应当祷告说主我要得着复兴从今天起我要作一个牧人我要去喂养人牧养人把人聚成一群", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Shepherding the believers is extremely important for their growth in the divine life we must preach the gospel and revive the church by the way of shepherding We should pray Lord I want to be revived from today I want to be a shepherd I want to go to feed people to shepherd people and to flock people together"}
{"zh": "第六篇", "en": "Message Six", "norm_zh": "第六篇", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Message Six"}
{"zh": "按着神牧养", "en": "Shepherding according to God", "norm_zh": "按着神牧养", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Shepherding according to God"}
{"zh": "务要牧养你们中间神的群羊，按着神监督他们，不是出于勉强，乃是出于甘心……—彼前五2。", "en": "Shepherd the flock of God among you, overseeing not under compulsion but willingly, according to God...—1 Pet. 5:2.", "norm_zh": "务要牧养你们中间神的群羊按着神监督他们不是出于勉强乃是出于甘心彼前五2", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Shepherd the flock of God among you overseeing not under compulsion but willingly according to God1 Pet 52"}
{"zh": "……主啊，……你知道我爱你。耶稣对他说，你喂养我的小羊—约二一15。", "en": "...Lord,... You know that I love You. Jesus said to him, Feed My lambs—John 21:15.", "norm_zh": "主啊你知道我爱你耶稣对他说你喂养我的小羊约二一15", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Lord You know that I love You Jesus said to him Feed My lambsJohn 2115"}
{"zh": "什么是按着神牧养？我们要如何才能按着神牧养？", "en": "What is shepherding according to God? How can we shepherd according to God?", "norm_zh": "什么是按着神牧养我们要如何才能按着神牧养", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "What is shepherding according to God How can we shepherd according to God"}
{"zh": "在主今日的恢复里，迫切需要牧养；我们都需要在基督生机的牧养之下，并与祂是一，", "en": "In the Lord's recovery today there is an urgent need for shepherding; we all need to be under Christ's organic shepherding and be one with Him,", "norm_zh": "在主今日的恢复里迫切需要牧养我们都需要在基督生机的牧养之下并与祂是一", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "In the Lords recovery today there is an urgent need for shepherding we all need to be under Christs organic shepherding and be one with Him"}
{"zh": "而牧养别人；我们是羊也是牧人，彼此互相地牧养并接受牧养。", "en": "and shepherding others; we are both sheep and shepherds, shepherding one another and being shepherded.", "norm_zh": "而牧养别人我们是羊也是牧人彼此互相地牧养并接受牧养", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "and shepherding others we are both sheep and shepherds shepherding one another and being shepherded"}
{"zh": "牧养是给群羊周全、柔细的照顾。", "en": "Shepherding is to take all-inclusive tender care of the flock.", "norm_zh": "牧养是给群羊周全柔细的照顾", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Shepherding is to take allinclusive tender care of the flock"}
{"zh": "基督是好牧人、大牧人、牧长以及我们魂的牧人。", "en": "Christ is the good Shepherd, the great Shepherd, the Chief Shepherd, and the Shepherd of our souls.", "norm_zh": "基督是好牧人大牧人牧长以及我们魂的牧人", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Christ is the good Shepherd the great Shepherd the Chief Shepherd and the Shepherd of our souls"}
{"zh": "彼得嘱咐长老们要按着神牧养神的群羊；按着神牧养，就是按着神的性情、心意、作法和荣耀，而不是按着我们的偏好、兴趣、目的和个性牧养。", "en": "Peter exhorted the elders to shepherd the flock of God according to God; to shepherd according to God is to shepherd according to God's nature, desire, way, and glory, not according to our preference, interest, purpose, and disposition.", "norm_zh": "彼得嘱咐长老们要按着神牧养神的群羊按着神牧养就是按着神的性情心意作法和荣耀而不是按着我们的偏好兴趣目的和个性牧养", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Peter exhorted the elders to shepherd the flock of God according to God to shepherd according to God is to shepherd according to Gods nature desire way and glory not according to our preference interest purpose and disposition"}
{"zh": "是灵的基督作我们魂的牧人，监督我们里面的光景，顾到我们内里所是的情形；因为我们的魂很复杂，所以我们需要那在我们灵里是赐生命之灵的基督，在我们的魂里牧养我们，照顾我们的心思、情感和意志，并顾到我们的难处、需要和创伤。", "en": "Christ as the pneumatic Christ is the Shepherd of our souls, supervising our inner condition and taking care of the state of our inner being; because our soul is very complex, we need Christ, who is the life-giving Spirit in our spirit, to shepherd us in our soul, taking care of our mind, emotion, and will, and caring for our problems, needs, and wounds.", "norm_zh": "是灵的基督作我们魂的牧人监督我们里面的光景顾到我们内里所是的情形因为我们的魂很复杂所以我们需要哪在我们灵里是赐生命之灵的基督在我们的魂里牧养我们照顾我们的心思情感和意志并顾到我们的难处需要和创伤", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Christ as the pneumatic Christ is the Shepherd of our souls supervising our inner condition and taking care of the state of our inner being because our soul is very complex we need Christ who is the lifegiving Spirit in our spirit to shepherd us in our soul taking care of our mind emotion and will and caring for our problems needs and wounds"}
{"zh": "那建造基督身体的牧养，乃是相互的牧养；我们都有缺点和短处，需要别人牧养我们；我们是羊也是牧人，彼此互相地牧养并接受牧养。", "en": "The shepherding that builds up the Body of Christ is mutual shepherding; we all have defects and shortcomings and need others to shepherd us; we are both sheep and shepherds, shepherding one another and being shepherded.", "norm_zh": "哪建造基督身体的牧养乃是相互的牧养我们都有缺点和短处需要别人牧养我们我们是羊也是牧人彼此互相地牧养并接受牧养", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "The shepherding that builds up the Body of Christ is mutual shepherding we all have defects and shortcomings and need others to shepherd us we are both sheep and shepherds shepherding one another and being shepherded"}
{"zh": "\t我们必须在神那爱、光、义、圣的属性上成为神。", "en": "We must become God in His attributes of love, light, righteousness, and holiness.", "norm_zh": "我们必须在神哪爱光义圣的属性上成为神", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T08:55:36.775208+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "We must become God in His attributes of love light righteousness and holiness"}
{"zh": "2026年感恩节特会—申言题目", "en": "2026 Thanksgiving Conference—Prophesying Topics", "norm_zh": "2026年感恩节特会申言提目", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "2026 Thanksgiving ConferenceProphesying Topics"}
