{"zh": "（说明复兴这件事是小申言者书“外壳”里面的“核仁”。）", "en": "(Explain that the matter of restoration is the \"kernel\" inside the \"shell\" of the Minor Prophets.)", "norm_zh": "说明复兴这件事是小申言者书外壳里面的核仁", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Explain that the matter of restoration is the kernel inside the shell of the Minor Prophets"}
{"zh": "第二题 人的后裔，就是人的儿子，能成为神的儿子（撒下七12-14上）", "en": "Topic 2: A seed of man, that is, a son of man, can become the Son of God (2 Sam. 7:12-14a)", "norm_zh": "第二提人的后裔就是人的儿子能成为神的儿子撒下七1214上", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic 2 A seed of man that is a son of man can become the Son of God 2 Sam 71214a"}
