{"zh": "周二", "en": "Tuesday", "norm_zh": "周二", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Tuesday"}
{"zh": "第一题 恢复神永远经纶行动中，有关神的灵紧要的点（约一14，林前十五45，启五6）", "en": "Topic 1: The recovery of the critical points concerning the Spirit of God in the move of God's eternal economy (John 1:14; 1 Cor. 15:45; Rev. 5:6)", "norm_zh": "第一提恢复神永远经纶行动中有关神的灵紧要的点约一14林前十五45启五6", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic 1 The recovery of the critical points concerning the Spirit of God in the move of Gods eternal economy John 114 1 Cor 1545 Rev 56"}
{"zh": "（请用一句简单的话，说明今天主的恢复是什么。）", "en": "(Please explain in a simple sentence what the Lord's recovery is today.)", "norm_zh": "请用一句简单的话说明今天主的恢复是什么", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Please explain in a simple sentence what the Lords recovery is today"}
{"zh": "第二题 我们蒙主呼召，乃是要实行神的经纶（提前一4，弗一10）", "en": "Topic 2: We are called by the Lord to practice God's economy (1 Tim. 1:4; Eph. 1:10)", "norm_zh": "第二提我们蒙主呼召乃是要实行神的经纶提前一4弗一10", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic 2 We are called by the Lord to practice Gods economy 1 Tim 14 Eph 110"}
{"zh": "（说明神的经纶完全是以基督为中心，以基督为实际。）", "en": "(Explain that God's economy is altogether centered on Christ and has Christ as its reality.)", "norm_zh": "说明神的经纶完全是以基督为中心以基督为实际", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Explain that Gods economy is altogether centered on Christ and has Christ as its reality"}
{"zh": "第一题 使外邦人作门徒，乃是将外邦人构成为基督的门徒（腓一19，林前六17）", "en": "Topic 1: To disciple the Gentiles is to constitute the Gentiles as disciples of Christ (Phil. 1:19; 1 Cor. 6:17)", "norm_zh": "第一提使外邦人作门徒乃是将外邦人构成为基督的门徒腓一19林前六17", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic 1 To disciple the Gentiles is to constitute the Gentiles as disciples of Christ Phil 119 1 Cor 617"}
{"zh": "（说明主耶稣如何将彼得和安得烈以及雅各和约翰，四个人构成门徒。）", "en": "(Illustrating how the Lord Jesus constituted the four—Peter and Andrew, and James and John—as disciples.)", "norm_zh": "说明主耶稣如何将彼得和安得烈以及雅各和约翰四个人构成门徒", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Illustrating how the Lord Jesus constituted the fourPeter and Andrew and James and Johnas disciples"}
{"zh": "第二题 使外邦人作门徒，乃是将外邦人构成为基督的门徒（罗一4，八29）", "en": "Topic 2: To disciple the Gentiles is to constitute the Gentiles as disciples of Christ (Rom. 1:4; 8:29)", "norm_zh": "第二提使外邦人作门徒乃是将外邦人构成为基督的门徒罗一4八29", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic 2 To disciple the Gentiles is to constitute the Gentiles as disciples of Christ Rom 14 829"}
