{"zh": "（说明这模子就是记载在四福音书里耶稣的生活，这是完全照着实际而有的生活。)", "en": "(Explain that this mold is the life of Jesus as recorded in the four Gospels, which is a life completely according to reality.)", "norm_zh": "说明这模子就是记载在四福音书里耶稣的生活这是完全照着实际而有的生活", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Explain that this mold is the life of Jesus as recorded in the four Gospels which is a life completely according to reality"}
{"zh": "第二题 主乃是用三十三年半的功夫，在地上活出一个神人生活的模型（太十一29，约六57）", "en": "Topic Two: The Lord used thirty-three and a half years to live out a model of a God-man life on earth (Matt. 11:29; John 6:57)", "norm_zh": "第二提主乃是用三十三年半的功夫在地上活出一个神人生活的模型太十一29约六57", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic Two The Lord used thirtythree and a half years to live out a model of a Godman life on earth Matt 1129 John 657"}
{"zh": "（说明基督活着，但不是祂单独活着；祂不是凭自己的生命活着，乃是凭神的生命活着。)", "en": "(Showing that Christ lived, but not He alone; He did not live by His own life but by the life of God.)", "norm_zh": "说明基督活着但不是祂单独活着祂不是凭自己的生命活着乃是凭神的生命活着", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Showing that Christ lived but not He alone He did not live by His own life but by the life of God"}
{"zh": "第一题 唯一讨神喜悦的生活，就是重复基督在地上所过的生活（利一3、9）", "en": "Topic One: The only life that is pleasing to God is the life that is a repetition of the life Christ lived on earth (Lev. 1:3, 9)", "norm_zh": "第一提惟一讨神喜悦的生活就是重复基督在地上所过的生活利一39", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic One The only life that is pleasing to God is the life that is a repetition of the life Christ lived on earth Lev 13 9"}
{"zh": "（说明在基督作燔祭的经历中经历祂的的生活，乃是讨神喜悦的生活。)", "en": "(Explain that experiencing His life in our experience of Christ as the burnt offering is a life that pleases God.)", "norm_zh": "说明在基督作燔祭的经历中经历祂的的生活乃是讨神喜悦的生活", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Explain that experiencing His life in our experience of Christ as the burnt offering is a life that pleases God"}
{"zh": "第二题 按手在祂身上，证明我们渴望与祂联合，过祂在地上所过的生活（利一3、9）", "en": "Topic Two: Laying our hands on Him signifies that we desire to be joined to Him to live the life He lived on earth (Lev. 1:3, 9)", "norm_zh": "第二提按手在祂身上证明我们渴望与祂联合过祂在地上所过的生活利一39", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic Two Laying our hands on Him signifies that we desire to be joined to Him to live the life He lived on earth Lev 13 9"}
{"zh": "（说明我们既然无法过这样的生活，就必须接受基督作我们的燔祭。）", "en": "(Showing that since we cannot live such a life, we must take Christ as our burnt offering.)", "norm_zh": "说明我们既然无法过这样的生活就必须接受基督作我们的燔祭", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Showing that since we cannot live such a life we must take Christ as our burnt offering"}
{"zh": "第一题 神悦纳燔祭，就将它烧成灰（利六11，一16）", "en": "Topic One: For God to accept the burnt offering is for Him to turn it to ashes (Lev. 6:11, 1:16)", "norm_zh": "第一提神悦纳燔祭就将它烧成灰利六11一16", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic One For God to accept the burnt offering is for Him to turn it to ashes Lev 611 116"}
{"zh": "（为什么一般人不以灰为令人喜悦之物；然而，对我们献燔祭的人，灰的确是令人喜悦的。)", "en": "(Why people in general do not regard ashes as something cheerful; however, to us who offer the burnt offering, the ashes are indeed cheerful.)", "norm_zh": "为什么一般人不以灰为令人喜悦之物然而对我们献燔祭的人灰的确是令人喜悦的", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Why people in general do not regard ashes as something cheerful however to us who offer the burnt offering the ashes are indeed cheerful"}
{"zh": "第二题 宝贝向神所献燔祭的结果（利一16，六10）", "en": "Topic Two: Treasuring the result of the burnt offering offered to God (Lev. 1:16, 6:10)", "norm_zh": "第二提宝贝向神所献燔祭的结果利一16六10", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic Two Treasuring the result of the burnt offering offered to God Lev 116 610"}
{"zh": "（说明灰不是要丢掉的，乃是要倒在坛的东面。）", "en": "(Showing that the ashes are not to be thrown away but are to be poured out on the east side of the altar.)", "norm_zh": "说明灰不是要丢掉的乃是要倒在坛的东面", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Showing that the ashes are not to be thrown away but are to be poured out on the east side of the altar"}
