{"zh": "第一题 住在爱里面的，就住在神里面，神也住在他里面（约壹四16-17）", "en": "Topic One: He who abides in love abides in God, and God abides in him (1 John 4:16-17)", "norm_zh": "第一提住在爱里面的就住在神里面神也住在他里面约壹四1617", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic One He who abides in love abides in God and God abides in him 1 John 41617"}
{"zh": "（说明住在爱里面，就是过着习惯地用这爱爱别人的生活，使神能在我们身上得彰显。)", "en": "(Showing that to abide in love is to live a life in which we love others habitually with this love, that God may be expressed in us.)", "norm_zh": "说明住在爱里面就是过着习惯地用这爱爱别人的生活使神能在我们身上得彰显", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Showing that to abide in love is to live a life in which we love others habitually with this love that God may be expressed in us"}
