{"zh": "第一题 基督是人子，不光是为着完成救赎，也是为着召会生活（来九24，启一12-13）", "en": "Topic One: Christ is the Son of Man, not only for accomplishing redemption but also for the church life (Heb. 9:24; Rev. 1:12-13)", "norm_zh": "第一提基督是人子不光是为着完成救赎也是为着召会生活来九24启一1213", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Topic One Christ is the Son of Man not only for accomplishing redemption but also for the church life Heb 924 Rev 11213"}
