{"zh": "第二题 我们能否帮助肢体，在乎我们让主摸我们的个性有多少（彼前五2，弗四29）", "en": "Question Two: Whether we can help the members depends on how much we allow the Lord to touch our disposition (1 Pet. 5:2; Eph. 4:29)", "norm_zh": "第二提我们能否帮助肢体在乎我们让主摸我们的个性有多少彼前五2弗四29", "saved_at": "2026-07-08T09:00:16.092585+00:00", "prompt_version": "", "source": "enhanced_translate", "norm_en": "Question Two Whether we can help the members depends on how much we allow the Lord to touch our disposition 1 Pet 52 Eph 429"}
